window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":801,"title":"Chapter 801: Chapter 800 - An Innocent Assassin!","paragraphs":["THRUUUM!","Near the Rising Stellar Peaks, the essence of Vastness rumbled out as the conflagration of scorching flames on the body of the Entity Vast were wiped away, the eyes of many beings trembling as they saw signs of burn marks on the body that were trying to heal rapidly!","The expression of Vast was wild as he looked with murderous eyes towards the Queen Dowager, and then to the figure of Noah far in the distance who was simply floating while holding on to a wiggling innocent slime.","Vast bellowed out at this scene as his body became ever larger, the essence of Vastness continuing to permeate out!","\"If I do not rip apart a vile creature like you today, then Vast is not my name!\"","RUMBLE!","His words came with an explosion of essence as he moved towards Old Man Khan and Tiamat, condensed stars, suns, black holes, and Quasars continuing to revolve around him as they flew out with every single strike.","This was the Entity vast on the move!","Meanwhile, Noah's eyes were shining vibrantly as within his hands, the wiggling figure of the Blue Slime had inadvertently disappeared and was nowhere to be seen.","Not many people noticed this nor paid attention to it, even all the beings on the battlefield and even those watching the real time feed of this battle at far away locations taken and recorded by experts simply there to gather information by watching- neither of them paid any heed to the disappeared slime as they only kept in check Noah who floated in the skies with his hands clasped behind his back!","He seemed to be like a grand general overseeing the battlefield as his pets rushed in based on his orders, doing everything on his behalf.","And his pets...were truly doing their job to perfection as the Aileron Army found themselves as the targets of the horrendous attacks from his terrific summons!","The Void Serpent had its jaws wide open as Low Tier GALAXY experts would be swallowed in a single gulp, the Calamity Bear looking down domineering as he released Hugs of Death all around.","A deadly beam of soul damaging light continued to shoot out of the Variant Oculothorax as all those it hit had their souls shattered, the arrogant Three-Legged Fate Crow burning everything around her with scorching golden flames!","Anywhere that Noah's summons went...the Aileron army would collapse as the even more fearsome Colossal Helios Leviathan was acting as a battering ram that tore apart the support lines of the Aileron Army.","Its huge body simply burst through with pure force before deadly beams of plasma shot from its mouth!","The many defenders from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter watched this scene with rising fervor, seeing the battle being titled to their side just from these forces alone as they rushed forth with even more vigor.","OOOOOH!","Bellows and yells could be heard throughout as in another location, Noah's subordinates were running wild atop their pets.","RAA! RAA!","The cry of the Emperor penguin could be heard with clarity as the resplendent tusks of his Mythical Frostbourne Mammoth pierced into the enemy lines, his body shining gold with the sin of Pride as his flippers released spatial waves every second.","Kazuhiko could be seen not too far away riding a Flaming Golden Lion as his sword released dense sword lights, Athena standing behind all him and many of the other fighters from the Infinite Galaxy as her summon, the Six Winged Ancient- released a beautiful green light that healed anyone injured!","It was a grand sight as something that made the hearts of many grow cold was also spreading out. It was the eerie sight of an Undead Legion made of Abyssal Undead crossing through the chaotic void and ripping apart anything they came across as a white light from a Holy Millennium Phoenix washed over them, these undead relentlessly chasing their enemies until they also turned them into nothing but bones!","Barbatos could be seen atop the Holy Millenium Phoenix as her face held a devilish look, obviously enjoying the scene of carnage in front of her as she laughed out wildly.","OOOOOH!","The Generals of the Aileron Army bellowed out commands as they moved themselves, the resplendent pairs of wings on their bodies paired up with the red-black essence of the Dao of Withering giving them a mystical look in the darkness of the chaotic void!","In another area, an exasperated Middle Tier GALAXY Aileron Royal was dodging attacks left and right as a curvaceous looking Elena was accompanied by an Animus Summon dripping with blood at every step. The summon was known as the Blood-Spiked Behemoth as it only granted a being with a Pure Vampyric bloodline more power.","Prince Cassius was accompanying his Aunt for safety nearby as his devilish silver hair danced in the chaotic void, a sword as thin as a thread weaving in his hands as it severed the head of a Low Tier GALAXY Aileron!","The fights were truly hectic and numerous as one could take multiple chapters to go through each of them, but the overall theme was the same- the beings from the Infinite Galaxy could finally fight on the same stage as Noah, and each of them were using their Traits, abilities, and summons to extreme efficiency as they seemed like battle hardened killing machines while moving through the chaotic void.","The audience of this fight from both sides were watching in a stupor as they saw this didn't seem like the normal fights!","On the side of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, the Holy Emperor was ready to send another Entity as support to make sure Noah's life would not be in danger, yet he erased this thought when he saw that the Peak Tier GALAXY pet of his alone was able to at least withstand strikes from Vast.","But as he watched the illusory screen that showed the images of the battle at Rising Stellar Peaks, he couldn't help but also hone his eyes on the beings that Noah teleported into the battlefield.","These beings seemed to be enjoying themselves in the middle of this war as they would occasionally grab glistening lights from the enemies they defeated, smiles apparent from their faces as everything seemed like a game to them!","Some even looked competitive as they stood against each other to see how many kills they could get in the time they had!","\"This...\"","Such a sight left the Holy Emperor without words as he remembered Noah's words.","'I alone...with more than an Ancient Power!'","The words of the arrogant genius appeared in his mind as the Holy Emperor pensively thought...","'Is it actually true...?'","But his question would not be answered now as on the battlefield, something astounding was about to happen!","As the Entity Vast was facing the ferocious attacks of Old Man Khan and his Summons along with the wrath of the prideful Queen Dowager.","In the midst of this battle with 2 Entities and a Peak Tier GALAXY Tiamat merged with Noah and backed by a great deal of support skills, a being had approached silently as its aura and even shape could barely be discerned!","Being blue and jelly like, an innocent slime had traversed the chaotic void as it now actually stood right below the Entity Vast, its eyes that should have been innocent now tightly nit with ferocity as at this moment, a horrendous aura more powerful than even Tiamat erupted from this hidden Blue Slime!","What followed after...was simply frightening to look at!"]},{"number":802,"title":"Chapter 802: Chapter 801 - Merely an Entity! I","paragraphs":["Even though the Blue Slime that Noah had contracted looked innocent, one must still remember its identity!","[Blue Slime](PRISMATIC+) :: An Animus Summon at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. A unique species rarely seen in the Animus Universe, this Blue Slime comes from the thought to be perished lineage of Universal Emperor Slimes that were hunted down to extinction in the Animus Universe by a coalition of beings from the Primordial Cosmos. The defining racial skill that made it a target for extinction is <<Universal Devouring>>, an ability that brought about a Universal Emperor Slime that held an entire Universe in the Primordial Cosmos hostage for 1000 years. Its unique composition gives it complete immunity to physical attacks and 50% Damage reduction to all other forms of damage. This Blue Slime has nearly mastered the Grand Dao of Devouring, but is also proficient in the Grand Daos of Four Elements, Slaughter, and Macrocosm, along with the Lesser Daos of Alacrity, Voidspace, and Vitality. When it fully becomes a Universal Emperor Slime, it will naturally awaken the Cosmic Dao of Annihilation...","A creature proficient in 4 Grand Daos and 3 Lesser Daos while also being at the Peak Tier GALAXY!","Not to forget its stupendous <<Universal Devouring>> that made its brethren a target by the experts of the Primordial Cosmos!","Such a creature was acting like an assassin as an invisible aura built up in its body while it was situated below the feet of the Entity Vast!","\"Haha, have you not heard of me? Do you not know what the Grand Dao of Vastness represents?!\"","RUMBLE!","While being surrounded on four sides by Old Man Khan’s summons and the terrifying Tiamat above, Vast continued to talk boisterously.","\"My essence is more vast than anyone you will come across in this Dark Universe, so even though pesky flies are keeping up with me now- you all won’t be able to do so in a few hours!\"","BOOM!","\"When that time comes, you can only prepare for death! Haha!\"","Vast was boisterous as he launched attack after attack, the black holes and Quasars he was throwing out truly seeming endless as his mana constantly brought more of them forth with every strike.","Old Man Khan’s aged eyes had a troubled expression as he knew without the support of Tiamat, he might have already been forced to retreat from the relentless attacks of this Entity!","But how would they get out of this situation around at a time like this?","\"Be on stand by to have your pets release their most powerful attacks soon. I’ll let you know when.\"","While wondering about how they would get out of the worsening situation, Old Man Khan received a telepathic message from Noah that would have caused him anger before, but his brows tightened in seriousness as he knew this being had too many surprises.","\"Haha, in front of this Vast, what can you do but di-\"","THRUUUUM!","Vast’s arrogant words were brought to a halt as he paled at this moment.","It wasn’t just vast, but everything on the battlefield paled at this moment as a terrifying aura burst forth!","What made it terrifying wasn’t because of its Realm, but the fact that it was the instantaneous release of the essence of four horrifying Grand Daos, this horrendous release coming from below the body of the Entity Vast!","His expression turned ashen as he tried to move, but the reaction simply was not fast enough as an instant later, a blue light expanded out and began rapidly covering his over 1000 meters body.","The red essence of Devouring and Slaughter covered this expanding blue light as the thing allowing its expansion- the essence of the Dao of Macrocosm, gave the body of the Blue Slime a glimmering starry l.u.s.ter that was reinforced by the Dao of Four Elements!","This seamless combination of 4 Grand Daos allowed the deadly expansion of the body of the blue slime to cover half of the Entity Vast before he could even react!","\"OOOOOH!\"","Vast bellowed out crazily as his face obtained a tinge of fear, utilizing him immense mana reserves to push all of the essence of Vastness he could command to stop the advancement of the body of the slime, a brilliant light shining out as the being that had not yet become an Entity had its swallowing stopped only halfway.","<<Universal Devouring>>.","RUMBLE!","The skill that caused the entire lineage of the Universal Emperor Slimes to be hunted down was cast.","What was terrifying about this skill was that when activated, the target that the body of the Blue Slime was wrapped around in would experience total devouring.","Not gradually or in a few seconds!","But...instant devouring!","Instant!!!!","WAP!","An instant was all that was required, and the lower half of an Entity disappeared.","\"...!\"","Old Man Khan’s expression turned ashen as the Entity Vast that was merely a torso with arms and a head screamed out a blood curdling cry!","\"AAAAAA!!!\"","The cry was one of immense fear and pain as it wasn’t just his body that was devoured, but half of his soul as well!","At this moment, there was but a single thought in this Entity’s mind.","That thought was to run!","To run and run extremely far away and at a rapid speed!","This was because Vast in his horrendously injured state could sense the viscous body of the slime beginning to expand as it wanted to swallow the rest of him.","So his half body shimmered with light as he was about to turn into a streak of light!","But it was at this time that Noah’s command descended onto the mind of Old Man Khan.","\"Now.\"","VROOOM!","Instantly, the attacks of four Peak Tier GALAXY Animus Summons that Old Man Khan had ready were thrown out, space thrown in chaos as his half body was pushed down towards the expanding Slime!","Horror filled his face as he saw his stomach fall into the viscous blue jelly, but he had no time to think as another horrendous attack descended down.","||Wrath of the Dragon Queen||.","RUUUUMBLE!","The chaotic void quaked as a magisterial presence descended yet again, hellish pillars of scorching multicolored flames from 4 illusory ten headed dragons and 1 very real one smashed into the half body of the Entity Vast, pushing him further into the expanding Blue Slime as even his head fell into the starry blue viscous mass!","\"AAAAA!!!\"","Dread filled this Entity’s whole body as beings at this level were extremely perceptive- and his senses shockingly told him that an instant later, he would be forever erased!","And this Entity’s intuition was correct as an instant later, terrifying words were uttered!","<<Universal Devouring>>","WAP!","\"...\"","As if he had never existed, the body of the Entity Vast ceased to be.","RUMBLE!","The now 1000 meter body of the Blue Slime shone with immense blue light as it trembled with happiness, its aura beginning to shoot up rapidly as something shocking was occurring within its body after it devoured an Entity!","Yet those on the battlefield only looked at the scene in stunned silence!","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"What the f*ck just happened...\"","Something unbelievable and terrifying took place as the entire battlefield came to a halt, only a single creature being able to move nonchalantly as a vibrant blue slime burped out happily while its aura rose!","...!!!"]},{"number":803,"title":"Chapter 803: Chapter 802 - Merely an Entity! II","paragraphs":["There very rarely comes an instance when a single person can be made speechless, and it’s even rare to make an entire group of people speechless.","Yet what had just occurred...made millions look forward stupidly as they didn’t even know what to do with themselves!","Those on the battlefield and those watching from their lofty thrones...each of them was looking at a shocking scene in a profound stupor!","Those on the battlefield experienced it most closely as they felt the horrendous aura of multiple grand daos erupt at once, and watched as a glimmering blue slime went on to devour an Entity in two gulps.","Yes, the Entity was being besieged by another Entity and even a terrifying Queen Dowager.","Yes, he was held down with two supremely powerful attacks as his upper half of a remaining body was swallowed. But...still!","He was an Entity! The Entity Vast! Known throughout the starry stars as a vile criminal proficient in a grand dao, and yet he...ah it was simply frustrating to even think about!","In the heart of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, the Holy Emperor’s throne was cracked in the middle as he had inadvertently put too much strength when he watched the scene playing out, his entire body trembling as his eyes shook while observing the scene.","\"How is this possible...\"","Only a muttering came out as the Holy Generals around him were silenced!","Far off in the Primal Winged Expanse, the expression of the Primal Emperor was ashen as he and the other Entities looked at the scene where one of the more powerful Entities from their side had fallen in a matter of seconds.","At this moment as they looked at the glimmering blue body of the slime, they saw this creature as some ancient Entity that the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter had hidden away, and that was the only way it could have done what it just did to Vast!","The entire sequence of the fall of the Entity Vast was pure majesty, every chained attack and execution of skills being something out of pure timed fantasy. If one thing had not occurred the way it did, the powerful Entity might have even survived.","Yet he was taken down by a terrifying slime!","Never in their wildest dreams would they have believed that the Blue Slime was merely at the Peak Tier GALAXY without fully comprehending any Daos yet when it did this, but even this was about to change as a shocking scene played out soon after.","Those on the battlefield and those watching from afar honed in on the figure of the enormous burping slime as they saw its body beginning to oscillate rapidly, a unique power beginning to coalesce from it!","Those familiar with this power became even more shaken as they realized it was the formation of an Aura of a fully comprehended Dao- the aura of what was commonly known as an Entity.","What!","THRUUUM!","Throughout the tumultuous essence, Noah’s body calmly warped above the enormous body of the blue slime as his figure came into focus on all those watching. Some seemed to have remembered that before the battle began, there was a small blue slime in this being’s hands as they now realized it was one and the same.","Their shaken minds became even more tumultuous as their brains worked hard to connect everything together, but Noah would not even give them time as while staring at the Blue Slime with shining eyes, he looked around the two armies that had come to a halt as his resonant voice rang out for all to hear.","\"That was the Entity everyone was making a big deal about? The Entity that the puny Primal Winged Expanse decided to send out first?\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking words reverberated out as the eyes of watching beings nearly bulged out when they saw the expression of disappointment on Noah’s face!","They really saw disappointment as they tried to grasp the incredulousness occurring at this moment, but his voice continued to ring out domineeringly.","\"Not even a trace of him remains from just two gulps of my pet, Ah!\"","\"He was only so-so, Merely an Entity!\"","RUMBLE!","The Holy Descendants and Ailerons nearly fell from the chaotic void at these domineering words, the far away powerful Entities from the Primal Winged Expanse adopting extremely solemn looks.","As Noah domineeringly floated in the chaotic void, the slime below him was releasing an ever increasing aura as its body began to go down in size. The increase in aura was of course the effect of <<Universal Devouring>>!","<<Universal Devouring>> :: Any life form that is devoured will be fully assimilated seamlessly as their abilities, Realm, Law Comprehensions, Dao Comprehensions, and anything else within their existence will be obtained. This is an ability unique to the Universal Emperor Slimes.","An ability unique to the Universal Emperor Slimes.","An ability that Noah saw would make him his first Entity, and it was exactly what was happening right now!","After having devoured Vast, the Blue Slime had gained the complete comprehension of the Grand Dao of Vastness as it now became a genuine Entity!","RUMBLE!","This was the same unique essence that beings associated with Entities! The same overpowering essence that would make any of those not in this realm feel overwhelming pressure!","This was the essence of a Grand Controller of a Dao, something even more unique and greater than laws as at this moment, the powerful essence of Vastness formed around the body of the Blue Slime like a natural Domain.","A domain of Dao Essence naturally and ever so present on its body!","THRUUM!","Through the contract he shared with the slime, Noah was able to see its stat panel as he observed something new appearing within it.","{Aura of the Grand Controller of Vastness} :: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended the Grand Dao of Vastness. It grants +5,000% Extra Damage, Increases the Mana Pool by 1,000%, and allows the Grand Controller of Vastness to utilize this Dao in unique ways...","A shimmering blue aura that Noah had seen as a film layer of light on the body of Vast now formed on his Animus Summon, the passive +5,000% damage of such an aura being the reason why Entities were so dreadful- not to mention the unique qualities of what a respective dao would provide!","Ah!","Noah reached out as he grasped onto the now small blue slime with excitment, its eyes having turned innocent once more as they blinked happily towards him.","Yet he had a wide smile appearing on his lips, a smile that caused others to be terrified as they observed Noah turning his head towards the Aileron Army while uttering horrendous words.","\"Now then, why don’t we start farming loot?\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":804,"title":"Chapter 804: Chapter 803 - Dreadful! I","paragraphs":["Fear was a curious thing.","There were many types of fear, but the more prevalent one at this time was the all consuming fear of death.","Rarely would a being ever feel such a fear, and it might only be once or twice in their lifetimes where one could see their life flash before their eyes.","At this moment, millions of Ailerons felt a deep and intense fear, a dreadful type of fear that guaranteed death for them the moment that the singular being holding on to a wiggling Blue Slime turned his eyes towards them!","Their hearts were enveloped in an intense fear as just from this being’s gaze, they saw that they were not even considered living things anymore! From his eyes, they saw that Noah’s gaze already considered all of them dead!","This thought actually had some truth in it as at this moment, Noah considered them as nothing more than loot- and it was loot of such great quality that he would never let it escape his sight.","\"Aaaah...!\"","\"Run...!\"","\"Run...!!!\"","THRUUUM!","Figures began to twist and tumble as the natural response to their all consuming fear was to naturally run.","RUMBLE!","Ignoring the Holy Descendants and any other enemies in front of them, the Aileron Army began to scatter as the Peak Tier GALAXY experts were the first to turn into streaks of light!","But the being targeting them was truly unforgiving and much faster than them, the void being something he could consider his home because of the [Void Devouring Blood Terror] skill tree that stemmed from Blood Lord. The moment his words finished and just as they began running, his figure melded into the chaotic void as he appeared right in the midst of the Aileron Army, uttering a single ability that would be feared by many in the future to come.","[Life Realm].","\"...\"","WAA!","Faster than a flash of light, a unique green light expanded out for hundreds of miles as it passed through every single Aileron and even included Noah’s subordinates and some of the Holy Descendants from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter.","This flash of green light washed over every single being on the side of the Aileron Army as the moment it receded...they all disappeared!","\"...\"","Many did not know what had just occurred, but some truly knowledgeable people did as back in the heart of the Primal Winged Expanse where the Primal Emperor was surrounded by Entities, one of them uttered with a solemn expression.","\"Instant Realm Creation...\"","The words made the expressions of the powerful beings in the surroundings much graver as they knew the intricacies of what this meant!","It wasn’t just the fact that it was a unique and rare seen ability, it was that utilizing it would truly require too much essence, especially when it came to forcefully creating an isolated space and dragging other beings into it.","An Entity had a somber expression as he voiced out what everyone else was thinking.","\"Unless they work together to very quickly break the spatial locks of that Realm, that entire Aileron Legion...is lost.\"","RUMBLE!","The body of the Primal Emperor trembled as his eyes were filled with wrath, but he came to the same conclusion!","All those caught in the newly created Realm would be facing the horrendous creature that devoured the Entity Vast...and what could they do against such a creature?","\"Good! Good! Good!\"","The Primal Emperor uttered indignantly as he continued to look at the scene with wrathful eyes!","...","Back in the Rising Stellar Peaks, the Old Man Khan stared at the enormous green door that represented the entrance into the Realm that Noah had locked millions of experts in, his hand landing against this door as he found that he wasn’t granted entrance!","It was a realm that locked everybody in and kept everyone out!","The other defenders of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter didn’t know if they should cheer or celebrate as the war truly did not follow the norms, many of them simply feeling a tinge of fear when they thought about the being carrying a blue slime and the fearsome 10 headed dragon that he commanded.","Even they did not want to know what was happening inside the locked Realm!","But inside of the [Life Realm], Noah stood above scrambling Aileron Forces as his gaze was cold.","In the past few seconds, the GALAXY experts from the Aileron forces had pushed down their fear as they tried to work together to break the confines of the Life Realm!","When they found to their despair was the thick roots being nearly impermeable to damage, looking towards each other in dismay as they then grouped together and stood in front of their entire disorganized Aileron Army.","\"If you want to get out, it’s only my death that will allow it.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s voice reverberated out as the Ailerons looked towards him with solemn faces, their hearts not necessarily fearing his figure the most, but the figure of the Blue Slime he carried in his hands!","This singular Blue Slime was currently releasing an oppressive aura of a being that had fully comprehended a Dao- an aura unique to an Entity! To their dismay, they found that they were actually imprisoned in a Realm with a dreadful enemy Entity that had defeated Vast in two attacks.","Their dismay was palpable as around 8 Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons cl.u.s.tered together, the millions of other Ailerons grouping up behind them pensively!","It was an astounding sight as near Noah, his 6 other Middle Tier Summons were by his side, his subordinates that numbered a bit over 30 beings also standing behind him as the enormous figure of Tiamat overshadowed all of them.","Even further behind Noah were a few tens of thousands of the defenders of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter that got caught up in his Life Realm.","But the scene was that grand! Millions of beings on one side, and it was actually this side that was looking fearfully to the opposing side that had less than 50,000 beings!","As Noah stared at the 8 Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons, the tens of them that were in the Middle Tier, and the over 100 in the Low tier GALAXY Realm...his eyes shone with palpable beams of light as all he could see was loot!","While holding the blue slime within his hands, he uttered shocking words that caused the blood of all the Ailerons to run cold.","\"Let’s see what this stage of Entity is all about. Don’t devour them, just kill them.\"","THRUUUM!"]},{"number":805,"title":"Chapter 805: Chapter 804 - Dreadful! II","paragraphs":["\"Let’s see what this stage of Entity is all about. Don’t devour them, just kill them.\"","Noah gave a command to the innocent Blue Slime that was releasing a horrendous aura, telling him not to devour the Aileron Army as the nature of the Universal Emperor Slime meant they would be devoured in their entirety as even loot would not be released- this was what occurred with the Entity Vast!","Noah then turned to his subordinates as he gave them a nod.","\"Go all out, my summons and Tiamat will protect you all.\"","RAA! RAA! RAA!","The Emperor Penguin bellowed out wildly at this as he and the others moved, Noah’s gaze then turning to the Holy Descendants that got wrapped up in the Life Realm!","\"You all just relax here for now, we should be done in a bit.\"","...!","Alarm and a deadly chill was the only thing the defenders of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter felt at these words even though they were all supposedly on the same side. What made them feel a cold chill was the dreadful attitude of this being that looked at the Aileron Army as nothing more than dead things!","This was a cold and heartless attitude they would only see in extremely powerful beings. The cold detachment while they condemned millions to death.","It was truly dreadful!","Of course, Noah himself knew of his actions and their consequences, his heart already prepared to bear the heavy responsibility even as he gave out the commands.","If they were on the weaker side when facing this Aileron Army, their lives would be left to their vices as they would be taken away without so much as a thought. It was merely kill or be killed. It was war, and war never changes!","So his eyes remained cold as he uttered to Tiamat as well.","\"Scorch them.\"","ROOOOAR!","The space shaking roar of a fearsome Queen Dowager erupted out as a ||Wrath of the Dragon Queen|| was cast!","Before, it was directed against an Entity as they used their wondrous essence to withstand such an attack with only minor burns. But the target this time was Low to Peak Tier GALAXY being who didn’t have such power- so the pillars of scorching multicolored flames from 50 draconic heads was an Apocalypse inducing scene as all those touched were disintegrated!","\"AAAAH!\"","\"We yield!\"","\"Take us prisoners!\"","Crisp and clean outline of cylindrical pillars would be left as gaps in the Aileron Army after scorching multicolored flames passed through them, only the Peak Tier GALAXY experts being able to withstand such an attack with heavy injuries or even possibly evade it.","Some had already begun pleading for their lives as Noah maintained his cold look while overseeing everything occurring in the life realm!","Others would argue that the rest of the army were merely soldiers following orders. That they were somehow blameless and only following the words of their generals.","Noah didn’t believe this thought as he knew those very same soldiers were the ones committing atrocities to anyone they were aimed to! They make the choice to pull the trigger, so they were directly responsible as well!","THRUUUM","So the dreadful scene of carnage in the Life Realm continued to play out as the tens of thousands of Holy Descendants that were watching felt their blood run cold.","They watched as after the scorching multicolored pillars of flames from Tiamat ended, the figure of Blue Slime descended onto the Aileron Army along with the fearsome subordinates of Noah.","The methods of the Blue Slime that was an Entity were particularly disastrous as its shimmering blue body expanded on wildly while compressing itself, coming into the shape of a luminous blue disc that was about 100 meters!","This blue disc thrummed with the aura of multiple Grand Daos, particularly the aura of the Grand Dao of Vastness is it allowed for the unique essence of an Entity to wrap around its body seamlessly.","ZIIIING!","The disc shaped Entity...then spun rapidly while barreling towards the aileron army, causing a shocking scene of dismembered wings and limbs to fly out as all those seeing the shimmering blue light would try to run away!","In the face of the Blue Slime, Tiamat, and Noah’s 6 other summons- even his subordinates from the Infinite Galaxy paled in comparison as more than 75% of the millions in the Aileron Army would go on to be taken down by him.","This was the burden of lives he would bear, as well as the Dao Crystals that had begun to appear on the battlefield with the deaths of powerful GALAXY ranked Ailerons who actually had deep comprehensions in the Dao of Withering, these Dao Crystals shooting out gorgeous beams of red loot light to the skies!","The scene was truly that of carnage and wonder as it continued silently in the locked Life Realm...","...","The situation of the battlefield at the Rising Stellar Peaks was thrown into a lull as millions of powerful Holy Descendants remained without enemies!","They could only stare at the shimmering green door that represented a Realm for about 30 minutes, and it was only then that they began to see some changes.","THRUUUM!","...!","The figures of the released beings made many people draw their breaths sharply, their hearts turning cold as they saw the thousands of Holy Descendants that were wrapped in the forced realm formation, as well as Noah and the forces he brought forth.","That was all!","The millions of Ailerons...none of them could be seen!","Such a shocking reality brought shock to many as the thousands of Ailerons that had witnessed what had occured in the Life Realm...they were looking towards the Blue Slime that had innocently gone back atop Noah’s head fearfully.","Nearby, the figure of a curvaceous Tiamat in human form could be seen as at this moment, all eyes landed on them!"]},{"number":806,"title":"Chapter 806: Chapter 805 - Shock and Reverence","paragraphs":["Many eyes close by and afar were glancing towards a single figure- a single human that had a wobbly slime atop his head as his eyes seemed to blaze with a profound light!","He seemed to very well know that all eyes were on him as he glanced at the solemn Old Man Khan who had the party of Holy Prince Rudolf, Princess Anastasia, and Princess Anna with him.","His eyes glazed over them as they turned around to face the blank chaotic void where millions of Ailerons used to be. The area was devoid of any life but Noah knew that further in, there were still multiple Ailerons putting their lives on the line to uncover more information and report what was happening here back to their command bases!","So he stared out towards the blank chaotic void as he voiced out grandly.","\"The Entity Vast was only so-so, and the Aileron Legion was even worse to match against! I hope the next battle will not be as disappointing...\"","RUMBLE!","Words of immense ridicule came out of him as those watching him felt a variety of emotions.","His demeanor was domineering!","This being...","The eyes glancing towards the being known as Noah were very different now compared to just an hour ago as those watching knew that the deadly Blue Slime that was a genuine Entity and even the terrifying Ten-headed dragon that was nearing the rank of an Entity all acted under his orders.","As he floated in the chaotic void grandly and spoke domineeringly, they were reminded of this reality!","This was because such a reality made it so that even though he wasn’t an Entity himself, he was even more monstrous than one as at the Middle Tier GALAXY stage, he was somehow commanding two Entity-equivalent creatures!","Even someone at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm like Old Man Khan was known as one of the strongest experts in the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter because of his Starry Behemoth Tarragon that had fully comprehended a Dao, his other three pets merely being at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm without having fully comprehended a Dao.","So for someone like Noah to have two Entities below him...many beings could only sigh in envy!","In the chaotic void, Noah seemed to have lost interest as he waved his hands, his figure beginning to go back towards the Rising Stellar Peaks as his subordinates followed close by with shining eyes.","This was because the battle they had gone through...had truly been eye opening!","---","As the Primal Emperor looked at the scene of Noah’s majestic figure, his face was cold as he spoke out to the Entities around him.","\"Brother Vast fell into a trap where he was besieged by one of the most powerful Entities of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter paired with a Dragon that has power at the cusp of an Entity...and that deceitful Slime that made it seem like it only broke through to become an Entity after Brother Vast was unjustly ganged up on!\"","RUMBLE!","The gaze of the Aileron Emperor shone with power as his wings released a grand light, those around him looking at each other with shining eyes as he continued.","\"Being able to stand against 3 Entities by himself and letting us reveal the hidden experts of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter is something we will forever be thankful to Brother Vast for! But this development only makes it all the more important for us to win this war!\"","\"That deceitful slime and ten headed dragon...the first time I saw them was when the Great Sage’s Primal Holy Land teleported my people out for the last time. For them to grow to such a level, the treasures in the Sage’s Holy Land must be something that we all seek, with the Ruination Core most likely being there as well...\"","RUMBLE!","The hearts of many beings were moved as the figure of the Holy Emperor rose, containing his talk as many schemes and plans sprouted!","...","In another area, the Holy Emperor was standing grandly with a shining gaze as his eyes honed in on the figure of Noah.","He thought of the fact that when he first met this being, he was at the QUASAR Realm and had only entered his eyes as a powerful genius to groom for the future.","He expected this future to be tens or hundreds of years down the line, not in a matter of f.u.c.k.i.n.g days!","When he really thought about it, his body actually began trembling as the reality that it had only been over 1 week and a half since their first meeting registered on his mind.","Less than 2 weeks since this Noah entered his Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, and he was somehow in the Middle Tier GALAXY Realm as he commanded an Animus Summon at the stage of an Entity and another that neared the same stage!","\"Holy shi...\"","The Holy Emperor nearly let off expletives as this thought fully registered, his figure disappearing from among the many other shocked Royals and Generals of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter as he made way towards the Rising Stellar Peak!","Meanwhile, Noah himself was not in the mood to show off or antagonize anyone anymore, his attention now set on all the loot that he and his Summons had collected over this battle at the Rising Stellar Peaks.","He talked with the figures of Old Man Khan and other Holy Descendants that were looking at him with extremely different gazes, leaving them with the tasks of any clean up as he teleported into the Infinite Galaxy with all of his people!","The figures of the Emperor Penguin, Elena, Kazuhiko and others entered the eyes of the experts of Ancient Powers and left them just as quickly, only being left to wonder what the geniuses that Noah brought forth really were.","In a certain starry space of the Infinite Galaxy, a wondrous scene was taking place as Noah floated in the skies, breathed out excitedly...and waved his hands, releasing all the loot that he had personally collected to float in front of him!","His summons that shimmered with the Grand lights of manifested Galaxies also took the initiative as they released all the loot they had picked up into the starry space in front of them, causing for the formation of gorgeous beams of loot light to shine all around!","From Dao Crystals to luminous Cores to Skill Books...","It was loot!","Sweet, gorgeous, resplendent loot!","Ah!"]},{"number":807,"title":"Chapter 807: Chapter 806 - Crystals! Cores! Skills!","paragraphs":["\"Am I dreaming...?\"","In a starry space outside of the Infinite Realm that was at the center of the Infinite Galaxy, enormous mountains of loot were piled up as they floated brilliantly in space!","Kazuhiko was looking at these mountainous bundles of loot as he pinched himself to see if he was dreaming, others around him shaking their heads as they all looked towards a single person.","All of the Harbingers and experts of the Infinite Galaxy stared towards the being that had a wobbly blue slime on his head as his eyes shone with a more blazing light than any of them! They were waiting for him to give direction and divide the loot as nearly 80% of it came from a wave of his hands and what his summoned animus released.","Even with all of them working together, their loot was barely 20% of what Noah had collected by himself!","\"Little Fish, these Crystals...\"","The voice of Barbatos rang out as her eyes were drawn into the Dao Crystals that only Noah and his pets could farm by chance from killing any being that were proficient in a Dao. She glanced at the Dao Crystals as she found out their information, her body beginning to shake as her eyes shone brightly!","Noah also came out of his stupor from glancing at all the loot as he smiled and spoke grandly.","\"Yes, the Dao Crystals are the most important out of everything collected...as they give a direct path to the title of Entity without having to spend hundreds of years comprehending the Dao!\"","THRUUUM!","Noah waved his hands as he collected all of the resplendent Dao Crystals that were shooting out gorgeous beams of loot light in the starry space, counting all of them as he made quick calculations based on the percentages each one would give.","Let’s do some math for a second.","After the Blue Slime assassinated the Entity Vast, Noah collected 8 Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons, tens in the middle tier, and a bit over a 100 in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm! This was nearly ten times as many GALAXY experts as the ones Noah had taken down in the Primal Holy Land and obtained enough Dao Crystals to comprehend 30% of the Lesser Dao of Withering.","But from the recent battles, there were 8 Peak Tier Experts that had comprehended much more of the Dao of Withering, so Noah received an overabundance of Dao Crystals from three of them who actually triggered the 10% chance to explode into Dao Crystals!","There was also the Ailerons in the QUASAR and Nebula Realm that made up the millions he had dreadfully reaped the lives of in the Life Realm- even though most had not embarked on the path of the Dao and those who did had abysmal comprehensions, the Affix was still triggered for them as Noah and his pets obtained a Dao Crystal here and there.","All of these factors culminated in the amount of Dao Crystals Noah gathered as his calculations continued!","When he collected all of them and finished his calculations...his eyes blazed with light as he shockingly found that with the 10% chance of Dao Crystals to drop from the defeated enemies proficient in a Dao, he had obtained enough of such Crystals to bring someone to 100% completion...over 12 times!","RUMBLE!","This meant that just from this battle, Noah’s own luck and the luck of his summons was great enough to give him enough Dao Crystals to make 12 full fledged Entities.","\"...!\"","Even Noah himself was alarmed at this reality as he found this Affix of the Ruination Core to be simply ridiculous when paired up with what he could do!","Of course, there was still the fact that those who absorbed the Dao Crystals had to be at Peak Tier Entity to be considered titled Entities for the norms of the Dark Universe.","This was because never in history had someone that had been in the Low or Middle Tier Realms been capable of fully comprehending a Dao to completion, only those at the Peak Tier living enough years and having the talent to achieve such a task!","But when it came to Noah...why would it matter to him whether they were considered full fledged Entities or not based on their Realm?","If he were to just give one of his subordinates a portion of the Dao Crystals and grant them 100% in the Dao of Withering, they would still get the unique aura of a Controller of a Dao as they received the horrendous boost in power that came with it!","RUMBLE!","Such was the truth Noah formed in his mind as he then looked at the subordinates around him...and then turned his eyes towards the pile of loot.","The task of who to power level to 100% comprehension of a lesser Dao would come later, the sacred task of finishing the count of loot continuing for now.","Aside from the Dao Crystals, there was a gorgeous amount of Cores ranging from Nebula all the way to Peak GALAXY!","The sheer amount of Middle Tier and Peak Tier GALAXY Cores made Noah believe it wouldn’t be an issue for him to ascend to Peak Tier after absorbing them, and it remained unknown if any would be left to power his subordinates to Middle or Peak Tier depending on how many it took for him to rise up.","His strength would still come first as with his Traits, he could dish out ridiculous power as even with the Dao Crystals, he would be using one of the 12 spots first and becoming the first Entity of the Infinite Galaxy!","THRUM!","Noah waved his hands as the Cores were also divided cleanly, his subordinates only watching with salivating eyes in the distance.","Next up were the Skill Books that were simply too numerous, but Noah took some time to scan through them as he found multiple techniques that utilized the Dao of Withering that would constitute an entire skill tree, as well as millions of other skills that would clutter the stat panel of anyone who dared!","All in all, it was a gorgeous scene of cleanly divided mountains of Dao Crystals, Cores, and Skill Books that filled the starry space of this small region of the Infinite Galaxy with a luminous treasure light!"]},{"number":808,"title":"Chapter 808: Chapter 807 - Since powering up has been so slow...","paragraphs":["Aside from the gorgeous loot, one must not forget an even bigger present out of an all out war with beings that were considered different existences from Noah.","It was, of course, the Skill Points that made many things possible that Noah was now looking at with passionate eyes as he made his subordinates wait even longer before they could enjoy the loot before them.","In his stat panel, he saw the gorgeous count of 12,358,013 Skill Points!","From the measly 2 million he had before, he had jumped up by 10 just from defeating the army that the Entity Vast led!","Such a number of skill points made his emotions churn as with them, he achieved his goal of 10 million skill points that were required to create a particular skill.","It was a skill meant to accelerate Noah’s growth, since he felt like he had just been rising too slowly in the past few weeks...","The rising he was thinking about wasn’t in terms of Realms or comprehending Daos and Laws, he knew very well that he was nearing or even already breaking any existing balance jumping from QUASAR to Low Tier and then Middle Tier in just weeks, where he was even about to attempt reaching Peak Tier Galaxy after just a bit over a week since his last Realm advancement!","The rising that he felt was going very slowly was of course the progress of assimilation of laws, and eventually it would be the assimilation of Daos that would stump him for years to come!","He found many loopholes to bypass the hundreds of years others would need to bypass Realms and comprehend laws and daos, but his progress in assimilation was abysmal as even now- he only had 5% in the progress of assimilation all Universal Laws.","To him, such a number was unacceptable as he wanted to bypass this point as well as the future hindrances of assimilating Daos. The solution...was to create a fearsome skill after he got some inspiration from seeing a particular Affix of the Ruination Core!","Thus, a skill named [Loot Drop- Assimilation Crystals], was created! Though its cost had stumped Noah until now.","A skill for his biggest problem at this moment.","A skill that allowed him to have a cheat when it came to something that would take beings hundreds or thousands of years to do- the Assimilation of Laws and Daos!","\"Haha!\"","He laughed out grandly as he gave the confirmation, 10 million skill points disappearing just like that as he gained a new passive skill on his stat panel.","He stared at this ability with shining eyes for a few seconds as he thought of a future where both Dao Crystals and Assimilation Crystals would drop freely, imagining a future where it wouldn’t take him months or over a year to assimilate all universal laws and step on the path of a Cosmic Dao that was promised to him, of a future where fully assimilating Daos to become a Sage or a Great Sage would only take him a matter of months if not less!","Who needed 100 years?","Who even needed 10?!","RUMBLE!","His essence thrummed forth domineeringly as he gazed upon the experts of his Infinite Galaxy that were still eyeing the loot- especially the Dao crystals, with shining eyes.","\"There shall be no favoritism when it comes to these Dao Crystals that are an easy path to becoming an Entity.\"","...!","Kazuhiko, Steel Mikhail, and all the other guys and Beasts of the Infinite Galaxy breathed out sighs of relief as they half expected the curvaceous women around Noah to be the first to be given these Dao Crystals as they awaited their turn for whenever the next battle came.","\"Hmph.\"","Barbatos saw their expression as she pouted while looking towards Noah, Elena’s eyes only shining ever brighter as it seemed her fanaticism only increased!","Noah continued as he gazed towards all of them calmly.","\"Simply put, the strongest at this moment will receive enough crystals to grant them 100% comprehension in the Lesser Dao of Withering. As for deciding the ranks of strength...it is naturally through combat!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah brought his arms to his head as he brought down the wiggling blue slime, continuing with his words as he pushed the slime forward.","\"This little guy has the keenest senses out of all us here, so he will oversee you guys competing as the strongest 11...will be among those who will very soon step into the ranks of Entities!\"","Essence blazed out wildly as the subordinates looked at each other with wild eyes.","They each knew what a power like that represented, and wanted to grasp it within their hands as they knew it was the peak of power at this moment!","RAA! RAA! RAA!","The Emperor Penguin bellowed out wildly as it floated in front of everyone else, calling out domineeringly with its golden beak raised high.","\"As the first beast of the original Spiritual Land, I will naturally have to keep my lead as the strongest! Who shall match me...!\"","THRUUM!","The scene became competitive as a mini tournament would go underway in the Infinite Galaxy!","Meanwhile, Noah stepped away as he grabbed the Middle and Peak Tier GALAXY Cores, disappearing from the starry space as he entered the depth of the Infinite Realm that was at the center of everything, and also the location where essence converged the most.","The area he arrived in was a culmination of multiple Law Spaces, where multicolored milky essence of all types could be seen physically coagulated because of the intense concentration!","’Just when will I have Dao Law Spaces...Ah!’","He shook his head sorrowfully as he sat down at a location that wasn’t too far away from the core of his Infinite Galaxy, choosing this place to absorb the numerous Middle and Peak Tier GALAXY Cores as he tried to see if they were enough for him to enter Peak Tier!","Thereafter...he would absorb one of the 12 portions of the Dao of Withering Crystals as he became a genuine Entity...","When one looked at the time, he spent 2 weeks traveling to the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter as he then spent just a bit less than 2 weeks within this Ancient Power.","Yet in this period of time, he went from QUASAR to Low Tier GALAXY, to Middle Tier GALAXY, and now...he wanted to enter Peak Tier GALAXY!","Less than a month!","Ah!"]},{"number":809,"title":"Chapter 809: Chapter 808 - ENTITY! I","paragraphs":["A variety of scenes were taking place at this time as many beings moved with their own ideals.","A few hours had passed since the battle at the Rising Stellar Peaks as the consequences were dealt with by the forces of the Primal Winged Expanse and the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter!","In the Rising Stellar Peaks region, the defense line found itself returning to position as very few of them had lost their lives, Old Man Khan reshuffling the forces as he stood guard over the region once more.","This powerful Entity didn’t know what to think as he stared at Anastasia, the one who had brought them to have a connection with the mysterious being that now commanded a powerful Animus Entity!","\"You can look at me all you want, but I won’t have any answers.\"","Anastasia spoke out calmly while looking at Old Man Khan and Prince Rudolf who had a lost look by the side.","RUMBLE!","Yet in the next second, a surprising event occurred as they felt a powerful aura near them, but this aura came from the place they called home and was extremely familiar as they calmed down and looked toward a certain direction, the image of the magisterial Holy Emperor materializing in front of their eyes as he spoke quickly.","\"Where is that domineering little Entity?\"","He spoke with a jovial smile as all he got was a head shake from Old Man Khan and Prince Rudolf, Anastasia being the one to speak as she stared out into the vast chaotic void.","\"He disappeared some time back to take care of something, he should return in a bit.\"","\"Hmm? Good! We must prepare a grand celebration!\"","In the Primal Winged Expanse, the Primal Emperor was speaking to a Peak Tier GALAXY expert that had a solemn expression on their face.","\"Take a few of your brothers and head towards the other Ancient Powers. Let it be known that the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter has unearthed their Sages’s Legacy...and that they have a Ruination Core!\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking commands came out from the Primal Emperor as the expert he was speaking to nodded sternly, his figure flashing away a second later.","The only one who remained was the Primal Emperor himself as his wings shimmered mystically, the Aura of the Dao of Withering on his body being extremely condensed as he was the single being within his Ancient Power that was the closest to fully assimilating this law.","Yet he could never take that last step and enter into the status of a Sage as like many Entities, he found that he could not so easily fully assimilate a Dao!","One had to find outside help and unique resources to do so, and unique treasures like the Tools of Ruination were at the forefront of things sought after by all Entities.","The Primal Emperor...would do all that he could to make sure that he got his hands on the treasures of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, even if he had to muddle the playing field and throw out bait to see if any other parties would bite!","THRUUUM!","This essence revolved around him as in his hands, a wondrous looking GALAXY core that shone with the light of stars was reducing by size every second as he absorbed more and more of it.","It went from something the size of a head and became a mere grain of sand in minutes as all the essence within it was s.u.c.k.e.d out entirely!","\"Haaa...\"","Noah sighed out in contentment as every single part of his body seemed to be vibrating with energy, his manifested GALAXY ever so close to remaining at Grand Completion before he could advance into the Peak Tier stage.","He had actually finished absorbing all of the Middle Tier GALAXY Cores as he was now on his 5th Peak Tier Core, and he finally felt the feeling of being full as the hundreds of billions of stars that formed in his illusory galaxy moved in a wondrous symphony of power and regality!","THRUUUM!","He began absorbing the next Peak Tier Core as this feeling came even closer, going on to finish this and another three more before he felt entirely full, a cracking sound tingling out thereafter as it felt like a dam had broken loose and surging waters were sundering down!","OOOM!","The atmospheric essence and law essence all around him resonated as he became the center of a huge mana storm, his GALAXY expanding on contracting constantly as it released wondrous waves of power.","He would be in this stage for some time to come as what he would focus on from now on would entirely shift to laws and Daos, where unlocking the next path of power lied in fully comprehending and assimilating Daos as he would then rise into the title of a Sage!","WAAA!","The raging essence around him slowed down as his figure became clear.","One could see the devilishly charming face carved from the traits of the Vampyre Progenitor. His hair was all sorts of colors at this point after he let it freely be influenced by the universal law essences flowing through his body, but his Manifested GALAXY was the most eye catching as it represented him standing among the ranks of true experts in the Dark Universe!","The Realm of Peak Tier GALAXY!"]},{"number":810,"title":"Chapter 810: Chapter 809 - ENTITY! II","paragraphs":["After a being achieved so many grand things consecutively, one would think they would take a breather and appreciate their work for a second.","Noah appreciated his work for s literal second as he nodded proudly while glancing at his Peak Tier GALAXY...and then waved his hands to bring out the wondrous Dao Crystals as he already moved on to grab another achievement!","The targeted goal this time was to comprehend a Dao to completion and obtain the title of an Entity, and Noah planned to do this in a stellar fashion.","Unlike others who would take hundreds of years to fully comprehend a Dao, he had the affix from a Ruination Core that allowed him to obtain Dao Crystals- treasures he would use to fully comprehend a Dao he never had skill in or began before and comprehend it fully in a shocking period of time!","His hands grasped the brilliant Dao Crystals as they shone with l.u.s.ter, their shine flashing brightly before dimming as he began to absorb...","While Noah began absorbing the resplendent Dao Crystals, the experts of the Infinite Galaxy were fighting to see who was strong enough to obtain the other 11 seats that would give birth to Entities!","Through sheer dominating power and the fact that they were the only ones to currently hold PRISMATIC Summons, the strength of the Emperor Penguin and Barbatos came out on top as they secured their spots.","The other figure that let himself known brightly was the Imperial Adjudicator, this old fox using his age and experiences paired with his Ultra Rare and Rare Summons he had obtained after switching to the techniques of the Infinite Galaxy- he used these Summons to wipe the floor with others as he obtained a spot himself, his conviction to obtain strength and be able to shoulder the burdens of Anastasia and Anna shining brightly!","Kazuhiko couldn’t be left behind as he utilized his Trait that nearly made him invulnerable on top of his Summons to claim another spot, Steel Mikhail and Athena being another two that shone brightly in their battles.","With an excited slime that was now an Entity overseeing the mini tournament, it quickly ended as the ranks of strength were decided and the other 5 that would be getting their hands of the treasured Dao Crystals were the Kraken, Elena, the Ruler of the Demon Realm Agares who held the Sin of Envy, the Imperial Phoenix who managed to break through and barely clinch in, as well as Anna who was around Noah the most since the Primal Holy Land!","All of them were in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm as their Traits and summoned Animus were what played key roles in obtaining their levels of strength.","RAA!","After the ranks were decided, the Emperor Penguin cried out grandiosely as it floated in front of everyone else, Barbatos showing an annoyed expression as they all looked towards the jovial Blue Slime and nonchalant Tiamat while waiting for Noah!","In the depths of the Infinite Realm that was at the Center of Infinite Galaxy, Noah’s eyes were shining brightly with palpable beams of light as he stupidly saw the percentage next to the Dao of Withering to really rise from 0% to 10% and then 90% just an hour later.","It was such a fantastical and unbelievable scene that should have never been possible, yet minutes later he continued absorbing the required Dao Crystals as the number went to 99% and ultimately reached...100%.","THRUUUM!","The area around him shook the moment this occurred, a momentous aura descending down as a phenomenon similar to when the Blue Slime became an Entity was recreated, albeit at a slightly smaller scale as the Dao in question was a Lesser Dao!","Noah felt the essence of the Dao of Withering he had never even touched until now descend unto him like it belonged to him for years, his heart strings being pulled as numerous ways to utilize the Dao bloomed in his mind.","He could better utilize this Dao if he created his own skill tree dedicated to it, or simply absorb enough skills from the defeated GALAXY Ailerons to form a skill tree from the skill books he obtained!","RUMBLE!","His thoughts were taken away as he had to stop everything to sense the new aura spreading around him, covering every part of him as he began to feel a sense of boundless strength.","This was an aura every Entity was afforded when they fully comprehended a Dao, an Aura of a Dao Controller!","<strong>{Aura of the Controller of Withering} :: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended the Lesser Dao of Withering. It grants +2,500% Extra Damage and allows the attacks of the Controller of Withering to contain a unique corrosive essence that deconstructs and reduces the attacks, mana, and life force of the target until they become empty husks...</strong>","A passive aura that granted half the percentage of Extra Damage as a Grand Dao, this one with its own unique feature as the Dao of Withering deconstructed and reduced something into nothingness. It was in the name- Withering!","Such an aura, similar to the Aura of the Grand Controller of Vastness, could have its percentage boosts increased and even more features unlocked in the future as one assimilated it into their origins and souls.","This was why those who were further in assimilation were extremely powerful, those who could fully do it and become Sages being geniuses that deserved their reverence!","Yet this would be a worry for later as for now, Noah’s body rose grandly while sensing the power flowing through him, knowing he had come a long way to achieve what he just achieved at this instant.","ENTITY!","He had achieved the title of Entity just a month or two after knowing and meeting such beings, a rank at the peak of power for the surrounding light years as it would allow him to move with ease and confidence! He could not help but bellow out a heart shaking roar as if he was announcing his arrival!","OOOOOOOOH!","The essence around him trembled as he called out, his dark hair flying wildly as an oppressive air leaked from him, his figure akin to an ancient creature from the Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":811,"title":"Chapter 811: Chapter 810 - Making Entities is Easy!","paragraphs":["OOOOOOH!","Noah’s bellow seemed to travel out from the expansive Infinite Realm and echo into the even more expansive Infinite Galaxy, his entrance into the title of an Entity being something celebrated by the Infinite Galaxy itself.","Such a stage allowed him great strength and survivability as he could now withstand strikes from those powerful Entities, being able to use the fully comprehended essence of the Lesser Dao to battle against powerful Bosses without being overwhelmed.","It was akin to a level 1 noob fighting the strongest boss of the dungeon right away- even if they were pay to win players who were armed to the teeth, because they hadn’t grinded and their level was below the boss by such a large extent, they would get obliterated at the end! It was an impossible gulf to cross before, but Noah had now risen to the level of these bosses as he could defend against their attacks and even get through their defences as he now stood at the same stage as them!","\"Ah...\"","He let out a content sigh as he enjoyed the feeling of his newfound strength while teleporting away, returning to the area where a mini tournament just ended as he found the Harbingers of Sin and other powerful combatants of the Infinite Galaxy cl.u.s.tered around the friendly Blue Slime.","Tiamat was off to the side as her drop dead figure seemed unapproachable, her gaze forlorn as she stared out into the starry space where even her aura could not find the end of within this wide Galaxy!","Noah’s appearance caused excitement to appear in the eyes of everyone as Tiamat turned towards him with shining eyes.","Her thoughts were tumultuous as she remembered the promise she had with this supposed Master of hers who wanted to be a Sage in under 10 years.","She had laughed at this as she thought it to be a mere joke, yet as she watched this being go from Middle Tier GALAXY and enter the Peak while also becoming an Entity in just days...she wasn’t so sure!","Her gaze was inquisitive as she wondered how he had been able to cause something as universe defying as Dao Crystals to come to be, such a treasure effectively being able to make one an Entity with such ease that she found herself questioning whether to ask for a portion herself as well.","’Hmph!’","She instantly threw this thought away as her pride was too high, knowing that she would very soon make a breakthrough and fully comprehend the Dao of Destruction.","This was a Grand Dao! What would a mere Lesser Dao of Withering be compared to this? So the dreadful Queen Dowager turned her head away from Noah’s brilliance as others swarmed towards him!","\"Master, I’m as amazing as ever that I even surprised myself...\"","The Emperor Penguin was shining with a golden light as he began bragging about his strength among everyone else, Noah patting this Penguin’s silky fur as he got the gist of what happened from everyone else.","He nodded towards the beings that earned the privilege of becoming future Entities, waving his hands as the glimmering red Dao Crystals he collected went towards each of them!","Every single one of them received the portion required to reach 100% in the Dao of Withering, their hands quickly going towards these treasures as their eyes glowed brilliantly.","\"Take your time to absorb them and feel out the Dao. You should get to 100% in just an Hour or two as you gain something only Entities grasp...with you getting the full title whenever we collect enough cores to bring everyone to Peak Tier GALAXY!\"","RUMBLE!","A grand proclamation was made from Noah as he handed out enough Dao Crystals to forge 11 new Entities.","To him, making Entities was just that easy!","If any other Entities or Ancient Powers found out what he was doing or the shocking things behind it, their hearts would simply rupture from envy and shock. Yet Noah gave away the Dao Crystals like nothing as the 11 experts nodded towards him with shining eyes.","\"Also, the [Library] should have a skill called [Loot Drop- Assimilation Crystals] by now. Be sure to learn it if you want to collect loot that will very quickly allow you to assimilate the comprehended Dao and boost your power even more!\"","Even more shocking words came out as this time, they raised alarm from the knowledgeable Tiamat from far away that couldn’t help but blurt out.","\"Assimilation Crystals? Similar to those Dao Crystals? Are you f.u.c.k.i.n.g telling me you’re going to extract the progress of assimilation from those you defeat and make it your own as well? That is...!\"","Her eyes were shaking as she connected the dots, Noah smiling towards her as he knew his promise of becoming a Sage in less than 10 Years would be an achievable thing in less than even a year!","Such a shocking truth even left him marveling as he wondered if he truly was a real Protagonist as his Trait stated...","\"Becoming a Sage should be light work. Be ready to fully submit when that time comes.\"","Noah spoke out with a smile as Tiamat had a difficult expression, the subordinates listening by the side looking at each other with disbelieving smiles as they commended Noah’s boldness to utter such words with everyone around, Barbatos and the other curvaceous women looking towards him with dangerous eyes!","But Tiamat’s expression was still difficult as she voiced out.","\"I...have a path of vengeance I must take! Even if you abide by the terms and I submit, you have to allow me to seek my revenge! I have an entire Universe littered with Great Sages, Monarchs, Paragons, and even the schemer of it all who is in the Universal Realm!\"","...!","Noah’s eyes returned with clarity a second later as many thoughts crossed his mind, with the others looking towards Tiamat in shock as they then turned to Noah and wondered who the hell he had connected himself to now!"]},{"number":812,"title":"Chapter 812: Chapter 811 - It Matters Not!","paragraphs":["As the heads of many turned with the new information of the grand realms ahead of them, Noah nodded his head simply as he replied while looking deeply into the wrathful eyes of the Queen Dowager.","\"Great Sages, Monarchs, Paragons, or even anyone in the Universal Realm...I don’t know the extent of their power, but it matters not!\"","RUMBLE!","Essence rumbled out from Noah’s words as others could not help but look towards him in a mesmerizing fashion.","Their hearts and eyes were pulled towards this being that now had an aura of an Entity, the air he released being extremely unique as his words seemed like they deserved to be heard!","\"I myself have many beings I need to find and seek answers from not just in a single Universe, but many of the universes that make up the Primordial Cosmos. This entire Dark Universe we are in...it is headed towards destruction as we speak from the actions of Sages and Great Sages that were forced by the experts of nearby Universes to use a Tool they had no idea how to utilize...this tool allowing them to separate our Universe from the Primordial Cosmos as it placed us in grave danger...\"","OOOOM!","Shocking revelations were released from Noah to everyone else at this moment as he chose to use this time to let them all know of the future that lay before them. He explained how the Great Sages had utilized a Cosmic Treasure they did not fully understand to cause the separation of the Dark Universe from the Primordial Cosmos, and exactly what this meant as this Universe was at this moment headed towards destruction!","...!","The Imperial Adjudicator had a blank gaze that was shared by many, their recent power ups that made them feel like masters of their own destinies waning as they realized the truth.","At the same time, Tiamat had a shocked expression while listening to Noah’s story, her eyes trembling with excitement as she couldn’t help but call out!","\"This is the Lost Sundered Universe from all those years ago? The Universe that had a Cosmic Treasure born in it?!\"","The gaze of Tiamat was heated as she came close to Noah, her bountiful c.h.e.s.t shaking as she sought to confirm something from Noah!","Noah himself was looking at this being that used to be one of the Ruling Forces of the Animus Universe as he knew she must have a deep history and be extremely knowledgeable! Her words connected to the truth as he replied slowly.","\"It should be one and the same.\"","Tiamat’s body thrummed with power at this reply as she voiced out with excitement.","\"Good! We have to find that Cosmic Treasure! With it, I can raise past even Great Sage with ease as I make my way back to the top...\"","She seemed lost in thought as she paced in the skies, Noah hiding his knowing smile as he probed for more information.","\"What do you know about the Lost Sundered Universe?\"","\"The name only became widely renowned in the Primordial Cosmos after its exploits of withstanding the powers of multiple nearby Universes were spread. It became even more famous after it was somehow separated from the Primordial Cosmos as it became known as the Lost Sundered Universe...\"","As she paced, Tiamat continued to reply without too much thought.","\"It was a shame for this Universe to be lost as it held a Cosmic Treasure, something so rare that if the truly powerful Universes had heard about it first...a Universal Realm expert would have descended onto the Universe to wipe out all the Great Sages as they took the treasure for themselves with ease!\"","RUMBLE!","\"But the surrounding Universes that knew of the possibility of this Cosmic Treasure kept this information from spreading for many years, with many only finding out after it was somehow separated from the Primordial Cosmos...Ah!\"","Tiamat seemed to be reminiscing as she talked of a great deal of things, Noah’s eyes shining more and more as he heard of the information. He had some questions himself as he couldn’t help but ask.","\"This should be that same Sundered Universe, but since we are separated from the Primordial Cosmos, I have always been curious about how beings utilizing a mere Lesser Dao of Summoning have been able to summon creatures from the Animus Universe that should still be a part of the Primordial Cosmos!\"","Tiamat was listening carefully as she waved her hands dismissively at the end.","\"Oh, that? This is because of a powerful Universal Realm expert that birthed the Dao of Summoning made it so that the summoned creatures could only come from his Universe, the creatures being able to traverse through Realms and achieve Grand Completion with ease the moment they are given the status of Summons!\"","\"So even with the Lost Sundered Universe being parted from the Primordial Cosmos, utilizing the Dao of Summoning still means the creatures have to come from the Animus Universe, with the price of summoning being paid by the one who birthed the Dao to begin with as that Universal Realm being gains more understanding of the mysteries of the Primordial Cosmos...\"","...!","Noah was nearly speechless at the information as he asked in shock.","\"When you achieve a high enough Realm...you can birth your own Dao?!\"","\"...Yes. But only if you are at a truly powerful stage.\" The gaze of Tiamat turned mysterious as she seemed to be lost in thought, all the others listening in also reflecting as they felt like their minds were expanded!","The surrounding space turned quiet before the piercing voice of the Emperor Penguin rang out.","\"What I don’t get is how the Dao of Summoning is considered a Lesser Dao after all that, it seems much stronger than something like Withering and even seems on par with the Grand Daos we have just witnessed!\"","The words of the Emperor Penguin made the eyes of many light up as they turned towards Tiamat questiongly.","The Queen Dowager seemed to have gradually returned to her old self as she waved her hands while replying.","\"The classification of Daos is based on to what extent they can push the power of the user. Something like Summoning that relies on others will have a bottleneck where the user finds it hard to achieve the stages of Monarch, Paragon, or even the Universe Realm at that.\"","\"Grand Daos such as Destruction or Vastness, or even something like the Cosmic Dao of Annihilation...those will truly allow one to reach the peaks of power!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah took in Tiamat’s words carefully as he didn’t necessarily agree with them.","The Dao of Summoning had been such a huge boost to him that he would even consider it better than some Grand Daos, but he knew it was because of his own unique circ.u.mstances that he was able to utilize this Dao with such extreme efficiency and usefulness!","Even the entire Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter with its Entities that studied it could not compare to him, so he somewhat understood what Tiamat was talking about.","He digested the many bundles of information while he spoke to his people.","\"You all absorb the Dao Crystals first. Keep in mind our path is thorny and filled with danger, and I even have a solution to the coming Apocalypse that you all will know in time.\"","...!","The eyes of the beings in the surroundings shone at these words as they looked at each other incredulously while also feeling a heavy weight lifted off their shoulders.","They had just found out they were all heading towards an Apocalypse, only to have Noah tell them he could solve it much later after they accepted their existential crisis. It was truly a rollercoaster of emotions as the words had a different meaning to Tiamat!","Her shining eyes nearly blurted out her question before she chose to telepathically ask Noah.","’You’ve gotten your hands on the lost Cosmic Treasure?!’","Tiamat’s gaze was shining as she stared at Noah, her eyes seemingly trying to devour him as he only smiled.","He only had a portion of the Cosmic Treasure called Ruination!","He had a single Ruination Core as he wanted to collect another from the Holy Emperor of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter! After that...he would track down all the rest as he undertook a grand task, his journey truly beginning at that time!"]},{"number":813,"title":"Chapter 813: Chapter 812 - What I Want! I","paragraphs":["Before Noah could think about the other Ruination Cores and his grand dreams, there was still the war with the Ailerons that he was very excited to finish!","He left his subordinates to absorb the abundance of information as he teleported from the Infinite Galaxy with the Blue Slime and Tiamat, even leaving Anna within to finish her absorption as he appeared close to the defensive line of the Rising Stellar Peaks.","RUMBLE!","His appearance caused many beings to turn towards his direction, their faces holding a myriad of expressions as Noah saw a particularly important new face!","\"Haha, you continue to exceed my expecta-\"","...!","The Holy Emperor had jovially begun laughing the moment his eyes landed on Noah, but he had to come to a stop as his eyes widened, his entire body beginning to shake incredulously thereafter.","This was because after lying his eyes for just a second on Noah’s body, he sensed the aura of a being that had fully comprehended a dao, the aura of an Entity!","\"How...\"","He stared in disbelief at this being as Old Man Khan and the others had their jaws wide open, Anastasia looking towards Noah with shining eyes behind the Holy Emperor. Prince Rudolf by side rubbed his eyes as he nearly screamed out.","\"Impossible! You...you were just at Middle Tier GALAXY a few hours ago! You can’t just...!\"","All those around the Rising Stellar Peaks were looking at Noah with alarm as they shockingly found this being not to just have upgraded his strength to the Peak Tier GALAXY, but had also somehow fully comprehended a Dao at the same time as he released the unique aura of an Entity!","\"...\"","The entire Rising Stellar Peaks went silent as those watching were mute in shock, Noah giving a bright smile as he nodded towards the Holy Emperor and Old Man Khan.","\"It’s merely an increase into Peak Tier and becoming an Entity, nothing much.\"","THRUM!","Domineering words erupted as Noah cared not for the reactions of others, continuing with his words!","\"So, what’s happened with our dear neighbors at the Primal Winged Expanse?\"","He asked nonchalantly as the Holy Emperor nearly broke down, sending his aura out to make sure he wasn’t mistaken, his gaze turning serious as his eyes contained innumerable thoughts while staring at Noah.","He looked towards their surroundings and the blank chaotic void behind them where the forces of the Primal Winged Expanse were still undoubtedly watching as he waved his hands and spoke grandly.","\"Let us have privacy for a second...\"","The Holy Emperor wanted to take Noah away and receive him properly with his new identity, but Noah merely nodded as he waved his hands and cast {Life Realm}, bringing his two summons and the Holy Emperor into a separate space as a small green door formed in the skies!","\"...\"","Old Man Khan looked at this scene in a stupor as he saw the formation of a Realm and was isolated from it a second time...","Within the Realm itself, the Holy Emperor looked towards Noah with shining eyes as he spoke.","\"I was truly wrong about you, and I can’t help but consider everything you have said to be true- even though that makes you all the more shocking!\"","Yes! The Holy Emperor truly could not believe it, but every single word Noah uttered had turned out to be true as he frightfully thought of his assertion that his aid was even better than an Ancient Power! After everything he had done in such a short period of time, the Holy Emperor really did not think he could just ignore the even grander assertion this being made before.","\"For gaining such power, I’m sure you have your own secrets...as well as a true aim for coming to my Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter!\"","RUMBLE!","\"...or do you truly want my granddaughter? Because we can arrange that as well...\"","Off to the side, Tiamat was shaking her head with a disappointed expression as the Blue Slime with a heart shaking aura of an Entity wobbled happily on top of Noah’s head.","Noah himself smiled as he thought about the question of his aims from this Ruler.","He had planned to crush the Ailerons entirely as he amassed even more strength before approaching the Holy Emperor for the Ruination Core- even if it had to be by force! But he was now here alone with the man in question as he wondered if he could do things differently...","He had many tools up his sleeves, but the biggest thing he could use when it came to the Holy Emperor was the fact that he had an entire Ancient Power to take care of!","Many thoughts swarmed in his mind as he then adopted a wide smile, essence beginning to rumble from him as he did something he hadn’t planned to do!","RUMBLE!","The burst of essence came from his very origin, deep inside him where his Universal Law Origins lay as one of them opened and released a resplendent looking red black Ruination Core!","...!","This core materialized in front of him as it shone with a luminous l.u.s.ter, landing on his palm as he glanced towards the shocked Holy Emperor.","\"I came with many goals, but this one is first and foremost.\"","RUMBLE!","He spoke calmly as he twirled the powerful Ruination Core in his hands, even Tiamat beside him trembling as her eyes began to shake while looking towards the Ruination Core!","\"You...you truly had a part of the lost Cosmic Treasure on you...!\"","She was even more shocked than the Holy Emperor as she knew of the fearsome power of this Treasure. Yet the Holy Emperor himself went through a series of shocks as he then backed away from Noah as he had a grimace appearing on his face.","\"That...how do you have that?! How can you handle it...?!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":814,"title":"Chapter 814: Chapter 813 - What I want! II","paragraphs":["The Holy Emperor was careful as he asked the first thing that came to his mind while his essence began to move, ready to summon his PRISMATIC Animus at any time as this advancement was not something that he expected!","His eyes honed in on the pulsating Ruination Core as he matched it with the one he knew, his heart only becoming more shocked as time passed.","Noah ignored the shaken Holy Emperor as he continued.","\"This is a Ruination Core. I know there is another in the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, though I don’t know how much you know about it.\"","The question seemed to make the Holy Emperor shake out of his stupor and pensiveness as he stared at Noah in shock. His expression underwent a myriad of changes as he seemed thoughtful and pensive, staring at the calm Noah who had an Entity knowledgeable in a Grand Dao above his head and another being nearing the rank of an Entity by the side.","Yet even at this scene, the Holy Emperor wasn’t fearful as he spoke out carefully.","\"We have studied the Tools of Ruination for a long time, and we have not been able to discern anything from them nor how to use them! How did you activate that one...how are you using it?!\"","The gaze of the Holy Emperor gradually became heated as time passed, Noah merely nodding as he continued to talk.","\"I assume you know of the history of the Tools of Ruination? Of the truth behind the event tens of thousands of years ago that wiped out all the Sages and Great Sages?\"","\"...Yes. Nearly all the powerhouses of the Ancient Powers know about this...whether through the pages of the Book of Ruination or from the messages left behind by Sages and Great Sages...\"","The Holy Emperor spoke carefully as his eyes remained on the pulsing Ruination Core in Noah’s hands, his mind seemingly connecting many things together as his eyes then shook while he turned to stare deep into Noah’s eyes!","\"We’ve only been able to discern the information that a special authority or physique is required for anyone to utilize the Ruination Cores, could it be that you...?!\"","The wise old man was smarter than Noah expected as it saved him lengthy explanations, his head mearly nodding as he moved on to the next step.","\"I am most likely the only being in the Dark Universe who has the physique capable of utilizing the Ruination Cores...and also the one who can save us all from the coming Apocalypse!\"","The Holy Emperor shook as he ascertained this truth, his mouth seemingly dry as he spoke once more!","\"The coming Cataclysm...? You...!\"","The words didn’t seem to come to him as the Holy Emperor merely stared at Noah in befuddlement.","All of the Ancient Powers that presided over the Dark Expanse knew or had glimpses of information about a future Cataclysm, and they knew it dealt with the event tens of thousands of years ago and involved the treasure known as Ruination!","Yet neither of them knew what to do to stop it as they all simply searched for the tools of Ruination and ways to utilize them. Very few had the proper knowledge of everything, with beings like the Entity that had appeared in front of Noah when he first formed the Infinite Galaxy.","That Entity had collected multiple Pages from the Book of Ruination as he even knew of the Physique required for one to even think about using the Ruination Cores, but others were even more in the dark than him as they only knew of theories from the Legacies that their Sages or Great Sages left behind!","The Holy Emperor from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter was one of these beings as he now faced a creature he had only heard and read about in hearsay.","\"My aim is the Ruination Core that should be under your care, if you would be wise and magnanimous enough to not simply let it collect dust and actually let me utilize it to save us all!\"","THUMP!","\"The coming Apocalypse is not one that can be survived unless I collect all of the remaining Ruination Cores and undo what the Sages and Great Sages did!\"","THUMP!","\"...!\"","The heart of the Holy Emperor was beating fast as he absorbed the multitude of information while seemingly lost in thought.","As the seconds passed, Noah returned the Ruination Core into his origin, this action bringing the holy Emperor back to attention as he stared towards him with shining eyes.","\"This explains your ridiculous genius and talent...even the things you’ve been able to do, but...\"","Noah looked at the gaze of the Holy Emperor and understood, as it was truly hard to let go of a treasure as profound as the Ruination Core! He seemed to see through the mind of this Ruler as he spoke calmly.","\"The Ruination Core will only continue to collect dust in your hands, but I can utilize it to save all of us. Your family outside, the trillions of lives in the Expensive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter...all of the Dark Universe! What is a mere treasure in front of this?!\"","RUMBLE","The question rang true as it seemed to have woken the Holy Emperor, his shining eyes calming down as he retained the demeanor of a Ruler!","\"The news of the Ruination Core had somehow been leaked to the Primal Winged Expanse as I kept them close as allies since I knew full well what would happen when it was spread. This is the reason why the Primal Emperor proceeded with this war...and there is nothing stopping him from muddying the waters further by telling others about it!\"","\"If the being that can utilize it appears in front of me while fighting for my Ancient Power...\"","The rest of his words didn’t seem to be coming out as if he was thinking heavily on this issue!","Yet when Noah saw this expression, he smiled as he knew he was already close to achieving his goal.","\"I can promise you security for the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, with no Ancient Power being able to bully you. The one I initiated this conflict with...I shall personally set off myself to finish it!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah voiced out domineeringly as the Holy Emperor glanced towards him once more with shining eyes.","\"You’ve been saying domineering things and accomplishing them with no issues so far that I subconsciously believe you when you speak now...sigh.\"","The aged Ruler let out a breath as he seemed deep in thought, thinking about the trillions of lives under him and the reality that a being who could actually utilize the tools of Ruination had appeared right before him!","\"Very well!\"","THRUUUM!"]},{"number":815,"title":"Chapter 815: Chapter 814 - The Second Ruination Core!","paragraphs":["When a Ruler made their decision, they acted on it with no hesitation!","The Holy Emperor did just that as he outweighed the risks and rewards after putting the terrifying being in front of him into full account.","His strong voice resounded out.","\"Since the Ruination Core reacted some weeks ago, many experts have been moving with more vigor searching for the tools of Ruination. I knew the one I had under my control could invite a disaster...so I always kept it with me since that day!\"","RUMBLE!","The Holy Emperor waved his hands the moment he finished his words. as a spatial ring appeared on his palm.","This spatial ring was inscribed with unique runic marking as Noah laid his eyes on it.","[Legacy Ring of Holding] :: An item passed down in the Windsor lineage for generations. It is capable of preserving many items in its isolated space while preventing any prying eyes from seeing within it...","A special item that held an isolated spatial space appeared in the hands of the Holy Emperor, his eyes only growing firm when he pulled it out as his essence drilled into it, a flash of light shining out as something appeared out of it a second later!","SHAA!","Noah watched with shining eyes as a second Ruination Core appeared. His hands nearly reaching out inadvertently as the Holy Emperor looked at the powerful treasures with melancholic eyes.","Tiamat was looking at this scene with disbelieving eyes as she didn’t think this backwards looking power also had a portion of the Cosmic Treasure that was sought after by many beings before!","\"Our Forefathers obtained this tens of thousands of years ago during their journeys, and it has been with us ever since.\"","His gaze was filled with reminiscence as his eyes became firm, the Ruination Core in his hands beginning to fly out towards Noah.","\"All the Ancient Powers are looking for the answer to evade the coming Cataclysm. It would be selfish of me to not make a move when the answer has come to me!\"","With these words, the Ruler of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter made the choice to let go of a treasure that others wanted dearly, something that was worth it enough to even start wars and destroy galaxies!","Noah gained a whole notch of respect for this being as his mana wrapped around the Ruination Core and brought it close to him, the treasure very quickly beginning to react to the one in his Origin as it began releasing a gorgeous red black light.","It seemed like an attractive pulling force was coming from Noah’s origin as the Ruination Core was inadvertently going towards it!","The Holy Emperor watched the scene closely as he saw the terrifying Ruination Core enter the glimmering c.h.e.s.t of this genius, soon disappeared as a second later...immense eruptions of essence burst forth.","THRUUUUM!","It felt like a resonance of mana as Noah brought the Ruination Core into another one of his 6 Universal Law Origins, the treasure settling in as if it arrived home!","Noah’s body felt like a battlefield of mana as he shone with a l.u.s.trous light, the red black essence of Ruination shooting forth from his domineeringly as for the first time since tens of thousands of years ago, two portions of the Cosmic Treasure Ruination were brought close!","Noah looked inside of his origin as he saw a distinct thin red line connecting the two Ruination Cores together, each of them pulsating with power as at this moment, Noah had obtained 2 Ruination Cores!","He didn’t have to do anything grand to get his second, merely talking with the Holy Emperor being enough as his exploits were big enough to back up his words in the mind of this powerful Ruler.","One didn’t have to always use brute force to get what they wanted!","RUMBLE","Noah was looking at the second Ruination Core as at this moment, he knew he could choose a second Affix to keep active at all times, his power being boosted by another level as he could be even more monstrous during combat, and also enjoy even greater benefits while cultivating when he switched to the affixes that dealt with increased assimilation and comprehensions!","As light bounced on and off of the Ruination Cores, he was also getting new information about new Affixes becoming available!","In the case of Laws and Daos, a new possible Affix that stated [+2500% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation of All Laws] and one that stated [+2500% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation of All Daos].","His eyes shone at these new possibilities as it meant he could see the terrifying +10,000% very soon if he collected more Ruination Cores!","A variety of new Affixes were added as Noah had many new ideas while going through them!","RUMBLE!","The obtaining of a second core was truly a grand achievement as the light between the two Ruination Cores endlessly bounced back and forth with an ever increasing might.","The resonance of the Ruination Cores continued as at the same time as this occurred, a chain reaction was taking place on all the tools of Ruination across the Dark Universe.","Each of them vibrated intensely for a few minutes as many powers were alerted, those knowledgeable connecting some dots as terrifying conclusions began to be drawn!","Light years away from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the Primal Winged Expanse, multiple Entities with unique physiologies stood around a vibrating Ruination Core with blank expressions.","These Entities were extremely unnerving to look at as all of them looked similar, yet they were completely different beings! An even more disastrous thing was the fact that from their bodies, one could sense the swirling essence of multiple Daos!","These were genuine powerhouses that would cause other Powers to tremble, being with immense powers! This was the Ancient Power in the North that was ruled by the Spirit Race!","\"It seems the one who can utilize the Ruination Cores has really come to be, otherwise this would not be repeating twice in such a short time span.\"","\"They seem to be able to very quickly find the locations of other Ruination Cores, so we will know who they are very soon as they will actually come to us...\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking thought was released as these aged beings nodded towards each other! The swirling light of Lesser and Grand Daos around them only made them only more menacing as they continued to discuss.","In other areas, similar scenes were occurring as whether it was in an Ancient Power or from a lone Entity that held the Tools of Ruination...they all knew something grand was coming as yet another reaction came from the Tools of Ruination within a short period of time!","They knew that grand changes were coming, and each of them had to be prepared!"]},{"number":816,"title":"Chapter 816: Chapter 815 - Unlocking the Bloodlines and Daos of Pets! I","paragraphs":["The eruption of essence was slowly dying down in the private Life Realm as Noah opened his eyes, his majestic figure made even more glorious by the terrifying Blue Slime wiggling atop his head.","By the side, Tiamat seemed to be thoughtful as the voice of the Holy Emperor rang out once more.","\"You said the coming Cataclysm could be stopped by you, what can the rest of us do to help?\"","\"All that I need to do is collect the remaining 4 Ruination Cores and put them together. Then I can undo the work that the Sages and Great Sages did to cause all of this!\"","Noah replied calmly as the Holy Emperor continued to question!","\"Undo the work of multiple Sages and Great Sages by yourself? I know you’re a genius but...\"","The eyes of the Holy Emperor were twitching at the reply as Noah merely smiled while speaking calmly.","\"It only requires the mana equivalent to multiple Sages and Great Sages, nothing much on my part!\"","\"...\"","The Holy Emperor could only look forth incredulously at this reply as he had no words, only watching as Noah came forward jovially to express his thanks.","\"You’ve done something great that you will only know the profound results of in the future! And for our nearest future...let us take care of the Primal Winged Expanse first!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s gaze turned ferocious as the Holy Emperor adopted a solemn expression.","Noah wanted to find out more about the powerhouses of the Primal Winged Expanse, so after he obtained the Ruination Core, he continued talking with the Holy Emperor and asked about the true power behind their enemies!","\"The Primal Winged Expanse is blessed with around 25 Entities, some of them being wandering Entities that pledged allegiance to them thousands of years ago!\"","The Holy Emperor gave an overview of the Primal Winged Expanse and its forces as Noah found out that they had over 25 Entities including the Primal Emperor himself. Some of these Entities were participating in this war, with others being cornerstones of the Ancient Power as they remained as reserve forced to protect their core lands.","\"Our Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter has similar numbers, with around 15 Entities deployed to cover numerous regions as less than half are cultivating around the Expansive Holy Land to act as protectors for the core regions.\"","He thoughtfully put together the information that the Holy Emperor continued to tell him as he thought of it in his own terms.","In his mind, there were around 25 Big Bosses that would drop the most prime loot if he could take all of them down, and they were really cl.u.s.tered in a single location as they waited for him!","When he realized this scene...he knew he had to do something wild as he wanted to target and take down all of these big bosses at once! He didn’t want a single one of them to escape as the singular thing that dominated his mind at this moment was...a Siege.","A Siege!","RUMBLE!","He rose up while looking at the Holy Emperor with a smile and spoke out grandly.","\"So I’ll be personally attacking the Primal Winged Expanse with my own forces. I ask you to trust me once more when I tell you the most important thing about all of this- do not interfere!\"","...!","The Holy Emperor looked forth in a stupor as he heard words that didn’t make sense.","But Noah’s words were because...he didn’t want any loot to be stolen away from him by the forces of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, so they had to stay away!","\"Can you promise me this?\"","Noah’s expression was stern as the Holy Emperor sighed while nodding. Even asking on whether he should interfere if Noah’s life was threatened- but he still said no!","After all was said and done, the talk between the Holy Emperor and Noah continued for another half an hour before the Ruler was satisfied after listening to Noah’s domineering requests, the Life Realm around them beginning to dissipate as their figures soon appeared back in the Rising Stellar Peaks.","Old Man Khan and the others looked at the reapplying figures as they came forward, Noah giving a light smile as he turned towards the dark chaotic void past the Rising Stellar Peaks where he knew the forces of the Primal Winged Expanse were still watching.","Hid eyes shone as he finalized his plan that he calculated numerous times in his mind...going towards this Dark chaotic void once more as he prepared a show!","This time, the show was to introduce himself- to show the Primal Winged Expanse and any other Ancient Power out there as he gave them a glimpse of Noah Osmont.","As he planned for the Siege of an Ancient Power, he wanted all the spread out Entities of the Primal Winged Expanse to gather as this time around, he wanted them to know he was coming!","RUMBLE!","He floated far past the defense line as he got into the same area where he had taunted them to send an army to him before.","This time, he didn’t speak any words as he merely waved his hands to summon his Middle Tier GALAXY Animus Summons.","With Tiamat not too far from him and the Blue Slime atop his head, the figures of the Three-Legged Fate Crow, Oraculothorax, Void Serpent, Calamity Bear, Colossal Helios Leviathan, and the Obsidian Panther all appeared grandly!","Their manifested galaxies shone with splendor as at this moment, the powerful Summoners of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter couldn’t even ask why someone had double the normal amount of summons contracted to him, their eyes only watching and opening wider and wider as they saw Noah begin to utilize the [Animus Growth Empowerment] skill on his summons right here and now.","...!","Many quickly realized that as this now apparent Entity was at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm, he could use the [Animus Growth Empowerment] ability to very quickly bring his summons up to the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm over the next few months and years, but they hadn’t expected him to begin doing such a thing at this moment!","Was he planning on publicly training his pets even when it would take weeks or months to just fully train one all the way to the Peak?","The forces of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter were confused as the hidden forces from the Primal Winged Expanse only watched closely from afar.","THRUM!","They observed Noah to cast still after skill on a majestic looking Three-Legged Fate Crow, the mana of an Entity utilized every time as the Animus felt a rush of essence wrap around it constantly!","It’s body was changing and growing larger at a visible rate it let out fierce cries, those watching beginning to feel its Realm slowly advancing from the Middle Tier GALAXY...and begin heading up towards the Peak!","The Three-Legged Fate Crow let put piercing cries as Noah cast one [Animus Growth Empowerment] after another, choosing to domineeringly catch the attention of the Ancient Power he would Siege with a grand show nobody had seen before.","\"He wouldn’t actually be...\"","\"No way...\"","\"Did he comprehend the Dao of Vastness as well?!\"","Cries began to soon ring out as those proficient in the Dao of Summoning saw cast after cast from this being relentlessly as he didn’t stop for even a second to recover his mana- seeing a shocking scene of someone continuing to cast a growth skill multiple times as if he continued like this- they shockingly realized they would watch the advancement of a an Animus Summon from Middle Tier to Peak Tier GALAXY in a matter of minutes!","Minutes!","\"No f.u.c.k.i.n.g way...\"","It was the conserved Prince Rudolf letting out the expletives as the Holy Emperor and others watched with shining eyes what a true Summoner could do.","RUMBLE!","Noah planned to do this for all of his pets publicly, showing a shocking show of power as he produced multiple Peak Tier GALAXY experts who would awaken powerful Bloodlines and Daos the moment they entered this Realm.","Apart from the Golden Crow, he couldn’t wait for the advancement and transformation of the Void Serpent into Jörmungandr!","\"Haha!\"","His wild laugh bellowed out in the chaotic void as the transformation of a Three-Legged Fate Crow into a genuine Golden Crow was underway at this very moment.","Those watching...would barely be able to close their eyes as a grand show played for all to see!"]},{"number":817,"title":"Chapter 817: Chapter 816 - Unlocking the Bloodlines and Daos of Pets! II","paragraphs":["\"What is he doing...?\"","In the core of the Primal Winged Expanse, an Entity voiced out towards his surrounding peers and the Primal Emperor while they watched the scene of Noah constantly spamming [Animus Growth Empowerment] on his pets.","\"From the information we’ve gathered about the Dao of Summoning, he should be upgrading the realm of his pets...though that process should take weeks at the fastest if not months at the slowest!\"","The Primal Emperor replied with Eyes blazing with light as those who heard his words quieted down!","\"So how is he doing it in minutes...\"","\"...\"","Silence reigned in the surroundings as nobody had answers!","---","CAAA!","A piercing cry reverberated throughout the chaotic void as golden scorching flames in the shape of a cross brightened up the Expansive darkness, the body of a creature over 50 meters tall registering on the eyes of many.","Everything about this creature was gold as its feathers shone resplendently, its golden eyes releasing an overpowering light as its Expansive wings seemed as sharp as blades while its three feet seemed strong enough to shatter mountains!","CAAA!","Noah laid his shining eyes on it once more.","<strong>[Golden Crow](Ultra Rare) :: An Animus Pet currently at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. It has reached a.d.u.l.thood and awakened the bloodline of the Archaic Golden Crow, directly gaining comprehensions of the Grand Dao of Inferno as more techniques will slowly be awakened by it. Its abilities include Fate Flames of the Void, Barrier of Brilliance...</strong>","His first ever pet was given the privilege of entering the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm first when one didn’t put into account Tiamat and the Blue Slime, Noah gaining a genuine Golden Crow under him as this majestic beast brought its golden beak to slowly nudge Noah, its reverberating flames causing for a magisterial scene to be displayed to many!","Old Man Khan was looking at this scene while shaking his head, this man being a veteran in the Dao of Summoning and saw exactly what had happened, but he still couldn’t believe it!","The first issue was the [Animus Growth Empowerment] skill itself that Noah was casting. It seemed to be much too effective and powerful! The other issue was naturally the fact that he had cast this skill way too many times and constantly over the past 15 or so minutes as they wondered a singular thing.","\"How has he not run out of mana?!\"","RUMBLE!","The disbelieving gazes of those watching would be left in the dust as Noah paid no heed, his body exploding with essence as he began to spam [Animus Growth Empowerment] on the Void Serpent and the others at the same time as well.","It was constant and repeated casting at a rate of multiple times per second, the truly knowledgeable beings nearly shaking from shock when they saw the scene as it entirely defied everything they knew!","The Holy Emperor thought he had been surprised enough, but as he looked at this scene- he couldn’t help but think back to something Noah had said when it came to his mana.","[\"It only requires the mana equivalent to multiple Sages and Great Sages, nothing much on my part!\"]","These words rang out in the Holy Emperor’s mind as he seemed to understand why these ridiculous words could somehow be true!","RUMBLE!","At the spot where Noah continued to upgrade the strength of his pets, the serpentine body of the Void Serpent was coiling as it became even larger, a hazy dark grey light wrapping around it as draconic roars could occasionally be heard.","The Dark grey light expanded wildly as the shadow of the Serpent became ever so bigger, only a few minutes passing before a luminous dark light shone out while a draconic roar resounded!","ROAAAR!","Off to the side, Tiamat had reminiscent eyes when looking at this creature unlocking a bloodline she was very much familiar with- a sister bloodline of her own lineage where she knew the being at the very peak of strength tens of thousands of years ago.","As the hazy light faded and the image became clear, Tiamat shook her head wistfully as she realized she was nearly looking at the youthful image of an old monster she used to know!","The fearsome and enormous creature she was looking at was the Void Serpent that had finally entered a.d.u.l.thood, a being now touring over 500 meters in size as its pristine dark-grey scales shone even in the chaotic void.","The Void Serpent was gone as finally, the true form of Jörmungandr had come to light!","<strong>[Galaxy Devouring Serpent- Jörmungandr] (PRISMATIC) :: An Archaic Animus currently in the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. Entering its a.d.u.l.t stage, this Galaxy Devouring Serpent has awakened one of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines of all Animus Creatures- the bloodline of the Galaxy Devouring Serpent, Jörmungandr. It has directly gained comprehensions in the Grand Dao of Devouring as the further its bloodline awakens, the faster its speed of comprehension and Assimilation will be...</strong>","\"Ahhh...\"","Those weak in the heart slumped to the ground while watching this scene, their brains barely being able to follow as they were watching something that went against everything they believed in!","2 Animus Summons raised to Peak Tier GALAXY in half an hour, and the person in question was relentless as he seemed to be continuing.","\"What is this...?!\"","\"It’s not real...it’s not real...\"","Shock, awe, and disbelief spread out at a shocking scene that would include itself onto the minds of all of those watching!","Yet Noah wasn’t done as while he laughed grandly when looking at the resplendent appearances of the Golden Crow and Jörmungandr, he moved on to the Variant Oculothorax and the Calamity Bear to finish their enhancements next!"]},{"number":818,"title":"Chapter 818: Chapter 817 - A Tyrannical Entity! I","paragraphs":["The Variant Oculothorax was a particularly unique Animus Summon as it didn’t have any powerful bloodline or history, simply being a unique creature that had undergone a mutation and was very proficient in the Soul!","When Noah finished admiring the gorgeous sight of a fearsome Galaxy Devouring Serpent, his constant spamming of [Animus Growth Empowerment] had been focused on this Variant Oculothorax and the Calamity Bear.","The winged eyeball that was proficient in laws of Light and Fate had grown ever bigger as it neared its final transformation, a piercing cry erupting from it as it grandly showed itself.","AAAAH!","The cry was one that made weaker beings clutch their heads in pain, just its roars carrying power to affect a being’s soul as this Oculothorax bowed its wings towards Noah subserviently!","Its size was now around 100 meters, its wings shining with a contrasting dark and gold color as the main body that was the eye could infuse terror into any normal being.","[Lightbourne Oculothorax](Ultra Rare) :: An Animus Summon at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. Its body is primarily an eyeball, and this particular Oculothorax has undergone a mutation through pure willpower and mastered the laws of Light and Fate. Since advancing to a.d.u.l.thood, it has stepped on the path of the Lesser Dao of Darklight. It contains a dreadfully strong soul as all its abilities carry potent Soul Damage. Abilities include Eye of Doom, Fate Extinguishing Light...","Yet another Peak Tier summon appeared in the bustling chaotic void as all those looking felt their minds grow numb.","The Primal Emperor’s gaze was increasingly solemn as he watched the being in the illusory screen continue to cast skills repeatedly, enormous bouts of mana being required every time.","\"The show he is putting up is merely a continuation of his boasting after the death of Vast. Since Vast boasted to have enough mana reserves to last for days while fighting, he’s merely showing his own reserves to be higher than Vasts!\"","An Aileron Entity by the side spoke out calmly as they all watched the illusory scene.","\"But such repeated casting and use of mana...even Vast had nothing like this!\"","\"...\"","No other replies came as the powerful Entities continued to watch in silence.","30 minutes passed as in the chaotic void where Noah could be seen by all, another one of his pets entered into the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm after being subjected to his constant spamming.","THRUUUUM!","The enormous Calamity Bear shook the surrounding space as its form underwent a grand change, shining black wings erupting from its back in a shocking fashion after its transformation!","\"OOOOOH!\"","A bellow was released from it grandly as it looked like a majestic king of all bears, Noah glancing at the new description of this Animus Summon.","<strong>[Archaic Void Calamity Millenium Bear](Ultra Rare) :: An Animus Summon at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. A unique species of Bears that takes on the mantle of [Calamity], having entered a.d.u.l.thood, this Millenium Bear has stepped on the Grand Dao of Nature as it strives to become one with those around it. Its abilities include Shield of Beginning, Hug of Life and Death...</strong>","The stellar Archaic Void Millenium Vear joined the ranks of Golden Crow, Jormungandr, and the Lightbourne Oculothorax as its aura oppressive stood as the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm as its body swirled with the essence of a Grand Dao!","The summoners from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter watched with agape expressions as they found themselves question whether all of them were studying the same Dao of Summoning.","Had they just been doing things wrong?","Were they just stupid people that considered themselves geniuses?","\"Why have we wasted so many years...\"","Even Prince Rudolf had a sunken expression as he couldn’t explain the scene in front of him!","30 minutes passed!","RUMBLE!","The colossal figure of the Leviathan became ever larger as it nearly covered the sight of everyone, the creature being thousands of meters large as its finished transformation was contrasted by something extremely small that could not be seen by many because of its shocking speed.","Both the Obsidian Panther and Colossal Helios Leviathan had advanced to Peak Tier and transformed at this crucial stage as Noah glanced at their new descriptions as well!","<strong>[Golden Colossal Helios Leviathan]( PRISMATIC) :: An Archaic Animus currently in the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. Being a mythical creature that traverses the Helios Sundering Seas of the Animus Universe, it is nearing full maturity as it has awoken the Golden Helios Bloodline of the Royal Helios Race. Proficient and Assimilated with the Laws of Death, Aether, Space, and Time, this Animus has now embarked on the path of the Grand Dao of Macrocosm. Its abilities include Unremitting Fortress, Realm Depredation... </strong>","<strong>[Tempestuous Obsidian Panther](PRISMATIC) :: An Animus Summon at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm. It is a unique species with the Bloodline of the Noble Black Panther Clan of the Tempestuous Realms of the Animus Universe. Its proficiency lies in quickness and speed that can even rival beings of higher stages as its deadly claws deal even more dreadful damage, with the laws of Space, Time, and Air being mastered. This Tempestuous Obsidian Panther is nearing full comprehension on the Lesser Dao of Alacrity, greatly enhancing its speed.</strong>","The Colossal Helios Leviathan looked like a moving fortress as its thick scales were tinged with gold, the flashing figure of the Obsidian Panther having sleek dark fur as it flashed around at such high speeds that only Old Man Khan and the Holy Emperor could keep their eyes on it!","\"...\"","All those watching could simply observe in silence at this scene as they truly watched from beginning to end as a being took 6 Animus Summons from Middle to Peak Tier of the GALAXY Realm in just a few hours.","\"This...is just too domineering...\"","\"Domineering? F.u.c.k.i.n.g hell, this is just tyrannical!\"","\"Tyrannical!\"","RUMBLE!","It truly was so! Not even domineering anymore as many beings thought this new apparent Entity was simply too Tyrannical.","In the chaotic void, Noah now floated next to the magisterial sight of 6 glimmering Animus Summons in the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm, the Blue Slime wiggling above his head and the fearsome Tiamat looking towards him with shining eyes making it a total of 8 Peak Tier GALAXY experts by his side!","\"Haha!\"","His bellowing laugh echoed out as the many watching beings nearby and afar looked towards him with still shocked eyes, wondering what this domineering being would do next.","Noah would not disappoint as the moment his bellowing laughter finished, he flew onto the enormous body of the Colossal Helios Leviathan as his other pets did the same, his voice ringing out explosively as the body of the huge leviathan began to move forward.","\"Primal Emperor...I am coming to pay a visit to your Ancient Power!\"","THRUUUM!","...!"]},{"number":819,"title":"Chapter 819: Chapter 818 - A Tyrannical Entity! II","paragraphs":["Alarm rose in the hearts of many as their jaws nearly detached, the voice of Noah ringing out continuously in their ears!","\"Primal Emperor...I am coming to pay a visit to your Ancient Power!...\"","\"...\"","Old Man Khan had incredulous eyes as he turned towards the Holy Emperor and asked what Noah was doing in shock.","The aged Holy Emperor did not say much as he shook his eyes and he replied.","\"He said he would lay siege to the Ancient Power, and he has now set off to do that.\"","...!","Old Man Khan scratched his ears and checked to see if his old friend had turned senile!","\"What the hell do you mean? That doesn’t make any sense! He’s...\"","RUMBLE!","The Holy Emperor raised his hands as he shook his head, his grand voice ringing out after.","\"His status represents something more important than what you or I realize. For now, let’s just watch.\"","\"...we won’t even be sending him support?\" Old Man Khan still didn’t believe what he was seeing as he still asked!","\"No. He specifically asked for none of us to interfere. No Entity from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter will make a move, I will let them all know!\"","The walking stick in Old Man Khan’s hand shattered as one shocking word after another came out, his hairs turning whiter by the second as he watched the domineering image of an enormous Colossal Helios leviathan moving forward.","The many Holy Descendants on the defensive line looked forth in a stupor as a single word began to spread among them!","\"Tyrannical...\"","\"The pride of Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter!\"","\"A powerful Entity!\"","\"Powerful? He’s f.u.c.k.i.n.g tyrannical! A Tyrannical Entity!\"","\"The Tyrannical Entity!\"","RUMBLE!","A single word spread across the millions that watched Noah’s domineering actions and declaration as he now stormed towards an Ancient Power.","---","In the heart of the Primal Winged Expanse, wrath was bubbling in the heart of the Primal Emperor as he sent out numerous communications to his powerful experts.","\"Be ready to intercept this freakish Entity. If possible, we cannot let him grow any further as he might become someone unbeatable in the future!\"","OOOM!","His words were known to be true by the other Entities as they recalled how just a day or two ago, the aura of an Entity was not on this being as he was merely a Middle Tier GALAXY expert. Unless he had a technique that lied to others about his Realm...the truth was terrifying to think about.","\"Amass our Peak Tier GALAXY combatants for this frontal attack, we saw how he can also teleport in groups of GALAXY experts...\"","Many preparations were made by a singular Ancient Power as Noah made his way over to the Primal Winged Expanse!","His pace while crossing the chaotic void was actually not fast, the Golden Colossal Helios Leviathan seemingly having fun swimming through the darkness as it let out terrifying bellows every now and then.","On its body, the manifested GALAXIES of all of Noah’s pets shone brightly as he nonchalantly talked to the Animus Summons to get a better grasp of their abilities.","The fearsome Jormungandr was talking to Tiamat with his head proudly held high while a wiggling Blue Slime that released the terrifying aura of an Entity was the most friendly of them all, going towards every other Animus Summon as it rested on their heads.","When it neared Tiamat, the curvaceous Queen Dowager had thrown it a dangerous look as the body of the Blue Slime wiggled before it just moved along!","It passed through all of them and eventually returned above Noah’s head as all the others did not seem to come to its standard.","Such was the scene playing out above the moving Leviathan as Noah neared an Ancient Power with no rush, hours passing by!","If one thought about it just a little, they might even think he was actually giving them time to prepare!","---","In other parts of the Dark Universe, many pieces were moving back and forth as grand movements were made.","A particular one worthy of note for us was the news that the Primal Emperor had released reaching the ears of far away Ancient Powers from the groups of Ailerons that would not be making it back to the Primal Winged Expanse alive.","But at this moment, the news of an apparent Ruination Core and a Great Sage’s Legacy being unearthed was known by many Ancient Powers, the consequences of such a move still being unknown as of right now!","But at this juncture when the Tools of Ruination reacted twice in a short period of time...news about the Ruination Cores could not be ignored!","\"Elder Sunflower, lead some of the invited Entities to check out the situation between the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the Primal Winged Expanse...\"","A majestic voice commanded a group of Entities in one corner of the Dark Universe.","\"Borrow one of the Sun Shattering Legions to gather more information...do not join their war!\"","Another command was given by a Ruler from another corner of the Dark Universe...","Many scenes like this repeated themselves as scouting Entities were sent out to see exactly what was occurring in the location where spread out news said a Ruination Core existed and a Great Sage’s Legacy was unearthed!","Numerous parties made their way over with quick speed, and the setup was glorious enough that they might arrive either just in time as Noah attacked an entire Ancient Power by himself, or they would be there to witness the devastating results after everything was over and done..."]},{"number":820,"title":"Chapter 820: Chapter 819 - A Full Frontal Attack!","paragraphs":["In the Southern region of the Dark Universe, there existed an Ancient Power with deep roots and history, one that many beings feared and steered clear of.","This was the Ancient Power ruled by the Spirit Race, unique existences that were heavily in tune with nature, laws, and Daos!","These beings had many unique features as among them, they shared a strong link in their souls as they easily communicated with each other.","\"Sister Gold, you should have made some advancements in your assimilation of the Daos of Alacrity, Vastness, Frost, and Destruction. Why don’t you set off for the outside Galaxies and observe if there truly is another Ruination Core in the hands of this little expansive cl.u.s.ter?\"","A message traveled through the connected minds as one being heard it and nodded, the shocking reality of this Entity from the Spirit Race studying 4 Daos being mentioned by them simply!","In the Northern region of the Dark Universe where the Arch Humans ruled, a lone Entity was moving through this Ancient Power after traversing outside alone for so long.","You might recall this Entity as the one that was able to see Noah briefly after he upgraded his Infinite Galaxy, the Entity that has been searching for the being capable of utilizing the Ruination Cores for all these years!","He was grumbling at his bad luck as he enjoyed the companies of other Entities in the Northern Region, friends that he had made over the land thousands of years.","\"Oh?\"","News about the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the Primal Winged Expanse reached the talking Entities as they discussed it without making any moves, but one of them had shining eyes as he stood up swiftly!","\"Traverser, don’t tell me you’re thinking of falling for such an obvious tactic?\"","A curvaceous female Entity drank the golden liquid from her cup as she asked curiously towards the dominating Entity that had miniaturized himself from his large size.","\"One can never advance in this Universe if we do not take risks! I thank you all for sharing this with me...\"","The other Entities shook their heads wryly as they watched one titled as Traverser flying out with a flash of light, yet another powerful Entity joining the fray among the many heading towards the war between the two Ancient Powers in the West!","---","The distance between the two powers could not be considered too vast or too close, with Entities being able to go from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and into the Primal Winged Expanse in as long as days or as short as just a few hours.","It all depended on the speed the Entity was moving at!","Noah was moving at an absolute snail’s pace as he gave time for his subordinates to finish absorbing the Dao Crystals that would grant them full comprehension in the Lesser Dao of Withering, and he also gave time for the Primal Winged Expanse to prepare him a buffet of loot.","As he slowly moved atop the Colossal Helios Leviathan, many plans swirled in his mind as thought of using [Plot Armor] or [Deus Ex Machina] during the coming battle, and the choice of the two Ruination Core Affixes that would best match him against powerful Entities!","He knew that many eyes were on him as he neared the coordinates of the Primal Winged Expanse he had gotten from the Holy Emperor.","Those from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter he had told to stay away and not interfere were watching, while those from the Primal Winged Expanse were preparing for him!","OOOOH","The bellow of the Colossal Helios Leviathan could be heard as the outline of the nearest Galaxy that made up the cl.u.s.ter of Galaxies that were part of the Primal Winged Expanse appeared.","Noah’s eyes shone as he could already see numerous figures littering the area.","At the forefront, the grand image of a majestic Primal Emperor could be seen as he was flanked side by side with many domineering figures, each of them letting out the terrifying auras of Entities as they looked towards Noah and his pets coldly!","THRUUUM!","Palpable waves of power could be felt spreading out at the mere presence of this many experts, Noah’s eyes shining brightly as he looked behind the Entities standing next to the Primal Emperor.","For this battle, the Aileron Race did not bring in millions of small dredges that would simply be killed, but only top tier experts as besides the Entities, over 100 Peak Tier GALAXY experts were gathered! Such was the strength of an Ancient Power...","Noah could count around 15 Entities coldly staring towards him, his eyes glancing around as he really expected the 25 that the Holy Emperor mentioned.","\"I’m not sure whether to consider you really bold or just plain stupid.\"","THRUM!","The resonant voice of the Primal Emperor rang out as he waved his hand, spatial fluctuations erupting out behind the Colossal Helios Leviathan and to its left and right sides as at this moment, more Entities appeared to flank Noah’s party right in the middle!","Behind him, 5 Entities with world shaking auras appeared, 3 to his left and 3 more to his right as it made 26 total Entities currently encircling him!","\"But since you have come here...I might as well make this your grave!\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of the Primal Emperor reverberated out as the 4 encircling groups of Entities had one person in each group shatter a crystal, a brilliant light shining out as a circular field of light exploded out to cover all the nearby surroundings- including Noah and his pets.","\"I know you like creating Realms and holding your enemies hostage, so I wanted to give you a taste of your own medicine as you get locked in an Illusory Unbreakable Realm that will hold you in while showing all the cowards watching what I will do to unruly Entities that threaten me!\"","RUMBLE!","The wrathful voice of the Primal Emperor continued to resound out as Noah’s eyes shone brightly, never having expected his full frontal attack on the Primal Winged Expanse to go this well.","The reason for this was the Illusory Unbreakable Realm that the Primal Emperor had just talked about!","\"Brother Primal, this Unbreakable Realm will be active for the next hour as nobody will be able to come in or out.\" The Entity releasing unique spatial fluctuations voiced out as his arrogant eyes landed towards Noah’s small figure far in the distance.","Yes! Shockingly, the fearsome ability that used the essence of the surrounding Entities was a powerful realm prison that enclosed and locked in all those in the affected space for a whole hour!","Everyone!","Only the controller that initiated it, the being with unique spatial essence on his body, could choose to cut off his connection as he left alone while dealing heavy self-damage to himself if ever he wanted to get out before the hour ended.","It was a truly powerful ability that had very shocking limitations!","\"Ah...!\"","Noah couldn’t help but tremble at this scene, his eyes not being able to hide their happiness as the single greatest he was afraid of- which was the Entities he wanted to fight running away from him, this problem was solved by his own enemies as they locked themselves with him in a timed prison.","How nice they were!","How magnanimous!","How magisterial!"]},{"number":821,"title":"Chapter 821: Chapter 820 - Lets Go!!! I","paragraphs":["Within the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, the Holy Emperor and Old Man Khan had returned to the core of the draconic shaped Realm as they were surrounded by 4 other Entities.","Noah had yet to meet any of them as they had been placed at far positions for defense, but the Holy Emperor had called some of them back as they now stood in a Core command room while watching the illusory scene of Noah and the forces of the Primal Winged Expanse playing out far away!","Old Man Khan’s face was cloudy as his body palpated with power. His strong voice coming out in anger.","\"This being is obviously a once in a life time genius, where we would have grown together in the next tens and hundreds of years as he possibly had the chance to become a Sage...!\"","\"Yet...yet! You let him go alone and now he is surrounded by 26 Entities that want to put on a show!\"","Anger was not hidden from Old Man Khan’s voice as he spoke, the Holy Emperor keeping his gaze calm as the other Entities looked at each of them with many thoughts.","Even though the situation looked extremely grim, the Holy Emperor’s face remained the same as his majestic voice came out.","\"As hard as it is while watching what is happening right now...I am trusting in his words!\"","RUMBLE!","The stance of the Holy Emperor was clear as they watched the shocking scene play out with clarity, the Illusory Unbreakable Realm having its unique quality in the name- everyone could see what was happening within it!","---","\"Haha! Very good!\"","Noah’s boisterous voice came out even while surrounded by a variety of Entities.","When he looked around him, he could see that many of them had the stellar pairs if wings that made them Ailerons, but a few were humans and 2 seemed to be from completely different species as their bodies held unique physiologies!","From them, he could sense the aura of profound Dao essence, each of their bodies thrumming with power as they looked towards not him, but the Blue Slime above his head coldly.","They had seen this creature sneak attack someone as powerful as Vast, and a large portion of their focus was on it!","While the Peak Tier GALAXY Summons Noah brought forth were strong, they weren’t seen as threats in front of the Entities’ eyes","To them, this battle was over and done with as the domineering Primal Emperor would soon give out a command!","Noah stopped his boisterous laughter as he looked towards them while his body began to explode out with essence.","\"Big bird bosses, you see...aside from my many other talents. I’m actually very proficient in making Clones!\"","RUMBLE!","The moment his words finished, his c.h.e.s.t shone as Noah made it seem like something was coming out from his origin.","He didn’t want to let the Entities in this realm prison know that he could leave at any time due to his Astral Connector Absolute Skill, so he made it seem like he was merely Summoning things from within!","But soon after, the devilishly handsome figures of beings with the same look as him appeared grandly, each of them carrying the same aura of an Entity.","\"...\"","Their number increased to match the numbers of Peak Tier summoned beasts beside Noah, the figures that looked exactly like him standing beside every Animus Summons but Tiamat!","\"Merge!\"","With each of these figures relating the aura of Entities, Noah had them merge with the Peak Tier GALAXY pets and the Blue Slime right after as an explosion of essence took place.","Shockingly, the Primal Emperor and other Aileron Entities let him perform all of these skills and transformations before attacking!","RUMBLE!","The Void Clones of both of his bodies merged with the Blue Slime, Colossal Helios Leviathan, Jörmungandr, Golden Crow, Calamity Bear, Oculothorax, and the Obsidian Panther as only Tiamat was not merged with yet.","A the same time, Noah affirmed that the two Ruination Cores affixes were set to [Slain enemies have a 10% chance to drop Dao Crystals based on the Dao they cultivate] and [The act of not taking damage for 10 seconds grants a Ruination Shield capable of withstanding a single strike from a Sage]!","A defensive affix and an auxiliary one to provide him with the most pristine loot were set as his newly created ability of [Loot Drop- Assimilation Crystals] was already working and simply waiting for him to take down his enemies.","Many things were in place as he thought about bringing out the subordinates that had been absorbing Dao Crystals in the Infinite Galaxy, but only a few had managed to bring their comprehensions to 100% as they all still remained in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm!","Due to this and being faced with the pressure of 26 powerful Entities and over 100 Peak Tier Entities behind them, Noah planned to maybe release the Emperor Penguin and others when the odds of the battle were not that dangerous.","He had [Save Point] and multiple other life saving means, while his subordinates were still only budding and had just now barely entered the ranks of power houses. So for this battle...he would take on all of these Entities alone!","The summoned pets that merged with his clones very quickly erupted with power as each of their bodies now held the aura of an Entity, their bodies rumbling with power as they were ready to strike!","The Primal Emperor and his forces still looked towards Noah coldly though, as not a single one made a move.","\"Are you done?\"","The domineering voice of the Primal Emperor that seemed free of worries rang out.","After surrounding a being with 26 Entities ready to gang up on him, would there ever be a need for someone to worry?","His mystical pairs of wings glimmered sharply as his body shone with l.u.s.ter, the ruler overseeing an entire Ancient Power that had assimilated a large portion of a Lesser Dao exploding out with power as the Entities around him began to move.","\"Let me show you despair. Let me give you a taste of the same treatment you gave my people!\"","RUMBLE!","The chaotic void quaked at the sight of immense pressures, Noah simply having a bright smile as his hair flung around wildly, the Blue Slime shooting forth from his head as Tiamat’s body erupted out and transformed!","\"Let’s go!!!\"","OOOOOH!"]},{"number":822,"title":"Chapter 822: Chapter 821 - Lets Go!!! II","paragraphs":["\"Let’s go!!!\"","A magisterial bellow erupted out as while faced with enemies in much greater numbers, Noah and his summoned pets moved with valor, their bodies shining out with power!","CAAA!","The resonant cry of the Golden Crow rang out first as the golden flames on its body shone splendorous, a single skill being cast that affected all allies.","[Aurora Flames of the Enforcer].","WAA!","The golden flames from her body intensified as they jumped onto the bodies of other pets, swirling around them menacingly as they each received a boost in power while gaining regenerative and defensive boosts from an ability of the Golden Crow!","ROAAAR!","The draconic roar of the Dragon Queen rang out majestically as the huge figure of Tiamat made her appearance.","There was a reason why Noah had not merged with her, this Queen Dowager sending him a single message some time back.","’Do not merge with me and share your aura of an Entity. I need to experience destruction in its true form- whether from my body being heavily injured or if I rip apart Entities...before I can completely comprehend the Dao of Destruction myself!’","Tiamat wanted to struggle against the Entities without any support, Noah trusting the abilities of this fearsome being to not die simply as he let her run free!","As for himself?","Since he had reached Peak Tier GALAXY and had become a genuine Entity, what prevented him from personally participating?","\"OOOOOH!\"","He bellowed out wildly as he didn’t call forth any weapons such as the Trident of the Sea or the less useful Dagger of Time at this moment, simply going towards the cl.u.s.ter of Entities around the Primal Emperor with his body that palpated with the aura of the Dao of Withering!","\"You dare come towards me with the Dao I have nearly assimilated?!\"","The Primal Emperor called forth in anger and fury as he sensed the aura of the Dao of Withering on Noah, his body moving towards him wrathfully.","The Entities by his side rushed towards the menacing Blue Slime and Tiamat, the ones that appeared behind Noah being matched by the Colossal Helios Leviathan and the fearsome Jormungandr while the ones on the left and right were targeted by the Golden Crow and Calamity Bear on one side, the Oculothorax and Obsidian Panther on the other.","It was a grand scene of multiple Animus Summons and Noah’s valiant figure rushing towards multiple Entities!","By all accounts, they were outnumbered!","Those they were attacking...were beings that had lived for very long and were already assimilated with their Daos by large amounts.","Everybody looking at this scene nearly closed their eyes as if they expected the massacre about to take place, as if they couldn’t bear to see such a Tyrannical Entity be stopped by being ganged up on by 26 Entities!","BZZZT...BOOOM!","Space weaved and cried out as the first impact occurred.","Multiple Entities had thrown out skills or physical attacks against Noah and his summons, the expected scene that should have occurred being one of bloody murder as logically- blood should have been drawn!","OOOOH!","Noah and his pets were only pushed back a little as illusory barriers appeared around them!","It was Ruination Shields!","The Shield came from an Affix that applied to Noah, and Noah had separated himself into multiple clones.","The clones had the boost of the Ruination Shields, and so did the Animus Summons that they completely merged with!","The only being that didn’t have the protection...was Tiamat as shocking ruptures and torn muscles could be seen after she took the strikes of multiple Entities, her grand wings shredded from the aura of Withering as white bones could be seen.","The Blue Slime wasn’t even fazed as he had the protection of his own Grand Dao of Vastness and a Lesser Dao of Withering from the merged Noah, its body zipping around crazily as it targeted a single Entity to devour!","\"This...\"","The scalps of the Entities tingled as they saw only a single pet of the Tyrannical Entity be injured, and the one that was injured...its aura had begun to rise crazily from the heavy injuries it sustained!","With ruptured wings and muscles bleeding out profusely, the Queen Dowager’s resonant voice rang out.","\"From destruction comes rebirth.\"","THRUUM!","The words came with them the eruption of a majestic aura, of the essence of the Grand Dao of Destruction that had reached completion just seconds after the battle began. The Queen Dowager that was awakening its memories and getting back its power after tens of thousands of years...had finally taken another step as she reclaimed the title of an Entity.","WAAA!","A magisterial air erupted from her as her injuries began to heal rapidly, pillars of scorching flames beginning to erupt out!","Yet...even this was not the most terrifying scene within this Illusory Unbreakable Realm as it was not the thing the Entities from the Primal Winged Expanse were most shocked about.","The most shocking event was the body of an Aileron Entity freely floating in space as an empty husk, the light within its eyes dimming as many came to realize an Entity had somehow fallen in the span of a few seconds!","Not too far away, the glimmers of a resplendent ray of light returned to a golden winged eye that was the Oculothorax!","Shockingly, it wasn’t the terrifying Blue Slime or Tiamat who were now Entities of Grand Daos that stole the show with the first impact.","Targeting an attacking Aileron Entity, the Oculothorax had released its [Eye of Doom] as the essence of Withering swirled around it, this ray ignoring the outstretched fist of the Entity as it shot straight to his soul and shattered it right away.","...!","OOOOOOH!","An invisible cry reverberated out from the glistening golden eye as it announced itself grandly, letting everyone know it was one of the deadliest combatants here!","Ah!"]},{"number":823,"title":"Chapter 823: Chapter 822 - Magisterial! I","paragraphs":["The watchers of the battles found themselves standing up from their seats when they really confirmed that an Aileron Entity had fallen just seconds from the first impact!","That was an Entity you know.","A being that had lived and cultivated for thousands of years.","Gone!","RUMBLE!","\"Soul Attack!\"","\"Reinforce your souls!\"","...!","The Entities cried out quickly as they shook their heads with mourning, knowing one of them was lost so stupidly because they hadn’t expected the rare Soul Damage attribute to appear here, nor how fast and deadly it would be when backed by the Dao of Withering!","The Primal Emperor had a wrathful expression as he voiced out.","\"Be careful of Soul Attack and the devouring Slime. Move together to wipe out these fiendish freaks!\"","WAAA!","The Entities moved in conjunction as they targeted Noah and his pets in groups.","The battles about to occur were so fast paced and involved so many moving pieces that we have to talk about them separately!","The following events were taking place simultaneously, each with their own ferocity and valor!","We start with the group of Entities that were facing the Lightbourne Oculothorax and the Obsidian Panther.","It used to be three of them, and now it was down to two as a dead Entity floated behind them!","Sadly, the body of this Entity didn’t trigger the Affix of the Ruination Core to drop Dao Crystals nor did it trigger Noah’s own Loot Skill to drop Assimilation Crystals.","The eyes of the remaining two Entities were looking towards the Oculothorax with careful eyes as they dated not underestimate the light shining from the enormous winged eye.","Yet as their attention focused on the Oculothorax with their bodies glimmering with resplendent abilities, the nonchalant Obsidian Panther by the side moved as his figure entirely disappeared!","SHAAA!","\"Watch out!\"","The scalp of one of the two Entities trembled as he only saw a black flash before he noticed a claw filled with glimmering dark claws that palpated with the essence of Ruination swipe towards him.","RIIIIP!","A horrid sound erupted as the claws sunk into the forehead of the Entity, his eyes filled with solemnity as he tried to move back while feeling the destructive essence of Withering try to pierce through the torn head muscles and necrotize his brain!","SHAA! SHAA!","The black flash disappeared once more as the Entity could barely keep up, and during this period of shock, the ray of light from Eye of Doom reverberated out once more as the Lightbourne Oculothorax let out a deadly strike.","\"F.u.c.k.i.n.g hell!\"","The two Entities matched with these two pets dodged to the inch of their lives every time as they found themselves not even able to release attacks!","CAA!","The resonant cry of the Golden Crow came with blistering flames that threatened to scorch the very space itself, these flames coagulating into sharp Golden claws that descended towards 3 Entities maddeningly!","\"Hmph!\"","These 3 Entities had become careful, but did not feel the strain as they faced the two pets.","Their bodies shone with the light of the essence of Withering, utilizing their proficiency in this Dao to form illusory weapons that smashed onto the Flaming Golden claws cast by the Golden Crow!","\"Nothing much, let us wipe them out and help the others!\"","The Entities felt the quality of these two pets to be lower as they proceeded to ready deadly skills to quickly defeat them, but it was at this time when they felt a tremendous presence behind them.","THRUUUM!","The Calamity Bear they always had their eyes on had somehow appeared before them, its kingly aura leaking out as it looked like an arrogant Ruler!","\"Hug of Life and Death.\"","WAAA!","The horrendous constrictive force was felt by the 3 Entities as they were held in place, their gazes changing as essence exploded from their bodies to resist.","Yet the Golden Crow appeared above them at this time as its golden eyes shone menacingly.","[Nirvanic Flames of Tyranny].","BZZZZT!","From its body, Golden flames that contained a tint of red appeared, the scorching temperatures they released only being enhanced by Noah’s essence of Withering as they thundered down towards the 3 Entities held in place!","OOOOOOH!","The Entities shockingly felt like their lives were on the line as they bellowed out, their bodies shining brightly to defend against these deadly attacks...","These 5 Entities were facing the enormous figures of Colossal Helios Leviathan and the deadly Jörmungandr as they had their task somewhat easier, flying around the huge body of the Leviathan as they released powerful attacks towards it.","The fearsome Jörmungandr was on top of the Leviathan as its serpentine head coiled, its red eyes watching the Entities surrounding them closely!","They used the enormous body of the Leviathan to their advantage as they believed it was only a matter of time before they pierced through its thick scales and took it down.","At this scene, the Colossal Helios Leviathan felt insulted as its booming voice rang out.","\"You think me to be huge and defenseless?!\"","RUMBLE!","Its resounding voice was followed by intense reverberations as it released a single skill.","[Realm Depredation].","...BOOM...CRACK!","It was also at this time that Jörmungandr moved in a magisterial fashion.","It raised its head high as its blood seemed to be boiling, its red eyes shining with a brilliant l.u.s.ter as they honed in on 2 nearby Entities with solemn faces as they faced the Leviathan’s [Realm Depredation].","With an air of majestic ancientness, Jörmungandr called out!","[Galaxy Devouring Serpent].","WAAA!","Essence gushed out wildly as an illusory image of a Primal Serpent appeared above Jörmungandr, its shape disastrous and massive as its abyssal eyes stared at the two target Entities.","Facing the eyes of this Illusory Primal Serpent, the Aileron Entities felt their souls shake as they actually felt a life-threatening feeling from it!"]},{"number":824,"title":"Chapter 824: Chapter 823 - Magisterial! II","paragraphs":["The sight of an enormous Galaxy Devouring Serpent was truly one of wonder as it captured the eyes of many of those watching this shocking battle!","Yet..there was still another ridiculous battle occurring simultaneously at the same time as the fights between the party of Colossal Helios Leviathan and Jörmungandr, the party of Golden Crow and the Calamity Bear, and the party of the Oculothorax and the Obsidian Panther.","It was the figures of Noah, a Blue Slime, and Tiamat going towards the Primal Emperor who was backed by 14 other Entities and 100 Ailerons in the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm!","THRUUUM!","Towards the enemies releasing deadly attacks filled with the backing of Daos, the three were fearless as they had the Ruination Shield still protecting Noah and the Blue Slime, with Tiamat having a grand light of destruction protecting her as she was the first to move.","[Wrath of the Dragon Queen].","RUMBLE!","The formation of 4 Illuosry Dragons with the same stature as Tiamat appeared grandly, the scorching pillars of flames billowing out of them majestically as this time...they held with them a deadly light of Destruction!","They were like palpating beams of plasma that even made the surrounding chaotic void melt as they rushed towards the 15 Entities and 100 Peak Tier GALAXY Realm experts rapidly.","Attacks like this were extremely deadly and effective as they affected a wide area, the coming Entities having to utilize a lot of their essence to cast skills that carried the essence of their Daos to protect themselves and stop it from wrecking the bodies of the Peak Tier Entities behind them that were actually feeling like they didn’t belong in this battle!","BOOOM!","The scorching beans of plasma hit as the Entities defended, the figure of the Primal Emperor being the first to fly of the scorching plasma as his hand formed into a claw that tried grasping towards the rushing Noah.","SHAAA!","The Primal Emperor pulled back instantly as he still recalled what had happened to the Entity Vest that the body of this Blue Slime had covered, his face solemn as the other Entities soon came beside him.","But one must recall...the Blue Slime didn’t just have its expanding ability and the Grand Dao of Vastness, it still had multiple other Grand and Lesser Daos that neared full comprehension because of <<Universal Devouring>>!","[Sundering Song of Death and Decimation].","The Blue Slime called out innocently as the essence around its body raged.","The essence of the Grand Daos of Vastness, Devouring, Macrocosm, Slaughter, and Four Elements raged our wild as they came together into a maddening symphony of chaotic tendrils of darkness that stretched out towards every single Entity!","It was the combination of multiple Grand Daos, these beings utilizing a Leser Dao looking forward in shock as they wondered how the hell a single creature containing so many Grand Daos!","The Primal Emperor’s face sunk even more as his body formed a spectacularly shining shield made of the essence of Withering, his voice ringing out as he weaved in and out to defend against the deadly tendrils that were the [Sundering Song of Death and Decimation]!","\"Focus on the most powerful one first!\"","Yet the other Entities could not reply to him as they were still trying to survive the deadly [Sundering Song of Death and Decimation] that tore apart their defenses any time the Dark tendrils touched them!","In the midst of all of this, Noah’s eyes shone brightly as his body began to erupt with light.","When it came to Noah, he truly had a great deal of abilities he could use. So many in fact, that one could consider him to be neglecting some stupendous abilities!","To fix this while also utilizing his greatest perk that was Infinite mana, Noah had designed a skill and used 1 million Skill Points to create it on his way here.","[Automatic Cast of All Support Skills].","His mind gave a single command that initiated a great deal of skills.","THRUUUUM!","Support skills from all the Universal Laws!","From all the Skill Trees!","An enormous influx of mana was used as it caused such tremendous pressure and brilliance that it pushed away any surrounding beings.","The essence of all Universal Laws freely raged around a single being as he was enhanced by a multitude of abilities that utilized their essence, his body shining splendrously as he took on a new form to represent all of these cast abilities!","He didn’t expand into the huge tree even though a transformation ability that also greatly supported him like [Galactic Tree] was cast.","Nor did he turn into a huge Terror or take on any enormous form!","The Universal Laws that he was assimilating in conjunction at this moment...wrapped around him seamlessly as when the light died down, Noah kept his original body while being adorned in a magisterial set of armor.","Shining with a rainbow of colors, he wielded sharp swords palpating with the essence of Death and Aether. On his back floated 6 golden gamers glimmering with the aura of Fate, with his robe shining a green l.u.s.ter as it represented the defense of Yggdrasil and Galactic Tree- shining with the essence of life!","On his back were mystical white and dark pair of wings, carrying with them the essence of Space, Light, and Wind as they threatened to be even faster than even the Obsidian Panther!","It wasn’t just these Laws as all over Noah’s body, the essence of all universal laws shone brightly as he actually utilized all of them at once, the laws forming into things like gloves, boots, earings...anything that could attach to his body and strengthen him.","Behind these laws were also a myriad of |Intents|!","Overall, it produced a Noah that was garbed in a magisterial battle robe and resplendent pair of wings, his body seemingly shimmering with all colors as he disappeared in a flash of light, only to appear in front of the shocked Primal Emperor with his two blades shimmering with the aura of Death and Aether already striking at the fair neck of this Ruler!","Faster and deadlier than even the Obsidian Panther!","...!","It was a magisterial sight as at this same moment, many beings had begun to arrive to see the conflict between the two Ancient Powers, the auras of multiple Entities utilizing resplendent skills drawing them to the borders of the Primal Winged Expanse right away.","When these powerful Entities from numerous Ancient Powers arrived behind the scenes to watch, their hearts shook as they saw multiple Entities encircling a single man and his summons.","The thing that provided the shocking factor was the fact that while surrounded by 25 Entities, the Tyrannical Entity in the encircling wasn’t one bit on the losing side as he even took the initiative to control the pace of the battle!","What they were about to see would truly be eye opening, these beings never being able to forget it as they would be introduced to the one known as Noah Osmont in a stellar fashion!"]},{"number":825,"title":"Chapter 825: Chapter 824 - One by One, They Shall Fall! I","paragraphs":["Sister Gold was watching a curious scene play out in the border of the Ancient Power that was known as the Primal Winged Expanse.","She knew all there was to know about the Entities connected to this Power, the prowess of the Spirit Race being something very few beings could imagine!","She was very knowledgeable about the forces of this Ancient Power...so she was all the more surprised when she observed them taking a beating from a single being that was utilizing the Dao of Summoning and Withering!","As a being that was working to assimilate the Daos of Alacrity, Vastness, Frost, and Destruction, as well as being a unique existence from the Spirit Race- she had a very keen eye when it came to quantifying the battle power of others and understanding their might.","At this moment, she was working to analyze the combatants fighting in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm as her figure melded into the chaotic void a few miles away.","The strength of the Entities coming from the Primal Winged Expanse...she understood.","Many of them were proficient in the Dao of Withering and had already begun assimilating it, with quite a decent amount of them increasing their +2500% Extra Damage of this Dao into the ranges of +3000-4000%.","Especially the Primal Emperor himself, this being should have been at a shocking 4800% boost as he was in the upper percentages when it came to fully assimilating the Dao of Withering!","When she looked at these Entities, her unique abilities could quantify and understand the output of their power. Yet when it came to the enemy they faced...she actually could not make any headway!","\"It is improbable...\"","She uttered out calmly as her mind observed the shocking battle that was occurring at high speeds.","\"That alone should have been very unlikely, if not impossible.\"","But even this point she placed aside as she focused on what this being was currently doing now.","From the 100 Peak Tier GALAXY Aileron experts that had circled the fighting Entities and got ready to lend support at any time while evading the horrendous attacks thrown within, Sister Gold picked up from their pensive conversations that the being facing 25 Aileron Entities was a genius from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, her ears picking up the names of Alexander and Noah simultaneously.","Her eyes were focused on this being as they observed that he alone was reinforcing and supplying the bodies of all 8 of his summons with an endless supply of Mana and Dao Essence!","He was supplying them with pure mana from the connection formed deep in their souls, and also using the mana within his own body and converting it to Dao Essence using his comprehensions in the Dao of Withering to boost the power of his Summons even more.","This thought process, Sister Gold could understand. But what she couldn’t explain was how this Entity had not dropped dead from Mana exhaustion after spending the resource so freely and wastefully like this!","Her brows jumped even higher when out of nowhere, she saw the explosion of Universal Law Essences.","Not a few law essences...but all of the Universal Law Essences erupted out and then swirled around this single Entity, his body being adorned by a magisterial set of armament as his power jumped up multiple levels!","\"This...\"","Sister Gold’s eyes finally became serious at this scene as she focused all her attention on this being.","Entities normally had one or two laws fully comprehended and assimilated, and they used them actively while supporting their Dao as they unleashed terrific attacks.","Yet to utilize the essence of all Universal Laws? At once?","\"It is not probable!\"","THRUUUM!","Her mental state was slightly affected by the scene in front of her, her thoughts moving quickly as she utilized the unique ability of the Spirit Race to send a message to all the Entities of her race.","One Race, One Soul!","This was the shocking motto of the Spirit Race that was one of the most feared Ancient Powers of the Dark Universe.","\"I’ve come across an Anomaly while observing the war between the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the Primal Winged Expanse. I’ll begin real time memory sharing.\"","RUMBLE!","In Sister Gold’s mind, another voice rang out calmly.","\"The utilization of all Universal Laws...and this usage of mana...\"","Terrifying beings had gotten their eyes of Noah as a single creature of the Spirit Race floated a few miles away from the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, yet it was like the numerous Entities of the Spirit Race were all there as their cold eyes analyzed this anomaly of Noah Osmont!","In other hidden regions all around the border of the Primal Winged Expanse, numerous hidden figures had already been watching or were arriving and hiding themselves to watch the ongoing clash that involved multiple Entities, many of them questioning how it was even happening the way it was!","A single Entity controlling multiple Summons was standing against an entire group of Entities, and it didn’t seem like he was on the losing side!","RUMBLE!","Inside the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, Noah was clad in shimmering armaments that thrummed with the power of Universal Laws that were enhanced with the essence of the Dao, his stats being boosted crazily as even he had yet to calculate the actual percentage.","Just from the single skill of Yggdrasil he had over +5000% Increase in Damage and other attributes, these percentages being increased crazily when he activated the support skills from all the Laws as he wouldn’t be too surprised if just the boost in [Damage] was over +10,000%!","ZIIIIING!","HO!","A burst of essence erupted from this Ruler as everything around him was pushed back, his eyes glancing at the magisterial figure of Noah as well as the swirling coagulation of essence around him!","The eyes of the Primal Emperor became more and more somber as Noah pushed forward even faster than light, arriving beside him again as a shocking clash ensued.","While keeping at bay the ferocious Noah that seemed like a Primal beast out for blood, the Primal Emperor sought support from the many other Entities around him!","Yet this was the time was the figure of a small Blue Slime zipped out, its body carrying a profound aura of multiple Daos as while the ability of the [Song of Death and Decimation] continued to spread the Entities out while they defended- it went forward to attack as the targets of Devouring entered its line of sight.","The Blue Slime represented terror as it appeared instantly behind an Aileron Entity, it’s body expanding rapidly as it was about to remind everyone of the horror they saw before!"]},{"number":826,"title":"Chapter 826: Chapter 825 - One by One, They Shall Fall! II","paragraphs":["The Blue Slime had targeted a defending Aileron Entity as it appeared silently from behind, its body rapidly going on to expand as the Entity only felt an uncomfortable feeling wrap over him before...","<<Universal Devouring>>.","WAP!","...he disappeared!","RUMBLE!","Essence erupted out as the moment an Entity was so easily devoured, the Blue Slime’s aura rose ever higher as instantly, it obtained the full comprehensions and assimilations of the Dao of Withering from the devoured Aileron Entity.","Off to the side, the scalp of the Primal Emperor tingled as his gaze remained cold, his wrathful eyes now counting 2 Entities on their side having fallen!","\"Do not let them make a mockery of us!\"","He bellowed out to the remaining 13 Entities nearby that had surrounded the baleful Tiamat and were carefully looking at the Blue Slime that had taken down their compatriot.","These Entities were beings that had lived long in age and were extremely wise, this ongoing situation beginning to make the gears in their heads spin as they began to have a foreboding feeling!","Noah’s gorgeous multicolored figure flashed in front of the Primal Emperor once more at this time, his mind sending a telepathic message to the Blue Slime as his swords filled with the essence of Death and Aether thundered forward.","\"That’s the only one you can devour. Kill the rest so that we can have a chance of collecting Assimilation Crystals!\"","A shocking message was sent out as the Blue Slime wobbled forth, its body exploding out with the auras of multiple daos as its speed was no less than Noah who was bolstered by all Universal Laws and Dao Essence.","Noah kept his eyes on the Primal Emperor alone as the other 13 Entities were actually held at bay by the dangerous Tiamat and Blue Slime, these PRISMATIC+ pets that each had their own shocking identities in the larger Primordial Chaos being even more overpowered than Noah!","He stared at the eyes of the Primal Emperor that seemed to have boundless wrath and calmness, the disposition of this Ruler being something rare as even in a situation like this, he remained level-headed as his body exploded with power.","Different coagulations and shapes formed around him as the assimilated Dao of Withering was used proficiently, each of them being extremely deadly as even while Noah evaded most of them, over 10 strikes had managed to land on him as the Ruination Shield on his body wavered!","THRUUUUUM!","Time seemed to slow down.","Ever since Noah had activated all the laws to reinforce his body, he seemed to have entered into a special state that he was slowly grasping as the seconds passed.","He didn’t know what to call it or what exactly it was, but this unique state made his body and infinite mana move ever faster, every single time he moved and attacked becoming faster and faster!","The gorgeous eruption of essence all around him seemed to come to a stand still, as if time itself had come to a stop.","The kingly Calamity Bear that had managed to successfully grasp an Entity into his Hug of Life and Death.","The resounding image of the shockingly luminous Golden Crow raining down sundering flames to hold the other Entities at bay while the Calamity Bear squeezed the Aileron Entity to death!","The scene of the deadly Lightbourne Oculothorax shooting out resplendent beams of [Eye of Doom] while the Obsidian Panther was ravaging an Aileron Entity with his body that could only be seen like a flash of light.","The scene of the enormous Colossal Helios Leviathan working with the Galaxy Devouring Serpent-Jourmungandr, to withstand and even cause 5 Aileron Entities to stand on the losing side.","All of these scenes seemed to reflect on his mind as he could feel his blood raging!","His hair danced wildly as from those observing him and the shocking scenes occurring in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, they shockingly felt like they were looking at an archaic creature let loose to bring destruction!","In his stat panel, unbeknownst to Noah, another shocking thing was happening.","The speed of his Universal Laws Assimilation was rising as the percentage in front of it changed with every passing second!","RIIING!","He felt the essence of laws coursing through him, and the dao essence that reinforced them as he actually...closed his brilliant eyes, his body moving even faster.","He put in even more effort as his body flashed faster than light, his two blades palpating with laws and dao essence piercing through the coagulation of dao around the Primal Emperor as he finally landed a deadly attack on this being!","SHAAA!","A second passed, and a bloody hand flew off the body of the Primal Emperor!","SQUELCH!","The sword in his other hand also landed as it dug deep into the bright wings of this Ruler, multiple pairs of wings flying out as blood freely sputtered out.","...!!!","A shocking lull descended on the battlefield at this scene.","At this shocking juncture as blood freely overflowed from the body of the Primal Emperor, Noah’s summons used this as a chance to lay out even more tremendous attacks as the instance of spacing out had shocking consequences!","From the side of the Colossal Helios Leviathan and Jormungandr, an Aileron Entity had been devoured in the jaws of the dreadful Serpent!","The Entity in the bear hug of the Kingly Calamity Bear...was squashed to paste after he lost the support of the other 2 Entities!","A shocking scene played out in the Illusory Unbreakable Prison as the being that had drawn the blood of the Ruler shone the most l.u.s.trously.","He raised his right hand as his Death Blade pointed towards the Primal Emperor while uttering tyrannical words.","\"Weak! Weak! Weak!\"","RUMBLE!","\"One by one...all of you shall fall today!\"","RUUUUMBLE!!!"]},{"number":827,"title":"Chapter 827: Chapter 826 - Pretty Obvious","paragraphs":["The juncture where the Primal Emperor had one of his hands and wings separated from his body was a particularly shocking one that etched itself in the minds of all those watching.","The Entities in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm were even more shocked as Noah’s summons used this instance to take multiple Entities down!","Aside from the 2 falling by the hands of Calamity Bear and Jormungandr, the [Eye of Doom] from the Lightbourne Oculothorax had found another target as an Entity found their soul shattered.","The Entities near Noah and the Primal Emperor were most shocked as the Blue Slime and Tiamat didn’t waste this opportunity.","The Queen Dowager’s body glimmered with an intense light as she didn’t use her dreadful [Wrath of the Dragon Queen], but another ability that she could now utilize as she had reclaimed her title as an Entity.","[Sanctimony of Destruction].","RUUUMBLE!","Essence bubbled forth angrily from the body of the Queen Dowager as above her, an enormous black door formed.","The door looked primal and old, opening slowly yet rapidly at the same time as an instant later, one could see a shocking draconic claw coming out from this huge door!","The claw was entirely black as it was made up entirely of the essence of destruction, its direction focused towards one Entity as it pinched...and this Entity found its body surrounded by the horrendous light of destruction a second later as his body and origin were squeezed from all sides, his Lesser Dao not being able to withhold the terrifying essence as the Entity exploded!","POOOF!","A shower of blood and gore erupted out as not too far away, the figure of the speedy Blue Slime was barely discernible as it chose a more eerie method.","Its body flashed in front of a shocked Entity as its viscous mass shot forth as it broke through the thin layer of essence shield and entered through the nose of this Entity!","After gaining access into the body of the Aileron, the Blue Slime expanded as its viscous mass that palpated with the light of multiple Grand Daos ballooned crazily.","POOOF!","Another Entity exploded out grandly as in the span of seconds, 5 Entities fell!","5!","Five beings that lived for thousands of years perished together in seconds- this reality shocking all of those watching as they didn’t even know what the hell they were looking at anymore.","Less than 20 Entities remained as Noah’s eyes scanned everything, his expanded senses from utilizing all universal laws and the shocking state he entered showing him many things.","From the 5 Entities that had recently fallen, 2 had exploded in a shower of loot as Noah’s eyes glimmered while landing his eyes on the shockingly colorful Assimilation Crystals for the first time!","Multiple in number and shining gorgeous, they disappeared silently from the battlefield as the merged Jormungandr silently put them away in Noah’s Expansive Space.","THRUUUUM!","Amidst this shocking scene, the Primal Emperor still had a wrathful expression while looking at Noah, his aura continuing to rise ever higher even though he was injured!","\"Do not falter!\"","RUMBLE!","He uttered these words out confidently to the remaining Entities as the swirling essence formed into a stellar armor around his body and soul.","His wrathful eyes followed Noah as his body shot out, the torn arm and wings not even being paid attention to!","SHAAA!","Noah’s figure flashed once more as he continued to get used to the unique state from utilizing all universal laws at once.","He noticed the activity next to the progress of All Universal Laws Assimilation percentage as it continued to rise ever so slowly, but it was rising!","This caused for his emotions to become even wilder as he got lost in the enticing feeling of the essence of all Universal Laws surrounding him, his mind forgetting anything else as he focused on their integration with him.","He had thought creating a skill like [Loot Drop- Assimilation Crystals] would be the only way to greatly increase his speed in assimilating Laws, but he was wrong!","The act he was undertaking right now was very unique.","Normally, a being would have gotten exhausted by now after activating and utilizing the abilities of all laws at once, but Noah’s oppressive aura only kept increasing as behind him, he had Infinite Mana!","ZIIIING!","This caused the swords made from the essence of death and Aether chase after the body of the Primal Emperor even faster.","Off in the distance of the chaotic void, Sister Gold was watching this scene as she relayed it to the many powerful beings in her Ancient Power.","There were many discussions ongoing among the group of existences from the Spirit Race, the beings that were ahead of everyone else when it came to comprehending and assimilating daos!","\"He seems to be actively assimilating all universal laws...\"","The obvious was stated as Sister Gold nearly pointed it out, but she wanted to be more productive as she shot back.","\"It still does not escape the fact that it is not probable. Everything else aside, what is not explainable is where all the mana to make this possible is coming from.\"","There was silence as the powerful beings watched the ongoing battle in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm.","\"We all agree that it’s pretty obvious he’s the one we might be looking for when it comes to the being collecting Ruination Cores?\"","\"The scene in front of us would make sense if this being contains the special constitution required to utilize Ruination Cores.\"","\"But it still doesn’t explain the source of his mana...\"","\"Stop it with the question of mana, we cannot explain it at this moment.\"","Many voices seemed to be buzzing back and forth in Sister Gold’s head as she was the center of the established connection.","Her face remained placid as she asked a question that shut up all the voices in her head.","\"Shall I confront him as an Ally or an Enemy?\"","\"...\"","The silence in her head became deafening as not a single voice spoke!"]},{"number":828,"title":"Chapter 828: Chapter 827 - Tyrannical!","paragraphs":["In the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, the situation was actually ridiculously looking dire for the many Entities that were grouping up against a single one!","The Primal Emperor saw this scene as he observed the battle while clashing against a relentless Noah, his vibrant voice ringing out again as he gave a painful command to the forgotten 100 Peak Tier GALAXY Realm experts that were surrounding the fighting Entities and watching apprehensively as they threw out attacks that could heavily injure any Peak Tier GALAXY being who didn’t have the protection of a Dao essence in an instant.","\"Join together and fight! Keep the freaks at bay while we take them down!\"","He continued teeming the unbelievably powerful Noah and his summons as freaks, his command ringing in the ears of the Peak Tier GALAXY experts as they moved apprehensively!","They actually did not want to enter the frightening battlefield, but Entity after Entity kept falling from their side as they knew if the unbelievable and impossible thing of all them falling occurred...death would also come for them.","So even though they were unwilling, they joined the fray!","BOOOM!","Resplendent long distance skills overflowed as they tried to keep their distance, but their abilities only bounced off the bodies of the summons as the moment they entered...the eyes Noah’s pets honed in on them.","They saw the pristine loot of GALAXY Cores, Law Assimilation Crystals, and Dao Comprehension Crystals when they looked at these beings that hadn’t yet fully comprehended their Lesser Dao, the option of them dropping Dao Assimilation Crystals not even being a possibility.","But Noah’s target when creating the loot drop skill was always to increase the rate of hid law assimilation, so these 100 Peak Tier GALAXY experts were simply gift wrapped for him!","He gave the command to his pets that while they matched and took down the Entities, they shouldn’t forget to send an attack or two to reap the lives of the Peak Tier GALAXY experts!","...!","Ah!","Such a domineering thought process came naturally to Noah. The thought that his summoned pets could simply take a few seconds of their time to butcher Peak Tier GALAXY experts for their loot...","How far he had come!","How short the period of time!","THRUUUM!","The Golden feathers of the mystical wings overflowed with blood as the Aether sword found its target once more.","The gaze of the Primal Emperor had turned solemn as he gave a command to the 10+ nearby Entities that were attacking Tiamat and the Blue Slime in conjunction.","\"Support me!\"","RUMBLE!","The words were strong, but painful to hear!","It was the Ruler of the Primal Winged Expanse asking for help from his allies...he was expressing that he alone could not keep the Noah that continued to rise in oppressive aura at bay.","How shameful!","The Primal Emperor could nearly feel his face burning red as two Entities appeared beside him, these two giving their brethren Entities a much harder time as they left them alone with Tiamat and the Blue Slime that comprehend many Grand Daos!","They reinforced the Primal Emperor as Noah now faced three powerful Entities by himself.","\"Hmph!\"","His domineering snort rang out as he moved like a flash of light, avoiding the attacks of the new Entities as his body finally materialized for more than a second once more.","His hair danced wildly as it didn’t even have the texture of normal hair anymore, seemingly looking like tendrils of blue mana dancing on his body as the arrogance and disappointment on his face was apparent.","\"The weak always huddle and gather together when faced against an oppressive force!\"","...!","The faces of the Primal Emperor and all other Aileron Entities in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm turned red at these words that stabbed deep into their hearts!","Those watching from afar that were in parties looked at their friends in shock as expressions of incredulousness were apparent on their faces.","They seemed to be asking themselves, did this f.u.c.k.i.n.g guys really just say that?!","But Noah paid all of this no heed as at this juncture, he changed one of the affixes on the Ruination Core as he stopped seeking for safety and defense, wanting to go on the full offensive mode.","The affix of creating a Ruination Shield if he hadn’t taken Damage for 10 seconds was taken off.","He didn’t choose the affix for Smiting his enemies with 10,000% Ruination Damage that had a 10% chance to activate.","He further made his base offensive boosts even crazier as he activated the fairly simple [+10,000 to All Damage] Affix!","Simple, straightforward, and for his current state that was already enhanced by numerous percentages and support skills...it was simply deadly!","THRUUUUUUM!","The moment the affix was activated, the faces of the Primal Emperor and the 2 Entities behind him drastically changed.","The Golden hammers shimmering with the essence of fate that were floating behind Noah disappeared and reappeared above their heads smashing down.","Noah’s body also turned into a flash of light as beside him just attacking with his Law Sword, he now also began casting active skills.","[Sever].","ZIIING!","[Portals of Terror].","[Fireball].","BRRRRRRRR!","Enhanced by ridiculous amounts, skills were cast as they bloomed in the midst of the 3 Entities.","Their faces drained of colors as they felt blazing miniaturized suns smash into them on top of a chaining Aether lightning, along with portals that released deadly essence!","\"No...!\"","One of the Entities screamed as he felt his Dao essence shield be ripped apart by the destructive nature of these skills, his wings beginning to burn up as a unique aroma permeated the surroundings.","It was the smell of a bird being overcooked, a second later a shining miniaturized sun stemming from [Fireball] piercing into his now defenseless head as his brain was melted!","RUMBLE!","The other Entity beside the Primal Emperor also had his Dao essence shredded as he fared somewhat better, evading the miniaturized suns with a heavy face as he thought he was out of the woods...that is until he felt the piercing dual swords of Aether and Death reach both sides of the neck from a suddenly appearing Noah, his head separated from his body a second later as blood bloomed out gorgeously.","Noah finished the job as his swords moved even faster, cutting up the entire body of the Entity as he was destroyed in both body and soul!","...!","Only the Primal Emperor was able to escape the shocking attacks with heavy injuries as to his dismay he realized...the two Entities he had just called to support him were dead in seconds!","WAA!","Noah’s grand figure materialized again as his domineering eyes locked with the Primal Emperor.","\"Call some more.\"","...!","Cold and domineering words that were deadlier than even his real attacks reverberated out of the battlefield, those watching nearly losing their minds at what had just occurred!"]},{"number":829,"title":"Chapter 829: Chapter 828 - Surrender in not an option!","paragraphs":["THRUUUM!","Outside of the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, silence reigned in the expansive chaotic void.","Even though many experts were hidden in the folds of space while watching the shocking battle, not a single vibration of sound could be heard!","Many of those watching were Entities from powerful Ancient Powers, and even they had solemn expressions as they watched Noah dispatch 2 Entities in a matter of seconds, only the more powerful Primal Emperor escaping his grasp.","Their solemn eyes were because they felt like they were facing a great enemy, the power that this single being showed being something they had not expected to see when they came to check out the war between the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the Primal Winged Expanse!","But among those watching, there were few that were only observing with cold eyes as a myriad of thoughts crossed their minds.","Sister Gold, the stupendous being from the fearsome Spirit Race, was among these Entities.","Ever since she had asked the question of whether they would treat this tyrannical Entity in front of them as an enemy or ally, the voices in her mind had quieted down!","This was because they knew the full weight of this decision after observing the power of this being along with the high possibility that he was the one that was connected to the Ruination Cores.","Thus, they calculated greatly before they even brought forth a thought.","The silence did not last too long, as an aged voice rolled out extremely slowly in the mind of Sister Gold.","\"Strength is king.\"","RUMBLE!","\"Enemy or ally, it does not matter. It only matters whether our goals can be achieved. If he furthers our goals he can be an ally, if he stands against us...there shall only be destruction.\"","THRUUUM!","A shocking statement was uttered in Sister Gold’s mind as her eyes shone brightly.","The being that spoke was someone extremely special among the Spirit Race, one of the beings that they termed Ancestor!","Even after watching and analyzing the horrendous strength that Noah displayed as he matched numerous Entities, he had still uttered a statement that made it seem that if they were to become enemies...it wasn’t them that would perish.","Even as they saw how he butchered Entities in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm.","Even as they saw his seemingly inexhaustible mana reserves or the terrific Animus Summons that were no less powerful than him!","Those from the Spirit Race were confident!","\"Use your body as the conduit to create a doorway. We shall reinforce you just in case.\"","\"...Yes, Ancestor.\"","...!","Even though Sister Gold was a terrifying being that was studying and assimilating many Daos, someone who looked down on the Entities studying a single Lesser Dao that Noah was butchering right now...even she was being sent reinforcements just in case!","Those of the Spirit Race did not take risks unless they knew they would win!","Essence silently erupted in a corner of the chaotic void near the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, no other Entities being any wiser on what was to come...","Back in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, over half an hour had passed as the realm only had 30 minutes remaining.","This 30 minutes...felt extremely grueling to the Aileron Entities as with every passing few minutes, another Entity would fall!","From the side of the Colossal Helios Leviathan and the fearsome Jormungandr, only 2 Entities remained as 3 were taken down.","The Golden Crow and Calamity Bear were left with a single Entity that had a fearful look on his face as his defenses were slowly ground down!","Where the main force of 15 Entities used to be around the Primal Emperor who faced the most terrifying Blue Slime, Tiamat, and Noah...only 5 Entities remained alive including the bloodied and battered Primal Emperor.","The results of this battle were extremely shocking to look at as time passed!","Many considered if it was a show, the unbelievable sight of Entity after Entity falling from the hands of a single being and his Animus Summons being something purely out of fantasy.","The face of the Primal Emperor remained cold and wrathful, nobody being able to understand the thoughts coursing through his mind as he pushed his body further and knocked away the vibrantly shining figure of a winged Noah that swirled with the essence of all laws!","WAA!","Every attack or skill coming from the shining being in front of him felt like a hammer of death smashing towards him, the damage they dealt being inconceivable.","The +10,000% All Damage increase from the Ruination Core was something overpowered as it felt like a train smashing into the body of a defenseless being every time!","With his body bleeding profusely on all sides, the Primal Emperor kept his cold gaze as his remaining wings shimmered, streaking towards Noah once more as he attacked.","Throughout all this time, he never uttered any words of weakness or called for the battle to stop while claiming misunderstanding like others in a deadly situation like this would do.","The remaining Aileron Entities looked at this scene in despair as they finally came to the conclusion that no matter what happened today, the Primal Emperor would not stand down!","Some felt emotional as they fought faster, while some had looks of hesitation as they felt like their lives could be taken at any second from the ridiculously powerful pets that seemed to have boundless strength.","The remaining Entity facing the the Oculothorax and Obsidian Panther could not hold on any longer as he evaded the rays of [Eye of Doom], his expression ashen as he called out!","\"I surrender!\"","THRUUUM!","The cry wasn’t particularly loud, but it reverberated throughout the Illusory Unbreakable Realm and the surrounding chaotic void.","\"...\"","Those that had it had somber expressions as they could understand the reason why!","The Aileron Entities hearing it were angered as they looked towards their struggling brethren with faces of betrayal, but the being’s pitiful cry only rang out again, this time with more determination.","\"I surrender!\"","...!","Ah...","Many shook their heads at this scene as the shockingly golden and white winged eye that was the Oculothorax stopped in front of the Entity in his last seconds of life.","Off in the distance where Noah continued to clash with the Primal Emperor, his bright and oppressive voice resounded out for all to hear.","\"Surrender is not an option that I can offer.\"","RUMBLE!","With his body flashing with innumerable lights from the essence of all laws and dao essence, Noah looked like a cruel archaic being as his bright eyes brought down judgment.","\"I shall offer you all salvation...as my loot!\"","...!!!"]},{"number":830,"title":"Chapter 830: Chapter 829 - Emperorslayer! I","paragraphs":["The plea of surrender was heard from the distraught Entity...and it was ignored!","THRUUM!","The body of the Oculothorax erupted with another golden ray of [Eye of Doom], this ray shining the fearful and shameful expression on the Entity calling for surrender, his face being burned into the eyes of many of those watching as it was illuminated brightly before the golden ray smashed into him.","BOOOM...CRACK!","Body and soul were shattered as another Entity faced their death!","\"...\"","Dense silence descended in the chaotic void as the only sounds heard were the crackling of resplendent skills cast from the relentless animus summons and the bubbling body of Noah.","The Primal Emperor remained steadfast as his eyes had become extremely calm in the midst of this unbelievable situation.","His wrath and anger were abated as even with fewer and fewer Entities remaining beside him, he still moved towards Noah with his utmost power!","He didn’t call upon the other Entities to lend him, nor the less than 30 remaining Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons that were fearfully trying to evade shocking skills in the dreadful locked battlefield.","He moved by himself as he felt his shoulders heavy, the weight that a Ruler of an Ancient Power had to carry being felt with clarity by him at this very moment!","He knew very well what was happening, and who exactly had brought it to the stage that it was at right now.","THRUUUM!","Every strike and ability that Noah released caused even more deathly injuries to wreck the body of the Primal Emperor as the other Entities within the Illusory Unbreakable Realm were not too far off the same fate.","His terrifying Animus Summons moved with valor as they relentlessly ground down their enemies, despairing gazes occupying the minds of the Aileron Entities as they one after another...they were all falling!","The Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons that moved with confidence and power in their Ancient Power were few in number, many of them killed just from the residual energies released from the shocking battle of Entities.","Within the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, the cl.u.s.tering glow of an abundant amount of loot could be seen floating around, cl.u.s.ters of Cores, Skill Books, Dao Crystals, and Assimilation Crystals being seen in some regions!","Noah’s eyes scanned all of these things as his eyes focused on the heavily injured body of the Primal Emperor.","It was time.","It was time to bring the Ruler of an Ancient Power to rest.","THRUUUUM!","Those watching felt breathless as they instantly felt that something of immense importance was about to take place!","A flash of multicolored light streaked across the chaotic void.","Two swords shimmering with death and aether vibrated, the sound they released akin to wailful cries that sought death and destruction.","The swords streaked towards the neck of a heavily injured grand Ruler of an Ancient Power that had remained dignified throughout the entire battle!","Not once did he beg for mercy.","Not once did he call off the ongoing battle.","His eyes seemed aged and filled with a mystical light, the Dao of Withering shining even brighter on his body!","At this juncture as he saw the shadow of death, he seemed to have understood something as the Dao in his origin became even more active. As he faced ultimate destruction, the essence of the Dao of Withering bathed his origin and soul as the last thing he was missing to finish assimilating was coming together.","If he had a status panel, he would be able to notice his assimilation in the Lesser Dao of Withering going from 98% to 99% as it was about to touch 100%!","SHIIING!","A flash of light.","A head flew.","SHING! SHING! SHING!","The Tyrannical Entity was relentless as the swords flashed incessantly at the head that flew out, cutting it into innumerable pieces.","SHIIING!","The blades then aimed at the heart of the Ruler’s body as it was ruptured and decimated, shining brightly as they went on to sever the body on all sides.","\"...\"","Noah stood with cold eyes as he was about to continue attacking, but stopped the moment he saw the eruption of loot occur.","RUMBLE!","Essence crackled wildly around his body as even with the battle against the Primal Emperor finished, his aura only continued to rise ever higher!","In the past few seconds, his heart had shaken as he felt a shocking aura about to bloom from the body of the Primal Emperor.","He wasn’t the only one, the many other Entities watching from afar also saw the same scene as they gaped in shock, realizing they would very soon see a being take the first step towards becoming a Sage!","To be considered a Sage, one had to have 2 or more Daos fully comprehended and assimilated. For a Great Sage, they had to have advanced past the GALAXY Realm while also comprehending and assimilating a Grand Dao or multiple Lesser Daos.","This Ruler of the Primal Winged Expanse...was just about to step on this path as he became among the few that had assimilated an entire dao, needing to do the same to one more before he was titled a Sage!","Yet...","Before the shocking aura could bloom, it was cut off.","Sighs of regret rang throughout the chaotic void.","His body glimmered with intense light as the essence around his body bellowed out in waves, his two swords dripping with blood as he stared at the chunks of meat that were the Primal Emperor!","He gave a nod of respect that only made those watching look at him incredulously, but it affirmed the reality of what they were seeing.","On this day, the Ruler of an Ancient Power in the Dark Universe had fallen!","Not to an army or an assassination from another powerful Ancient Power, but to a single man that wasn’t known until just a few weeks ago!"]},{"number":831,"title":"Chapter 831: Chapter 830 - Emperorslayer! II","paragraphs":["The Entity Traverser had crossed the vast gulf of distance from where he was as he sped towards the two Ancient Powers currently embroiled in the war.","It had taken a significant amount of time for him to get there, his eyes sensing the grand light of powerful skills being cast by multiple Entities as he made his way towards the border of the Primal Winged Expanse where a shocking fight was taking place!","He arrived minutes before the end of the battle, he arrived just in time to see a being assimilate a Dao...and then watched in shock as this being became mincemeat seconds later.","But the more shocking thing that made his heart shake was the archaic looking being that killed a possible future sage...his sight remembering the face that was surrounded by intense light as the same one that had escaped from him weeks ago!","The same being he was chasing, the being that had the physique that could wield Ruination Cores and ultimately...the Cosmic Treasure known as Ruination!","\"This...\"","His heart thumped in excitement and in shock as he recalled this being was merely in the Quasar Realm when he laid his eyes on him before he and the entire Galaxy he was in suddenly disappeared.","Yet this being had pierced into the rank of Peak Tier GALAXY a few weeks later, and now even held the power of an Entity as he just dispatched a Ruler of an Ancient Power!","\"...\"","Traverser was deep in thought as he wondered...was the being with the physique receptive to Ruination Cores supposed to be this ridiculous?","Many thoughts were crossing through his mind as first and foremost, he wanted to talk with this special person!","Yet he knew this thought might be hard to bring to fruition when he spread out his senses and felt the many hidden auras in the chaotic void surrounding the Illusory Unbreakable Realm...","---","Inside the locked Realm that had just a few minutes remaining before it would break, occasional yells and death wails could be heard as Aileron Royals became empty body husks or had their origins ruptured.","Noah’s expanded senses were able to catch many eyes from multiple directions staring towards him, but his gaze remained placid as his focus stayed within the Illusory Unbreakable Realm. His eyes remained without an ounce of emotion as he turned his face to the few remaining Ailerons within the Illusory Unbreakable Realm.","The remaining Entities were on their last breaths of life after the death of the Primal Emperor, their hearts in deep pain as they joined the rest of their brethren in the next few seconds!","The 100 Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons...were reduced to 0 even though they had not even been at the focus of the battle- just the stray attacks from the Entities shattering their bodies and souls.","Noah did not even have to lend his help after he took down the Primal Emperor, his Summons being proficient enough to wipe out all remaining Entities thereafter!","In the region of the chaotic void, deafening silence pervaded as when one looked into the Illusory Unbreakable Realm, they found not a single Aileron alive.","The void of space was painted with a tinge of red as the focus of many eyes remained on the luminous figure supported by the multicolored lights of many laws.","They watched as he flew slowly in the locked space, going towards glistening cl.u.s.ters of light that were Cores, Dao Crystals, and Assimilation Crystals.","They were swiped away in seconds as the calmness in the locked Realm remained.","Not a single soul moved as the shimmering figures of Noah and his pets took the spot light!","This action by itself was extremely shocking, and the one carrying it out was given an unspeakable title that nobody had held in the last tens of thousands of years.","\"Emperorslayer...\"","It began as an uttering among the hidden figures, but this uttering was as loud as a strike of thunder as it traveled through the chaotic void and entered the ears of many!","Emperorslayer!","THRUUM!","Essence erupted out as at this moment, the barrier that kept the Illusory Unbreakable Realm together trembled and shattered.","The 1 hour timer had passed as those within could come out, and those outside...could reach the beings that were within!","Noah’s eyes remained cold and fearless as he looked to the blank chaotic void around him, not making a single move.","SHAA! SHAA!","The grand figure of the Holy Emperor who held a difficult expression appeared, backed by Old Man Khan and 5 other Entities from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter!","As this Ruler of an Ancient Power looked at the being that had just become an Emperorslayer, the thoughts swirling in his head were too many!","Old Man Khan by the side still had an expression of disbelief as even while he watched the whole battle and how everything went down, he still couldn’t believe this was the same being that wasn’t even in the GALAXY Realm when he first met him weeks ago.","Yet he was somehow an Entity that could dispatch an Emperor of an Ancient Power that was about to fully assimilate a Lesser Dao!","\"Truly tyrannical...\"","This was the only thing Old Man Khan could say as he sighed while he, the Holy Emperor, and other Entities stood in front of Noah while looking out to the expanse of chaotic void before them.","They knew that multiple powerful figures from all corners of the Dark Universe were watching and observing nearby.","They saw how Noah had just spent a whole hour fighting with 26 Entities and taking all of them down, and knew he wouldn’t be in any state to match even more fearsome Entities if those watching in the dark attacked!","Thus, the Holy Emperor and the Entities he had nearby all came towards Noah as they planned to put their lives on the line to defend this Tyrannical being that should be exhausted by this point!"]},{"number":832,"title":"Chapter 832: Chapter 831 - The Watching Entities Reveal Themselves","paragraphs":["Noah’s eyes were impassive as a calm smile appeared on his face.","The Holy Emperor and others actually appeared in front of him with somber expressions as they seemingly put their lives on the line to defend him!","They truly thought that after a long battle like the one he just had, he would not be able to keep himself in top shape much longer.","Yet the form he currently held that was put together by the support of multiple laws still remained active on his body without him deactivating a single skill.","His eyes were glancing at the numerous hidden figures in the folds of space as he didn’t make a move, wondering which of them would do it first!","Would they be more enemies for him to plunder loot, or would they be dismayed by his power as they scurried away?","He and many others wondered who among those watching would be the first to make a move!","The deafening silence in space was very quickly shattered as a burst of boisterous laughter rang out with the appearance of a figure who released a shocking aura.","\"Haha! I’ve finally gotten to meet you again! I hope you do not leave too quickly this time...\"","RUMBLE!","The thundering voice of an enormous being smashed into the ears of many, his huge figure becoming visible soon after. He had a humanoid shape, yet towering over 100 meters as one of the defining features was that on this being’s face, he had a third eye instead of two!","The third eye fully glistened with a red light as it was closed, but it was the thing that released the most oppressive force from this being.","\"...!\"","\"Traverser!\"","\"That fool...\"","Many whispers abounded as the huge body of Traverser miniaturized to become the same height as a normal human, his figure nearing the area Noah was at rapidly!","RUMBLE!","The figures of the Holy Emperor and Old Man Khan stood in front of Noah defensively as his Animus Summons formed a line beside him.","The Blue Slime was actively dancing above his head as the summon seemed to enjoy the bubbling essence that had even enveloped Noah’s hair and made it dance wildly.","The Entity Traverser looked at all of this with a beaming smile as he stopped a few meters away, his resonant voice ringing out once more, but this time as a telepathic message to Noah alone.","\"I have been looking for you for a great deal of years after I obtained the knowledge from the Book of Ruination. I wish you no harm and actually have a singular goal- to do what I can to help the User of the Tools of Ruination to save our Universe!\"","THRUUUM!","The strong voice of Traverser rang out grandly as Noah’s eyes shone even brighter.","He recalled this being from weeks ago, an Entity that had appeared just a second before he teleported himself and the whole Infinite Galaxy away. As he gazed upon this being, Eyes of Truth affirmed his identity!","[Ebon Vaandal] :: An Entity proficient in the Laws of Space, Chaos, and Time, as well as the Daos of Destruction and Voidspace. He is an extremely powerful Entity that has earned the title of Traverser in the Dark Universe, his assimilations in the two Daos he studies being extremely high as he spent many thousands of years traveling throughout the Dark Universe. He holds multiple pages from the Book of Ruination as he continues his search for the being that he considers the Savior that shall stop the coming Cataclysm...","The details of this powerful Entity appeared in Noah’s mind as his vibrant eyes saw this being truly meant his words!","Among the many beings he had come across in his life, this one had been actively looking for him as he gained more thorough knowledge from the Book of Ruination and was searching for the being that could bring them all together for the possibility of undoing the work of the past Sages and Great Sages.","Towards this being...Noah adopted a bright smile as he also laughed boisterously while going towards him, shocking the Holy Emperor and others that were looking towards Traverser with caution!","\"Haha, Brother Traverser! You see, I was very weak and had to be careful a few weeks back. Just the thought that an Entity had found my Galaxy made me run...\"","His words were nothing like the domineering coldness many beings heard when he took down multiple Entities, the many hidden beings in the chaotic void observing this shockingly powerful Entity go towards Traverser as he fearlessly stood in front of him with a smile!","Even Traverser was taken back before his smile bloomed even more, his heart at ease as he realized achieving his goal of connecting himself to the being that could use the Ruination Cores might be even easier than he expected.","\"Good! I have many things I wish to discuss with you, but it seems like I am not the only one looking for you...\"","THRUUUM!","In one direction, five Entities dressed in regal armament appeared. Each of them were four-meter tall as they looked like the most beautiful humans one could come across- these were the beings from the Arch Human Race from the Northern Region of the Dark Universe!","In another direction, the Entities that represented the Ancient Power ruling over the Desolate Galaxies in the East also appeared.","Lastly, the shocking personage of the Spirit Race, the beings that many looked towards with apprehension as they ruled the Southern Region of the Dark Universe with a tight grasp...these unique beings made their appearance as the entire environment of the chaotic void changed.","RUMBLE!","Sister Gold was the first to appear as Noah laid his eyes on the Spirit Race for the first time.","With a body that wasn’t entirely corporeal, a beautiful creature that could barely be seen with the n.a.k.e.d eye appeared. Her body danced with the essence of multiple terrifying Daos as among the Entities appearing, her aura dwarfed all of them in power as she seemed like a horrendously powerful big boss!","Yet she wasn’t alone as a second later four more figures letting out auras no less shocking than hers appeared from behind!","THRUUUM!","With called eyes and devoid of emotions, they stared at nobody else as their eyes only found a singular being.","The being was smiling wildly with a confident expression as his body was still wrapped with the luminous armament from all universal laws, his two swords within his grasp seemingly vibrating as he stared at the beings from the Spirit Race!"]},{"number":833,"title":"Chapter 833: Chapter 832 - A Tyrant of a Throne! I","paragraphs":["Traverser had a somber expression as he stared at the appearing Entities, his gaze coming to rest on the blank expressions of the Entities from the Spirit Race.","He always hated these beings the most from all the ones he met, as they never sat right with him!","Their pompous blank expressions that looked at every other beings as worthless, their indiscernible thoughts that made them extremely eerie...and their stupendously powerful Ancient Power that had Entities comprehending multiple Daos with ease.","They had also made their appearance here as their goal also seemed to be the same being he had managed to find again.","’Sigh.’","Traverse gave a melancholic sigh as he stared at the nonchalant expression of the being in question that focused on nobody else but the Entities of the Spirit Race as well.","---","Before the battle within the Illusory Unbreakable Realm had ended, Sister Gold followed the words of one of the Ancestors of the Spirit Race as she used her body as the conduit to bring forth 4 more Entities.","It was an extremely unique ability that strained her origin, yet she had performed it perfectly as 4 beings no less powerful than her in power appeared!","These 4 Entities were reinforcements when it came to the question of whether the powerful Entity that was most likely the holder of the Ruination Cores would be either an ally or enemy.","The moment such a thing was decided...the terrifying Entities from the Spirit Race would make a move!","Yet when the battle had ended, the Tyrannical Entity acted very differently than many expected.","What should have been a careful Entity who should have been exhausted from his recent shocking battle...was nowhere to be seen as his terrifying transformation was kept active, his eyes gazing domineeringly as the Entities from multiple Ancient Powers that appeared all around him.","The essence of all Universal Laws around him danced wildly as he floated away slowly from the group of Holy Emperor and Traverser.","They were shocked at this scene as they saw even his summons remained in a singular line with them, hesitantly watching what this domineering Entity was about to do!","THRUUUM!","With the Aether and Death swords palpating in his hands, he floated singularly in the chaotic void as he willingly left the protection of the Holy Emperor and the Entities he brought, even leaving his pets behind as he floated alone while staring at all the powerful beings!","His expression was filled with a confident smile as a resonant voice rang.","\"My dear brothers and sisters of this Dark Universe...I wonder why you have chosen to appear before me on this special day!\"","RUUMBLE!","Fearless words that carried a trace of arrogance smashed into the ears of ever Entity, their eyes squinting dangerously as they were asked a simple question.","Yes! What exactly were they going to do after watching 26 Entities be massacred along with the Ruler of an Ancient Power?","The darkness of the chaotic void flashed with light as not a single being answered.","The Wandering Entities similar to Traverser moved a bit further back while staring at Noah’s figure, only the Entities from Ancient Powers remaining in place!","Noah glanced at all of them as he received no answer, his face quickly showing a tinge of disappointment as he brought his two shimmering swords to shine on his face.","\"If it is a fight you want, I’ve gotten quite a decent workout from butchering 26 Entities. Sending some more to accompany them in death won’t be a problem for me.\"","\"...!\"","RUMBLE!","Taking down 26 Entities...was just a work out?!","Their hearts trembled as Noah continued to stare at each of them fearlessly. He had his own plans.","He would actually have no qualms with offending and beginning a fight with every single Ancient Power out there, but he had made some promises!","The Holy Emperor coming by his aide just now reminded him of his promise to protect the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, and he also wanted to swallow his enormous gains from the 26 Entities he had just taken down.","Before he completed a few things..he didn’t want to completely antagonize every single Ancient Power out there!","This was especially so when he looked at the information of the 5 Entities from the Spirit Race that were staring towards him emotionlessly.","These beings were truly terrifying with the multiple Daos they studied, but what was even more terrifying was that they weren’t the most powerful beings from the Spirit Race!","Noah had always wondered about the truth that many beings questioned over the past tens of thousands of years- after the deaths of all the Sages and Great Sages due to their actions all those years ago, had any new ones risen?","As he stared at the details of the 5 Spirit Race Entities before him, he had a shocking answer as he read the details about the [Ancestors] of the Spirit Race!","He looked at the swords made of baleful essence of Death and Aether in his hands as he gave a command, the swords erupting in a shower of essence as they coagulated behind him to form into a shape.","The Entities watched with sharp eyes as they saw the vibrant eruption of the essence of other universal laws go towards the formation of...a stellar throne made of essence in the middle of the chaotic void!","Such a thing was simple for Noah to make as he commanded the Universal law essences, his body going and sitting on the throne grandly as he stared at all the Entities without fear!","A throne made up of the essence of all Universal Laws appeared in front of the eyes of many, the being that made it sitting down grandly as his domineering voice rang out once more!"]},{"number":834,"title":"Chapter 834: Chapter 833 - A Tyrant on a Throne! II","paragraphs":["A spectacular throne made out of the essence of all Universal Laws existed in the chaotic void, the voice of the Entity atop it spreading out for all to hear.","\"Before you choose the course of your actions in the next few minutes, I want you to think about the 26 Entities that made up the Ancient Power behind me.\"","RUMBLE!","It was like a king giving a sermon to his subjects!","Like a Ruler stating inviolable facts that could not be desecrated!","\"I gave them a heads up many hours ago that I was coming for them, and they prepared a so called prison for me and brought their entire force that amounted to 26 Entities. They calculated and believed with their thousands of years of wisdom...that they would easily be able to kill me!\"","THRUUM!","\"Yet even with all their calculations and preparations...all 26 of these beings perished one by one under my hand!\"","Noah’s eyes released arcs of light as he sat upon the grand essence throne, his voice piercing deep into the hearts of all those around him.","\"I want you to think about these beings and ask yourselves...are your calculations and preparations any different?!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Can you guarantee with certainty that you won’t find yourselves in a similar predicament that you just watched? Just constantly shocked as every single Entity sent my way dies one after another? Can you guarantee yourselves that you won’t be like the Ruler of this Ancient Power behind me?\"","...!","His words thundered down as even the hearts of Entities skipped a beat!","There were truly a great collection of watchers that came from the news of the war breaking out between the two Ancient Powers and the news of the Ruination Core, and even more had arrived while the battle in the Illusory Unbreakable Realm was taking place.","Yet Noah glared down at all of these beings fearlessly as his words rang out clearly in each of their ears!","Only the crackle of essence from Noah’s body sitting atop the throne made up of essence could be heard.","His voice rang out once more as with a domineering gaze, he gave out an ultimatum.","\"If you can guarantee your life, if you are truly confident...then stay. If you aren’t, I’m gonna need you to roll the f.u.c.k out of here!\"","THRUUUUM!","...!","The Holy Emperor had his jaws nearly torn as he looked forward in shock.","The powerful Traverser had his eyes shining with an intense light as he gazed upon this being he had been looking for, for so long!","Such tyrannical words came from a single Entity as they were inscribed in the minds of all those watching. But when they thought about it, he really could back it up with actions if need be!","So those that did not want to participate...the lone Entities that weren’t associated with Ancient Powers or just stepped from regions of the Dark Universe that just had a few cl.u.s.ters of galaxies but weren’t powerful enough to be considered Ancient Powers...these beings began to disappear.","One after another, the many new eyes populating the chaotic void began to pull back!","The few individuals were all gone as only three groups remained while they locked eyes with the arrogant tyrant of the shimmering throne.","The group of Entities that represented the Ancient Power ruling over the Desolate Galaxies in the East glanced at Noah closely before they warped away.","In another direction, the group of Arch Humans standing at 4 meters tall glanced towards him with shining eyes as their bodies rumbled with the aura of a Grand Dao, a Dao that caused for the illusory image of a sharp sword that could cut through anything to appear above them- the Grand Dao of the Sword!","\"How shall we address you, friend?\"","The one at the forefront that had unparalleled devilish beauty voiced out with a smile as if he hadn’t heard any of the insults that Noah had just thrown out.","Noah looked towards these powerful Entities with calm eyes as he replied blandly.","\"A few days ago I heard the moniker of Tyrannical Entity when I wiped out a rat, today I’ve heard the moniker of Emperorslayer after I took down an Emperor. It’s up to you which one you use!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Good!\"","The Arch Humans shone brightly with the aura of the Sword Dao, their figures disappearing soon after as many Entities cleared out.","Noah sat on his resplendent throne as his eyes turned towards the only remaining foreign Entities here.","It was the 5 figures with incorporeal bodies...the Entities of the Spirit Race!","The expressions were blank while staring towards Noah, causing for immense tension to fill the surroundings.","Traverser changed his expression as he stared at the incorporeal beings. He truly did not like the Entities of the Spirit Race.","The Holy Emperor sighed as he gave a nod to the Entities around him, prepared to move at any time as they observed the tremendous pressure being released from the group of 5 incorporeal Entities.","Yet...Noah raised his hands towards them at this juncture, a hand that told them to stand down! He then locked eyes with the Spirit Being at the very forefront, the one known as Sister Gold who had just opened her mouth with no sound coming off of it, her message entering Noah’s mind directly!","\"What is your purpose in collecting the Ruination Cores?\"","RUMBLE!","His body thrummed with power atop the throne as he sent back his own telepathic message.","\"Naturally, it is to stop the coming Apocalypse!\"","The eyes of Sister Gold and the 4 Entities accompanying her shone with immense light at this answer, their connected minds receiving Noah’s message with clarity! They still debated on whether to approach this being as an Enemy of an Ally...and they still had not made that choice even with the answer they were given.","So Sister Gold asked again!","\"What is your purpose in collecting the Ruination Cores?\"","RUMBLE!","The same question, and Noah’s bright hair danced wildly as he got an idea of what these terrifying beings wanted to hear. He smiled arrogantly atop the throne as sent a message back.","It was a message that had shocking consequences!","\"My purpose...is to reconnect the Dark Universe with the Primordial Cosmos!\"","The moment his answer arrived in the mind of Sister Gold, their bodies erupted with terrifying essence a millisecond later.","Dao essence began to dance wildly as the bodies of the Spirit Race Entities moved apart, each of them releasing a horrendous level of power!","Sister Gold’s eyes were expressionless as her sonorous voice rang out in the chaotic void.","\"Enemies it is.\"","RUUUUMBLE!"]},{"number":835,"title":"Chapter 835: Chapter 834 - Pull Back!","paragraphs":["The Spirit Race that was seen as a fearful force by many were filled with mysteries, their purpose and aims known by very few as they remained secluded even though they boasted tremendous strength","Rarely would they ever be seen making a move, and when they did...it was something grand!","THRUUUUUM!","The 5 Entities from the Spirit Race still held blank expressions as their bodies erupted with essence, the aura of multiple Daos swirling on each of their bodies as the pressure made many beings gape in shock!","The Entities from the various Powers had only pulled back from the region, watching to see if anyone would actually make a move.","Their hearts trembled as they saw from the bodies of the Spirit Race Entities...the pristine aura of a fully assimilated Lesser Dao could be felt from the two Entities that flanked Sister Gold!","\"Impossible...\"","The heart of the Holy Emperor trembled as he gave a command to the 5 Entities he brought, unwillingly sending word to half of the remaining Entities left behind to protect the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter to bring them here for support as well.","Traverser’s eyes shone with intense light as his body expanded rapidly, the crimson eye in the middle of his forehead threatening to erupt at any second as he sighed deeply in his mind.","Yet their power was unquestionable as shockingly, two of them had a Lesser Dao fully assimilated as they were a step away from becoming titled Sages!","The power one could wield with a fully assimilated Dao wasn’t just an additive factor where they became twice or thrice as strong...depending on the Dao, they could see their power spike up to unimaginable levels.","Yet even when faced with this shocking sight, Noah merely nodded his head while remaining atop his throne.","His hand came down commandingly as the Animus Pets he controlled came up behind him in a grand fashion.","Yet another one of his clones appeared as he merged with Tiamat, making it so that all of his pets were merged with him as an instant later, each of them uttered domineering words he himself had uttered not too long ago.","[Automatic Cast of All Support Skills].","[Automatic Cast of All Support Skills]...[Automatic...]","RUUUMBLE!","The chaotic void ruptured at the sight where Noah and his pets stood.","\"How is this possible...\"","\"That wasn’t even his full power?!\"","They watched with agape expressions as they saw the same magisterial armament made of all Universal Laws wrap around each of Noah’s summons, their bodies gaining fitting armament that adhered to their physiology as in a matter of seconds, a stellar armored Dragon Queen appeared.","ROAAAAR!","The resonant bellow that Tiamat released shook everyone from their stupor as the scene established itself with clarity!","Multicolored essence abound on all sides, 8 magisterial Animus Summons adorned with resplendent armament that caused their strength to rise to unknown levels!","A wiggling bouncing Slime that had stopped being blue and now shone with a golden l.u.s.ter...its eyes seemingly filled with light as it stared at the 5 Entities from the Spirit Race with excitement.","A fearsome Galaxy Devouring Serpent that had golden scales and shimmering wings now attached to its back, its head slithering dangerously as its red eyes shone with glory!","CAAA!","A kingly Calamity Bear floating in the chaotic space as he was enthroned in an armament fitting for a king, its gaze arrogant as its paws shone with a menacing l.u.s.ter!","Each of the pets had varying transformations, but all of them could be described as magisterial while they stared down powerful Entities.","\"...\"","The watching Entities felt their hearts shaking as they recalled the words that the Tyrannical Entity had uttered.","It seemed he wasn’t bullshiting as somehow...his essence was as boundless as ever!","Noah rose upon his throne as he cracked his neck side to side.","It seemed like he had to use [Plot Armor] after all.","ZIIIIING!","His body began to vibrated rapidly as his Universal Laws Throne disappeared, sharp blades appearing on his hands as they pointed at the incorporeal throats of the Spirit Race.","\"...\"","At this juncture where everyone forgot to breathe while waiting for something glorious, a single Ancient voice rang out for all to hear.","\"Pull back.\"","THRUUUUM!","The voice actually stemmed from the connected minds of the 5 Spirit Race Entities, ringing out in their minds as they were given a command...but the voice also stretched out from their minds and spread out into the outside chaotic void as it was heard by all those in the nearby tens of miles!","THUMP!","Noah felt his heart constricting as his eyes shone ever brighter, this voice that was just uttered bringing with it immense pressure unlike anything he had felt before!","The voice alone was akin to an entire world smashing into their minds as it rang once more.","\"What you seek, I have two of. You will have to come to my door if you ever wish to accomplish your goal.\"","THUMP!","The voice dripped with power and majesty as its words rang out most clearly in Noah’s mind, his eyes shining ever brighter as he locked eyes with Sister Gold.","Whatever being that was speaking through her seemed to have immeasurable strength, even the body of the powerful Sister Gold only being able to relay his will!","\"Return.\"","Like an inviolable command, the words uttered were followed to completion as the bodies of the 5 Entities from the Spirit Race disappeared in the next second.","\"...\"","Many beings gaped in shock at the sequence of events as their hearts trembled with fear.","Was a fight not supposed to break out? Weren’t they ready for another grand show? What had just happened?","Most of all...that voice!","Oh, that voice!","The voice lingered on the minds of many as Noah’s eyes shone brilliantly in the chaotic void. His mind had a myriad of many thoughts, but a single one triumphed among the sea of thoughts.","’That was a Sage, wasn’t it? What happened to all you f.u.c.kers being dead?!’","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":836,"title":"Chapter 836: Chapter 835 - Has He Comprehended a Cosmic Dao?!","paragraphs":["The region of the chaotic void near the Primal Winged Expanse was entirely silent as only the crackle of essence from the shining bodies of Noah and his pets reverberated out.","Everybody else was shocked to their cores as some quickly began to leave, others still hiding themselves and staying behind to see if any more noteworthy things would occur!","Noah glanced in the direction that the 5 Entities of the Spirit Race left as many thoughts swirled in his mind.","The voice that had come from them was extremely domineering, and his senses definitely screamed that it was a big boss when he recalled the tone and demeanor that seemed to say everything was under their control!","Yet this voice had commanded the powerful Entities from the Spirit Race to pull back as they let it be known that they held 2 Ruination Cores...giving him a headache on how he would collect all the remaining four as he pushed this thought aside for now.","There were truly a great deal of this he had to deal with at this moment, as well as a tremendous amount of loot to go through!","His eyes briefly looked at any remaining Entities hiding in the distance as he then turned towards the Primal Winged Expanse next.","This was an Ancient Power that had cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies under it, and there were no Entities to look after it!","After taking out all of their figureheads...the next step was to naturally assimilate them all into his Galaxy! But this would take an enormous time and effort, as there were an abundant amount of experts in the GALAXY Realm he could sense fearfully looking towards him from the nearby Galaxies, and trillions of beings that he would have to fully dominate under him.","When he thought of such a task, his face scrunched in annoyance as he then looked at the Holy Emperor that stood next to the shocked Traverser.","Towards this Ruler of an Ancient Power, Noah adopted a wide smile as he didn’t even bother paying attention to their stupor at the sequence of events, smiling brightly as he went towards the Holy Emperor.","\"Brother Windsor! So you see, I have this Infinite Galaxy...\"","---","At this time, across the darkness of the chaotic void.","The party of 5 Spirit Race Entities that had warped away very quickly...expressions of disbelief could be seen on their faces as Sister Gold was the first one to speak up while their bodies pierced through the layers of the chaotic void with ease!","\"Ancestor, why stop us? We ascertained he was an enemy, and we should have been sufficiently prepared with the 5 of us to be able to wear down his defenses and ultimately take his life in seconds.\"","THRUM!","She received no reply as her blank expression contained a tinge of worry, speaking out once more.","\"He wishes to rejoin our universe with the Primordial Cosmos. Even if he somehow succeeds in doing this...it is an action that will allow powerful experts to easily descend down and do as they wish. We cannot...\"","\"Hush..\"","RUMBLE!","A single word.","Silence was all that followed.","Sister Gold remained quiet as she and the other 5 Entities moved through the chaotic void, their expressions solemn as they waited for the voice to ring out once more.","\"That creature is a truly curious case. You 5 would have actually not been able to reign him in.\"","\"...!\"","Yet she could never in a million years deny the words of this ancestor as she knew how he grasped one of the most top tier Grand Daos in existence, a Dao that the Great Sage who led the many Sages of the Dark Universe in the past assimilated...the Grand Dao of Destiny!","She knew that this Ancestor must have utilized the abilities of this Dao right before their battle and ascertained some things...","\"It’s not even a matter of power, as you all had more than sufficient power to even destroy his origin with my help after...hmmm an hour?\"","The eyes of Sister Gold and the 4 Entities returning with her became even more perplexed as the Ancestor told them that even in the state that the Tyrannical Entity was in after fighting 26 Entities and his apparent help in the battle, they would only be able to kill him after an entire hour!","\"What’s even more interesting is that even after his origin is destroyed...he isn’t truly dead, and simply disappears from our...time. That is when things would have truly become tricky. I need to devise something against this.\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking words that would have even caused Noah’s heart to tremble if he heard them resounded out.","Even if a Sage made a move, they still would have not be able to take the terrifying being’s life as even if they destroyed his Origin...he wasn’t truly dead!","Sister Gold’s expression had turned somber as she recalled the image of the single man sitting atop a throne as she couldn’t help but ask.","\"That should nearly be impossible...unless he has somehow grasped the Cosmic Dao of Chronology...\"","\"No...if it was such a Dao then that being would already be running around the Dark Universe with everything in his palms. No, this is something else...I shall consult with the others for now. He will have to come to us either way if he wants to get his hands on the other Ruination Cores.\"","The grand voice of the Ancestor refuted Sister Gold as she and the other 4 Entities continued their return with perplexing thoughts.","Their conversation was brief, but it involved shocking secrets and the abilities of a fearsome being that was just one of the Ancestors of the Spirit Race!","He had somehow accounted for [Plot Armor] and its 1 hour time span, and even accounted for [Save Point] in Noah’s worst case scenario.","Yet even this Ancestor...did not know how to combat such shocking abilities at this time as he had the Entities of the Spirit Race pull back!","A battle had not occurred, nor had the two parties mingled...yet the single meeting between them would have shocking consequences.","The Dark Universe was wide and extremely vast, with many old monsters hidden within that were simply waiting for a certain time to come.","That time...was fast approaching as many pieces moved on an enormous chessboard, none the wiser on who were the pieces...and who were the players!"]},{"number":837,"title":"Chapter 837: Chapter 836 - Assimilating Ancient Powers is Easy I","paragraphs":["\"Brother Windsor! So you see, I have this Infinite Galaxy...\"","The Holy Emperor stared at Noah in a stupor as he began conversing with him freely after they just saw 5 extremely powerful Entities move out right when a fight was about to erupt, this event seemingly being nothing in the Tyrannical Entity’s eyes as he was moving to more important matters!","As Noah looked at the Primal Winged Expanse that had cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies, he came up with a plan for an easy assimilation as it would have to begin with the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the few Entities they held that could be used to oversee large regions of Galaxies.","\"It will be a way for me to fulfill my promise of keeping your Ancient Power entirely safe, the treasure I have being something that others can only imagine...\"","His body rumbled with colorful essence still as he waved his hands to bring forth the Infinite Galaxy, causing for the Holy Emperor to be hit with shock after shock as something fantastical was explained to him!","A plan was laid out to the Holy Emperor for the cl.u.s.ter of Galaxies under him to be fused into this larger Galaxy, such an action allowing for the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter to be hidden away safely as it could not even be reached by others.","The Holy Emperor gradually worked through the phase of the shock of such a thing being possible as he thought about it deeply.","When he thought of the powerful Entities that had just appeared as well as the trillions he had to protect...this Ruler locked his eyes with Noah for an entire minute before this shocking plan was agreed upon!","\"I’ll need to meet all the Entities under the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and judge to see if they can all be trusted to oversee the Cl.u.s.ter of Galaxies from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter...as well as the Primal Winged Expanse!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s aims were made clear as he planned to first assimilate all the galaxies of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and then use its Entities to oversee all the newly added Galaxies, as well as keeping the GALAXY Rank Ailerons in check as he gradually established a new order. His own subordinates that had been absorbing the Dao of Withering Crystals would also be put to work in the tumultuous time to come as they familiarized themselves with their newfound strength.","The Ailerons were already defeated with the deaths of all their Entities...all that remained for them now was to be subjugated under Noah’s heel!","SHAA! SHAA!","Figures began to flash away from the border of the Primal Winged Expanse as Noah’s clones un-merged with his pets, the clones taking the Infinite Galaxy and disappearing with the Holy Emperor and other Entities to complete the task of quickly assimilating the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter.","The few remaining watching Entities that had hidden themselves continued to observe with careful eyes as some of them followed the direction of the leaving clones and Holy Emperor, only Noah, his pets, and Traverser being left behind in the region of the chaotic void!","While the clones went to complete their task, his main body stood at the border of the galaxy cl.u.s.ter of the Primal Winged Expanse as his aura spread out wildly.","The Ailerons in the nearest Galaxy felt their hearts shake as they observed the eyes of this being, his gaze seemingly waiting to bring down judgment as they saw him wave his hands and cause the appearance of a majestic throne made of Universal Laws Essence to appear once more, his piercing eyes continuing to stare towards them dominantly as he...waited!","\"Brother Traverser, why don’t we talk in the meanwhile?\"","With his clones handling an important task, Noah got situated atop a throne that the Blue Slime was bouncing up and down on, turning his gaze to the Entity that had been searching for him for a long time.","Traverser came out of his stupor as he stared at him for a few seconds, shaking his head incredulously as the third eye on his forehead shook with elation!","---","Having many bodies working on many tasks provided for immense efficiency, and this was exactly what Noah was experiencing at this moment.","His main body began discussing with Traverser as he gained a vast amount of knowledge about the Dark Universe and the Ancient Powers within it. His clones moved to talk and assimilate with Galaxies as another one of his clones...was counting the loot that he had collected!","This clone was in the core regions of the Infinite Galaxy, within the land that used to be Noah’s home world as he pulled out a variety of Cores, Dao Crystals, Assimilation Crystals, and Skill Books!","The most important thing to Noah at this moment was the Assimilation Crystals, as this was what he needed the most in order to achieve one of his grand goals at this moment- the Cosmic Dao of Ruination!","Even the Dao Crystals triggered by the Ruination Core didn’t take the center of his attention, as he would only be able to produce more Entities from his subordinates with them.","His eyes glimmered as they looked at a collection of vibrant Assimilation Crystals that shone with a luminous light of stars, these Crystals being the thing that would bring him a powerful Dao.","With the 5% chance to drop due to [Loot Drop- Assimilation Crystals], he had received numerous Law Assimilation and Dao Assimilation Crystals from the 26 Entities and 100 Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons.","Probability would say the skill would have been triggered at most 6 times, but Noah’s Protagonist Trait came in clutch as aside from the Primal Emperor himself exploding into a pile of Law and Dao Assimilation Crystals...the deaths of 5 Entities and 10 Peak GALAXY Ailerons granted the crystals!","The mere thought of what these shocking Crystals could do...made Noah tremble in excitement as he couldn’t wait to begin!"]},{"number":838,"title":"Chapter 838: Chapter 837 - Assimilating Ancient Powers is Easy II","paragraphs":["The Aileron Entities granted Noah both Law and Dao Assimilation Crystals, but he would be shelving the Dao Assimilation Crystals for now until he could use them for the Cosmic Dao of Ruination.","This was one of the most unique features Noah had in mind when he designed the Loot Drop skill. He made it very clear in the definition that the Assimilation Crystals could be used for any Dao!","Whether it was Lesser, Grand, or Cosmic...if he collected enough of them, what stopped him from doing something extremely balance breaking?","THUMP!","His heart felt the excitement at the mere thought of it as his eyes turned towards the Crystals that he could use at this moment- the Law Assimilation Crystals.","From the Entities and Peak Tier GALAXY experts, tens of Law Assimilation Crystals covered his sight as his clone grabbed onto one of them.","It shone with a bright blue hue as it vibrated, whatever mysteries and essence lying inside it swiftly flowing into Noah’s origin!","THRUUUM!","He felt his mind bubble in excitement as his eyes focused on the stat panel that showed the progress in the Universal Laws Assimilation.","[Universal Laws Assimilation: 8%]","The number had risen nicely when Noah used the support skills of all Universal Laws and wrapped his body with their essence while fighting the Ailerons, where even now he knew he needed to explore the unique state he was in some more and have his clones use it actively at all times.","But with the inclusion of the Law Assimilation Crystal...the percentage exploded up by an entire decimal point to 8.1 as the crystal was absorbed!","RUMBLE!","Noah’s eyes shone with l.u.s.ter as his origin revolved faster, sulking in the entire Crystal in seconds as he nearly trembled when looking at the stat panel.","[Universal Laws Assimilation: 9%]","\"...\"","A single Law Assimilation Crystal increased the assimilation of all of his laws by 1%.","He had 33 remaining Assimilation Crystals.","...!","Shockingly, he could raise his progress of assimilation that had been going at a snail’s pace above 40% after this single battle!","What speed!","What majesty!","And this was only in terms of laws...he couldn’t wait to see the scene when he utilized the Dao Assimilation Crystals in the future!","RUMBLE!","He continued his blatant cheating that would cause others to cough up blood if they found out, many things continuing to happen at the same time...","24 hours passed since the shocking battle at the border of the Primal Winged Expanse.","During this time, something even more shocking occurred- an event that would send waves throughout the Dark Universe!","It was the mystical event where the cl.u.s.ters of galaxies that made up the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter...began to disappear one after another as in a matter of hours, the few foreign Entities watching managed to observe the complete disappearance of an Entire Ancient Power!","They observed the figures of the Tyrannical Entity moving with the Ruler of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, galaxies disappearing everywhere they passed until nothing remained.","It was such a shocking scene that would forever remain ingrained into their memories...and it wasn’t even done!","Within the very same Infinite Galaxy that was the culprit of the shocking event, the Holy Emperor was floating near what used to be the draconic shaped Holy Land of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter.","He, Old Man Khan, and multiple other Entities were still staring around in a stupor as they affirmed their eyes truly were seeing this unbelievable reality where realms and galaxies were fused into one thing!","If it could be explained with clarity, the act of assimilating galaxies into the Infinite Galaxy was similar to multiple small circular objects joining together with a much larger one.","In the case of the Infinite Galaxy, it continued to take in the circular shaped and other unique shaped galaxies as the protective boundaries of these smaller galaxies disappeared, all of their stars, planets, realms, and many other stellar objects spilling into the grander Infinite Galaxy.","No borders were present between the fused galaxies as even the stars and stellar bodies of Noah’s Novus Galaxy could now be found near the stars and stellar bodies of the past Nexus Galaxy!","This same concept applied to all the newly coming galaxies as the Infinite Galaxy expanded even further, and it also meant there had to be all that many more beings overseeing the increasingly vast and ever expanding additions of stars and planets.","\"This is something I will leave to you all in conjunction with some of my clones.\"","Noah spoke these words calmly as he glanced at the Holy Emperor and his party of Entities that presided over the past Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter.","He had looked over all of the 20 or so Entities that had the majority of them comprehending the Dao of Summoning, but their lackl.u.s.ter Summons that were Ultra Rare at most with a few PRISMATIC here and there made Noah glance over them just briefly.","\"This is just...\"","The Holy Emperor breathed out his disbelief as he could only accept what he saw. His arms stretched out into the starry space of this grand galaxy as he felt the overwhelming concentration of essence that was multiple times greater than any location on his past Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter!","His heart trembled as he glanced at the borderless and vast stellar bodies around him as he asked carefully.","\"Just how many galaxies have been assimilated in here? How many trillions of beings?\"","The Holy Emperor asked a question that nobody had asked Noah since he began fusing Galaxies all the way from the Nexus Galaxy.","His clones had been carrying the task of looking for more galaxies whenever Noah wasn’t actively using the Infinite Galaxy as the progress had not been little!","Noah’s eyes shone with regality and calmness as he replied.","\"After the 800th Galaxy, I stopped counting the trillions of stars and beings.\"","...!","That’s right!","Over 800 Galaxies had been fused into the Infinite Galaxy so far, even though this number might seem minuscule when compared to the 100,000 goal that was required to upgrade the Infinite Galaxy!","Even the 800 fused Galaxies required Noah to delegate many beings to multiple regions, only being able to keep balance in the Infinite Galaxy due to the fact that the Galaxy itself was an actively moving Entity. It constantly monitored what was happening within it as it would alert Noah’s clones and the Harbingers of Sin if any beings in a certain region were doing something they shouldn’t, and it could even utilize the features of the Infinite Galaxy to take action itself.","This was the only reason that everything wasn’t in utter chaos right now!","When it came to the goal of 100,000, Noah’s clones had covered a very short portion of the vast Dark Universe as of right now...and he knew he would only need some time before he broke through into thousands of fused Galaxies as he neared his goal.","\"Now...the Galaxies of the Primal Winged Expanse wait for us...\"","He finished assimilating one Ancient Power with ease as he wasn’t done, heading towards a defeated one as he would assimilate even more Galaxies before he continued his search for Ruination Cores!"]},{"number":839,"title":"Chapter 839: Chapter 838 - An Infamous Entity","paragraphs":["The mysteries and wonders of the Dark Universe were innumerable, with the truly powerful beings dwelling within this universe using their power to understand all these unknowns.","They varied from regions where unique stellar bodies bloomed, regions where one could find huge cl.u.s.ters of black holes and Quasars or unique Galaxies with their own rare qualities.","On this day, yet another wonder had bloomed in real time as multiple factors coincided that allowed for powerful experts to be in the affected region, watching with their own eyes as the shocking event occurred!","After the disappearance of the Galaxy Cl.u.s.ters of the Expansive Dragon Expanse, the wizened Entities turned their eyes to the Primal Winged Expanse and true enough- its cl.u.s.ters of galaxies were next to disappear.","The body of the Tyrannical Emperor could be seen situated on a magisterial throne made of an overabundance of universal essence, the figure of Traverser by his side as the eyes of these two beings were on the remaining Aileron powerhouses, watching silently as the galaxies these Ailerons dwelled in began to disappear!","For those that did not know the reason behind the disappearance of the Galaxies, it was an eerie scene of a Tyrant situated upon a throne...watching silently as the Galaxies in front of him vanished.","Every time that a flash of light occurred and a galaxy was gone, the Tyrannical Entity would turn into a streak of light that tore through the chaotic void, traveling countless miles as his gaze and pressure descended unto the next galaxy within the cl.u.s.ter...that Galaxy disappearing as well!","It was such a dominating scene that caused the eyes of those watching to tremble, this scene playing out until the many Galaxies that had lost the protection of the Primal Emperor and his Entities all disappeared.","Within a day, the Ancient Power that was the Primal Winged Expanse was wiped out.","The Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter had disappeared even earlier.","The cause of it was a singular being that was domineering enough to be moving across space while sitting calmly upon a throne made of laws!","The chaotic void seemed extremely destitute and silent.","Not a word was spoken as many beings left, the news about a Tyrannical Entity beginning to spread to the knowledgeable beings of the Dark Universe.","A Tyrannical Entity had sprouted from the Western Region of the Dark Universe. He was first seen dominating 26 Entities by himself as he killed an Emperor. He was then seen moving across the two Ancient Powers in this region as a day later...these powers disappeared!","He rose from obscurity as now...information about this Tyrannical Entity was beginning to spread. To the far reaching Desolate Galaxies that held cl.u.s.ters of warlords fighting for power. To the wondrous lands of the Arch Humans where the fanatic of the Sword Dao could be found. To the cohesive lands of the Spirit Race where power and regality overflowed!","The name of the Tyrannical Entity thundered across with fervor.","A new era was on the horizon!","---","A few days passed since the disappearance of two Ancient Powers.","Many things seemed calm on the surface, but the expansive Dark Universe was even more bustling at this moment as many powerful beings moved with their own goals!","In the starry chaotic void, an enormous Leviathan could be seen shooting across as atop it, two figures were talking.","It was the Tyrannical Emperor that had become the topic of discussion for many beings, as well as the somewhat known Entity- Traverser!","Noah had been expanding his knowledge of the Dark Universe and the notable powers dwelling within as he talked to this Entity that had been searching for the being capable of using Ruination Cores all this time.","Much of the information revolved around the 3 Ancient Powers Noah had yet to come across- the one where the Arch Humans ruled that was known as the Consummate Sword Expanse, the one overseeing the Desolate Galaxies that was known as the Desolate Expanse, and lastly it was the Spirit Domain where the unique Spirit Race ruled!","Noah gained much more knowledge about these Ancient Powers and what types of Daos they studied, his focus actually honing in on the Consummate Sword Expanse where the Arch Humans ruled.","\"I can ascertain the location of the remaining Ruination Cores, and going by what you’ve told me...one of them should be in the region under the Consummate Sword Expanse.\"","Yes! The location of the 4 remaining Ruination Cores was spread out across the Dark Expanse, Noah still being able to glean information of their locations as he utilized Eyes of Truth on the Ruination Cores themselves. After organizing the abundant collection of information, he confirmed that one should be in the hands of the Consummate Sword Expanse, and 2 were in the hands of the Spirit Race!","The fourth one...was the most tricky one as it didn’t remain in place, constantly moving across the regions of the Dark Universe as Noah knew it must be in the hands of a powerful wandering Entity, or something even more terrifying.","\"Getting the Ruination Core off the hands of the fanatics that sleep with their sword in the Consummate Sword Expanse will be...\"","Traverser’s eyes shone with a sharp light as he spoke of the powerful Entities that studied the Grand Dao of the Sword.","Noah smiled at this as his eyes landed on this being that was known as Traverser. Aside from expanding his knowledge, he had vowed to support him any way that he could until he obtained all the Ruination Cores and stopped the apocalypse that was coming for them all.","It was an unexpected ally out of the battle with the Ailerons that Noah planned to put to full use!","His eyes focused on the vibrant third red eye of this Entity as he voiced out domineeringly.","\"It’s only another Ancient Power. They either adhere to my will...or the heads of their Entities shall roll!\"","RUMBLE!","Even the surrounding space shook at the sheer arrogance as Traverser’s eyes became even sharper, these two beings making their way towards an Ancient Power that was second only to the Spirit Race of the Dark Universe!"]},{"number":840,"title":"Chapter 840: Chapter 839 - Setting Off for the Sword Expanse!","paragraphs":["Within the Infinite Galaxy.","After the assimilation of two Ancient Powers into it, the Infinite Galaxy had turned even more boisterous as the additions this time around weren’t just in quantity, but of tremendous quality as the galaxy cl.u.s.ters obtained had Entities and multiple experts at the GALAXY Realm!","Noah’s subordinates were watching this in real time as the Emperor Penguin arrogantly oversaw the galaxies where the Ailerons resided, the remaining GALAXY experts of this Ancient Power being meek in front of the strength of the being that took away their Entities in a dominating fashion.","From the Aileron Galaxies, the majority were from the Aileron Race, but humans and a variety of other unique species existed among the trillions of beings spread out across the stars.","THRUM!","The flippers of the Emperor Penguin were letting out an intense light as he held a Peak GALAXY core, absorbing it as his golden eyes moved across the numerous stars of the past Primal Winged Expanse carefully! His current Realm was in the Middle Tier GALAXY, yet one could notice the distinct aura of an Entity from his as he had been among the few to use the Dao of Withering Crystals to completely comprehend a Lesser Dao.","This arrogant penguin and other subordinates of Noah who had achieved this 100% comprehension in a Dao were now enhancing their strength even further as they were given the loot from the recent battle, the l.u.s.trous GALAXY Cores going towards them as they quickly tried to push their strength towards the Peak to become genuine Entities.","While the Emperor Penguin moved to oversee the newly added Galaxies, the other experts within the Infinite Galaxy each moved with their own ideals!","An example of this was a scene that was occurring at this exact moment in a cl.u.s.ter of stars that used to be at the center of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter. The Imperial Adjudicator was standing powerfully in front of the Holy Emperor, Anastasia, and Anna by his side as this past galactic ruler confronted the man that nearly gave his wife and daughter away!","A look of shame could be seen in the eyes of the Holy Emperor, but his gaze remained steady as he met the man that gave him his little granddaughter.","The Imperial Adjudicator’s body now let out the aura of an Entity along with Anna, their Realms reaching Anastasia at Middle Tier GALAXY as they could genuinely consider themselves powerhouses that could protect themselves.","The strength that the Imperial Adjudicator strove for to protect his family...he had achieved it as he now stood proudly in the ranks of experts!","Like the Imperial Adjudicator, many other powerful beings in the Infinite Galaxy moved with their own ideals as their main goal remained getting stronger. Barbatos was a prime case of this as she was in a Time Space absorbing Peak GALAXY Cores, her red eyes vibrant as she recalled Noah’s words that he uttered to all his subordinates that entered the rank of Entities.","\"The Tower of the Great Sage Aoin still contains a myriad of Animus Summons...with a few PRISMATIC summons that still need their masters! The most powerful among you once you all reach the Peak Tier...will get to choose from the PRISMATIC and Ultra Rare Summons!\"","THRUM!","These words from Noah had spurred another period of training for his subordinates as they were now forged into powerful Entities. The next time they stepped out of the Infinite Galaxy...their names would become renowned as they left behind their own trail of destruction!","---","A few more days passed as many things occurred in the Infinite Galaxy.","Noah was still atop the Colossal Helios Leviathan with Traverser as it streaked across the chaotic void, his eyes closed as he had just utilized the [Protagonist’s Bookmark] that had finally ended its cool down!","The target was of course the Holy Emperor, Noah making sure to keep his focus on the Dao that had granted him the huge boost in power that he used to power through the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and the Primal Winged Expanse.","Swirling waves of the essence of the Dao of Summoning erupted from him as Traverser shook his head incredulously by the side, watching this Tyrannical being advance through a dao as easy as it could be.","The tide of essence receded into Noah’s body as his sharp eyes opened.","He felt the overpowering strength coursing through his body as his gaze went towards his stat panel.","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Controller(All Laws)]","[Trait(s) : Infinite Mana & Protagonist]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","[Vitality: GALAXY(PEAK)]","[Focus: ∞ ]","[Strength: GALAXY(PEAK)]","[Law(s) : Life-100%, Death-100%, Aether- 100%, Karma-100%,Fate-100%,Chaos-100%, Light-100%, Dark-100%, Space-100%, Time-100%, Fire-100%, Water-100%, Earth-100%, Air-100%]","[Universal Laws Assimilation: 46%]","[Primeval Propitious Physique: 96%]","[Skill Points :: 32,413,487]","A shining stat panel that he reduced to the most important details, with the most important thing in Noah’s eyes being the number of skill points that were one of the most important loot to come from taking down 26 Entities and 100 Peak Tier GALAXY Ailerons.","They were truly the most giving big bosses as the number of skill points they gave were many!","This gave way to many possible skill creations as the next best thing was the sweet 79% next to the Dao of Summoning after his use of Protagonist’s Bookmark, as well as the 46% next to all Universal Laws Assimilation.","He was nearly done with comprehending the Dao of Summoning and nearly halfway through assimilating all laws as a prized Cosmic Dao waited at the end of it!","RUMBLE!","\"We should be nearing the Consummate Sword Expanse?\"","His voice was powerful, his gaze was filled with starry light as they were set upon another Ancient Power.","This one was the 2nd strongest within the Dark Universe, overseeing a great deal of Galaxy Cl.u.s.ters as they ruled through pure strength alone.","This strength was provided by a single dao that was unique in its nature, a dao that went to the extremes of a weapon!","Ruled under the banner of the Sword Dao, the galaxy cl.u.s.ters prospered as they produced beings filled with fanaticism towards the sword.","The next target that held a Ruination Core was locked on as Noah neared the Consummate Sword Expanse!"]},{"number":841,"title":"Chapter 841: Chapter 840 - The Glorious Consummate Sword Expanse","paragraphs":["In a corner of the Dark Universe, one could observe a truly interesting cl.u.s.ter of Galaxies that were all situated together to form a unique form of a sword!","Whether it was formed naturally or had an expert that had done something shocking, it was a breathtaking scene in the chaotic void.","From the hilt all the way to the tip of the blade, the starry light of Galaxies illuminated such a pristine shape as Entities crossing the chaotic void would feel their hearts tighten when they stood at a far enough distance to be able to observe the stellar bodies in full.","Noah was able to do this exact thing at this moment- his vibrant eyes seeing the unique formation of the stellar bodies that came to form a sharp sword!","VOOOM!","The Colossal Helios Leviathan continued to tear through the chaotic void as they neared this Consummate Sword Expanse, Noah’s eyes focusing on the enormous Galaxy at the tip of the sword shaped stellar bodies.","This was where the center of this Ancient Power coalesced, the place known as the Consummate Sword Holy Land!","\"The strength of these fanatics is somewhat high as they are one of the few beings to love the Dao they study too much. This passion has allowed many of them to easily comprehend and assimilate it as even I am unsure of the extent of their power.\"","Traverser voiced out with careful eyes as the Animus Summon they were on made its way towards the Galaxy at the tip of the Sword formed stellar bodies.","The Ancient Power they were heading to was known as the second strongest after the Spirit Race, but nobody had been able to truly quantify their strength!","Yet to Noah...such strength did not matter as he could protect himself with surety. This was made even more true as his eyes shone while he activated a particular skill.","[Save Point].","THRUM!","Unique essence flashed from him as he created another Save Point, the skill’s could down having been met a few days back as before he stepped onto another Ancient Power, he saved his progress!","He could now move with even fewer worries as he kept his focus on the goal of this trip- the Ruination Core.","He didn’t need to mingle or insert himself into the Ancient Power while slowly rising up in ranks.","He didn’t have to hide his identity while slowly gaining the trust of the core figures of this Ancient Power.","No. He had risen to a level of strength where he could boldly move, his identity as the Tyrannical Entity being more than enough!","He was truly excited to see how this different approach would play out!","RUMBLE","The enormous Colossal Helios leviathan made no effort to hide its aura, and neither did Noah or Traverser as they neared the Consummate Sword Holy Land.","Naturally, this meant their powerful auras could be picked up hundreds of miles away as a second later, spatial fluctuations brought forth a 4 meter tall being in front of the path that the Colossal Helios Leviathan was taking.","It was a being of pristine beauty, his humanoid figure and characteristics making him no other than a creature of the Arch Human Race!","The aura of a powerful Entity bounced off of his body as his hands could be seen resting on a sharp sword.","His eyes were sharp as his piercing words rang out.","\"Friends, can I ask your purpose for coming towards our Consummate Sword Expanse?\"","RUMBLE!","His words traveled like sharp swords across the chaotic void as they reached Noah and Traverser, the Colossal Helios Leviathan still continuing to move its monstrous body forward without stopping as if an Entity had not appeared in front of it!","Noah gave a warm smile towards this Entity as he replied.","\"Naturally, it is to see the beautiful sights of your Ancient Power while learning about the Sword!\"","A reply that caused the eyes of the Entity from the Consummate Sword Expanse to shine brightly, his hand beginning to vibrate as they held the terrific sword he had on him!","The sight of the enormous Leviathan not even stopping as it barreled forward was matched with a bursting essence shaped like swords from the body of the Entity as his aura began to rise.","Neither side was coming to a stop as it seemed an impact was imminent!","SHAA! SHAA!","Yet it was at this moment that more 4 meter tall figures warped in, their bodies brimming with power as Noah even remembered a few of them from the party that he had met a few days back after the battle with Aileron Entities.","\"Emperorslayer...to think we would meet again so soon!\"","RUMBLE!","The most devilishly handsome Arch Human that had spoken to Noah last time as well appeared grandly as he spoke, his powerful aura bellowing out in waves as he seemed like a sharp sword ready to strike!","The enormous Colossal Helios Leviathan came to a stop just a few feet away from the cl.u.s.ter of appearing Entities, Noah waving his hands as the enormous animus turned into a streak of light and returned into his origin. The figures of him and Traverser appeared in the stellar chaotic void as he floated towards the Arch Human Entities.","\"I’m only visiting another Ancient Power. The last one left a bad taste in my mouth as I was left wondering how other powers in this vast Dark Universe are.\"","...!","The eyes of the Entities with essence as sharp as swords constricted as the one at the very forefront spoke with a smile.","\"Then you are guests of our Consummate Sword Expanse! Come, let us not be bad hosts...\"","The devilishly handsome Arch Human Entity welcomingly waved towards Noah and Traverser, his eyes hiding a sharp glint as he and his brethren parted in the middle to escort two guests into the Consummate Sword Expanse.","It was a wondrous cl.u.s.ter of galaxies filled to the brim with beings that studied a unique dao passionately, its Entities being truly powerful as it boasted power second only to the Spirit Race."]},{"number":842,"title":"Chapter 842: Chapter 841 - The Master Was Right!","paragraphs":["In the depths of the Consummate Sword Holy Land, a mystical Realm existed where the core power of the Consummate Sword Expanse resided.","This Realm was full of fantastical herbs and vegetation that were packed to the brim with essence, mana flowing serenely around the verdant vegetation as a single being was sitting down meditating with a glistening sword on his l.a.p.","He would occasionally stroke the sword as it hummed in a dangerous tone, the essence of the Dao of the Sword swirling around this being in large amounts!","SHAA!","A second later, the figure of 4 meter tall Arch Human teleported into the mystical Realm, his head bowed to the meditating being as he spoke out with reverence.","\"Sword Emperor, that...Tyrannical Emperor truly did come to our Expanse. Brother Brightsword is escorting him and Traverser into the Consummate Sword Holy Land at this moment.\"","The voice of the bowing Arch Human was filled with respect, which made this scene all the more shocking as from the body of this Arch Human...the aura of Entity was bursting off.","An Entity was bowing respectfully to the meditating being, giving him a shocking status!","THRUUM!","The meditating Sword Emperor opened his eyes as the surroundings resonated with his breathing, his voice that was filled with sharpness ringing out.","\"Good. The Immemorial Sword Formation is ready to be initiated?\"","\"Yes, Emperor. With the Consummate Sword Holy Land as the conduit itself, many of our Entities have been stationed throughout the different levels of the formation ready to start at any time.\"","The Entity’s eyes were filled with fervor as they glanced at the Sword Emperor, seeing this Ruler nod his head as the Entity warped away right after.","\"Big Sis Morgana, the being I mentioned has entered my Ancient Power. What the Master told us so long ago is turning out to be true...\"","A simple message, but one that would cause the minds of the beings that knew the status of this Sword Emperor to reel in shock. No sound came back from the other side of the medallion as the Sword Emperor waited calmly, seconds passing before a sharp voice could be heard.","\"The so called Master of Ruination that the Old Fool talked about before he croaked? F.u.c.k if I care that he’s come to you!\"","The voice was sharp and filled with disdain, with the truly perceptive readers being able to link the vulgar way of speaking of this being to an ’Entity’ that was mentioned some time back!","On the other side of the medallion that the Sword Emperor was speaking into, the small body of a girl that was floating in the chaotic void while twirling with a Ruination Core could be seen.","This was the exact same being that was the other holder of a Ruination Core, the one that Noah labeled to be a powerful Entity of even worse of a being that was actively moving throughout the Dark Universe!","Her petite figure brimmed with shocking power as she played with a Tool many beings were searching for, her voice ringing out again as it traveled to the Sword Emperor.","\"I was wondering why this stupid tool would be vibrating after all this time, never did I expect the bullshit ’Master of Ruination’ to have actually propped up! What the hell makes him worthy, huh? He’s still barely an Entity from what you’ve told me!\"","The expression of the Sword Emperor remained placid at the barrage of words from the being he called Big Sis Morgana as he replied.","\"The Master has never been wrong. But of course, I still made my own preparations. To make sure that we have a chance of survival...to make sure we can withstand the maniacs of the Spirit Race...I will even sacrifice my power and Origin.\"","...!","The eyes of the petite figure countless light years away constricted as she began screaming loudly into her medallion.","\"You little shit! What do you plan to do? Can you stop doing stupid things just for a second when I’m away? What do you mean sacrifice your Origin? You better have not believed all of the words of that Old Fool!\"","Her voice was sharp to the ears as the Sword Emperor smiled while turning his face away. His face was melancholic as he repeated words he had heard tens of thousands of years ago.","\"A being capable of freely wielding the Tools of Ruination. A being that rises from nothingness and into a peak powerhouse in a short period of time. A being that gets stronger from devouring the strength of others...everything that the Master said to us before fits with this being. I have collected all the information about him that dates back to when he appeared in the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter just weeks ago. Do you know what his realm was then?\"","\"...\"","The petite figure was silent for a moment as the Sword Emperor continued.","\"Merely at the QUASAR Realm.\"","...!","\"And now, he stands as an Entity just a month later, with enough power that even when he came in contact with the Spirit Race...it was actually them that pulled back!\"","RUMBLE!","\"What?!\" The petite figure known as Big Sis Morgana shouted out at these unbelievable words, the Sword Emperor continuing as his eyes swirled with powerful light.","\"The Spirit Race not moving against him after meeting gives us a chance, a chance that I will use to the fullest to achieve the dream of Master. I know you can feel that the Cataclysm is nearing as well...this might be the last chance that we have to move against the Spirit Race and take the remaining 2 Ruination Cores from them...the last chance to give the Master of Ruination a chance to undo what Master and the others did a long time ago!","RUMBLE!","Morgana felt her heart tremble as she had a foreboding feeling, essence beginning to swirl around her as she voiced out angrily.","\"You dumbass! Wait for me and dont do anything stupid. I’ll come back and peel the origin of this useless Master of Ruination to find out his secrets as I use the tools of Ruination myself. Do not do anything before then!\"","THRUUUUM!","The chaotic void shattered as the petite figure of a terrifying being shot out at high speed, her blazing with anger as she made way towards the Consummate Sword Expanse!","Back in the verdant mystical realm where the Sword Emperor resided, his eyes shot out innumerable lights as he put the medallion away and looked to the skies while speaking mysteriously.","\"Master...I shall help to undo what you and the others did all those years ago...\"","His gaze seemed to hold a myriad of secrets as he stared into nothingness, his body brimming with power that was way past an Entity!","It was the power of a Sage!"]},{"number":843,"title":"Chapter 843: Chapter 842 - The Immemorial Sword Formation Activates","paragraphs":["Noah was able to enter the grand Galaxy that was the Consummate Sword Holy Land with relative ease as the Arch Human Entities guided him in.","It was filled with a myriad of stars like any galaxies, but it held a mysterious air that made it seem extremely old and archaic!","Traverser was the only one who seemed to have his guard up as Noah and the Arch Human Entities floated towards an enormous golden door with smiles.","\"This is the Sword Realm that is more than worthy of receiving respected guests such as yourselves.\"","The lead Entity introduced the Realm they were entering through the golden door as they appeared in a fantastical environment.","Noah was in the skies as he watched an expansive fantasy city filled with buildings and structures built to the likeness of swords, vast grasslands present throughout as it seemed like a land that past Sages would stroll through!","The essence was vibrantly dancing in the surroundings as the party of Entities descended down an open area that held majestic outdoor dining tables and chairs, Noah and Traverser being welcomed to sit down as a variety of glistening food and drinks appeared on it.","\"Now, let us talk over a hearty meal.\"","The lead Entity had an indiscernible smile as he smiled at them, Noah not caring as he sat down and comfortably began helping himself to the golden drinks and meat that vibrated with essence.","\"I am the Sword Emperor’s right hand man, Brightsword. May I know why the Emperorslayer has made his way over to our Ancient Power?\"","Brightsword glanced at Noah with a smile as he asked.","It was an extremely weird environment as all the Entities were watching Noah, him being the only figure that was digging into the food and enjoying himself as even Traverser seemed to be carefully looking back at the watching Entities.","\"I came for the Ruination Core that is somewhere in this Ancient Power.\"","\"...\"","Silence descended onto the majestic outdoor dining area as even the wind stalled, Traverser’s eyes opening wide as they locked towards Noah...watching as this being merely continued enjoying his meal with a savory look after saying shocking words!","What was even more surprising was...the fact that the Arch Human Entities didn’t react in a shocked manner or erupt out in anger, remaining still as Brightsword only kept smiling.","\"I see. Then we must follow the will of the Sword Emperor!\"","THRUM!","Brightsword said these words powerfully as his eyes shone with immense l.u.s.ter, Noah merely glancing towards this Entity and those around him with squinting eyes as he spoke nonchalantly once more.","\"And what is the will of your Sword Emperor?\"","There was a period of silence as Brightsword waved his hands while smiling, seemingly giving a signal as he smiled.","\"The will of the Sword Emperor is something even we cannot deny...so I shall wish you good luck in obtaining what you want. If fate permits, I might even stand in front of you again!\"","RUMBLE!","The gaze of Brightstar and other Entities seemed to hold innumerable mysteries as the moment these words finished, the figures of the Entities in front of Noah began to disappear one after another as Noah and Traverser also felt themselves swept away by a spatial storm!","\"Hmmm?!\"","Noah’s eyes shone with bright light as he sensed his surroundings, his eyes glancing around to find himself in an entirely new area that held a much different environment than the one he was in. He finished the golden drink he had in his hand nonchalantly as he began to focus.","Spreading his senses out, he saw that he had been teleported to a planet that had no life on it, the only figures on this planet being him...and a single Arch Human Entity that was stroking his sword with a melancholic expression!","This Entity was standing in front of an enormous magic circle that shone with an intense light, Noah’s Eyes of Truth locking onto it as his eyes nearly bulged out when he somewhat ascertained what was going on.","THRUUM!","Yet he didn’t have to put the pieces together as a moment later, the Illusory image of a devilishly handsome Arch Human formed in the skies of this planet! This one held a head full of dark hair that moved with the wind, a sharp jawline and an air of a being that carried themselves with immense majesty!","His eyes seemed to hold a myriad of mysteries as he glanced down towards Noah and spoke grandly.","\"I am glad you could make your way down to my Consummate Sword Expanse...as it gives me a unique opportunity to do something I had long given up on and thought of as mere stories!\"","RUMBLE!","Filled with the light of majesty and power, the Sword Emperor had appeared in front of Noah in an Illusory form.","With the simple appearance of this figure, Noah’s senses also caught the usage of enormous amounts of mana in his surroundings, knowing a unique phenomenon was occurring at this moment as he stared at the floating figure in the skies.","\"Tens of thousands of years ago, my Master told the tale of a being that would be capable of holding immense power, of a being that could utilize the Tools of Ruination!\"","RUMBLE!","\"It has been so long that I nearly forgot about this tale...that I nearly gave up! Yet, a being matching the descriptions Master mentioned has stepped onto my home, but this being...is not up to par with the ill.u.s.trious one that my Master painted.\"","The resounding voice of the Sword Emperor was filled with melancholy as he looked at Noah.","\"The Master said that the one capable of using the Tools of Ruination would be able to very quickly rise in strength as they could devour the origins of others and assimilate them into their own power.\"","\"I am inclined to believe in the Master, and it is the reason why I have made so much effort. But...I must be sure that I am making the right choice, so I shall give you a chance!\"","The barren planet Noah was on quaked as enormous amounts of essence flooded in, something shocking that had been underway finally being completed.","\"This chance lies on the Immemorial Sword Formation that has been activated. A formation that spans across 50 planets and stars- each of them connected together to create a unique Spatial Realm that uses the Origins of the Sword Kings of my Consummate Sword Expanse at their core.\"","\"Within this Immemorial Sword Formation, you will stand against my Sword Kings as you make your way to the top. If you are capable enough and are the true Master of Ruination, you should be able to defeat them as you assimilate their power to increase your own. It is a huge sacrifice that my forces are making as they will lose a significant portion of their power with their defeat...but I must do this if I want to realize the dream of my Master!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s eyes shone brightly as he stared at the illusory figure, his mind rumbling with many thoughts as a singular one came to the very forefront when he looked at the situation before him.","’So...you’ve created a Dungeon where Entities are the mini bosses?!’","...!"]},{"number":844,"title":"Chapter 844: Chapter 843 - The Immemorial Sword Dungeon!","paragraphs":["Noah’s mind was filled with a myriad of thoughts as he gradually understood the situation around him, putting together the many pieces of information that the Sword Emperor was throwing out as he created a larger picture.","It seemed like he wasn’t alone in trying to prevent the apocalypse, beings like Traverser and this Sword Emperor existing who also had the same goal!","To further this goal, Traverser had joined him and pledged to help in any way he could, while this Sword Emperor was an old monster that had a supposed prophecy passed down by a being he called his Master...this being somehow foretelling that someone like Noah would appear in the future.","This alone made Noah’s mind buzz as he wondered what type of Dao or unique power that being cultivated to be able to see something like that, and what truly happened with the Sages and Great Sages that caused the separation of the Dark Universe from the Primordial Cosmos.","He couldn’t help but ask.","\"Who exactly is this master you keep on referring to?\"","The Illusory figure glanced at Noah as their starry eyes moved, their dominant voice ringing out once more.","\"My Master was the Great Sage that stood at the forefront of the battle against the nearby powers from the Primordial Cosmos that aimed for our Cosmic Treasure, the one that also knew what would happen when they cut off our Dark Universe from its home. But he did this because he saw that it was the only way to grant us time...where he even sacrificed his life and the life of all living Sages to cut us off and give us a few tens of thousands of years where we were waiting for a single being to rise.\"","RUMBLE!","\"Even the maniacs of the Spirit Race do not know this secret, Master being the only one that knew and passed it down to his disciples. Otherwise...they would have not so recklessly let you go in the Primal Winged Expanse. This is because you are the bane of what they stand for...you are the supposed being that would connect us back to the Primordial Cosmos and stand to protect this Universe.\"","\"Whether that being truly is you, we have to test and affirm with full certainty. Your power at the rank of Entity is not enough to stand against the Spirit Race and obtain the other 2 Ruination Cores as their strength is unfathomable! Let us see if you are truly the being we have been waiting for...climb through my Immemorial Sword Formation and defeat my Sword Kings. If you can truly assimilate their strength and rise in strength to approach Sage...I have no problem handing you the Ruination Core in my hands!\"","...!","Noah felt his heart beat faster as this truly wasn’t a situation he expected.","He didn’t have to slaughter his way through an Ancient Power as this time around, he was mingling with beings that knew of the apocalypse to come and actually wanted to prevent it.","But they had to have assurances that they weren’t giving away their supreme treasures to some weakling as this Sword Emperor had chosen a unique way to go about it...by creating a dungeon!","What was a dungeon?","In Noah’s Homeworld and the Beast World, dungeons were widespread as the Origins of beasts were used to serve as the mobs within, everytime they were defeated leaving behind a portion of their origin to the victor as they gradually lost their power and sense of being.","Their origins could be replenished with the input of essence as overtime, they lost all of their identity and simply became mindless origin machines that acted as puppets within a dungeon. In the past, the Spiritual Land of the Beast World had also created a dungeon for the test Noah took before he became its master- where the Emperor Penguin, Polar Bear, and other Spiritual Land beasts were used as the mini bosses in the dungeon.","The dungeons were unique spatial realms where those connected to the dungeons did not truly die...only losing a portion of their origin as their souls also received immense damage from the pseudo-death!","This was exactly what the Sword Emperor had done. The so called formation he had set up...was a dungeon that had 50 Planets interconnected, each one acting as its own level as it held a varying amount of Entities as mini bosses!","\"...\"","Noah was breathless as he affirmed this by glancing at the planet he was on with eyes of truth.","<strong>[First Floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon] :: The first floor of a dungeon created for a unique purpose. A single Entity has to be defeated on this floor before the challenger can step on the runic magic circle and be teleported into the 2nd floor...</strong>","The fantastical reality really was so as Noah shook his head incredulously, looking towards the illusory figure of the Sword Emperor with a difficult expression.","He had expected an enemy when he came, but unexpectedly found something entirely different!","RUMBLE!","He expressed his thanks in the only way that would reach the magnanimous Sword Emperor, his body beginning to bubble with power as he would take this pie that was falling out of the sky and take huge bites out of it.","He gave a nod of respect to the Sword Emperor.","\"I will thank you in advance for this opportunity!\"","The figure of the Sword Emperor nodded with melancholy as he began to disappear.","\"Traverser has no role to play in this Formation, and he will simply be watching the scenes playing out like many others. Prove to us that you truly are the being we are waiting for.\"","WAP!","The illusory figure disappeared as on the barren planet- on the first floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, only Noah and a single Entity was left.","The hairs on Noah’s head began to dance wildly as they focused on the Arch Human stroking his sword with a sad expression.","The sword in his hands seemed to be humming a tune, where with every passing second the shocking aura it released only became more and more powerful. The Entities, or as the Sword Emperor referred to them, the Sword Kings- would not lay down their lives easily as they knew with their defeat, their origin and soul would be heavily injured as their battle power would be greatly reduced!","So Noah would have to put in some work if he wanted to defeat these Entities that were fanatics of a Grand Dao of the Sword as he advanced through a one of a kind dungeon.","A dungeon made just for him.","Filled with Entities proficient in the Grand Dao of the Sword that he could defeat for Dao and Assimilation Crystals, Skill Points, and a myriad of other loot.","It was something out of his wildest dreams as he couldn’t help but let out a bellow of happiness!","\"OOOOOH!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":845,"title":"Chapter 845: Chapter 844 - Picking Up a Grand Dao is Easy I","paragraphs":["In the mystical realm filled with lush greenery, the Sword Emperor was still situated among the verdant grass as he peacefully breathed in and out.","A few meters away from him, an illusory screen could be seen that showed the scene of Noah looking towards one of his Sword Kings, the body of the Emperorslayer beginning to bubble with power as things were about to begin!","Many thoughts crossed the Sword Emperor’s mind as he looked at this scene, his essence constantly making sure the Immemorial Sword Formation that was set up was working perfectly.","He had no regrets from his actions, the possibility of the identity of this Master of Ruination simply being too important as he had to act! His senses told him that the Cataclysm was truly near, and if they wanted to stand against the suicidal Spirit Race...they had to move.","THRUM!","Essence was now erupting freely on the First Floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon as his starry eyes locked in to pay attention.","In another location, Traverser was left behind as the voice of the Sword Emperor had reached him to explain the ongoing situation, an illusory screen also present on the outdoor dining area they were in that showed the scene of Noah and the Sword King.","All the other floors of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon also had similar illusory screens as Noah’s battles would be analyzed by the very same beings he would face, his mission becoming increasingly harder as he climbed up.","The pieces were set.","The board was made.","Now, it was time to play.","On the first floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, Noah directly activated [Automatic Cast of All Support Skills] as his hair danced wildly, his body being wrapped by the multicolored essence of all Universal Laws as glorious wings erupted behind him while he was adorned in a magisterial armament.","Vibrant golden hammers swirled on his back as two sharp swords appeared in his hands, the Sword King in the distance glancing at the Swords with a light smile as he wielded his own.","\"You really do dare raise a Sword against someone that has wielded it their entire life.\"","His voice was soft and placid, Noah sensing many emotions in it as the moment the being finished talking, he began walking towards him.","THRUM!","Each step he took, his aura became even wilder as the Sword he held hummed, Noah feeling the power of the Grand Dao of the Sword as he moved himself.","He was truly curious what exactly this Grand Dao has that created fanatics.","\"The Will of the Sword Emperor must be followed...and he told us to go all out as if death in here was truly final!\"","BOOOM!","This object was naturally the Sword of the Arch Human Entity, Noah’s colorful eyes watching things as if in slow motion as he saw the swirling coagulation of the essence of the Sword Dao on the descending weapon.","This essence was truly unique as it was filled with immense power, this single strike making it seem like it would bring down the weight of an entire star when it met its target!","The Dao of Withering had essence with a destructive nature that deconstructed and eroded the enemy, the Dao of Vastness has expanding essence that granted the user unique properties...every single dao had its own unique essence.","The essence of the Dao of the Sword...gave its Entities extremely sharp and destructive attacks that carried the force equivalent to or even greater than the weight of stars or the even heavier stellar bodies, causing for the Sword Kings to be capable of shattering planets with a single swing of their sword!","RUMBLE!","Such was the strike that was coming towards Noah, his arms rising up to bring his two Sword that palpated with the essence of Aether and Death to stop the advancement of the Sword King’s strike that was smashing towards his face.","....BOOOM!","The impact was horrendous, the sheer weight the strike carried smashing into Noah’s Swords as it passed through them and descended onto his body, smashing him backwards as his body was thrown a few miles back!","WAA!","So this was the power of the Sword Dao!","\"Good!\"","THRUM!","His body exploded back towards the Sword King miles away, the pressure he released becoming even wilder as the Ruination Cores’ Affixes were activated.","[+10,000 to All Damage] and [+10,000 to Attack and Cast Speed] were activated as his figure turned into a streak of light, the swords he wielded moving at speeds that the watching Entities who were lax on the other floor failed to catch!","...!","They rose up from their nonchalant gazes as they focused on the illusory screen, only then being able to see the path of Noah that had truly become too fast out of nowhere!","BOOM!","It was Noah’s turn to strike back as the Sword King he faced barely raised his sword in time, the clash this time causing space to shatter as neither side was moved back!","Horrendous sounds were rusting out as the eyes of the Sword King focused feeling the force that Noah released now to be on par with the enormous strength that his Dao provided him.","\"...!\"","It was a chilling truth that only came by due to [+10,000 to All Damage] and [+10,000 to Attack and Cast Speed], the effects of the Ruination Core Affixes being the same if not more than what boosts the fully comprehended Daos provided to Entities!","\"Haha!\"","It was a shocking reality as Noah moved to strike again, enjoying the feeling of his body moved at shocking speeds and releasing tremendous power as he had yet to even call forth his summons.","As for the affixes, he would be replacing the Attack and Cast Speed affix the moment his foes were about to be defeated and replace it with the [Slain enemies have a 10% chance to drop Dao Crystals based on the Dao they cultivate] Affix in order to collect the Dao Crystals of this resplendent Sword Dao himself!","His strikes gaining the force equivalent to the weight of stars? He wanted it!","RUMBLE","The clash against the two Entities continued wildly as the eyes of the Sword King turned bright, his mouth moving in a barely discernible whisper.","...","The skies turned quiet as an ability was cast.","Hundreds of Sword began materializing above Noah, each of them carrying the weight of stellar bodies as they tore through space and thundered down.","\"Ah...\"","Towards such a shocking ability, Noah had a bright smile as around his body, innumerable miniaturized stars, suns, black holes, and quasars began to form.","The abilities of the Void Terror and the Terror of Aether- Cthulhu skill trees that were brought up had many abilities that conjured up stellar bodies as the method of attacking.","They eventually reached the stage of being able to throw out even black holes and Quasars as attacks, the only thing Noah could not do at this moment being the fact that he couldn’t conjure up a miniaturized Galaxy to throw at someone...but he had a real Galaxy to do that with if he wished!","But with his body brimming with power as stellar bodies coalesced around him, he faced the onslaught of hundreds of swords!","BOOOM!"]},{"number":846,"title":"Chapter 846: Chapter 845 - Picking Up a Grand Dao is Easy II","paragraphs":["BOOM!","...THRUM!","Minutes passed on the first floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon as two streaking figures of light could be seen.","One had a tinge of blue that represented his sword essence wrapping around his body, while the other had too many damn colors coalescing all around him as he was being aided by all laws and a few daos!","When one observed closely, they would be able to see that the figure of the Sword King was disheveled as the pressure he released was gradually waning, while the figure of Noah was just as vibrant as ever.","This was the difference between beings that had limited energy...and one that had an infinite amount of it!","BOOM!","Noah attacks were only becoming more and more smooth as his aura rose ever higher, the +10,000% support in Damage, Attack, and Cast Speed provided by the Ruination Core on top of his other support skills and the percentage boost that his completely comprehend Dao of Withering provided making him overpower an Entity that studied a Grand Dao over time!","BOOM!","The figure of the Sword King began to be pushed back as he could only defend, his sword humming sadly by his aide as it felt like it failed to protect its master.","The eyes of the Sword King were bright as he remained relentless even when things turned disadvantageous.","He fought until his hand was cut off and the trusted Sword was lost from his grasp.","SHAA!","An Affix was switched.","SHAA!","A head rolled to the ground of a barren planet.","\"...\"","Those watching the scene had many complicated thoughts as at this moment, the first floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon was cleared.","The body of the dead Sword King exploded out as it disappeared, leaving behind a cl.u.s.ter of Cores and a skill book...along with a few Dao Crystals that could drop with a higher chance than Assimilation Crystals.","Noah’s body remained vibrant and colorful as he reached out, putting the Cores in his Expansive Space while his hands had already begun absorbing the [Grand Dao of the Sword Crystals] after changing to the affix that would allow him to obtain an even larger percentage of this Dao.","<strong>GALAXY [Sword of Revelation] :: An area of attack ability that calls forth hundreds of swords that are as dense as black holes. Each of them points towards the enemy as their tips will pierce through them to reveal the secrets lying within. </strong>","He learned the GALAXY Rank skill book right away, not doubting that it would be one of the few skills that would form into a skill tree that could utilize the essence of the Dao of the Sword into an ability.","He could create some powerful offensive skills for the Dao of the Sword too if he wished as he had over 32 million skill points at this moment...but his thoughts were on creating a singular powerful one sometime soon in the future that could be utilized and enhanced by all laws and daos!","The scene on the barren planet turned silent as many beings watched the Tyrannical Entity sit down while he absorbed gloriously shining Dao Crystals.","In front of him, the runic magic circle shone brightly as it was asking him to step into it and arrive into the second floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon where even more powerful foes waited for him!","---","In the mystical realm filled with verdant greenery, the Sword Emperor was staring with shining eyes as he observed what occurred the moment one of his Sword Kings was defeated.","He saw the appearance of a book and Cores as his eyes actually focused on the brilliantly shining Dao Crystals that shot a blue loot light into the skies.","He observed as Noah began absorbing the crystals...his eyes opening in shock as he felt the aura of the Sword Dao begin to erupt from Noah soon after!","\"Truly capable of devouring the strength of others to advance...but to do it this fast? On a Grand Dao as well..?!\"","The firm heart of the Sword Emperor was shaken as right after, a slight smile appeared on his lips.","\"This affirms his identity even more, which means...!\"","The eyes of the Sword Emperor were filled with many mysteries as he glanced back at the illusory screen.","RUMBLE!","He was watching the progress of Noah absorbing the Dao Crystals when not too far from him, spatial fluctuations erupted out and a Sword King with an ashen expression appeared!","It was the very same Entity that had just battled and been defeated by Noah.","His eyes seemed to have dimmed as he let out a light cough, the Sword Emperor glancing towards him with careful eyes as he spoke.","\"How do you feel?\"","\"...my cultivation is destabilized as I nearly fell to Middle Tier GALAXY...and my comprehensions into the Dao of the Sword are murky!\"","\"It’s as if I did not fully comprehend the Dao all these years, the only saving grace being my progress in the assimilation of the Dao lighting up the way again after I came to.\"","The Entity spoke with a firm expression as he didn’t seem to hold even the slightest regret!","The Sword Emperor kept his firm expression as he nodded.","\"We were right! He can devour the Realms and comprehensions of others as he grows at a rapid rate...the Master has never been wrong with his words!\"","RUMBLE!","The Sword King nodded deeply at these words as his figure disappeared, his report having finished as he now needed to recuperate for who knew how many years to recover his Peak strength and straighten his Dao once more.","He didn’t ask the most pressing question as he was too afraid to ask or even think of it.","It was the purpose of the Immemorial Sword Formation, and the fact that the being at the very top level of it was the Sword Emperor himself.","If that Tyrannical Entity really managed to get past the groups of Sword Kings at the higher levels of the formation, what would happen if he reached the Sword Emperor?","It was a shocking thought that was better left unsaid as on the first floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, Noah finished absorbing the Dao Crystals and stood up.","A light smile could be seen on his face as the Sword made from Death and Aether trembled within his hands.","The Sword Kings on the upper levels of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon stood up with grim looks as they really confirmed it.","The Tyrannical Entity now had the essence of the Dao of the Sword swirling around him, his edge having become even sharper as he stepped on the runic magic circle leading to the next floor!"]},{"number":847,"title":"Chapter 847: Chapter 846 - The Tyrannical Entity Decimates Sword Kings! I","paragraphs":["On the second floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, there were two Sword Kings waiting for Noah.","Neither of them spoke a single word as their faces were extremely serious, knowing the power of this being as they had just seen it first hand!","THRUUM!","Their swords cried out as they moved faster than what the eyes could see.","Noah gave a light smile as he ironically cast a single skill.","[Sword of Revelation].","WAA!","The skies became filled with hundreds of Swords that carried with them the essence of the Grand Dao of the Sword...and also all universal laws along with the deteriorating essence of the Dao of Withering!","It was multiple times more deadly than when it was first cast against Noah on the first floor, as it was also supported by the switched Ruination Core Affixes of [+10,000 to All Damage] and [+10,000 to Attack and Cast Speed].","BOOOM!","The figures of the two Sword Kings rushing towards him were blown back as their bodies glimmered with the essence of the Sword, their eyes shining brightly as they were attacked with their own skill!","\"OOOOH!\"","One of the Sword Kings released a vibrant bellow as he threw the sword he held into the skies, Noah watching with shining eyes as this Sword split from one to two, from two to four...","It continued splitting more and more as the Sword King valiantly called out.","[Starry Flow of the Sword]!","RUMBLE!","His sword that had split apart numerous times formed into a mass that looked like a rushing body of water.","The cast of this ability was followed by the shocking formation of an enormous starry river, this river being made of an innumerable number of Swords as it thundered towards the rain of Swords that Noah released from the skies!","The clash was grand as space quaked, the starry River of swords moving with purpose as they sn.a.k.e.d towards Noah.","He only smiled calmly as he did something that only he could do.","[Sword of Revelation].[Sword of Revelation].[Sword of Revelation]...","He began spamming...","THRUUM!","The rain of hundreds of swords ripped apart the starry River as even more of them thundered towards the two Entities, their faces filled with frustration as they faced a being that truly did not play fair!","In the next second, they found that fairness truly wasn’t in this being’s vocabulary as while they faced the rain of swords palpating with the reinforcement of all laws and multiple Daos, a blob of a blue had silently appeared behind them.","Nobody knew when, but the terrifying Universal Emperor Slimes has been summoned silently as it came to the back of the unsuspecting Entities... its body expanding as it swallowed one of them whole.","...!","Alarm filled the faces of the two Sword King as the one that didn’t have his body covered by the body of the slime watched in shock as his friend...disappeared entirely in the next second!","WAP!","<<Universal Devouring>> was utilized as the Blue Slime got a meal on the second floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon.","RUMBLE!","Its body began to tremble with happiness as its small eyes formed into a crescent, the aura of an Entity proficient in the Dao of the Sword erupting from it as this ridiculous Slime gained yet another Grand Dao to its list of fully comprehended Daos!","BOOOOM!","The body of the Blue Slime moved like a sledge hammer as while reinforced by the essence of numerous Grand Daos, it smashed into the shocked Arch Human Entity and flung him out towards Noah, the body of this Entity spurting out blood after its defenses were punctured from a hit that contained the essence of so many Daos.","He flew like a missile towards Noah’s direction as what awaited him...","[Sword of Revelation].","THRUM!","\"...\"","Two Entities were cleared out in seconds as a Blue Slime cheerfully went towards Noah, its body bouncing up and down on his head excitedly as its small body released the shocking pressure of multiple Entities!","There was immense silence in the upper floors of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon as the many Sword Kings saw that somehow, the second level was passed even faster than the first as their Entities were taken down in less than a minute.","\"This...!\"","The eyes of the Sword Emperor in the far mystical realm shone brightly at this scene as he continued watching!","On the second floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, Noah went towards the area where the second Entity had just died, his hands grabbing onto the Cores as well as.... Law and Dao Assimilation Crystals!","This Entity didn’t trigger the Affix of the Ruination Core and had instead triggered Noah’s own skill as he gave out the even more wondrous Assimilation Crystals.","Along with this, a single Skill Book floated in the air as it turned into a streak of light and flew into Noah’s mind.","[Starry Flow of the Sword](0/5) :: The ways to decimate an opponent with your sword are many, but none are as powerful as sacrificing your Sword to form into a starry stellar river of swords that decimated your enemy.","On the third floor, yet another pair of Sword Kings waited for them as the moment Noah and the Blue Slime were teleported in...they attacked with fervor as they saw the ridiculous strength of these two beings!","ZIIIING!","The clouds in the skies of the barren planet the third level they were on parted as from above, two blue shimmering Swords that spanned multiple miles long thundered down.","[Wrath of the Sword King].","RUMBLE","The eyes of Noah and the Blue Slime turned towards the skies as the sharp tips of the two Swords were the only thing covering their sight, the eyes of the Sword Kings wrathful as they pointed down towards them!","They actually wanted to snipe them the moment they entered the 3rd level, horrendously powerful attacks smashing towards them the second they appeared.","THRUUUM!","Noah released a bright smile as he used the new GALAXY Rank skills he had obtained, while the body of the Blue Slime ballooned up excitedly while facing the mountain sized Sword descending towards them!"]},{"number":848,"title":"Chapter 848: Chapter 847 - The Tyrannical Entity Decimates Sword Kings! II","paragraphs":["Traverser was watching with blazing eyes as a shocking scene played out on the third level of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon.","Under the pressure of two mountainous Swords, the Tyrannical Entity pointed his Aether and Death Sword to the skies as he cast the very same skills of the Sword Kings!","[Starry Flow of the Sword]!","The Sword of Aether shattered as it formed into a stellar river of Swords, the Sword of Death doing the same as two raging rivers of Aether and Death appeared to stand against one of the mountainous swords.","RUMBLE!","The small figure of the Blue Slime also ballooned up greatly as its viscous body thrummed with the essence of many Daos, the second mountainous Sword smashing into it as...it could not go down any further!","BZZZZT!","Space was the only thing hurt as it quaked and cracked, the stellar rivers of Death and Aether swords shattering the enormous Sword that represented the [Wrath of the Sword King].","Traverser’s scalp tingled as he stated at this shocking scene as in the next moment, a heart rending Roar could be heard as on the field of the third floor, the image of a glorious Queen Dowager appeared the moment that the two mountainous swords were repelled, its ten heads erupting out with scorching pillars of flames while the Blue Slime and Noah moved like streaks of light towards the two Sword Kings.","\"They...they’re decimating Entities that studied the Grand Dao for all their lives...\"","That’s right.","What was happening as Noah ascended through the floors of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon wasn’t a fight anymore, it was simply the Decimation of Entities as he seemed to get more and more powerful after every passing floor, clearing them even quicker than the previous ones as the Entities within were destroyed in even more spectacular ways!","RUUMBLE!","On the third floor, Noah watched the two Sword Kings explode into loot as he stood on one of Tiamat’s heads, waving his hands as multiple Galaxy Cores entered his Expansive Space while he also grasped onto the appearing Dao Crystals.","Only a single Entity dropped Dao Crystals this time as no assimilation crystals came out, with two more skill books appearing in front of him that he quickly learned while already absorbing the Dao Crystals!","[Sword Intent](0/5) :: A powerful intent blooms in your Origin as it can reinforce your will on the path of the Sword. +1000% Increased Damage on all abilities that utilize the Dao of the Sword. This percentage can be increased greatly depending on your comprehension in the Dao of the Sword.","[Wrath of the Sword King](0/5) :: A mountainous Sword is the only way a King can release his wrath. The angrier the caster is, the more powerful the damage will be as the percentage is capped at 1000%.","Noah digested the 2 skills as they were very quickly assembled into a skill tree on his stat panel, combined with the other 2 he had gained prior as the four of them were grouped under a single tree!","[The Way of the Sword](0/500) :: A skill tree containing the abilities capable of making one proficient in the way of the Sword. Contains the Abilities [Sword of Revelation](5/5), [Starry Flow of the Sword](5/5), [Sword Intent](0/5), and [Wrath of the Sword King](0/5).","Just a few other floors and some luck...and he would be able to fully comprehend an elusive Grand Dao while he collected Assimilation Crystals.","His eyes blazed with intense light as he knew...if he fully crossed the floors of this Immemorial Sword Dungeon, it truly might not be a problem for him to bring his Universal Laws Assimilation all the way to 100%!","THRUM!","His eyes blazed with power as before he proceeded into the next floor, two clones warped in as they turned into streaks of light to merge with the dreadful Blue Slime and Tiamat, the clones using [Automatic Cast of All Support Skills] as the immense power these two PRISMATIC+ pets released became even more fearsome.","The swirling essence of all Universal Laws around their bodies gave the watching Sword Kings goosebumps as they saw the Tyrannical Entity and his Summons descend unto the next floor, which was another barren planet with 2 Entities on it!","Their bodies were already glowing bright with the Dao of Sword, moving with a delay as they had seen what this Tyrannical Entity had done the floor prior.","It was truly an interesting scene as the Sword Emperor had spread out his Entities across the Immemorial Sword Dungeon in terms of power, putting 2 Entities every level after the first one until the 20th- with those on higher floors being the Sword Kings that had assimilated more of the Grand Dao of the Sword as their power was much more frightening!","It should have been a dungeon that caused its challenger to despair and lose their will after a few floors, yet they saw the scene of the challenger getting stronger after every floor as he went to the next one with vigor!","On the fourth floor, the 2 Sword Kings did not last a minute under Noah’s onslaught of skills that their own people were using not too long ago, along with the ferocious strength of the two PRISMATIC+ Pets.","If this wasn’t enough, [Wrath of the Sword King] was cast as Noah made sure to utilize the Sin of Wrath to boost the percentage boost of this skill near its maximum before he struck, causing the formation of an enormous sword miles long to pierce through the skies of the barren planet, a single one of these swords squashing an Entity that was struggling with a stellar river of Swords a second later.","\"...\"","It was truly a dominating show of power as he seemed unstoppable!","What was most frustrating of all for the watching Sword Kings was the fact that this Tyrannical Entity was defeating their people so overwhelmingly through skills they had known since before they even became Entities!","In the Ancient Power that held Entities that loved and studied the Sword Dao with fanaticism, Noah was actually utilizing this same Dao to thrash its most powerful Entities left and right.","The Sword Kings were breathless as they saw Noah enter floor after floor as the decimation only continued.","From his body, this could see the Illusory figure of a sword surrounding him as one of the 3 Entities on the 21st floor sighed with utter shock.","\"He is already coalescing a Sword Will to naturally reinforce his origin and soul...!\"","They could only watch it utter shock as the Tyrannical Entity breezed through the first few floors of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, the essence of the Dao of the Sword around him becoming even thicker as after defeating multiple Entities proficient in this Dao, he was collecting enough Crystals to very soon completely comprehend it!"]},{"number":849,"title":"Chapter 849: Chapter 848 - 100% in a Grand Dao, a Disastrous Event! I","paragraphs":["Amidst the devastating scene of Sword Kings being whipped left and right, the Sword Emperor was actually smiling in the mystical verdant Realm.","\"Master has never been wrong...\"","He was smiling because his assertions came to be true, the being in front of him truly being the Master of Ruination as no other being could do what he was doing!","This reality also caused him to pause as he became serious, thinking about the end result of the Immemorial Sword Formation that he had set up.","He would be the last being to face this Tyrannical Entity if he kept this pace and climbed all the way to the 50th level of the Formation.","The Sword Emperor thought of the one he called Big Sis Morgana who was furiously coming towards the Consummate Sword Expanse as his face lost its seriousness and adopted a light smile.","\"It should be okay. She’ll be there to pick up the slack...\"","The eyes of the Sword Emperor were filled with innumerable mysteries as he continued watching the shocking scenes play out.","On the 6th Floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, the fearsome Jormungandr and the Golden Crow made their appearance grandly along with the Blue Slime and Tiamat, the pace that the Tyrannical Entity cleared each floor becoming even faster as the Entities proficient in the Grand Dao of the Sword were decimated within minutes from the overwhelming force of Entities that Noah brought with him!","A clone warped in for each summoned Pet as they all became adorned in the stellar Armament of all Universal Laws, this time also being aided by the Grand Dao of the Sword that Noah was on his way to fully comprehending as he collected more Dao Crystals.","On the 15th floor of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon after taking down over 18 more Entities, the Affix of Ruination had triggered enough times as Noah obtained the Dao Crystals he required to do something stupendous!","His eyes blazed with light as they saw the percentage rapidly jumping from 70% to 80%, and from then on as it raced towards 100%!","THRUUUM!","The watching Sword Kings were truly mystified as they also watched this scene on their illusory screens, Traverser joining them in their shock as these beings were ridiculously watching as an illusory Sword coagulated on Noah’s body, his figure beginning to release an aura that only the Sword Kings had been releasing this entire time.","\"...ridiculous!\"","A reality many Sword Kings wanted to deny as they had spent blood and tears for thousands of years to fully comprehend the Grand Dao of the Sword, and this being in front of them...he really comprehended it in less than an hour.","...!","He had truly been moving through the Immemorial Sword Dungeon in less than an hour, and he had a shocking 100% next to the Grand Dao of the Sword as his body erupted with a brilliant blue light!","WAAA!","A space shaking aura began to emanate from Noah as at this moment...it wasn’t just his pets that had a Grand Dao fully comprehended. And he had joined their ranks as well.","They landed on the stat panel as they observed the Dao of the Sword.","<strong>{Aura of the Grand Controller of the Sword} :: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended the Grand Dao of the Sword. It grants +5000% Extra Damage, +5000% Attack and Cast Speed, +50% Increased Soul Defence, and boosts all abilities of the Sword by 1000%.</strong>","\"...\"","When it came to percentages, Noah was a big fan of them.","The percentages floating in front of his eyes...they only made his eyes shine brighter as he calculated the craziness of adding this on top of all the other percentages he had!","The Entities from the Consummate Sword Expanse had only been able to keep up with him and withstand the barrage of attacks from him and his pets for a minute or two because they had a boost like this on them.","Noah was able to decimate them without it as he brought boosts from Ruination Cores and his own support skills that called on all Universal Laws and their |Intents|.","Now on top of every other boost he had...he would also put on the support of the Grand Dao of the Sword as the results were about to be disastrous!","Purely disastrous!","While a Tyrannical Entity was ascending through a dungeon, a monumental event was about to occur in the Dark Universe.","Far from the Consummate Sword Expanse that Noah was now moving in, there were the Desolate Galaxies in the East that were ruled by the Ancient Power known as Desolate Expanse.","Compared to the past Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter and Primal Winged Expanse, or even the Consummate Sword Expanse- the Desolate Expanse contained the most cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies by a large margin!","It was an Ancient Power that had the union of multiple races and beings, their power not being centralized as they were spread between factions of powerful Entities that oversaw portions of the vast cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies.","Purely in terms of number and power, it was considered the 3rd most powerful Ancient Power in the Dark Universe!","Yet on this day, a terrifying event occurred as after it, the Desolate Galaxies would never be the same.","It came out of nowhere, and when it occurred- it happened instantly.","What was most shocking was that it affected tens of thousands of light years in distance as multiple Galaxies were affected!","On this day in the Desolate Expanse, enormous fissures tens of thousands of light years long tore apart the chaotic void."]},{"number":850,"title":"Chapter 850: Chapter 849 - 100% in a Grand Dao, A Disastrous Event! II","paragraphs":["It had been business as usual in the Desolate Galaxies as many beings moved about across multiple galaxies.","In the next few seconds, multiple shocking scenes played out instantly across the span of galaxies, but we will focus on a few!","One was of a being from the Treant Race that held the power at S Rank, living on an expansive green planet that resided on a small Galaxy.","Without any warning, this being from the Treant Race saw a flash of extremely dark light that seemed to consume everything spread out in front of him, this light expanding in an instant as it swallowed the entire planet this being was on!","RIIIIP!","The planet and everything within it...gone in an instant!","The terrifying rupture didn’t stop there as it expanded thousands of light years instantly, tearing the small Galaxy which that small planet was located on in half.","If one could observe the circular shape of that small Galaxy and all the twinkling stellar bodies within it, they would be able to notice a vibrating dark fissure that had devoured every single stellar body in the middle of this Galaxy as it turned dim without any colors!","...RIIIP!","The overwhelming dark Fissure erupted right in front of his eyes as well, spreading to devour him and nearly the entire Galaxy he resided in...in an instant.","In another location!","A curvaceous Entity was dressed in sagely green robes as she gave a lesson to Peak GALAXY Rank experts on the Daos she had fully comprehended.","Coincidently, it was the Entity Nirnasha that was studying the Dao of Vitality that Noah had met weeks ago in the Burning Domains Galaxy!","She had traversed the chaotic void and received an attractive offer from one of the factions of the Desolate Expanse that always invited more Entities, accepting it as she was expounding on the Dao of Vitality to the GALAXY experts on a certain Galaxy.","In front of this Entity proficient in the Lesser Dao of Vitality and the Peak GALAXY experts...yet another Fissure erupted out to cover them in an instant.","Nirnasha’s face had changed briefly as she seemed to sense something foreboding, her body beginning to light up with light as she tried to move, but before she could do anything...the fissure devoured her!","It ruptured the starry space within this galaxy and the chaotic void outside of it as it was larger than most other Fissures, swallowing the entire Galaxy and the trillions of beings within it instantly.","It was an interesting sight that nobody would get to see!","But! The point to be made here was that no matter if it was a being at Rank S, in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm, or even in the rank of Entities...against the instantly expanding and dreadful Fissures that came out of nowhere, nobody survived.","Nobody!","THRUUUM!","The chaotic void spanning tens of thousands of light years around the Desolate Galaxies trembled and wavered as from nowhere, fissures tore apart galaxies as everywhere they spread became lifeless.","The Fissures themselves were extremely dark, holding an enticing light that seemed to want to devour everything.","They seemed to lead to nowhere as the stellar bodies and galaxies they devoured were nowhere to be found.","Those that had lost their lives on this day? The trillions were too many to count.","From Entity to Rank F individuals, nobody escaped.","The all devouring Fissures were expanding!","It was the beginning of something that was known from tens of thousands of years ago, something that was a product of the actions of the Sages and Great Sages.","It didn’t happen all at once as it would occur in stages, but the first stage had already begun.","An Apocalypse was coming!","---","Back in the Consummate Sword Expanse, a Tyrannical Entity was ascending through the Immemorial Sword Dungeon with ease as he and the other Entities as well as the Sage within this Ancient Power...knew nothing of what had just occurred in the Desolate Galaxies.","Noah had all of his Animus Pets summoned and merged as they each adorned stellar Armaments backed by the power of all Universal Laws.","Around their bodies, the swirling essence of multiple Daos could be seen as the pets themselves were studying their own Daos and at the same time receiving Noah’s essence of the Dao of Summoning, Vitality, Withering, and the Dao of the Sword!","Their bodies hummed with power as the more shocking thing was the mystery of where the essence that continued to power them came from.","They had to get ready as this Tyrannical Entity had already crossed the halfway point- the 25th Floor.","Even though he now met three Sword Kings to hinder him, he was actually tearing through them even faster than when it was one Entity or 2 as he had summoned all of his pets to aid him!","The Sword Emperor says this scene as his eyes shone with intense light.","He saw that this Master of Ruination would most likely keep his dominant strength in battle on all the coming floors, being able to most likely even defeat his strong Sword Kings that nearly assimilated the Dao of the Sword fully as he would reach him in a matter of time!","\"If that’s the case..let’s simplify things!\"","THRUUM!","The Sage moved as his body shone with mystical lights, his mana as vast as the stellar space as it was activated on the Immemorial Sword Formation.","His vast essence wrapped around the remaining levels of the Dungeon aside from the one saved for him, the Entities within this level feeling a spatial wave overtake them once more as the voice of the Sword Emperor rang out clearly for all to hear.","\"We shall not waste any more time in this case...as you shall simply face all the remaining Entities for the last level of this Formation before you can proceed towards me.\"","RUMBLE!","The hearts of the Sword Kings shook at these words as their eyes shone with immense light!","While Noah...his eyes were even brighter than theirs as he began to laugh out wildly!","This was because from the levels he cleared and the levels remaining...there were 73 Entities left for him to go through.","The Sword Emperor had then chosen to simply merge the remaining levels as he...would face all the remaining 73 Entities at once.","\"...how Glorious!\"","THRUUM!"]},{"number":851,"title":"Chapter 851: Chapter 850 - With a Swing, A Sword King Falls! I","paragraphs":["Noah and his pets were about to step on the magic runic circle leading into the next floor when suddenly, it disappeared in a flash of light as everything began to tremble!","His shining eyes tried to peer through the truth of what was happening as he gazed at his surroundings, but the voice of the Sword Emperor rang out soon enough as an incredulous reality was brought to light.","\"We shall not waste any more time in this case...as you shall simply face all the remaining Entities for the last level of this Formation before you can proceed towards me.\"","THRUUUUM!","The words were accompanied by tremendous spatial fluctuations, the planet Noah was on warping through space as it disappeared, Noah and his pets remaining alone in the starry space.","A moment later, the spatial light reappeared as the figures of multiple Entities came to be.","Each of them shimmering with an intense blue l.u.s.ter that represented the pristine aura of the Dao of the Sword, 73 Entities warped in the starry space near Noah one after another.","Their eyes were filled with battle intent as they looked at the being that had decimated their people at every level, thinking that they might have a chance to do the same to him at this moment!","After all...there were 73 of them! That was 73 genuine Entities that fully comprehended the Grand Dao of the Sword.","Sure nothing crazy and unexpected would happen in such a battle, right?","Noah looked at the scene of Entities littering the starry space as towards this...he could only smile brightly while his body let off even more glorious power.","\"....how glorious!\"","He had been worried about the Sword Emperor cutting it short or taking the other Entities away from him as he moved rapidly through the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, and yet this man had instead grouped up and brought everyone to him!","He was truly too magnanimous!","THRUM!","The Sword Kings knew Noah’s terrifying power as they moved the instant they appeared, their mana moving as numerous abilities were cast.","SHING! SHING!","The sounds of vibrating swords filled the starry sky as for the first time ever, Noah faced something that he had only ever done to other people.","It was the act of facing multiple of the same abilities at once, an act he achieved through spamming. But the Entities in front of him used their sheer numbers to their advantage as all 73 of them cast skills from the Way of the Sword Skill Tree!","[Starry Flow of the Sword]. [Wrath of the Sword King]. [Sword of Revelation]. [Starry Flow of the Sword]. [Wrath of the Sword King]. [Sword of Revelation]...","The sonorous voices of all 73 Entities rang out as they surrounded Noah on all sides, their voices moving in conjunction as the starry space lit up.","This beautiful and deadly sight of the attacks of 73 Entities rushed towards Noah and his pets as they threatened to wipe out everything in their path!","CAA!","The cry of a Golden Crow was heard.","ROAAR!","The roars of Tiamat, the Colossal Helios Leviathan, the ferocious Jörmungandr, and the flashing Obsidian Panther could be heard.","OOOOH!","The kingly Calamity Bear bellowed out as its authority was tested, the Oculothorax joining it as it released waves of spiritual pressure.","\"...\"","The Blue Slime blinked as an innocent smile appeared on its wiggly body, a gulp of a being that seemed to be too overwhelmed with the choices of meals being heard.","||Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust||.","His expression was extremely solemn as he uttered these words, his body that was wrapped in a myriad of boosts from Laws and Daos trembling the moment he finished.","The skill that scaled up to the level of the user, ||Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust||, was cast.","RUUUUMBLE!","[Starry Flow of the Sword]. [Wrath of the Sword King]. [Sword of Revelation]...","GALAXY Rank skills were spammed in large numbers.","The innumerable number of Swords rushing towards Noah and his pets...trembled!","THRUM!","[Realm Depredation].","[Flames of Glory]. [Wrath of the Dragon Queen]. [Galaxy Devouring Serpent]. [Flash of Darkness].","The voices of the Golden Crow, Tiamat, Jörmungandr, and the Obsidian Panther reverberated!","THRUUUUM!","[Majesty of a King]. [Golden Eye of Truth].","The Calamity Bear waved its paws as they erupted with a magisterial light, the Oculothorax shimmering with golden l.u.s.ter as an uncountable number of golden rays erupted from it.","[Vastness].","The Blue Slime uttered a single word as its body began to balloon up crazily, numerous Dao Essence swirling around as it threatened to devour everything!","An impact occurred.","BOOOOOOM!","When the scene cleared, the shocking image of a Tyrannical Entity standing perfectly unharmed could be seen, his pets adorned in glorious Armament surrounding him as a fearsome Blue Slime could be seen continuously expanding!","The eyes of the Tyrannical Entity lifted as they locked on the 73 Entities around him as he uttered a dominating command.","\"Rip them apart.\"","RUUMBLE!","His figure disappeared into a streak of light as he moved, his pets rushing out towards the shocked faces of 73 Entities that had all released attacks in conjunction against a few enemies...and found them all repelled with ease!"]},{"number":852,"title":"Chapter 852: Chapter 851 - With a Swing, A Sword King Falls! II","paragraphs":["One might come across a myriad of shocking and incredulous events throughout their lives, but nothing would ever be as incredulous as watching a single Entity with his pets fearlessly match 73 other Entities.","Traverser was watching the scenes with an agape expression as he observed the Sword Kings to be moving slower as if they were in a quagmire, the effects of ||Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust|| fully settling in as they had to use their essence to prevent against the corrosion of a horrendous area of attack skill that was now backed with the immense power of multiple Daos and Laws!","The Animus Summons moved in furiously as the Sword Kings did not give them an ounce of fear, their resplendent attacks raining down mercilessly as they attacked multiple Entities at the same time.","The Blue Slime was the most terrifying thing as it seemed to be expanding continuously, its enormous body very soon being able to occupy the surrounding starry space as any that entered the viscous mass would have an extremely horrendous ending!","As for Noah himself...this guy had already closed his eyes as the swords of Aether and Death vibrated in his hands.","He wasn’t using his eyes as his aura was spread out wildly, sensing the Universal laws supporting him as well as the Dao essences he was freely releasing from his body with his endless mana.","He had yet to figure out the unique state he entered when he utilized all laws at the same time, but he knew that every single part of him felt extreme exhilaration as his senses were magnified by a large extent.","So with his eyes closed, he waved his Aether Sword as a starry river of swords was formed from the use of [Starry Flow of the Sword].","THRUUM!","His Death Sword waved to the other side as a rain of sharp swords in the thousands tore through space through the use of [Sword of Revelation].","From above, mountainous swords had begun raining from all around as at this moment...a spamming session of ultimate proportions had begun.","Traverser felt his heart grow cold as while he observed, he was shocked to find out that every time Noah waved a sword, one of the Sword Kings on the battlefield would fall!","Other times it was due to the attacks of ferocious Animus Summons that moved with extreme ferocity while using the gaps of defense created by Noah’s relentless spamming attacks on the Sword Kings.","But the truth remained the same...every time the being with his eyes closed waved his swords while he continued to spam countless numbers of skills, an Entity fell!","RUMBLE!","The figures of the Sword Kings never reached Noah to even land any attacks on him due to the relentless nature he was spamming his skills, where they could not even get near him.","If they could not even reach him while he constantly attacked and decimated their defenses with abilities that held too high of an attack power...what could they do but fall?!","And so with every swing of the Tyrannical Entity’s swords, the battlefield had one less soul present.","\"This...\"","Traverser felt his scalp tingle at such a scene as he reached towards his forehead to wipe perspiration and sweat. The actions occurring in front of his eyes were so shocking that they made an Entity break into a cold sweat!","In the mystical Realm filled with plains of green, the Sword Emperor looked at the scene where his Sword Kings had reduced by more than 10 in less than a minute.","’Is this his current Peak state of power? Extremely powerful, but...’","Even as the Sword Emperor saw Entity after Entity fall, his eyes only shone brightly as he remained placid.","\"...but it is still not enough!\"","RUMBLE!","Yes!","Even though it was a tremendous show of power, the Sage still shook his head as he knew it wasn’t enough!","\"Against the suicidal Sages from the Spirit Race...it is not enough!\"","The Sword Emperor had a thoughtful look as he thought about the incorporeal beings that were the Spirit Race.","When taking into account every powerful being in the Dark Universe, they were the only ones that deviated from the common goal of trying to prevent the apocalypse of their Universe.","At this juncture, Morgana had flown into a rage as she nearly declared a war, the Sword Emperor being the one to pull her back as they digested what just occurred.","The answer had been so shocking that the two of them could not make heads or tails of why.","Why would anyone not want to save their own home?!","As he thought of this, the eyes of the Sword Emperor shone like resplendent lanterns as he decided...the last step truly had to be taken.","\"For the Dark Universe.\"","THRUM!","In the starry space of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, Noah was moving with closed eyes as he swung his swords while causing an eruption of skills.","Every time he swung, an Entity fell as there seemed to be a grand symphony of destruction that only he was conducting!","Dao Crystals, Assimilation Crystals, Cores, and Skill Books filled the area as they blazed with immense loot light.","Noah’s senses occasionally picked up on the numerous law Assimilation Crystals as he knew a 100% Assimilation of All Laws was not too far away!","RUMBLE!","So he moved with even more vigor as the Grand symphony of death and destruction continued, Entity after Entity disappearing from the stellar space like mere flies!"]},{"number":853,"title":"Chapter 853: Chapter 852 - The Last Boss is a Sage! I","paragraphs":["In the merged second to last level of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, a shocking sight was wrapping up as Traverser could hardly believe it.","The Sword Kings that were being thrashed left and right through the spamming of GALAXY Rank skills as one of them fell every time the terrifying Tyrannical Entity waved his swords...even they did not believe it!","The pure ridiculousness of a single being with his 8 pets decimating over 70 Entities was simply unheard of, but when one put Noah’s abilities into account- it wasn’t an impossibility.","One could look at it in a way that even though he was acting like a single Entity, the fact that he released numerous skills constantly was akin to him doing the job of multiple Entities- thus, the difference of numbers was overcome by sheer skill!","THRUM!","Yet another Entity fell as Noah finally opened his eyes after a whole minute.","His starry eyes shone with resplendent light as when he closed them, over 60 Sword Kings were fighting against his pets and himself.","Countless casts of [Sword of Revelation], [Starry Flow of the Sword], and [Wrath of the Sword King] along with the oppressive and ever present ||Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust|| had occurred in this single minute that his eyes were closed- with his pets releasing their own resplendent skills as well.","A minute later, he opened his eyes as he saw...just 5 Emperors remaining on the starry space!","Each of them were spread apart as their c.h.e.s.ts heaved, their eyes trembling in fear!","That’s right! The hearts of the fearsome Sword Kings, Entities who spent thousands of years learning the Grand Dao of the Sword and built strong minds and bodies...these beings couldn’t help but tremble as they witnessed the situation where tens of Entities perished in less than a minute as they were the only ones remaining!","An average of a second for the fall of an Entity.","How ridiculous!","How unfair!","How glorious!","THRUUUM!","Noah felt his body erupt with even more essence as at this point, it seemed to be moving on muscle memory as he rushed towards the remaining Entities.","His pets weren’t to be left behind as the Golden Crow released blazing golden flames, the Blue Slime swallowing another Entity as pillars of scorching flames erupted from Tiamat!","It did not take long before there was complete silence on the battlefield, the only things that could be heard being the crackling sounds of essence that coursed through the bodies of a single Entity and his 8 Summons.","In the starry space of this level of the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, the glimmering pillars of gorgeous loot light could be seen brightly as an innumerable number of Dao Comprehension Crystals, Law and Dao Assimilation Crystals, and resplendent GALAXY cores could be seen floating freely.","Noah’s figure grandly floated in the starry space as he stared at all this and the significance of exactly what he had done.","Even when he did find out about and began mingling with Entities weeks ago, they seemed like magisterial positions that were filled with power and might!","Yet...here he was a few weeks later...where he had just personally carried out the decimation of 73 Entities in a matter of minutes, with the majority dying in a single minute.","He did that!","\"OOOOOOH!\"","He released a primal bellow that seemed to emanate victory and power, his multicolored figure shining grandly in the starry space that he came out the grand champion of.","\"...\"","The Illusory screen showing him to the Sword Emperor and Traverser were silent as they observed his figure to go towards the glimmering cl.u.s.ters of loot light, seeing this as the unique ability of the Master of Ruination that allowed him to absorb the strength of others.","The Sword Emperor looked at this scene with shining eyes as many thoughts crossed his mind.","’Maybe...’","RUMBLE!","Spatial essence spread out wildly as the area the Tyrannical Emperor was in shone with light, the figures on the starry space disappearing.","WAP!","In the mystical realm filled with verdant grasslands where the Sword Emperor was at, the disappeared figures of Noah and his 8 pets could now be seen!","They looked around the mystical area that emanated peace and wonder, their eyes honing in on the figure not too far from them that released not an ounce of power.","Seemingly like a normal Arch Human that had never cultivated their strength, the Sword Emperor rose from the verdant plains as he turned towards them.","He was dressed in simple white robes as even without any oppressive air being released by him, one would be able to notice the distinct demeanor and aura of a being that had accomplished a major milestone.","The unique aura of a Sage...Noah was able to come face to face with it for the first time as his eyes showed utter calm!","The dark hair of the Sword Entity flowed beautifully in the wind as within his right hand, the simple sword that was lying on his l.a.p before appeared.","The moment this sword was held, the very air surrounding the Sword Emperor warped and trembled as an immense aura threatened to pour out!","Noah’s eyes shone brightly as he locked eyes with this being that made many things possible for him due to the Immemorial Sword Dungeon.","He was immensely thankful, and also wanted to give him the respect he deserved by completing his wishes for the Immemorial Sword Dungeon! So his figure moved the moment he arrived in this mystical realm filled with verdant plains, turning into a streak of light as he appeared in front of the Sage in an instant.","He moved against a Sage without so much as a word!"]},{"number":854,"title":"Chapter 854: Chapter 853 - The Last Boss is a Sage! II","paragraphs":["SHIING!","Noah’s swords that were dense with the essence of Death and Aether flashed dangerously towards the neck of this wondrous Sage in front of him as he wanted to test out exactly what this stage entailed!","BZZZT","Yet as his swords neared the body of the Sage, his eyes opened wide as he saw the expression of the Sword Emperor clearly. The eyes were like a vast body of water as they were filled with utter calm.","He did not lift up the sword in his right hand to block, but merely raised his left hand!","A simple palm reflected on Noah’s eyes, but this palm seemed to have covered his entire eyesight as the trajectory of the two swords of Death and Aether were pulled towards it, both of them striking against this palm as a sound akin to two metals hitting resounded.","CLAAANG!","...!","\"You do not yet understand the meaning of the word Sage.\"","THRUM!","The voice of the Sword Emperor rang out clearly as Noah saw the palm that was seamlessly and without worry holding his two swords...pinch down.","The universal essence that made up the two swords shattered!","\"Let me show you.\"","The voice of the sword emperor rang out again as Noah’s body, even with all the boots of speed, seemed to be extremely slow in the face of the palm that shattered his two swords, his eyes only registering this same palm coming towards his body as before he could even have the thought of evading it, it smashed into him!","...BOOOOOOOM!","A simple palm without an ounce of energy.","A simple palm that was more powerful than any attack Noah had taken.","SHAA!","His figure tore through the skies of the mystical verdant Realm as he smashed into the wings of the ten headed Tiamat, the monstrous Animus letting out a painful sound as Noah’s figure tore through her sturdy wings while his figure continued to fly out from the impact!","...!","The figures of the Golden Crow and the Obsidian Panther flashed towards Noah’s flashing figure as the fast summons appeared behind him, using their bodies to bring his barreling figure to a halt as the scene they saw caused flames of anger to erupt from their hearts.","Half of Noah’s body was missing as a wriggling mass of bones and muscles very quickly regenerated!","\"Haaa...\"","He let out a guttural breath as his eyes were red and filled with blood, looking incredulously towards the lone figure of the Sword Emperor that had thrown a mere palm his way and shattered his defenses as half of his body was wiped out!","ROAAAR!","OOOOOH!","His pets roared furiously at this scene as they pounced towards the Sage, this powerful being not even glancing at them as his eyes remained on Noah.","\"The full assimilation of multiple Daos opens the way to something that only those at the stage of Sage and above enjoy, something that is inviolable in strength and power.\"","WAP!","The baleful attacks of Noah’s pets hit the air as the Sword Emperor appeared above Noah’s rapidly regenerating figure, another palm descending down from him as even the Obsidian Panther was not fast enough to prevent it!","BOOM!","Noah had only begun giving the command to his mana to teleport his body when the palm landed on him again.","THUNK!","His figure smashed into the ground as numerous bones cracked, yet they also healed nearly instantly later as the essence of all Universal Laws had begun filling up his injured body with even more vigor!","\"You heal nearly instantly. If you can keep this up, maybe you’ll learn something.\"","The moment Noah’s body was about to fully reform as new skin covered the regenerated muscles, the figure of the Sword Emperor appeared beside him on the ground as his left hand reached out once more, this time clasping onto his shoulder as a moment later, Noah felt like he was locked on by an unmovable object.","\"Here is the first lesson- When one steps into the title of a Sage, they gain access to something called Primordial Essence.\"","Noah’s shining eyes looked at the figure that was nonchalantly talking while holding him in place, his body erupting in multicolored essences as an innumerable number of miniaturized stellar bodies bloomed from him, countless illusory swords also coming out as they all went towards the Sword Emperor!","Sin of Pride and Envy were also running at full steam from Noah’s body as he looked at the Sage, yet this being only shook his head as he felt a foreign power try to affect him, the stellar bodies conjured and the illusory stellar rivers of swords not even reaching his body as they seemed to evaporate from a thin film of light.","\"In front of true strength, tricks are meaningless.\"","The hand that clasped onto his shoulder like a metal clamp released a unique essence onto Noah’s body, this essence washing over the universal laws essence he conjured up in the form of armament as it utterly shredded it once more, and then proceeded to enter his body as he felt a searing pain in his origin and soul!","\"As I was saying- Primordial Essence. It is the access of this unique power that opens the door of true power to Sages, Great Sages, and all those above them. It is also the reason why right now even with all the attacks you used to decimate my Sword Kings...even you can do nothing but defend.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah felt his mangled body shake as a foreign essence ravaged him, his body thrown behind like a rag doll while his pets tried playing catch up with the figure of the Sword Emperor once more.","This being clad in a white robe simply warped across space as he evaded the attacks of the Animus Summons with ease, his brows lifting up a little as when he warped to a certain place in the skies, the silent figure of a vibrant blue slime was somehow already there as its body ballooned up to try and devour him!","WAP!","Yet before the body of the slime could expand, the Sage was much, much faster as he flashed away, a thoughtful look on his face.","\"Truly Interesting.\"","He floated in the skies grandly as he watched the figures of all of Noah’s pets stand in front of his mangled and healing body, their eyes filled with fury as they stared at the Sword Emperor.","Noah finished regenerating a second later due to all his support skills that were further enhanced by the Law of Life and the Dao of Vitality, his soul still feeling pulsating pain from the foreign essence that had just ravaged him.","He sat on the flat ground of the green plains as he breathed sporadically, his heart beating fast as he looked towards the being termed a Sage in front of him in shock!","This...what the f.u.c.k was this?!","The shocking scene of the Tyrannical Entity that had been decimating other Entities left and right...the scene of this same Entity getting thrashed played out in mystical Realm as the robe of a Sage remained white and clear, his eyes gazing down towards the Tyrannical Entity as he uttered dominating words.","\"This...is the power of a Sage.\"","THRUUUUM!","It was pure speed he could not keep up with!","It was pure power he could not defend against!","It was the wondrous power of a Sage!"]},{"number":855,"title":"Chapter 855: Chapter 854 - Primordial Essence!","paragraphs":["When Noah had met the Sword Kings of the Consummate Sword Expanse before, they had repeated to him multiple times that the ’Will of the Sword Emperor’ would always be followed.","He thought this was mere fanaticism to the Sage of their Ancient Power, but he now realized it was something much grander as he felt the power of the Sage for himself!","He was releasing such dominating strength that Noah nearly activated Plot Armor to achieve a state of invincibility, but he held it off.","This wasn’t a life and death situation, and as much as the Sword Emperor was thrashing him around, he didn’t actually want to kill him.","This could be seen by how he was freely talking while throwing out his palms, and also why he wasn’t throwing these powerful attacks to Noah’s summons as the Sage targeted him alone!","Noah listened to the words of the Sage as he felt the tinge of damage to his soul and Origin from his last attack, his eyes landing on the figure majestically floating in the skies of this verdant realm as the details of the Sage appeared in front of him.","<strong>[Sword Emperor] :: A Sage that has lived for tens of thousands of years and experienced the vicissitudes of life. He has completely assimilated the Grand Dao of the Sword, and the Lesser Daos of Voidspace and Alacrity. The complete assimilation of more than 2 Daos has allowed this being to gain access to Primordial Essence...</strong>","Noah’s eyes shone as he read the information of this wondrous being, his eyes honing in on the words this Sage had mentioned before that apparently granted him such tremendous power- Primordial Essence!","<strong>[Primordial Essence] :: The abstruse essence that gave birth to the Primordial Cosmos. One can gain access to it in a myriad of ways, but beings that have assimilated 2 or more Daos can access slivers of it to descend onto them to allow for the refining and purification of their body and soul. Those in the stage of a Sage will at most be able to purify 10% of their body and soul, those at the stage of a Great Sage being able to purify at least 25%...the assimilation of more Daos will open up a wider path for the transmission of Primordial Essence and allow a being to increase the percentage of their body they can refine and purify....</strong>","Terrifying information entered Noah’s mind.","They gained access to Primordial Essence that allowed them to purify their bodies, that being the reason why the Sword Emperor seemingly had such overwhelming strength when he faced Noah.","One would be keen to remember that as a Sage, he could only refine and purify 10% of his body with the Primordial Essence over his long lifespan, only able to increase this percentage if he became a Great Sage!","Yet even this level...Noah as an Entity could barely keep up with it...","\"Good!\"","Noah bellowed out with shining eyes as he looked at the Sage floating above. He was truly thankful to this being as he had opened his eyes to the path forward, a glorious path of power that he wished to grasp with his own hands.","THRUUUM!","Essence vibrated out as Noah thought about a great deal of things in a few seconds. He came to a decision as all of his animus pets aside from the Blue Slime all turned into streaks of light that returned to his origin!","The slime rested on his head with keen eyes that looked at the Sage with great fervor.","The Sword Emperor stared at the two beings below him with a starry gaze as his voice rang out once more.","\"You’ve seen the strength of a Sage. What will you do to stand against it?\"","The Sage threw out a domineering question as his mystical eyes locked with the Tyrannical Entity. He was hoping for this being to surprise him again as he was looking for something- something that would make him comfortably leave the task of preventing the Apocalypse of their Universe.","He wondered what this something would be!","Noah glanced at this powerful being with shining eyes as he voiced out simply.","\"Give me just a minute.\"","RUMBLE!","The eyes of the Sage constricted as he heard this, a smile appearing on his face as he wondered, what could one do within a minute?!","---","A minute walk neither long nor short, as one could use it in a myriad of ways.","Noah’s now unmerged clones that were separated from the Animus Summons appeared in a circle within a Time Space of the Infinite Galaxy.","In the circle the clones were surrounding, numerous glistening loot that represented Law Assimilation Crystals lay gorgeously, the count being so high after Noah took out more than 130+ Entities from the Immemorial Sword Dungeon!","These Crystals would be more than enough to completely have his Assimilation of All Laws percentage to 100%!","The gift of the Sword Emperor had truly been too grand, accelerating his timeline greatly as each of the clones grabbed the assimilation crystals...and began absorbing them rapidly.","Waves of essence flowed out gorgeously as the clones worked in conjunction, the speed of the percentage shooting up greatly as it crossed the 50% threshold in seconds!","THRUUUM!","In the outside space, not even a second had passed after Noah voiced out that he would only need a minute, the Sage seeing his body exploding out with all Universal Law essences as a storm of it began to swirl around him.","’Universal Laws? What can this do...?’","The Sage only had this thought as he quickly focused, noticing the storm of universal law essences around Noah only getting wilder and wilder!","Within the Infinite Galaxy, the Clones had already gone through half of the Assimilation Crystals in the loot pile as a second outside was 100 seconds in here, the clones working fast as the percentage next to All Universal Laws Assimilation crossed 80%.","RUMBLE!","Relentlessly and ridiculously, Noah went towards the goal of accomplishing 100% Assimilation in all Universal Laws by using the method given from the Book of Ruination, this method promising the birth of a Cosmic Dao!","The Cosmic Dao of Ruination!"]},{"number":856,"title":"Chapter 856: Chapter 855 - All Laws Assimilated! Cosmic Dao!","paragraphs":["One would wonder how or why the Book of Ruination listed that the assimilation of all Universal Laws using the technique it gave would make one step on the path of the Cosmic Dao that also had the name of the Cosmic Treasure- Ruination.","There were Daos that existed which came from a combination of Laws or laws and other concepts, the Dao of Four Elements and the Dao of Voidspace being among them.","Yet there was nothing as unique as the birth of something that came from the assimilation of all Universal Laws!","Of course, there were many Sages, Great Sages, and even beings in the levels of power above that tried a myriad of ways to seek power- some of them taking tens of thousands or hundreds of thousands of years to comprehend all laws and assimilate them to see if they could give birth to something truly powerful and unique.","This was how the Daos of Four Elements and Voidspace came to be in the past- due to powerful beings in the Universal Realm researching this path and coming to these Daos as achievements.","Through their tremendous power, they then actualized these Daos as they came to fruition!","This was Dao Birth!","Yet never before in history had a being been successful in assimilating all laws and making something with them.","It wasn’t to say some didn’t try, with past Universal Realm powerhouses in the Primordial Cosmos assimilating all laws but not being able to succeed in fusing them to produce something.","None of them were like Noah who had first comprehended all of the universal laws without assimilating any of them.","He was first an anomaly that had been able to comprehend all laws at such a low Realm of power, and he was lucky enough that he didn’t assimilate them as he comprehended them!","When he did assimilate them...it was when he obtained a page from the Book of Ruination that listed the technique to do it, and he began by assimilating and fusing all the laws in the beginning stages as all of them were grouped together under All Universal Laws Assimilation.","Nobody had done it before, as nobody had received instructions from a Cosmic Treasure to do so.","Now, he was nearing 100% in this task after he utilized skill points to create a wondrous skill that allowed him to devour the assimilations of others!","THRUUUUM!","Gorgeous colors of lights were surrounding the group of clones that had Law Assimilation Crystals in their hands, their bodies glowing with a rainbow of colors as their eyes shot out beams of light!","In the outside world, the Sage’s eyes were opened wide as he stated with surprise towards Noah, only a few seconds having passed since this being uttered domineering words, and now a unique aura erupted from him.","This ’red’ swirled around him wildly as it carried an Ancient air with every passing second, the aura of something grand stemming forth from it as the Sage was now looking at Noah with immense shock!","\"This aura! This air!\"","The Sage focused on the scene as he sensed an aura of old erupt out, an Aura that reeked of ancientness that should not in any way be coming from the young being!","This aura caused Noah’s body to be lifted to the skies as it was cradled by the red essence that danced around him wildly, his eyes opening as they shot out glorious beams of red light, this outburst causing a flash of red that even required the Sage to close his eyes from it.","OOOOOOOH!","A primal bellow released from Noah at this moment as his body felt a tremendous amount of power flowing through!","He floated grandly as he had achieved 100% in assimilating all laws, the moment he did so giving him something he had longed for ever since he learned of it- a Cosmic Dao!","WAAA!","The air cleared as his figure became visible for all to see. Even the Blue Slime was pushed off of him when all the essences around him turned red, the Blue blob also turning to look as its master as its eyes shook.","His hair was waving wildly atop his head as it had also taken the color of the red aura, turning into a bloody crimson color!","Everything...red!","RUMBLE!","The aura that Noah released at this moment was like nothing that even the Sage had come across before, Noah himself looking within him as he searched for the answer.","The answer of course...was the newly comprehended Cosmic Dao!","<strong>[Cosmic Dao of Ruination] :: A dao that many have searched for, but nobody has stepped on. A single being- Noah Osmont, has now begun embarking on as they will be the first to experience its mysteries. Just by comprehending this Dao, the boost of +10,000% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation of All Daos is granted, along with +10,000% to All Parameters(Damage, Defense, Attack Speed, Cast Speed, Health Regeneration, Health Reserves, Mana Regeneration, Mana Reserves, Resistances, Mental Processing, Soul Defense...). When one fully comprehends this Cosmic Dao, the boosts will be DOUBLED. When one fully assimilates this Cosmic Dao, the boosts will be QUINTUPLED. A Cosmic Dao such as this requires for it to be comprehend and assimilated by the soul- aside from Ruination itself, outside resources or treasures will yield no help. The one comprehending this Dao gains access to Ruination Essence, a type of essence that exists outside of the Primordial Cosmos- they can slowly use this essence to refine their body and soul into the deadliest weapon. Currently, the user can refine and purify up to 15% of their body and soul...at the full comprehension stage, the cap is increased to 35%, with the full assimilation stage allowing for up to 100% purification and assimilation. The user comprehending this Dao also gains the Absolute Skills that can only be activated through a counterpart of this Dao- the Cosmic Treasure Ruination. This Dao also allows one to seamlessly utilize the Cosmic Treasure Ruination as all Affix Effects are doubled. More mysteries of this Cosmic Dao wait to be discovered as the one comprehending it forges towards complete Assimilation...</strong>","\"...f.u.c.k.\"","Even Noah was speechless as what he had unlocked was simply too balance breaking!","RUUUUUUUMBLE!"]},{"number":857,"title":"Chapter 857: Chapter 856 - Who needs Primordial Essence?! I","paragraphs":["The Sword Emperor was staring towards Noah’s figure incredulously as he could sense an aura of ancientness from it!","An aura that seemed to scream of power as it wildly waved around him, an Aura he had not come across before.","\"This...\"","While he could not figure it out, Noah himself had just read about the Glorious rewards he received from the full assimilation of the universal laws.","A Cosmic Dao!","A Dao that only the top experts of the Primordial Cosmos even had a chance of enjoying, and his Dao was one of a kind as nobody had even embarked on it but him.","Its effects...were simply stupendous, but he wanted to get over the disappointment first!","The disappointment related to the sentence in the description that he read- [A Cosmic Dao such as this requires for it to be comprehend and assimilated by the soul- aside from Ruination itself, outside resources or treasures will yield no help.]","A sentence that screamed of someone trying to make things harder for him!","Comprehending the Cosmic Dao would have been hard enough as he would have had to do it all by himself, but he at least thought assimilation would be a breeze as he had the Dao Assimilation Crystals.","Yet the Tier of a Cosmic Dao was so high that in its description it listed no outside resources would be of use. Assimilation Crystals and all their wonders...would be no use on Cosmic Daos! Due to this, Noah nearly wanted to revolt...","But he was pacified as he read about the stupendous effects the Cosmic Dao gave him, starting with the boosts that were purely on the realm of ridiculousness.","Just from comprehending the Cosmic Dao, he received boosts similar to a being that had comprehended and assimilated a Grand Dao!","For him, it was even higher as it was +10,000% to All Parameters. It wasn’t just All Damage or Speed...but all parameters!","Even Grand Daos gave the full +10,000 boost once assimilated to one or two parameters, but this Cosmic Dao said f.u.c.k all that as it added it to everything!","He...he truly had no words for this.","It meant the +10,000% base would become +20,000% at full comprehension, and this +20,000% would become +100,000% at full Assimilation!","What a magisterial set of numbers! What balance breaking reality!","Noah’s eyes searched the description of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination with fervor as he came upon the mention of Ruination Essence.","He had just learned about Primordial Essence, the unique essence that actually birthed the Primordial Cosmos and could be accessed when one was in the stage of a Sage.","Yet ridiculously...merely comprehending the Cosmic Dao granted him access to something called Ruination Essence that had effects and caps that seemed much more resplendent than even the Primordial Essence.","THRUUUM!","His body that was covered by a wild blazing aura looked to the skies as he stretched his hands out.","Since he had access to this stupendous Essence, he would utilize it to strengthen himself!","His actions caused the essence of the Cosmic Dao to swirl above him, rapidly spinning in a circle as space seemed to be getting torn.","TRHUM!","A second later, the swirling stopped as Noah’s eyes squinted while observing at the center of the circle of red essence, a black hole the size of one inch appeared!","This black hole was extremely dark as shockingly, it was reminiscent of something we had come across before- the Fractures that tore apart the Desolate Galaxies!","Yet Noah didn’t know of this as he looked at the small one inch hole, his outstretched hands making a grasping motion as a tendril of thick crimson liquid began to leak out of it.","RUMBLE!","The Sword Emperor was staring at the scene in front of him in shock at this point as what was occurring was simply unbelievable!","This was because the sight of essence swirling in a circle to create a small opening that had a unique liquid essence pour out of it...this scene was extremely similar to what he was able to do when he became a Sage.","This was how he obtained the Primordial Essence, and the small hole he could access it from as a Sage was less than half an inch!","...CRACK!","One could hear the shout of something shattering, but it wasn’t space this time as the horrid sound came from Noah’s body.","OOOOM!","The moment he swallowed the liquid Ruination Essence, it felt like something had broken within him as an instant later, it was being rapidly resounded- and at extremely high speeds at that!","The crimson liquid Ruination Essence pierced into his origin and soul as it bathed it entirely, and it then proceeded to cause Noah the most intense pain he had ever felt in his entire life as...it began to burn.","Purify!","The essence was purifying his body and soul, and it had to do so in the most excruciating manner possible as his face was drained of all color while he bellowed out.","OOOOOH!","It was a bellow of pain and frustration, a bellow of feeling his soul burning inside out!","THUMP!","The sound of his heart beating was like a drum, pound and resplendent as he came out of the pain of Purification for the first time while feeling like a new man.","OOOOH!","He couldn’t help but release another triumphant bellow as his now crimson hair waved around wildly, his eyes shooting out luminous beams of red light!"]},{"number":858,"title":"Chapter 858: Chapter 857 - Who needs Primordial Essence?! II","paragraphs":["The stellar image of Noah floating in the skies glimmering with red all around was extremely striking.","His bright eyes glanced at his Stat Panel as he noticed yet another addition that he focused on!","[Ruination Essence Purification Effects](Currently .1%) :: +1000% to all Parameters.","\"...\"","Ruination Essence!","His body and soul that was purified with such resplendent essence was given a huge boost merely at .1%...","This was the type of power that made the Sage in front of Noah so powerful- he had purified his body with what was known as Primordial Essence, most likely gaining huge percentages in all Parameters as he moved with great power!","Yet Noah’s Cosmic Dao of Ruination granted him +10,000% in all Parameters outright, while his purifying of his body and soul just now with the Ruination Essence that existed outside of the Primordial Cosmos...granted him +1000% to All Parameters!","That +1000%...was just him purifying his body and soul by .1%.","This meant that when he purified his body and soul by 1%, he would gain another 10,000% in All Parameters.","\"...fuuuuck!\"","Noah’s brain nearly exploded at this reality, as one must recall that in the case of Primordial Essence, Sages could only use it to purify 10% of their body and soul while Great Sages were only upped to 25%!","Meanwhile, Noah could utilize this Ruination Essence to purify up to 15% at his current stage, and 35% when he fully comprehended the Cosmic Dao.","His Parameters had the capabilities to exceed a normal Sage just in the level he was at currently!","One must also remember...there was also the Primordial Essence that Noah had not even begun using.","It created such a wondrous possible future that Noah wasn’t sure how it would all turn out.","Such power!","Such magisterial possibilities!","This wasn’t even all...","The skies of the mystical realm quaked and tumbled as the aura Noah released became more and more oppressive. This was due to the fact that with the advantage of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, the Affix Effects of the Ruination Cores were now doubled.","Doubled!","This means he currently had +20,000% increase to All Damage for one affix, and +20,000+ increase to Attack and Cast Speed for the other!","This was on top of the base +10,000% to All Parameters that the Cosmic Dao of Ruination gave, now was it putting into account the +1000 to All Parameters from Noah purifying his body with Ruination Essence.","All in all, even without putting the boosts of the Aura of the fully Comprehended Daos of the Sword and Withering in the picture, over +31,000% in boosts were currently rushing through Noah’s body!","Ah!","RUMBLE!","His hands then shot up to the skies once more as he tried to utilize his essence to cause another one inch circle to appear and release more Ruination Essence, but found to his dismay nothing coalescing in front of him.","\"...if that Essence is similar to what I think it is, you won’t be able to call it forth again until your body is capable of handling another round of purification. For others, this could be a day, with the less talented needing weeks or months.\"","The being in question turned his vibrant eyes to gaze upon the Sage staring at him in a stupor as he replied.","\"Seems I took a bit longer than a minute, my apologies!\"","His crimson hair that was affected by the essence of Ruination waved wildly as he turned his eyes towards the Sage.","He wondered if this being had already purified his body to the max of 10% for the level of a Sage...if he already had +100,000 increase in All Parameters due to the Primordial Essence!","\"What...is that?\" The Sage’s eyes swirled with wisdom as he couldn’t help but ask, the implications of what he was seeing being too grand.","Noah’s eyes squinted as he thought for less than a second before he made up his mind, his voice ringing out domineeringly thereafter.","\"You mentioned the Primordial Essence that I couldn’t grasp yet, so I simply went ahead and began comprehending the Cosmic Dao of Ruination. It just so happened that it gave me access to Ruination Essence that is as potent if not more than the Primordial Essence.\"","\"...!!!\"","RUMBLE!","Essence similar to Primordial Essence! And he...he accessed it by simply comprehending a Cosmic Dao?!","Such bullshit was enough to cause the mind of the Sage to spin as he tightly looked at this being in front of him.","Even his great Master had not been able to catch a wisp of a Cosmic Dao, and the vast majority of beings in the Primordial Cosmos were in the same boat as those that were capable enough and had embarked on a Cosmic Dao were few and far in between.","’Master of Ruination...Cosmic Dao of Ruination...it would not be too far fetched!’","The Sage thought simply as he nodded to Noah with a smile.","He had a smile on his face as he felt like the words of his Master were ringing in his ears at this time.","He had seen the ’something’ he needed to ascertain this being could truly lead them against the Spirit Race and obtain the remainder of the Ruination Cores to stop the coming Apocalypse!","He could hear the words of his Master who had condemned himself along with many Sages and Great Sages to death just to give the Dark Universe enough time to give birth to the Master of Ruination...and that time was actually here.","\"Come. O Master of Ruination! Let me see the extent of your power!\"","The Sage bellowed out grandly as an immense aura shot forth from him, his right hand rightly grasping the Sword as he finally felt like he could use his full power against this being!","\"OOOOOH!\"","Noah’s bellow reverberated out as the swirling essence of Ruination swirled around him with even more vigor, his Blazing red eyes sending out pillars of light as his crimson hair waved wildly, his hands making a grasping motion as two crimson Swords appeared on them!","Swords made from the essence of Ruination.","Swords containing the essence of a Cosmic Dao!","With these in hand, his figure flashed towards a powerful Sage..."]},{"number":859,"title":"Chapter 859: Chapter 858 - I Can See You!","paragraphs":["In the mystical realm filled with bright greenery, the skies were crying out in fear as at this moment, a figure clad in a red aura moved to instantly appear in front of a Sage as he bore his two frighteningly crimson swords over!","SHAA!","The image of the Sage disappeared as the swords hit air, his voice ringing out in the surroundings as it seemed to occupy everything.","\"With this power up, you should be able to handle a strike from my sword...\"","RUMBLE!","His words ended with the loud ringing of a sword being drawn, the right hand that held the sword finally being drawn and active as the Sage who had purified his body with Primordial Essence...this Sage now attacked seriously!","His image was fleeting as he moved across the skies, his eyes observing the swirling red aura around Noah that seemed to actually give him a sense of danger.","’Was the essence of a Cosmic Dao so powerful? That its mere usage would make a Sage be careful of it?’","His sword was striking down mercilessly on Noah’s right shoulder, being merely an instant away from striking it...but the red light around Noah became even more luminescent as the eyes of the Sword Emperor observed tremendous speed he was familiar with, this speed somehow keeping up with his strike as instead of his sword drawing the blood and limbs of Noah- he found the vibrant red swords this Tyrannical Entity held to actually clash against his!","BZZZT!","Space cracked and cried out at the clash, the Sage watching as his strike was countered for the first time since this battle!","He saw the eyes of Noah that were blazing with intense red light, the voice of this Tyrannical Entity ringing out against his ears clearly.","\"I can see you, Sword Emperor.\"","...!","BOOOM!","Their swords bounced off each other as the Sword Emperor remained still, Noah being the one to be pushed off with the attack!","But with this, he had successfully defended against a Sage with his own power for the first time.","\"Very good!\"","The eyes of the Sword Emperor glimmered with light as he spoke, his eyes opening ever wider as in the next moment, his aura picked up spatial teleportation as multiple figures clad in a shocking red aura began to appear around him.","RUMBLE!","Figures holding the same face as Noah, yet their bodies letting out even more terrifying power as it was his clones that could ridiculously display not just his full power, but 120% of it!","Each of them had the red essence of Ruination vibrantly swarming around them, their crimson hair wildly flying around as they held the same exact red swords as Noah.","\"I hope you won’t mind my clones joining the fight.\"","The main Noah spoke as the appearance of 8 clones and the pressure they released constantly destabilized the skies.","\"It is a part of your strength. Let us see if it will help you!\"","WAA!","||Primal Supremacy Swords||","...","DING!","The moment his words finished, a ringing sound erupted out...and then continued to erupt out en masse as it rang over tens of thousands of times in an instant.","With every ringing, there was the appearance of a bright blue sword as the instantaneous ringing of tens of thousands of times caused for the appearance of tens of thousands of blue swords!","They formed columns and rows around the entire area as before Noah and his clones could even blink, an innumerable number of swords had appeared between each of them! The skies turned into a sea of deadly swords that moved with the command of the Sword Emperor, this being coldly releasing the command for the Primal Supremacy Swords he had called for to descend onto their enemies.","RUMBLE!","Noah’s essence moved rapidly as the abilities from [The Way of the Sword] skill tree were utilized, this time the starry rivers of swords and gigantic blades raining down being backed by the essence of a Cosmic Dao as they tried to protect their Master from the stupendous strength of a Sage that had an unknown percentage of his body already purified by Primordial Essence!","BOOOM!","---","As the shocking battle went underway in the Consummate Sword Expanse, another being of stupendous power was tearing acoss the chaotic void while making her way to this very same Ancient Power.","The small body of the being known as Big Sis Morgana had a furious expression on her face as she used her b.a.r.e hands to tear apart the chaotic void and fold space as she constantly warped across, yet even with such shocking actions she still felt like she was too slow!","\"Surrounded by idiots in this f.u.c.k.i.n.g Universe! Others are suicidal, others are fools that believed old geezers too much!\"","Her wrathful voice rang out to nobody as she moved, venting her anger as she moved while talking!","\"That Old Geezer had foreseen that they would all die and their actions would give time for a powerful being to rise and successfully protect the Dark Universe? Bullshit! Who alone can protect an entire Universe? A mere kid just entering the rank of an Entity is the answer???\"","RUMBLE!","\"You better not kill yourself for such stupid claims Kaiser...otherwise I’ll accelerate the destruction of this Universe with my own hands!\"","...!"]},{"number":860,"title":"Chapter 860: Chapter 859 - A Sages Sacrifice I","paragraphs":["Space was ruptured and trying to heal on all sides as the vibrant greenery in the mystical realm was torn down.","RIIIP!","Yet another tear in space erupted as the magnificent Sword Emperor swung his sword towards another clone, this clone barely managing to survive as the essence of Ruination held shocking properties that caused the dissolution of the strong essence this Sage released!","Yet even with such a feature, the Sage was still moving freely across the torn skies as at this moment, his pure Speed and power still exceeded Noah!","’Has he truly purified 10% of his body and soul with Primordial Essence?’","Noah’s thoughts moved at instantaneous speeds with the +10,000% boost to All Parameters that included his mental faculties, wondering if the Sage he was battling had already reached the shocking level of +100,000% to All Parameters with the purification of the Primordial Essence!","’In that case...\"","RUMBLE!","Essence wildly flew out as while the Sword Emperor was besieging a clone, the appearance of terrifying Tiamat reappeared in the skies that weren’t littered with as many terrifying blue swords, a clone clad in the red aura of Ruination merging with her right away before rejoining the battle- this time its power boosted as a terrifying Queen Dowager now moved while being assisted by the essence of a Cosmic Dao!","ROAAAR!","Tiamat let out a terrifying bellow when she felt this essence, her body being covered by it entirely as it reminded her of an age long ago.","It reminded her of when she ruled over large regions of the Animus Universe, when she wielded her own Cosmic Dao of Annihilation as she was the Progenitor! The being that ruled with domineering strength before she was betrayed by the other Rulers of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines!","ROAAR!","A second later, the appearance of the fearsome Jormungandr, Golden Crow, Oculothorax, Calamity Bear, Obsidian Panther, and the enormous Colossal Helios Leviathan made their appearance- Noah’s clones merging with them as their strength was vastly increased before they went to match the terrifying Sage!","At this moment, Noah was measuring the percent increase of [All Parameters] that this Sage had by continuously adding more and more strength gradually, and he so far found out that the percentage of purification for this Sage exceeded 5%!","RUMBLE!","Even while surrounded by the Animus Summons enhanced by the essence of a Cosmic Dao, he flashed through the skies while wielding his sword gloriously.","It felt like a single man with his swords standing against raging storms with ease as Noah observed the Sword Emperor to actually...close his eyes the moment he increased his power output by having his clones merge with his pets.","His eyes opened wide in shock as he saw this Sage with his closed eyes beginning to change, his 4 meter form gradually disappearing as something else was taking its place!","The voice of the Sword Emperor then rang out magisterially throughout the torn skies.","\"When you fully assimilate the Dao of the Sword, you truly become one with the Sword.\"","...!","A resplendent, gorgeously shining blue sword that was inscribed with numerous runic markings!","This sentient sword...tore through space as it instantly appeared above Tiamat, passing through her wings as they were instantly cut cleanly!","ROAR!","The Queen Dowager bellowed out furiously as muscles and bones tried to reform rapidly, the Sword Form of the terrific Sage having already flashed away as it went to strike towards another pet, Noah watching this scene with shock as the Sword Emperor...had really turned into a f.u.c.k.i.n.g sword!","One with the Sword!","SHAA!","The singular arch human in sword form tore through the skies as he began to dominate the battlefield once more, Noah’s pets falling on the defensive as Noah’s main body gave chase.","At this juncture, a variety of thoughts crossed Noah’s mind on how he could reign in this Sage, a myriad of answers popping up in his mind as one of them was Skills.","He now had a myriad of Daos, even grasping a Cosmic Dao that held terrifying boosts! What he needed now at this moment...was a skill that could put all of these Daos to use as he came out with something that could threaten a sage!","Millions of thoughts came and went through his mind as he calculated, finding all the different possibilities with Skill Creation as he pulled up the number of his Skill Points during this time.","[Skill Point(s) :: 98,245,252]","From the 30 million something skill points he had after the events of the Primal Winged Expanse, they had more than tripled as he tore through the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, each of the Sword Kings he defeated giving him hundreds of thousands of skill points!","While looking at these points and his current situation, a skill was quickly devised and calculated as it was placed in the Skill Creation tab.","<strong>GALAXY [Cardinal Sword of Ruination] :: An Unavoidable ability that locks on to the aura of the selected enemy and does not stop until it reaches the target, even if it had to traverse the entire Universe. The Cardinal Sword of Ruination will include the essence of the Daos of Ruination, Sword, and Withering as the base- the seamless inclusion of these dao essences granting +10,000 Physical and Soul Damage. Cost of Skill Creation: 30,000,000</strong>","A fairly simple skill design that played to the weakness Noah currently had when it came to the wondrous Sage in front of him- his attacks were evaded or did not reach the being!","The ability of Cardinal Sword of Ruination being unavoidable required 15 million Skill Points, the seamless inclusion of the Daos of Ruination, Sword, and Withering required 10 million Skill Points, as the +10,000 Physical and Soul Damage addition required 5 million more skill points.","Noah could have made an even more fearsome skill by using the remaining 60 millions skill points, but he saved these for a rainy day as he knew his true enemies within this Universe were the Spirit Race he was yet to meet. For the purposes of the slippery Sword Emperor...this should be enough!","RUMBE!","[Cardinal Sword of Ruination].[Cardinal Sword of Ruination].[Cardinal Sword of Ruination]...","WAA!","In the skies, humongous swords 10 meters large that glimmered and vibrated with the intense auras of 3 Daos began to appear, each of them shooting out like a guided missile as they went towards the far off Sword Emperor!","Mixtures of red and blue permeated throughout the swords as they appeared one after another, the first one reaching the Sword Emperor as this Sage in sword form merely flashed away from it to attack another one of Noah’s pets. Yet...the sword that he just evaded warped right where the Sword Emperor appeared, exploding gloriously as the essence of three Daos tore apart space and caused the shimmering Sage to pause!","BOOM!","Unavoidable!","The Sage had taken damage for the first time in a while from an attack his speed could somehow not evade.","It was the advent of a skill that Noah could spam against his enemies while he was light years away, a skill they wouldn’t be able to avoid as they had to be hit and either survive it with their sheer power and defenses- or face death!","RUMBLE!","A crucial juncture was about to occur in the battle within the mystical realm, a juncture that would cause for a magisterial outcome of this dreadful battle!","Yet amidst all of this, there was one thing that many might have forgotten or slipped out of their minds.","It was something that had been silent all this time even though it comprehended a great deal of Daos, more daos than even Noah and the Sword Emperor.","Hidden in the folds of space of the mystical Realm, a Blue Slime was quietly waiting for a chance.","It wanted the blood of a Sage.","It wanted to completely devour a Sage as it obtained that exact same strength!"]},{"number":861,"title":"Chapter 861: Chapter 860 - A Sages Sacrifice II","paragraphs":["Crimson red swords shot forth like missiles towards the Sword Emperor, each of them screaming resonantly as they would not stop until they smashed into him!","Wherever he teleported, wherever he disappeared to...the crimson Cardinal Swords of Ruination would be there!","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","Three of them exploded out in succession as the sharp auras of the Daos of Withering and Sword were bearable, but the essence of Ruination was deadly.","It was a much higher tier essence that even while just being at the stage of comprehension, Noah could command this essence to burn through the defenses of the Sword Emperor’s fully assimilated sword essence!","\"Good!\"","The vibrant shout of the Sage emanated out while he was in sword form, the coalescing of sword essence occurring as he remained in one spot and allowed all the chasing Cardinal Swords of Ruination to smash into him.","BZZZZT!","Space quaked and trembled as when the scene cleared, it showed ravaged sword essence as the bright blue sword that represented the Sage...had lost some of its l.u.s.ter!","Yet when the Sage expected recompense, he found out to his stupor that multiple more Cardinal Swords of Ruination were already heading his way. Noah had not stopped casting them for a single second as they seemed like homing missiles constantly rushing towards the Sword Emperor.","At the same time, the roar of an emotional Tiamat rang out as an enormous door appeared in the skies, this door opening rapidly to show the illusory form of a terrifying dragon head!","Its jaws opened as from them, purple red flames erupted out that filled the skies. The other summons moved with vigor while enhanced by Ruination, Jormungandr opening its jaws wide as the illusory form of a Galaxy Devouring Serpent appeared behind him- its terrifying force temporarily holding the Sage in place.","The purple red flames in the skies were joined by scorching golden flames, the Golden Crow looking at the Sage domineeringly as it released its fury!","All the other pets moved with vigor as the Sage was besieged on all sides, the homing missiles that were the Cardinal Sword of Ruination continuing to smash towards him and dealing constant damage.","But in the midst of all this...the Sage laughed!","\"Haha! Very good! With this, there is a chance!\"","As he felt the terrific power of this being that now had the strength of a beginner Sage even though he had not yet become one, the Sword Emperor felt like his Master’s words were close to fruition.","He knew that this being grew ever stronger from devouring the strength of others, and he attributed the current rapid rise in Noah’s power to be due to the Sword Kings he had been fed in the prior floors of the Immemorial Sword Formation.","He actually wasn’t too far off as this was actually the truth!","But the Sword Emperor knew that for the strength of this being to be even more stupendous, he had to be the last sacrifice!","Even at this point while he was besieged on all sides, he had a variety of ways with the Strength of a Sage to erupt with deadly strength and reap the lives of Noah’s pets or even possibly Noah himself, using his flames of life to choose mutual destruction.","But he didn’t do so as after experiencing the shocking strength and taking on the Cardinal Swords of Ruination that caused tiny cracks in his sword form, he finally stayed still as he was ready to make the ultimate sacrifice!","He knew that his Origin would be preserved due to the Immemorial Sword Formation, that he wouldn’t truly due. But still! He would be losing a large majority of his power as for the events to come...he would rest them on the hands of this being!","’Capable of comprehending a Cosmic Dao while not even being a Sage yet, how can I compare?’","BOOM! BOOOM!","Cardinal Swords of Ruination continued to smash into the sword form of the Sword Emperor as the attacks of the pets threatened to tear apart his strong layers of defenses unsuccessfully. His figure was like a lone sword swimming amongst the waves of destruction, peacefully passing through unhindered!","It was a truly wondrous scene as in the next moment, a Cardinal Sword of Ruination smashed into the Sage and threw him towards a certain direction.","It was a fold in space where a Blue Slime had been waiting patiently for the entirety of the battle.","WAA!","Its magisterial essence was released at this moment as its body ballooned to cover up the surrounding 20 meters instantly.","’Hmm?’","The Sage had a smile on his face as a brilliant blue light shone, his sword form evaporating as he turned back to his devilishly handsome 4 meter tall body the instant before an Absolute Skill was activated.","When he returned to his body, his serene eyes gazed towards Noah’s main body far off in the distance as they seemed to give him a singular message.","’I let you defeat me!’","It was the pride of a Sage that did not wish to fight to the death, where even while using his life and power to further his goals, he still let it be known that he was truly powerful!","<<Universal Devouring>>.","WAP!","The devilishly handsome figure of the Sword Emperor...then vanished.","\"...\"","It was the sacrifice of a Sage.","It was a selfless action that would be the reason for something wondrous to bloom, for the rise of a shocking being that would etch his name in the annals of history!"]},{"number":862,"title":"Chapter 862: Chapter 861 - A Slime Aspires to be a Sage!","paragraphs":["The mystical Realm that the Sword Emperor used to be in shook with instability.","Its beautiful scenery was utterly destroyed as Noah and his pets were the only ones remaining, all of their eyes on the position of the Blue Slime that had its wiggly body trembling in the skies!","RUUMBLE!","Spatial essence washed over all of them in the mystical realm as they were warped away, their figures forever disappearing from the Immemorial Sword Dungeon as they appeared in the starry space of the Consummate Sword Holy Land- the galaxy that was the core of the Ancient Power.","Not too far from them, over 100 Sword Kings were staring towards the figures of Noah and his pets with shining eyes, Brightsword and another Sword King hoisting up an extremely weakened Sage between them!","The eyes of the Sword Emperor were dim as they had lost their mystical light, his origin and soul heavily injured as he thought he had severely underestimated the unique ability of the Tyrannical Entity to devour the strength of his enemies.","Compared to his Sword Kings, he had lost over half of his strength as his body that was purified by Primordial Essence by more than 6%...it had somehow lost its purification as he barely held on to 1%!","He didn’t just lose half of his power like others defeated in the Immemorial Sword Dungeon, but nearly 90% of it as unlike what the Sage thought- it wasn’t Noah who was the most terrifying when it came to devouring enemies, but the blue slime!","Its Absolute Skill was extremely terrifying even in a dungeon that prevented the true deaths of those connected to it, it nearly swallowed all of them up. Such was the attack that devoured the Sword Emperor, his eyes ever so slowly regaining their lights as they locked on to the vibrating figure of the blue slime.","The eyes of Noah and his pets along with the Sword Kings and the Sage...they all looked towards the singular Blue Slime as at this moment, three shocking auras of completely assimilated Daos began to emulate from it!","Sword, Voidspace, and Alacrity!","The starry space above this slime cracked and sundered in the next moment as the bellowing of space being ripped apart rapidly to allow the spread of a wondrous type of essence took place!","The Sword Emperor watched in shock as a hole larger than a meter opened above the small slime- a whole numerous times larger than what he was always able to create to pull Primordial Essence to purify his body! Yet the slime had a hole over 1 meter open as shockingly, a dense amount of Primordial Essence rushed towards it and threatened to swallow its body.","Its Absolute Skill still wasn’t done with granting it 90% of the power of a Sage it was able to devour as the 90% of the purification the Sage had rushed towards him in the form of rivers of Primordial Essence.","This was over 5% purification occurring all at once!","It defied the rules and norms as even Noah was only able to purify only .1% when he first came in contact with Ruination Essence, but the Absolute Skill of the Blue Slime allowed it to be washed over by Primordial Essence as it forged towards 5% Purification.","AAAAAA!","A piercing scream erupted out from the wiggling body of the slime as the pain it went through was unlike anything that others would experience, no one having to ever withstand the essence that birthed the Primordial Cosmos in such large amounts all at once.","Noah felt this soul screeching scream even pass through the connection he had with the slime as it pleaded for him to share some of it!","The Blue Slime was truly pitiful as Noah bared his teeth while sharing the pain. He knew that once the Slime passed this ordeal, he would have genuine Sage battle power as the Blue Slime would gain over +50,000% boost to All Parameters from the purification it was currently undergoing, and such a number was something that was truly too fantastical to even think about!","A heart rending 5 minutes passed like this as the Slime withstood a tremendous amount of pain- pain that scorched one’s very body and soul...","When the hole in space closed and the Primordial Essence stopped flowing into its body, the Blue Slimer glimmered with light as it released a terrifying aura.","RUMBLE!","The fully assimilated Dao of the Sword, Voidspace, and Alacrity cradled its body up as to top it all, an intense pressure that came off from a being that had begun undergoing purification through Primordial Essence- the aura of a Sage glimmered off of the Blue Slime!","WAA!","It released a majestical air as its small body wiggled, Noah raising his thumping head that had bore the soul rending pain with the slime as he smiled.","He himself had power that could be considered barely as a beginner Sage, while his Animus Pet was a full fledged one!","What a grand reality!","The eyes of the Sword Emperor and his Sword Kings shook as they were still staring at the Slime in a stupor, and this was especially so for the Sword Emperor who knew what the previous events fully represented.","Yet before any of these beings could digest these new developments, a tear of space could be heard far off in the distance, a powerful sound of something approaching reaching them!","Sound and light barriers were broken as the speeding thing revealed itself in front of their eyes, its eyes filled with wrath.","The figure of a small woman with vibrant dark hair and blue eyes could be seen, her exceedingly blessed c.h.e.s.t heaving up and down as she honed in where the most powerful beings were cl.u.s.tered in the Consummate Sword Holy Land!","The powerful being known as Big Sis Morgana had arrived!"]},{"number":863,"title":"Chapter 863: Chapter 862 - Big Sis is Here!","paragraphs":["\"...\"","The stellar space was eerily silent with the appearance of the small girl, the Sword Kings’ beside the Sword Emperor looking towards her with shaking eyes as a glimmer of fear could be seen beneath!","The expression of the Sword Emperor also changed slightly as he saw this being, his weak body rising up towards her.","The one that had arrived, Big Sis Morgana- looked towards the Sword Emperor with angry eyes as she saw his state, her c.h.e.s.t heaving up and down even more ferociously as she then turned her eyes towards Noah!","She glanced at this figure that now had a slime bobbing up and down his head happily as her resonant voice reverberated out.","\"You!\"","RUMBLE!","It was only a single word, but it was followed by space bursting again as Morgana appeared in front of Noah instantly, her fist already outstretched as it palpated with the aura of the Grand Dao of Destruction!","A fully assimilated Grand Dao of Destruction that contained hints of multiple other Daos...","Yet another Sage had arrived as her entrance was explosive, striking towards Noah the most she saw the state of the Sword Emperor!","She moved with such intense speed that Noah only saw her fist when it was already a few inches from smashing his head in, but he didn’t have to worry as before the fist could smash into him...the wiggly figure of a slime appeared.","BZZZT!","A horrendous impact was felt as destructive energies were dispelled and countered, the face of Morgana getting even angrier as her other hand already arrived to grab on to the body of the Slime, trying to yank it away from Noah while her small legs struck towards the point between his legs!","It was such a shocking and brutal form of battle as this Sage used her b.a.r.e body that was wrapped with the essence of the Grand Dao of Destruction mostly, her feet that were deadlier than the force of an entire Galaxy trying to smash Noah’s precious gems!","\"You...!\"","Intense anger filled Noah’s eyes while the body of the Blue Slime glimmered, an intense light of the Dao of the Sword erupting forth as Morgana was pushed back, her deadly legs smashing into the stellar space and causing it to shatter.","OOOOM!","The slime had become one with the Sword as it took a splendorous form, rotating around Noah protectively as its blade was pointed towards the wrathful Sage in the distance!","Noah didn’t give the command for the Blue Slime or for any of his other pets to strike as he knew this Sage was an ally, and an ally that had with her something he was actually looking for!","<strong>[Morgana Wight] :: A Sage that has assimilated the Daos of Destruction, Fortification, and Alacrity. She has spent countless years exploring the Dark Universe as she maintains immense disdain over it and all the creatures within it that she considered exceedingly foolish. The only being capable of reining her in is the Sage who was the disciple under the same Master as her...</strong>","A glorious set of words to introduce the newly entering Sage, Noah going over as the strong voice of the Sword Emperor reverberated out.","\"Morgana! Why would you fight with our ally? This is the being our Master talked out-\"","\"Shut up! Do you see yourself? You have less than 10% of your power remaining, barely a husk of what you used to be!\"","The resonant voice of the girl rang out as she talked down to a Sage as if she stood at a higher position.","\"I know you’ve always been slightly foolish after that Old Geezer brainwashed you, so I can’t blame you too much. But your Big Sis will at least beat up the one that did this to you! This is that so-called Master of Ruination right? He’ll answer for this!\"","BOOM!","The slime didn’t budge one bit as aside from having obtained the power of a Sage and having 5% of its body and soul purified, an action that granted it a shocking +50,000% to All Parameters by the way- it truly had too many Daos that it had comprehended as all of their essence danced with every strike the slime made!","BOOM!","Morgana smashed her little fists that contained a force strong enough to easily shatter stars and planets as the Blue Slime was there to counter it, her cute expression of anger increasing as she wasn’t getting her way.","The Sword Emperor stopped not too far away as he stared in wonder at the fact that Noah’s summon could now match Morgana, but this Sage did not know about the true quality of this Universal Emperor Slime!","It was after all a being that in the near future would awaken its own Cosmic Dao!","\"You...you’re gonna let this little thing do everything for you?!\"","When Morgana saw her relentless attacks not passing through the Blue Slime in Sword form as space around her was the only thing that continued to shatter, she taunted the calm Noah that was observing everything as her eyes rose up arrogantly.","Noah had been learning all he could about this being as he perused through the information he could find through Eyes of Truth, his gaze placid as after obtaining a power nearly equaling a Sage and having his Slime be a genuine one- his worries had truly decreased by a large amount!","As he knew the girl was a disciple of the same Great Sage as the Sword Emperor, she was placed in the camp of allies- her just being a difficult one to deal with.","\"I don’t plan to fight with a kid, so I can only let my pet fight with you if you want to continue.\"","\"...\"","The Sword Emperor who had thought the situation would calm down with the passing seconds as everyone would get to talk looked towards Noah in a stupor the moment he finished saying the shocking words!","Why did he say those words? Why not anything but those words?!","RUMBLE","\"A kid? A KID?!\"","BOOOM!","Space quaked and tumbled as a dense aura of destruction circled around Morgana, her eyes utterly enraged while looking towards a calm Noah.","A hectic introduction of allies was underway as the force of beings that would be the ones to band together in order to save a Universe from an Apocalypse was gradually being formed!"]},{"number":864,"title":"Chapter 864: Chapter 863 - More Ruination Cores, Shocking News! I","paragraphs":["It took another half hour of Morgana running rampant across the stellar space as numerous barren stars and planets were shattered as she chased Noah trying to land hits on him unsuccessfully.","Her blessed c.h.e.s.t heaved up and down as she looked dangerously towards him while she spat out words.","\"If you ever call me that name again...there’ll be hell to pay!\"","She spoke as if she had won and was now threatening Noah, the being that merely nodded towards her as the Sword he held turned into a blue slime that went to rest on his head.","His body wasn’t blazing with the aura of Ruination anymore as his hair returned to its normal dark gold, but his eyes now contained a hint of red as they shone like starry stars!","He donned a regal white robe as he ignored the Sage cutely glaring at him, going towards the other Sage that was nearly 4 times her size.","\"Sword Emperor, you have my deepest thanks...even though I still have to bother you with even more things!\"","Noah said with earnest words towards the Sage with a weak complexion.","The Sword Emperor had truly given much, with his Sword Kings losing nearly half of their strength while he lost so much more!","But the result...was the Master of Ruination climbing from an Entity and having the power of a Sage in just a single day after he entered his Ancient Power.","Arriving at this shocking truth, the Sword Emperor also knew what Noah was talking about when he mentioned he would have to bother him with even more things!","Essence freely flowed out as the weakened Sage waved his hands, causing for the appearance of a cube shaped red black object that caused the eyes of every being here to shine.","\"You’re really...\"","Morgana was about to start cursing again when the Sword Emperor interrupted her, giving the Ruination Core he had held after so long.","\"This is something I scoured the Dark Universe to find for tens of thousands of years, only being able to locate this single one as the other is in Big Sis Morgana’s hands.\"","Noah’s eyes glimmered as he nodded at this, the function of locating Ruination Cores having long told him it was on the body of the small voluptuous figure of Morgana!","RUMBLE","An intense red light shot out when his hands touched the Ruination Core, the tool coming active as his essence of Ruination nearly burst out wildly. But it dove into his body and Origin with ease as it found a third Universal Origin Core to reside in, this Core also forming a link with the other 2 in Noah’s body as he glimmered in an intense red aura.","WAAA!","A space shaking aura erupted out of his as the tinge of red threatened to cover his whole body, the light only dying down a second later as everyone looked towards him in amazement!","Yet a mocking voice came out a second later that poured cold water into everyone’s thoughts.","\"This guy is really showy huh? Shines red every damn second he gets!\"","Morgana had her hands crossed as she held up her blessed c.h.e.s.t, portraying an unimpressed expression even though her eyes were tinged with shock!","This was because she had felt the Ruination Core she had hidden away vibrating the moment Noah took in the one Kaiser gave away, affirming who the being that had caused all the prior reactions was truly the one in front of her.","Yet even then, she was relentless as the Sword Emperor had to sigh while raising his voice towards her.","\"Big Sis...if you ever valued our Master, you would also release the Ruination Core on you so we can start preparing and planning for the future to come!\"","The weakened Sage’s voice was resonant as it rang out in Morgana’s ears, but she became even more pompous as she replied with a sneer.","\"Why should I give this guy something I searched for for 23,837 years? That’s a lot of years, you know? I could have been relaxing at the edge of the Universe or some shit during that time. Why should all my hard work just be handed away!\"","RUMBLE","The Sword Emperor had begun to get angry as Noah’s eyes also squinted dangerously, when they came to a stop as they felt yet another aura barrel towards them rapidly from far away.","This one was nowhere near as powerful as Morgana, but it was rushing here at such great speeds that it felt like their lives depended on it!","RUMBLE!","Spatial fluctuations erupted out as the figure of a disheveled Sword King appeared.","His hair was messy as his eyes were tinged with immense fear, looking towards the Sword Emperor as he hurriedly spat out shocking words!","\"It’s gone...the Desolate Galaxies...they’re gone!\"","...!","\"What?!\"","RUMBLE!","\"They’re inescapable! If you get caught in one, it doesn’t matter your rank as they draw you in and grind you to dust! I washed an Entity try to outrun one Fracture...only for them to fully be devoured in a second!\"","...!","The Entity continued to release shocking words as the expressions of everyone turned grim.","Noah felt his heart palpating as his expression turned sour.","He truly thought he would have more time!","The Universe had been chugging along just fine for tens of thousands of years before he was even alive, why could it not give him ten thousand years as well to become overly OP as he thrashed down all the enemies in it and obtained all the Ruination Cores?","Why the hell did the Apocalypse come just when he neared the Peak ranks of power within this Universe?!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":865,"title":"Chapter 865: Chapter 864 - More Ruination Cores, Shocking News! II","paragraphs":["\"That’s not all, the Fractures that tore apart galaxies...they actually seem to be expanding over time, and their rate of progression is not slow!\"","...!","The Sword King delivering the news seemed to be vying for the top position of how many apocalyptic things one could say to get his points across, the Sword Emperor looking towards him as his expression was more grim than anybody else.","Why now?","Why now?!","He had only just located and began helping the Master of Ruination. The being was powerful, but not fully there to stand against the Spirit Race and obtain the other 2 Ruination Cores!","His tired eyes were filled with melancholy as he turned towards Morgana.","\"Morgana, we truly have no time. Please give the Master of Ruination the Core...\"","\"Shut up!\"","Morgana’s face was scrunched up as she waved her hands unwillingly, another stellar Ruination Core appearing in her hands as the moment it appeared in space, it shot forth towards Noah with fervor as the eyes of Morgana trembled.","She had searched for this treasure as it stayed with her for so many years, and it now left her like an ungrateful child without so much as a thought!","THRUM!","It smashed into and melded with Noah’s body as a scene similar to a prior one appeared, Noah’s body glimmering with an intense red light soon as amazingly in the span of a day since entering the Consummate Sword Expanse...he had obtained 2 Ruination Cores!","\"Well, Master of Ruination, do you feel overflowing power surging through you? You can finally appear out of the blue and save everyone?\"","Morgana’s voice rang out as Noah’s feeling of reveling in the obtainment of Ruination Cores was cut short. He looked towards Morgana and the Sword Emperor as he spoke out calmly.","\"We need to gather the rest of the Ruination Cores soon. What needs to be done to stop what is coming...it can only be done when all of the Cores are combined to become one Treasure!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s words pacified some of the fear of the apocalypse that many had begun to feel with the news the Entity came with.","\"We also need to visit the Desolate Galaxies to see exactly what we’re dealing with.\"","...!","\"...we shall do just that. For the Ruination Cores, we have to pry them off the hands of the Spirit Race...as it seems they have ulterior motives that we cannot understand!\"","The voice of the Sword Emperor rang out as Noah’s eyes squinted, his voice coming out questioningly.","\"Do you know anything about this?\"","It wasn’t the Sword Emperor that answered, the voluptuous Morgana feeling that the attention had shifted for her as she spoke to have all eyes turn toward her.","\"Those fools at least want to welcome death, I can commend them for that! They do not want to work with anyone about anything, simply locking themselves up in their Spirit Realms as the years waste away!\"","The Spirit Race of the Dark Universe. Beings with unique physiologies that had enormous power in their hands. Yet...they weren’t the ones moving earnestly to save their Universe!","It was such an unbelievable reality that many did not know what to make of it...","---","The homes of these beings boasting an enormous amount of power were eerily silent even though they were filled with trillions of beings. This was due to the fact that each of them could mentally connect with each other, their Realms filled with a sense of silence that one would normally not come across in other places!","At this moment, deep in the Spirit Domain.","In an area where powerful auras resided, two cubed red black Cores shone with a gorgeous light twice before dying down not too long later each time.","The shining of these cubes represented a great deal of things to those that held them, with their reaction this time being particularly important as it represented a shocking reality!","\"This is somewhat unexpected.\"","A voice rang out, but it wasn’t ringing out in the outside world- it was in the mental world of the Spirit Race!","It traveled amongst the minds of a group of powerful beings as the eyes of many of them were focused on one.","\"What did you find out from utilizing the Dao? You were always the keenest among us.\"","A Sage of the Spirit Race was put on the spot as his incorporeal body was masked in the darkness, his voice ringing out.","\"The Master of Ruination has unexpectedly collected 4 Ruination Cores, with the two in our hands being his next aim. I didn’t expect for the two childish creatures in the Sword Expanse to give them to him so easily.\"","His voice was inquisitive as a shockingly powerful Dao Essence swirled around him, the essence golden in color as it represented Destiny!","His incorporeal hands seemed to be reaching into a cloud of gold as he plucked out fruits of knowledge, his expression constantly changing as an innumerable amount of information entered his mind.","His expression hardened somewhat in the next second as something seemed to have occurred.","\"I can’t grasp any more information on the Master of Ruination, which brings some uncertainties on what is to come.\"","A shocking message was passed from him as something perplexing to the Spirit Race occurred!","\"As the one capable of wielding Ruination Cores, our sight might have been masked by the fact that he owns more of them.\"","\"Possibly...\"","The Sage in question had a piercing expression as possibilities were brought forward. But neither of the powerful beings of the Spirit Race brought forward the true reason why the Grand Dao of Destiny could not be used to get information on the Tyrannical Entity!","This phenomenon began the moment that Noah gained the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, the Sage of the Spirit Race only finding out about it now!","\"The plans do not change nonetheless. The two Sages from the Sword Expanse can be handled, the allies he will bring forth only being able to stand against the soldiers in our ranks...the only thing we need to account for is his ability to be invulnerable for an hour and the capability to escape death by leaving our Time...\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking plans and schemes were in play for the Tyrannical Entity as the powerful Spirit Race accounted for many scenarios!","\"It has already begun in the Desolate Galaxies, we could simply tether his soul to the destructive energies of Ruination that have begun spreading out there...\"","\"Possibly...\"","\"Ruination...\"","The voices spoke in different tones yet sounded alike at the same time. It was an eerie environment to be in as the Sages of the Spirit Race were trying to think one and two steps ahead of a being they knew would be hard to kill!"]},{"number":866,"title":"Chapter 866: Chapter 865 - Give Me a Second to Become a Sage!","paragraphs":["As the incorporeal Sages from the Spirit Domain pondered on the Dao of Destiny to find the correct path for their goals, the Tyrannical Entity was still in the Consummate Sword Expanse communicating with two Sages!","The Sword Kings and the left out Traverser were by the side as Morgana was even more actively talking after the news about the destruction of the Desolate Galaxies.","\"The Spirit Domain has multiple Sages, those bastards having always seemed sneaky as hell to me as I don’t doubt they’re hiding some shocking secret.\"","Her words made the expressions of many harden as her eyes focused on a singular being.","\"We must prepare, and have someone actually strong enough to stand against the suicidal Spirit Race!\"","Morgana tauntingly looked towards Noah as she spoke, sensing how this being had not even assimilated a single Dao.","Even though he might have battle power nearing a Sage, he wasn’t one himself!","\"The one to lead us is someone who hasn’t even assimilated a single Dao? A being that barely qualifies as a Sage in terms of strength?\"","Her voice was extremely piercing in the starry space as it was filled with mischief, Noah looking at Morgana as he waved his hands to return his pets but the Blue Slime into his origin, sending his now unmerged clones back into a Time Space of the Infinite Galaxy as he planned to do something stupendous!","Morgana and the others looked at this scene quizzically as Noah let out dominating words.","\"Assimilating daos...huh? Give me a few seconds to assimilate some Daos and become a Sage.\"","...!!!","Shock and incredulousness filled the eyes of those that heard the words, the Sword Emperor’s face being the most shocked one as he had heard words similar to this not too long ago!","This being had told him to give him a minute as he came out having somehow comprehended a Cosmic Dao thereafter, and now he was saying to be given seconds before he assimilated Daos and entered the ranks of Sages...","Ah!","Amidst the stupor and shock of others, Noah’s clones had entered the Time Space of the Infinite Galaxy as they each held and had already started actively absorbing Dao Assimilation Crystals!","Noah now knew he couldn’t use them on his Cosmic Dao, so he went ahead to assimilate his fully comprehended Daos as he planned to step into the folds of a Sage in a matter of seconds in the outside world!","The Affix of [+15,000% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation of All Daos] that would have normally been just a mere 7,500% with the addition of two more Ruination Cores as it used to be 2,500% when he obtained the second Ruination Core was also set, a tremendous amount of boosts becoming available for this session of assimilation as one must not forget the +10,000% from the boost of merely having the Cosmic Dao of Ruination itself!","It meant that for the Assimilation Crystals...Noah would not have to absorb many to have his percentage shoot up by a large amount!","RUMBLE!","The absorption session of Dao Assimilation Crystals began for the first time ever, Noah making his way across the fully comprehended Daos of the Sword and Withering as the Grand and Lesser Dao began to skyrocket up at the same rate.","His clones worked in conjunction to absorb multiple Crystals as it didn’t take him too long to observe the percentage of assimilation on both Daos shoot from 0% towards 100% after absorbing just 5 rounds of Assimilation Crystals on all his clones!","OOOOM!","A unique air began to surround the clones as Noah’s body in the outside world was even more vibrant.","Morgana, The Sword Emperor, and many of the watching Entities observed the essence around Noah to shoot up the moment he said to be given a few seconds to become a Sage, watching in shock as this being erupted forth with the essence of the Sword and Withering in large amounts as seconds later, they receded onto his body calmly as if they were all reigned in- as if they were all subservient!","A second later...the aura of a being that assimilated Daos erupted as the eyes of watching Entities and Sages nearly bulged out of their sockets!","\"You...you...!\"","Morgana was pointing towards Noah in a stupor as her bountiful c.h.e.s.t shook, the Sword Emperor looking form in blatant amazement as next, the saw the space trembling above Noah’s head as a phenomenon similar to what the Blue Slime had undergone took place once more.","This time, the hole that tore open the space was barely an inch in size, nowhere near as monstrous as the Blue Slime!","Wondrous and regal looking blue Primordial Essence came from this tiny hole in the sky as it dr.a.p.ed over Noah, piercing into his origin and soul as he underwent another round of purification.","This time it was from an entirely different essence, and something unique that Noah had not expected occurred when the Primordial Essence entered his Origin!","It seemed to sense the Ruination Essence that had already purified him as it swirled around seemingly in confusion for a few seconds, but the essence had to purify nonetheless as it did its job a second later!","Noah found to his shock that unlike the piercing soul rending pain he had gone through when he underwent his first purification under Ruination Essence, the Primordial Essence felt extremely warm and cool as he felt no pain.","Only the sensation of him becoming stronger as he received another +1,000% to All Parameters!","RUMBLE","His body shook with majestic power as the genuine aura of a Sage leaked from him, those watching by the side having their jaws nearly detaching from their bodies as they stared at him with utter disbelief.","\"Well, it took longer than a few seconds, but a Sage is a Sage.\"","...!","Domineering words left his mouth as the Entities were roused up, Traverser looking towards Noah with increased shock as he met this being not even a few days ago when he was just an Entity!","What the genuine f.u.c.k was going on here?!","Morgana finally had no words to spare as in the starry space, only the joyful laughter of the Sword Emperor had begun to resound as this old Sage felt his heart rest easier and easier with this show of power.","On this day, Noah Osmont had become a Sage!"]},{"number":867,"title":"Chapter 867: Chapter 866 - The Fractures That Tore Apart Galaxies","paragraphs":["You know, I’ve seen some shit in my years of life, but I haven’t seen any load of bullshit like what I just saw right now.","This f.u.c.k.i.n.g guy really went ahead and assimilated 2 daos in seconds to become a Sage, and even went further on to act cool while his origin and soul should have been getting painfully purified for the first time!","It was such bull that I nearly questioned whoever set up rules and common sense of advancing through the Realms of power.","Even if he was the so called Master of Ruination, how the hell do you explain this shit?!","Ah...I digress.","I can’t show my shock to this being or anyone else.","I am, after all, the Big Sis.","\"So you’ve entered the ranks of Sages. I hope the Spirit Race gives you a few years to purify your body and soul, oh, and the apocalypse that’s already started also gives you that same time.\"","I looked towards the ridiculous being that had just become a Sage as I test him out.","Surely he won’t have any more ridiculous surprises?","I thought Kaiser had turned into a true imbecile to have so much of his strength s.u.c.k.e.d dry by him, but this guy sure was convincing with the way he did things.","But this f.u.c.k.i.n.g guy actually didn’t reply to me as he looked over with those unimpressed eyes, turning towards Kaiser instead as he spoke.","\"We have much planning and preparation to do, but I need to go see these Fractures that tore apart the Desolate Galaxies...I need to know exactly what apocalypse we’ll be facing!\"","His annoying voice that was always filled with confidence as if nothing could go wrong for him rang out.","How long had this guy even lived for him to be talking like he has everything in the palm of his hands?","I’ve lived long enough to have witnessed the deaths of the stupid Sages of this Universe and watched the birth and destruction of Galaxies, yet this kid...","He was truly someone that made you angry just by looking at him!","Kaiser nodded towards him as if he was already a damn follower, his eyes turning towards me as he spoke.","\"You and Morgana should go to Desolate Galaxies with Fastsword, I will get things started over here as me and the Sword Kings recuperate and try to regain some of our strength!\"","Kaiser went ahead and did something I’ve always hated- deciding what to do without caring what others thought.","\"Hmph.\"","I didn’t even bother with words as I saw the starry eyes of this so called Master of Ruination nod and turn towards me and the stupid Entity that had run from the Desolate Galaxies while screaming about the end of everything.","\"Let’s go!\"","I grabbed the neck of that Entity and began shooting off towards the direction of the Desolate Galaxies, my body tearing apart through the space of the Galaxy as I entered the chaotic void in seconds!","I turned around to see how far I had left the anger inducing Sage behind, only to find him a meter away from me as he tore apart through space with his hands clasped behind his back while he tried to look all cool, a bouncing blue slime on his had to add on to the ridiculous sight.","---","The journey from the Consummate Sword Expanse and towards the Desolate Galaxies did not take longer than an hour- Noah, Morgana, and the Entity that was unwillingly being pulled by his neck like a cat arrived there in no time.","Noah’s eyes constricted as when they neared, he could already begin to see the heart shaking Fractures that were larger than even Galaxies, each of them menacingly shining with power as they slowly pulsed and stretched out!","They seemed terrifying...but he was getting another sensation from them at the same time.","BZZZT!","The chaotic void was constantly being consumed by the fractures as it felt like an extremely hard structure was being cut up and destroyed.","\"No matter your Realm- whether an Entity or a lowly ant, anyone that gets consumed by these Fractures perishes!\"","The Entity that had reported this phenomenon spoke with a tinge of fear as the three of them watched the horrendous ruptures in space.","They were a few miles away, but Noah and Morgana spread their senses out to cover the Fractures as shockingly, each of them returned with different feelings towards it!","\"My aura gets consumed entirely the moment it touches them. Even a Sage would not be able to escape these fractures if they get caught in them!\"","Morgana had a serious and solemn look for the first time as she looked forward with seriousness. Yet Noah...he had an incredulous expression on his face as when he spread his aura out to cover the terrifying fractures, he found an odd feeling- something he could only describe as a calling!","It was an extremely disconcerting feeling as at the same time, the ruptures in the chaotic void seemed extremely dangerous as they threatened to even tear apart Sages.","Unlike Morgana, his aura was not consumed to nothingness as he could observe the outer edges of the fractures and its features, yet he could only see darkness in all other areas as from within...he could sense the aura of Ruination!","Ruination!","THUMP!","His heart thumped as he affirmed this, many thoughts crossing his mind as he ran across a myriad of scenarios. The thoughts of the Cosmic Treasure Ruination and its subsequent Cosmic Dao, the definition of Ruination Cores themselves that said those using them will more than likely bring upon themselves Ruination.","As the one comprehending the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, would he be an exception?!","His body naturally began to flow towards it as the Morgana and the Entity looked towards him incredulously.","He commanded the Blue Slime to stay behind as it moved from his and floated to the side.","\"Hey big guy, the hell are you doing?\"","Morgana’s sharp voice rang out as Noah’s expression became firm, his thoughts being confirmed the more his aura spread out to cover the large Fracture near them!","His voice that caused the 2 beings near him to nearly detach their jaws rang out as he advanced towards the Fracture even faster.","\"I’ll be right back!\"","RUMBLE!","A glimmering red essence erupted to cover his body as he crossed the few miles difference between them and then...disappeared into the frightening Fracture that swallowed even the chaotic void itself!","\"...\"","The Entity incredulously looked towards where Noah had disappeared as he didn’t even know how to react!","\"Well, there goes the supposed savior of the Universe.\"","Morgana’s voice was the only thing that could be heard in the chaotic void as the figure of Noah disappeared into the Fracture!"]},{"number":868,"title":"Chapter 868: Chapter 867 - Swallow it all!","paragraphs":["Darkness.","This was all that Noah felt the moment he entered into the shocking Fracture that swallowed everything!","No sound, no sight, no smell...nothing!","Even the limbs attached to his body...he wouldn’t be able to know he had them if they weren’t attached to him.","It was an extremely terrifying feeling that would make one suffocate in fear as they had a mental breakdown in seconds!","The moment he entered, an extremely terrifying energy had threatened to consume him- and it would have done so in seconds if he didn’t have the essence of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination!","In this utter darkness where nothing could be felt, Noah waited calmly as the only thing he felt was his beating heart. It only took a few seconds before the darkness began to recede, and the source of light...was Noah himself as a red aura spread forth from him to illuminate the surroundings.","THUMP","Within his body, the Ruination Cores had become active as they pulsed with his heart, releasing a unique aura that allowed the light released from Noah to spread out even faster.","Ruination Essence!","Something akin to the Primordial Essence that birthed the Primordial Cosmos, a unique type of essence that as someone traversing the Cosmic Dao of Ruination- he could only obtain small slivers of it to purify his body every now and then.","Yet in this place...there were rivers of it floating freely!","RUMBLE!","He had wondered how he could raise his strength in terms of purification of his body, the Sword Emperor having told him that geniuses could call slivers of Primordial Essence in varying frequencies that went from days to months and even years.","He...didn’t have months and years to spend while calling small, small slivers of both Primordial and Ruination Essence, and the answer was surprisingly in the ruptures that had begun destroying the Dark Universe!","He wanted to explore the mysteries of this place he was in as it felt completely different than being in the Dark Universe, but this would be put aside as he fully focused on the current finding of this unique essence.","There were rivers of this essence in this location, Noah’s body beginning to shine ever brighter as his hands reached out to a flowing river of Ruination Essence and brought it to his mouth, swallowing it and gulping it down whole!","RUMBLE","The painful process of purification that others would go through in small amounts...Noah began it en masse as a large amount of Ruination Essence burned and purified his origin and soul, the percentage of Ruination Essence Purification Effects began to rise rapidly!","Noah had to undergo immense pain and wracked apart his very soul, but he was coming out of it stronger as every .1% he saw gave him +1000% in All Parameters.","THRUM!","The river of Ruination Essence he had swallowed was quickly used up as the full percentage of purification rose to .7%.","An unexpected boon!","A wondrous surprise to find from the deadly Fractures that swallowed entire Galaxies!","Noah felt his body that had become significantly stronger as his eyes let out beams of light, his hands going forward to grab onto and swallow even more rivers of Ruination Essence.","It would be a painful procedure, but he would undergo all of it as he knew how hard it was for Sages to purify their bodies through Primordial Essence.","Nobody had the opportunity like him where he could absorb up to the Peak of what he was allowed to, and that was 15% for him due to his Cosmic Dao!","Rivers and rivers of Ruination Essence were taken in by him one after, Noah turning numb to the soul rending pain as he focused on the benefits.","When the percentage of Ruination Essence Purification Effect reached 3%, Noah stopped feeling the pain entirely as his eyes were focused on what these numbers meant.","A mere 3% was +30,000% increase to All Parameters!","This knowledge made him move with even more vigor as he went towards the ultimate goal of 15%, of +150,000% in all boosts!","When he got to that point, would the Spirit Race he had to face still be able to stand against him?","---","Back in the Dark Universe, Morgana’s figure was staring closely towards the nonchalant Blue Slime after its master was s.u.c.k.e.d into the Fracture.","It didn’t seem phased at all as the Sage sighed, thinking that the Tyrannical Entity had somehow survived diving into such a place that even she would not dare to!","’Just what is he...’","But with the assumption he was still alive from looking at this Summon, Morgana and the shaken Sword King by the side waited as Noah underwent an enormous boost of power in an entirely different location than any of them could expect.","A few hours passed.","In the area Noah had found himself in, his body had tendrils of red essence traveling over his skin as a shocking sensation of strength erupted from him!","It was the sort of strength one would rarely come across, the type of strength that only beings that had lived for tens of thousands of years could possibly obtain!","The strength of an extremely powerful Sage emanated from him as on the stat panel, a wondrous scene could be observed.","[Ruination Essence Purification Effects](Currently 15%) :: +150,000% to all Parameters.","\"...\"","A purification of 15%.","Its boosts were so high that one could barely believe it.","This abundant strength...freely flowed throughout his body as he couldn’t help but let out a bellow in the unique environment he was in!","\"OOOOOH!\""]},{"number":869,"title":"Chapter 869: Chapter 868 - Prepare for the Final War! I","paragraphs":["After Noah released his joy of gaining such a tremendous boost of power so very quickly, his eyes turned to the mysterious area he was in as the rivers of Ruination Essence flowed serenely around him.","He utilized this very essence as he began to move around the area carefully.","He was the only point of illumination everywhere he went, everything else seemingly just blank darkness!","He found no answers as to what this area exactly was or even where either was.","Eyes of Truth told him nothing when he stared around as he had a few terrifying conjectures based on what he already knew about Ruination, and the fact that it stemmed outside of the Primordial Cosmos!","But he was given no affirmation as he roamed around an entire hour and found nothing.","It seemed endless as he moved, and he didn’t even know what he was looking for as all he saw were expanding rivers of Ruination Essence all around.","After searching for so long and finding nothing and nobody, he decided it was time for him to try returning back into the Dark Universe.","Maybe his comprehension in the Dao of Ruination was too low, or he had not met other factors. But the reality remained that he wasn’t able to find out anything about this unique area he was in that was filled with Ruination Essence!","He would come back when he fully comprehended the Dao of Ruination or even when he assimilated it as he tried to understand more About what this place truly was.","As for the method of leaving this place, of course, he utilized the absolute skill that allowed him to move from any location, <<Astral Connector>>!","RUMBLE!","Silently, just as he had arrived, Noah left and returned near the Desolate Galaxies of the Dark Universe.","He warped a few miles away from the fracture that he had dived into as the figures of Morgana and the Entity that was still shaken looked toward him with incredulousness!","The Blue Slime happily bounced as it came towards him and landed on his head, the voice of Morgana ringing out.","\"You are truly something else....what now?\"","Before warping back to this location, Noah had reigned in his terrifying strength of someone that had undergone 15% purification, thus Morgana had not been able to see through this or she would have been in even more of a stupor!","His expression is grim as he looked at the shattered Desolate Galaxies where trillions of lives were lost, his voice ringing gout.","\"We need to gather and strengthen all of our forces...we need to prepare and head down to the Spirit Domains right away.\"","\"The Ruination Cores in the hands of the Spirit Race...we will have to pry them from their hands if we have to. Otherwise, it will not just be the Desolate Galaxies that are affected!\"","RUMBLE!","Morgana had a sharp light cross her eyes at these words, the figures of the two Sages and one Entity rushing back towards the Consummate Sword Expanse where they found the Sword Emperor and the Sword Kings to be located in the e Consummate Holy Land where they were recovering.","The Sword Emperor asked what they had found out as Noah gave him a summary breakdown, Morgana simply shaking her head as she didn’t even mention the fact that this guy could enter the fractures that swallowed anyone and come out of them alive whenever he wished.","As Noah stared at the beings that had given up more than half of their powers to strengthen him, he was filled with the light of sympathy as he spoke towards the Sword Emperor.","\"I have a place I can bring you guys into, a place where time moves differently- where 100 days there is simply a day passing in the outside world.\"","The eyes of the Sword Emperor and Sword Kings shone at this as a light nod was seen from the weakened Sage.","---","In the vibrant Infinite Galaxy, a shocking number of scenes were taking place in an expansive Time Space where the condensation of atmospheric essence was as abundant as it could be.","The scenes of multiple Subordinates of Noah absorbing crystals and Cores crazily could be seen, the loot from the Sword Kings having been abundant!","Noah had only utilized a few of the Dao Comprehension and Assimilation crystals as the cores and skill books were all free to subordinates.","As his main body moved and the outside world, some of his clones had continued to distribute loot and guidance to the powerful Entities within the Infinite Galaxy as at this moment the goal was to create multiple entities that completely comprehended the Daos of the Sword and Withering!","There was also the shocking reality where because Noah had such an abundant amount of boosts in terms of comprehending and assimilating, he had more than enough Dao assimilation crystals to possibly cause the complete assimilation of two Daos on a single subordinate and be able to make another Sage!","Yes! Amidst all of this, Noah could ridiculously make another sage!","As for who would take that spot?","The piercing cry of the Emperor Penguin rang out to announce itself as its body released an aura at the Peak Tier GALAXY Realm after being power levelled and absorbing cores for the past days in this time space.","Apart from its Realm in the peak GALAXY, the distinct essence of the Dao of Withering and the Dao the Sword could be felt from its body as the Emperor Penguin had stupidly also achieved their complete comprehension by absorbing the numerous amount of Dao crystals that Noah obtained from the Immemorial Sword Dungeon.","The penguins’ golden beak shone with extreme l.u.s.tre as it looked at Barbatos, Steel Mikhail, Kazuhiko, and many other Harbingers of Sin as well as the subordinates that didn’t have any of the sin abilities.","The figure of the Emperor Penguin rose above all of them as it seemed to announce itself to be the strongest of the initial inhabitants of the Infinite Galaxy.","This penguin announced grandly that it would be the one to receive the ultimate loot from their master...and be the next one to achieve Sagehood!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":870,"title":"Chapter 870: Chapter 869 - Prepare for the Final War! II","paragraphs":["The Sword Emperor along with Morgana and the Entities of the Consummate Sword Expanse appeared in the wondrous Infinite Galaxy as their hearts that were already worn out with shock were put to the test again.","\"This...seems like a never ending Galaxy...\"","The Sword Emperor spread his aura out as he covered trillions of stars, and yet he couldn’t find the boundary of this Galaxy they had been teleported into as it seemed endless!","Noah gave a light smile at this as he moved across the starry space and towards the entrance of a Realm that was established to be a Time Space with all the universal law essences freely flowing about.","\"It’s because there are over a thousand Galaxies fused into it. Naturally, even a Sage would not be able to cover the distances with their aura.\"","...!","The eyes of the powerful beings flashed with shock as they entered the Realm.","This particular Realm was designated by Noah as the place for a majority of the powerful beings within this Galaxy to meet and train, and it was the location where the Emperor Penguin and others were currently training!","\"The levels of atmospheric essence seem to be more than 10 times higher than even the Consummate Holy Land...\"","The voices of the Entities rang out here and there as they observed the vibrant realm filled with essence as they also picked up on the aura of...multiple Entities!","RAA!","The fearsome cry of an Emperor Penguin gloriously rang out as its sleek figure appeared while Noah and the party behind him were descending.","The Penguin wasn’t the only one as Noah had passed the word for everyone to gather, the powerful figures within his Galaxy all congregating towards this Realm they were currently in as the auras of multiple Entities appeared!","SHAA!","The figures of the Imperial Adjudicator, Anna, Anastasia, the Holy Emperor...many beings began to appear in the small realm as their auras alone caused the very skies to shake.","The Sword Emperor glanced at all the appearing beings as he looked towards the Holy Emperor- the being that was a Ruler of an Ancient Power not too long ago, and yet was at this moment in the Galaxy of the Master of Ruination!","\"Brother Windsor.\"","The Sword Emperor spoke with a light smile even though the two Rulers were in different Realms, not belittling a fellow being that looked over an Ancient Power within their Dark Universe.","\"Sword Emperor!\"","Meanwhile, the Holy Emperor was shocked to find the figure that this Ancient Power had only gathered information about but were unsure of whether they truly had a Sage within it- and he had met this Sage personally!","Noah looked at this scene of many different beings meeting each other as the Harbingers of Sin also all appeared, the vivacious figure of Barbatos appearing in the skies with a smile that was very quickly wiped away when she noticed the voluptuous Morgana that was floating beside Noah and the Sword Emperor.","\"...who the f.u.c.k is this now?\"","Her resonant voice rang out as it ignored the fact that genuine Sages had appeared in the Infinite Galaxy, nor that the person she was looking towards was also a Sage herself!","\"Oh?\"","Morgana and Barbatos stared at each other as the two looked at the opposite being’s figure up and down.","They saw the distinct similarities that very few others had as Morgana’s voice rang back while everyone was frozen.","\"Who’s this little kid talking so pompously? It’s almost as if she considers herself on the same stage as me!\"","RUMBLE","Domineering words rang out as essence erupted from the small body of Barbatos, Morgana only looking forward with a smile as Noah’s eyes turned sharp.","The dense essence of the Dao of the Sword and Withering swirled around Barbatos as even though she wasn’t a Sage, she looked towards Morgana threateningly as she shot back!","\"You dare talk towards me like that? Some random bitch that just appeared?!\"","BZZZT!","The Sword Emperor and many others were shocked as they saw Barbatos talk back against a Sage fearlessly, Morgana’s face gaining a trace of anger as her aura also began to shoot up.","\"What will you do about it, little girl?\" This wizened Sage that had lived many years long knew that the figure of Barbatos was simply acting out because she had seen Noah be accompanied by her, long figuring out that there was some sort of relationship between these two!","She couldn’t help but tease and act out herself in return as the resemblance between her and Barbatos was too striking...and she didn’t appreciate that!","Barbatos heard the words of Morgana as her eyes shone dangerously, her expression becoming extremely dignified as she uttered words that could end all battles.","\"Little Fish.\"","RUUUUMBLE!","A heart shaking aura erupted from all around as the skies of the realm quaked and shuddered!","WAA!","From Noah, a horrendous aura of power much higher than the Sword Emperor at his prime or even Morgana erupted out, every being in the surrounding feeling their origins shaking fearfully as they turned to see tendrils of terrifying red essence erupt over Noah’s body!","His eyes shot out beams of red light as his hair began to shine crimson, his gaze staring down everyone as he uttered words that were akin to an Emperor talking to his subjects.","\"We have no time to bicker amongst each other, as we must now prepare for the Final War of the Dark Universe!\"","RUMBLE!","\"The enemies are mysterious and powerful, beings that actually wish for the destruction of their own home. Against them...we cannot lose!\"","His words carried immense power as those who heard them could only nod, but The Sword Emperor and Morgana were looking towards him with utter disbelief as this being in the span of a few hours had somehow achieved more than each of them had obtained in thousands of years! In thousands of years!!!","Barbatos was looking at each of them domineeringly as she came to stand beside Noah, her eyes lingering on the body of the voluptuous Morgana as they seemed to utter a message only for her.","\"Now...let us plan!\"","Noah’s booming voice resounded again as the most powerful beings in the Infinite Galaxy were dominated into silence, all of them staring towards Noah with awe as the planning for Final War for the Dark Universe went underway!"]},{"number":871,"title":"Chapter 871: Chapter 870 - Making a Sage With Ease!","paragraphs":["The two Sages of the Consummate Sword Expanse were still in disbelief as the powerhouses of the Infinite Galaxy were introduced to each other.","Kazuhiko was the welcoming Entity from Noah’s people as he was the most friendly, going towards the weakened Sword Kings as his eyes glimmered excitedly when he saw the beings that lived all their lives attached to the Sword.","Since he was a Rank A Hunter, he had used a Katana as he was a fanatic of Swords from a young age, so when Noah’s clones passed the Dao Crystals he obtained from the Immemorial Sword Dungeon to them...his excitement had risen through the roof!","Now that he got a chance to communicate with the Sword Kings themselves, he felt as if he had found his long lost brothers.","The entire Realm that they were on was built to be a Time Space, so Noah told the Sword Emperor and Kings that they could begin recuperating here as with just a day passing in the outside world, 100 days would pass in this location.","After seeing his show of power where the aura he released was even more oppressive than even the past Sword Emperor, they could only agree with disbelief as Noah also used the farming feature of the Infinite Galaxy to provide them with treasured Herbs that event Entities would have a hard time collecting.","Fruits and herbs that were filled with large amounts of essence, as well as Potions that Noah’s clones had formed from the Alchemy Feature of the Infinite Galaxy were handed out as the weakened Entities and Sages sought to heal themselves somewhat before the battle began!","While the Sword Emperor and others were healing, Morgana angrily followed behind Noah as he floated in the skies looking at the Harbingers of Sin.","\"You’re all deserving of the ultimate loot as you worked hard...but a promise is a promise!\"","RUMBLE","\"The one to forge the path ahead the fastest would be the one to receive the most prized rewards, and that was the Emperor Penguin.\"","RAA!","The prideful cry of the Penguin was heard as he floated in front of everyone to bask in the glory!","Even Barbatos had an angry look on her expression as she nearly pouted at the fact that she wouldn’t get to be the first Sage aside from Noah, but she reigned herself in as she didn’t cause a scene.","Noah waved his hands as the glimmering Assimilation Crystals appeared in the skies, surrounding the Emperor Penguin that began to absorb them right then and there.","Nobody else even dared to go close as they only watched enviously as the power of the Emperor Penguin began to rise.","Off to the side, Morgana looked at this with shining eyes as her resonant voice rang out.","\"So this is how you so quickly became a Sage? These Crystals just go ahead and increase the assimilation of Daos just from you absorbing them? This is just blatant cheating...\"","The Sage had her eyes opened today on the ways others went to increase her power, thinking back to the thousands of years she spent as her eyes shook from the memories!","Noah merely nodded while watching the progress of the Emperor Penguin.","\"Just some treasures I can make that can produce Entities and Sages, it isn’t much!\"","...!","The Harbingers of Sin looked at each other with smiles while Noah blatantly showed off, a few minutes passing as the aura of the Emperor Penguin rose ever higher.","In half an hour, the aura of a completely assimilated Lesser Dao was released from the sleek body of the Penguin as its golden beak shone with prideful l.u.s.ter.","Another hour passed, and the aura of a completely assimilated Grand Dao exploded out, the aura of the Emperor Penguin becoming even more condensed as with the full assimilation of two Daos, the skies above them parted grandly to allow the opening of a small hole- this hole releasing the wondrous Primordial Essence that went on to purify and welcome a new Sage!","RAA! RAA!","The Emperor Penguin roared out prideful as it withstood the pain of Purification of body and soul, coming out of this immense pain a few minutes later as a new being- the aura of a Sage grandly emanating from the body of the first beast of the Spiritual Land.","RAA!","The body of the Emperor Penguin shone gold as the light of Pride radiated from it, basking in all its glory as Noah saw the details of the aura wrapping around it that he also had the same of when he advanced to become a Sage.","<strong>{Aura of the Assimilator of the Sword} :: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated the Grand Dao of the Sword. It grants +10,000% Extra Damage, +10,000% Attack and Cast Speed, +100% Increased Soul Defence, and boosts all abilities of the Sword by 2000%. The user can also become one with the Sword as they obtain Sword Form- a form that doubles the boosts of this aura.</strong>","<strong>{Aura of the Assimilator of Withering} :: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated the Lesser Dao of Withering. It grants +5000% Extra Damage and allows the attacks of the Controller of Withering to contain a unique corrosive essence that deconstructs and reduces the attacks, mana, and life force of the target until they become empty husks. The user can now even corrode time itself as they can briefly slow the progression time in a certain area.</strong>","The stellar descriptions of the unique auras that swirled around those who assimilated Daos were displayed!","The Grand Daos came with even larger percentage boosts as some Lesser Daos had their own uniqueness.","Noah waved his hands to collect the remaining Assimilation Crystals that would only be enough to get one of his subordinates to progress through half of a Dao, not sufficient to increase their strength majorly as he would keep them for when he fully comprehended a Dao and wanted to assimilate it quickly!","He glanced at the newly advancing Sage that shone with the l.u.s.ter of pride as he smiled, his domineering voice ringing out in the surroundings.","\"So making a Sage is this easy...\"","A statement that was extremely arrogant, but also one that nobody could refute as Morgana was among the few still looking at this scene in shock!"]},{"number":872,"title":"Chapter 872: Chapter 871 - An Emperor Atop a Throne of Ruination!","paragraphs":["Barbatos and the others rolled their eyes at Noah’s words as he became serious and addressed everyone again, the Emperor Penguin coming by his side as the Blue Slime bounced happily atop his head.","\"Since the Emperor Penguin got to become a Sage, the rest will get their pick of the PRISMATIC and Ultra Rare Pets from the Great Sage Aoin Tower.\"","RUMBLE!","Even more rewards were put out as there were still a great deal of Animus Summons to be contracted, especially the powerful PRISMATIC Summons that each had their own histories and uniqueness!","None of the ones that remained within the Tower were on par with Tiamat and the Blue Slime, but they were barely behind them in terms of power as the Entities that contracted them would have their strength boosted by a large degree.","Barbatos and the others would have the chance to contract Summons such as the Monkey King, Abyssal Black Tyrant Dragon, Galaxy Devouring Wolf, and many others as their power would be raised greatly!","RUMBLE!","Noah teleported them into the Primal Holy Land as in the next few hours, many inhabitants of the Infinite Galaxy continued to prepare themselves for a shocking war that would decide the fate of their Universe!","Some like the Sword Emperor and Sword Kings remained in the Time Space as for them, they spent days recuperating and regaining some of their strength in the wondrous Realm that was filled with an overabundance of essence.","They would be overseeing Legions of the Infinite Galaxy Beasts that were below the levels of beasts like the Emperor Penguin, as well as the remaining GALAXY Rank combatants from the Primal Winged Expanse they absorbed!","Even the Ailerons would be putting in the work to defend their Universe after these beings were brought under Noah’s heel.","Entities like the Inquisitor Athena would be placed as Commanders of these Legions as they led thousands of beings into battle as the Imperial Adjudicator and Anna did the same.","So many things were happening at this moment in the Infinite Galaxy that it would take countless pages just to describe them all!","In one area, Queen Adelaide was accompanied by a Clone of Noah and her trusted Guard, Night, as they toured the trillions of stars within the Infinite Galaxy.","Noah had such free time and leeway with his clones that he would have one or two accompany Barbatos and Adelaide in his free time as they toured the countless planets within the Infinite Galaxy and enjoyed different cultures and foods while also enjoying each other’s company.","Noah had such luxury with his clones as while he could be fighting Entities or a Sage in the outside world, a Clone that wasn’t needed could be in bed relaxing with a special someone as he enjoyed the fruits of the Infinite Galaxy!","Who else but Noah could live so grandly?!","Such was the bustle of activities occurring throughout the Infinite Galaxy, the hours going by as a day passed in the outside world.","Even though it was injuries of the origin and soul, the Sword Emperor was able to recover 25% of his original strength as the Sword Kings that didn’t get devoured by the Blue Slime had about 75% recovery from their peak power.","With the Fractures that had continued to spread from the Desolate Galaxies and not knowing exactly where the next apocalyptic event would occur, Noah and the Sages within his party concluded that they had to move as soon as possible to recover the 2 Ruination Cores from the hands of the Spirit Race!","---","In the darkness of the chaotic void, Noah was floating majestically at the area that should have been the location of the Consummate Sword Expanse.","Yet this area was now just a blankness of the chaotic void, the Galaxies that used to occupy and form cl.u.s.ters having all been absorbed into his Infinite Galaxy!","He had talked with the Sword Emperor about this during the 100 days they spent in the Time Space, the Sage nodding at the idea with a smile as it was only Morgana that nearly screamed her lungs off.","The Legacy of the 2 Sages that had been there during the time when Ruination was first used...it was now devoured by Noah as it went forward to enrich his ever growing Galaxy with even more beings and culture!","As he floated in the area where the Ancient Power used to be, the miniaturized Infinite Galaxy floated beside him.","He took it within his hands as his figure warped away, going towards the direction where he could sense two Ruination Cores!","Hours passed as he moved across the chaotic void. Only coming to a stop when he was an hour or two away from reaching the Domains of the Spirit Race.","At this point, essence thrummed from his body as he would summon his forces here to prepare before moving any further.","His body glimmered with light as he first summoned his Animus Pets- the terrifying figures of the Jormungandr, Tiamat, Golden Crow, Calamity Bear, Obsidian Panther, Oculothorax, Colossal Helios Leviathan, and the Blue Slime all came out grandly!","ROAAAR!","The chaotic void shook at their entrance as Noah then waved his hands and caused the figures of the Sword Emperor, Morgana, the Entities, and those in the GALAXY Realm that were present in his Infinite Galaxy to all begin to be teleported out.","RUMBLE","Wild energy erupted out as powerful beings began to fill the chaotic void, Noah floating in front of all of them as he watched the scene with shining eyes.","At this scene, essence released from him as it was tinged red, this essence forming into a magisterial throne of essence that pulsed with the light of Ruination.","Similar to when he first created a majestic throne when utilizing the essence of all Universal Laws, he now made a grand throne from Ruination Essence as he then sat on it grandly while watching the teleportation of many glorious Legions from his Infinite Galaxy!","RAA!","The Emperor Penguin that was just teleported out thought its Master really knew how to appear imposing and majestic as it looked at the magisterial throne Noah sat on, going on to float on the side opposite of the slime as its golden beak shone with pride at having such a Master!","The Manifested GALAXY present on Noah’s body made him even more vibrant in the dark chaotic as while he sat on a glorious throne, he watched the formation of terrifying Legions fill the nearby chaotic void.","This was the force he would be taking towards the Spirit Domains.","These were the Legions that he himself led!","They had Sages, Sword Kings, and a variety of Entities present within them as he had absorbed multiple Ancient Powers, all of them now displayed in front of him as he gazed upon them all while seated on a throne.","It was such a magisterial scene that it deserved to be etched onto the annals of history!"]},{"number":873,"title":"Chapter 873: Chapter 872 - A Ridiculous Skill Tree!","paragraphs":["The Progenitor is truly glorious.","I felt this even more so as I stared at the scene before me, at something that nobody in their wildest dreams could have imagined would be brought to fruition, and in such a short period of time at that!","Master was seated upon a glorious throne as two Sages occupied his sides. A shimmering blue slime and the much too favored Emperor Penguin.","Ahh...how glorious of an honor it would be if the Progenitor had me by his side! The things I would do for him...!","But! I am merely Commander Elena that now leads a Legion of Vampyres, Infinite Galaxy Beasts, and Ailerons under my wing.","At the Peak GALAXY Realm and having been given the chance to fully comprehend the Dao of Withering and the Sword, I was now a genuine Entity that could move unhindered!","Yet...I was just one among the many under the banner of my Master.","In the nearby tens of miles, other Legions led by The Inquisitor Athena, the Kraken, Steel Mikhail, Lady Anna...many of the Entities that master had created from handing out the wondrous GALAXY cores and Dao Crystals- they all led their own Legions as each of us looked towards the Progenitor with proud gazes and reverence!","The figures of the newly appearing Sages- the Sword Emperor and Morgana...they stood at the forefront of the Legions as the much too lucky Barbatos actually stood at the same spot as them!","Beside Barbatos, the enormous figures of powerful Animus Summons could be seen. A Holy Phoenix ghat glimmered with light, a Monkey King that looked forward with a smiling expression.","It wasn’t just her as among the Harbingers of Sin, Kazuhiko was also lucky enough to get his hands on the ferocious Galaxy Devouring Wolf while Steel Mikhail stood atop the Abyssal Black Tyrant Dragon!","The Holy Emperor and Imperial Adjudicator were just a bit further back as they were surrounded by their own PRISMATIC and Ultra Rare Summons, all of us without question looking towards the being on the throne.","Tell us what to do!","We shall all follow the will of the Progenitor! Of the Tyrannical Emperor! Of the Master of Ruination!","RUMBLE!","---","Noah stared at the wondrous scene of numerous beings that all came from his Infinite Galaxy.","It seemed like a completed picture, and yet at the same time, it wasn’t!","This was because he had still not released all the forces he could release- he still hadn’t utilized some fairly important skills!","RUMBLE!","As he sat upon the throne, a deep smile appeared on his face while being watched by every single being, he utilized a skill tree he had left in past as [Arch Lich Ra’Zan].","The skill tree of the Arch Lich had been upgraded through the ranks of Nebula, Black Hole, Quasar, and now stood at the GALAXY Realm as a great deal of abilities were unlocked.","Many of them were on the support side as they increased the number of Undead the Lich could summon or heavily enhanced their strength by giving them new qualities, but in the end, a wondrous skill that could call forth a terrifying Undead Legion came to light.","He skipped past the many skills gained throughout the stages as he focused on the ones gained at GALAXY Rank that made the most difference!","<strong>GALAXY [Arch Lich Ra’Zan]...>>>[Galaxy Consuming Nether Lich Emperor] :: A skill tree capable of calling forth an undead catastrophe at the level of destroying Galaxies, a being that is normally a champion from the Necrotic Universe. Depending on the user, the results of this skill tree may vary. Abilities include [Summon Undead]....>>>[Galactic Undead](5/5), [Abyssal Nether Necrolords](5/5), [Aura of the Nether Lich](5/5), [Soul Reaper](5/5), [Sweet Release of Death](5/5)</strong>","There were a great deal of abilities within the skill tree, some that could be easily simplified and others that deserved to be read to completion!","An important note was also in the description of the skill that stated [Depending on the user, the results of this skill tree may vary]! How strong and ridiculous the results of its abilities could be...were all up to the being utilizing it!","As for its abilities?","[Soul Reaper] was a wondrous ability that granted all the summoned Undead within the legion +10,000% Soul Damage, while [Aura of the Nether Lich] allowed for the unique aura of the Galaxy Consuming Nether Lich Emperor to surround all undead as they gained +10,000 to All Damage, Regeneration, as well as Attack and Cast Speed.","These abilities were the ones that could simply be given summaries of.","They were shocking enough that Noah asked himself why he had not raised and utilized this skill at GALAXY rank sooner!","<strong>[Galactic Undead] :: All of the summoned Undead under the banner of the Galaxy Consuming Nether Lich Emperor will at the least be in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm. The more powerful Undead that could be summoned in the Middle Tier to Peak Tier GALAXY include Abyssal Undead, Lich Kings, Death Knights, Abominations, Crypt Lords, Wights, and Primal Zombies that can spread galaxy ending plagues. </strong>","<strong>[Abyssal Nether Necrolords] :: On top of many other specialized Undead, the Nether Lich Emperor can call forth Abyssal Nether Necrolords that reside deep in the heart of the Necrotic Universe with the aid of its Master. These Necrolords are relentless creatures hell-bent on destruction, proficient in the Grand Dao of Decadence as they cause the dissolution of every area they pass through.</strong>","<strong>[Sweet Release of Death](5/5) :: The Nether Lich Emperor rarely releases his legion to return to rest. When they are released and given the sweet release of death, it is done so in a decadent fashion as all of the currently Summoned Undead explode to deal the collective damage of all of them in the form of Soul Damage towards the selected targets.</strong>","A wondrous skill tree.","One truly worthy as Noah even thought it was almost on par with the Blood Lord skill tree that granted him his stupendous clones!","This was the same skill tree that even Barbatos had been able to bring up to the GALAXY Rank by utilizing her Skill Points, but even she could not use it at even 1% effectiveness as Noah could...the skill tree requiring simply too much mana to keep the Nether Lich Emperor active and even provide it the mana to utilize to summon creatures such as the Abyssal Nether Necrolords, Primal Zombies, or the Abyssal Undead.","If someone other than Noah utilized this skill tree, they would be drained of all of their mana in a matter of minutes as they cannot sustain it!","Almost as if it was made purely for him!"]},{"number":874,"title":"Chapter 874: Chapter 873 - You thought it was over?!","paragraphs":["While seated atop his Ruination Throne, Noah called upon the Galaxy Consuming Nether Lich Emperor.","RIIIP!","The chaotic void was ripped apart to allow its entrance, a terrifying robed Lich towering over 20 meters in size making its appearance.","The robe was tinged with the color of blood as within, two red flames shone from a pristine obsidian skull that stared towards Noah.","As this skill tree was an ability cast by him, it was influenced by his own power, the summoned Nether Lich Emperor brought forth thrummed with the wondrous essence of Ruination!","The appearance of the Nether Lich Emperor took Morgana and the Sword Emperor by surprise as shockingly, they found this creature to be releasing the aura of...a Sage!","Noah had unexpectedly called forth a Summon, and it was a creature at the stage of a Sage...","\"F.u.c.k me...\" Morgana could only shake her head and mutter under her breath silently at this scene, but the surprises weren’t done.","DING!","The Nether Lich Emperor wielded an enormous skull staff that held a laughing and crying skull, this skull staff smashing onto the chaotic void as it seemingly shattered, a large amount of Undead beginning to erupt from the ruptured spaces.","Abyssal Undead, Lich Kings, Death Knights, Abominations, Crypt Lords, Wights, Primal Zombies...in the thousands, all of them began to appear as they filled up the spaces that the inhabitants of the Infinite Galaxy had not filled up.","What was the most striking about these undead aside from them ranging from 2 meters in size to some being 100 meters in size...was the fact that all of them were undoubtedly in the GALAXY Realm!","Not just within the GALAXY Realm, but the Manifested stage of it!","Thousands of terrifying undead that shimmered with illusory galaxies...","\"...!\"","Shock rose on the face of the newly arriving allies at this scene as they knew to be able to use an ability that called forth so many creatures at the GALAXY Realm...the essence consumption was something nobody should have.","Yet the being on the Ruination Throne defied all these expectations as aside from the thousands of GALAXY Rank Undead being summoned, the chaotic void tore even further apart as red skeleton hands began to crawl out, n.a.k.e.d skeletons that were fully shining crimson making their appearance!","The Abyssal Nether Necrolords that were creatures who had fully comprehended the Grand Dao of Decadence rose from the call of the Nether Lich Emperor.","Of course, if they fully comprehended a Dao, they were releasing the aura of an Entity.","The summoned Nether Lich Emperor had called forth thousands of Undead at the GALAXY Realm, and it was now summoning Entities!","Entities!","\"Oh come on...!.\"","Tens of shimmering crimson n.a.k.e.d skeletons rose, each one carrying a red skull staff as they each towered at 20 meters.","A maximum of 100 seemed to be the allowable summon limit from the Nether Lich Emperor...causing for 100 Entities to appear wondrously among the constantly growing Undead Legion!","All of the undead shimmered with a wondrous red light, their bodies releasing terrifying fluctuations as their eyes shone with crimson flames.","A terrifying number of them continued to propagate the surrounding chaotic void as even Noah’s allies and subordinates felt their hearts chill at this singular ability!","Barbatos was looking at the scene with shining eyes as she knew she would get vastly different results when she summoned her undead, none that would be anywhere near as powerful as Noah’s, where she could at most call forth the Abyssal Undead and Lich Kings in the numbers of hundreds to sustain them for an hour or two, or call forth thousands of weaker ones that could stay for many hours.","The problem lay in mana.","The skill that was cast by Noah had even shaken the hearts of his allies as he was ready to point it towards the Spirit Race.","There was also a fact that some readers may have not caught on.","It was the fact that this was an ability that was cast by him.","The skill he cast that called forth the Nether Lich Emperor also benefited from his stupendous strength of 15% purification.","Do you recall what 15% Purification provided?","If one truly understood the significance of this, they would know that Noah wasn’t just moving as a chess piece on top of a huge board that was the Dark Universe...but that he was about to destroy all the other pieces and flip the whole board over!","For this fight, he was going overboard!","At the Glorious sight before him, Noah’s body palpated with strength as he stared at the legions he had called forth from the Infinite Galaxy, as well as the Undead Legion that was constantly growing.","You would think he was done. You would think that the show of power was over!","But...he wasn’t done! He truly wanted to go above and beyond for this fight as the preparations weren’t done!","RUMBLE!","His body glimmered atop the throne as he cast abilities that allowed him to summon beings at the same stage as him.","{Witch Slaves} from the Demon King Sitri that called forth 3 Undead Witches proficient in Blood Magic.","{Primal Conjureror} from Demon King Gremory that called forth 2 Creatures at the same rank as the user. They used to be Trolls and Dullahans as options, later scaled up to Red Dragons, Chaos Pixies, and Abyssal Phoenixes.","Noah’s thoughts moved as his essence surged, these two skills being cast as gloriously, the auras of 5 Sages had begun blooming around Noah!","\"...\"","...It was just f.u.c.k.i.n.g ridiculous at this point."]},{"number":875,"title":"Chapter 875: Chapter 874 - The Incorporeal Spirit Race! I","paragraphs":["Three devilishly voluptuous Witch Slaves that trembled with the aura of Sages appeared, the aura of Ruination present on their bodies!","They were wearing scantily clad clothes as their red eyes vibrated with power, each of them bowing grandly towards the Emperor on the Ruination Throne.","An enormous Chaos Pixie over 100 meters in size also appeared, its childish face terrifying as its wings fully glimmered red. It was accompanied by the appearance of an Abyssal Phoenix that shone with black and blue flames, their arrival causing those watching to nearly lose their minds as it really was the appearance of 5 beings with the aura of Sages.","\"You can’t just do that...\"","The tired voice of Morgana rang out as she wondered whether she should even bother complaining and being surprised at the shocking actions of this being.","Who the hell goes ahead and summons multiple beings at the stage of Sages after stepping into this stage themselves just a few days prior?!","The shock and stupor from Morgana had made her so tired as at this point, she was utterly defeated as she just shook her head at the ridiculousness and waved a white flag. The ridiculous guy could do whatever he wanted from now on and she would just watch and accept it as a matter of fact.","Noah grandly looked at the sight of the Undead Legion that shimmered with Manifested Galaxies and the Witch Slaves and Primal Spirits bowing towards him in subservience, turning his head towards the Legions of beings from the Infinite Galaxy as he began to speak, his voice spreading out far across the chaotic void!","\"I stand before you today not as a Ruler, but as a being just like you with a dream! A dream to live a life full of happiness and wonder, to live in a Universe that isn’t headed towards destruction!\"","RUMBLE!","He began a speech abruptly after such shocking actions, but his voice drew in every single soul as they listened intently, his words resonating in their origins!","The hearts of many beings shook as Noah began, feeling their hearts beating faster as their blood began to boil.","\"I will live just like you all if we succeed, and I will die just like you all if we don’t! But against the enemies that wish to snatch the dream of happiness from us...against the enemies that wish for the destruction of our Universe...we cannot lose!\"","It was unknown who began, but a bellow rang out from the side of Vampyres as it carried throughout the numerous Legions, bellowing voices of GALAXY Rank experts and Entities resounding out.","\"Although we are from different Galaxies, from different Races and cultures...we have fought and progressed together! We are now fighting for freedom and the safety of our home, a fight that we cannot lose!\"","Noah’s eyes traveled across the many regions that consisted of beings from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, Primal Winged Expanse, the Consummate Sword Galaxy...and so many more. Each of them felt his words as they looked at each other, more bellowing screams ringing out!","OOOOOH!","\"Towards these unruly beings that wish Death to their own Universe...we shall stand atop the ashes of their souls as Champions!\"","OOOOOH!","Beings were thumping their c.h.e.s.ts or smashing their feet onto the empty chaotic void, causing heartrending reverberations to ring out as they all felt their excitement reaching the absolute peak.","Essence wildly flew out as the bellows of many beings reverberated across the chaotic void, Noah’s throne vibrating with power as it turned towards the direction of the Spirit Domains and began to move forward, his voice resounding out once more.","\"Set off!\"","The essence of many beings in the peak of power of this Universe thrummed out, a fearsome Undead Legion also moving with them as the chaotic void shook when all of them moved in conjunction while following a man moving on a throne.","The auras of multiple Sages surrounded the Ruination Throne as they followed their Master!","The hearts of the Legions from the Infinite Galaxy were filled with the light of hope as they moved with vigor towards a brighter future, as they aimed their swords towards the Spirit Race!","This caused for the shocking sight of the powerful forces of the Infinite Galaxy beginning to cross the dark chaotic void, their movements causing the waves of fate and destiny to shift as they soon neared the Spirit Domains!","---","Some light years away from the enormous force that was piercing across the chaotic void.","The location where the Spirit Domains of the Spirit Race resided could be seen grandly.","If an expert looked at them from a light year or two away, they would be able to notice the outline of the Spirit Domains that looked like enormous circular balls of lights that shimmered grandly in the chaotic void!","Their boundaries were shockingly clear as one could see the stellar bodies within, these Spirit Domains being like large bubbles floating in the chaotic void as they seemed extremely delicate!","The vast Spirit Domains held an uncountable number of the Spirit Race, and they seemed to be extremely calm and at peace while a terrifying force barreled towards them. Some of the brighter Domains seemed empty though, as its inhabitants were not actually there, but in another location.","Opposite the direction from where Noah’s forces were coming from, a cl.u.s.ter of a truly incomprehensible number of beings could be seen!","They floated in front of the first Spirit Domain as the luminous barrier of the domain illuminated the nearby hundreds of miles of the chaotic void, even a being in the EPIC Rank being able to see everything around clearly.","Their bodies were incorporeal as their faces were blank, their eyes being the only thing shining as from within...one could see an immense amount of confidence.","Overflowing confidence!"]},{"number":876,"title":"Chapter 876: Chapter 875 - The Incorporeal Spirit Race! II","paragraphs":["One might themselves asking for what reason the Spirit Race would hold such immense confidence?","There were actually a variety of answers for this question, but they could not be revealed so easily as one of the answers came in the form of a Grand Dao- one that was particularly ranked high among the many Grand Daos out there...it was the Grand Dao of Destiny!","A Dao that allowed a being to pierce through the abstruse mysteries of the fates of others and the forces moving either with them or against them...a Dao that would take too many pages to explain just from its sheer mysteriousness.","Through this Dao, the Sages of the Spirit Race knew that the Master of Ruination was coming!","They knew of the forces he was bringing!","They also knew...of the eventual result they had calculated.","Through all of this, they weren’t filled with fear as instead, overwhelming confidence leaked through every part of their orifices!","Even though towards the past few days when they had not been able to glean any more data from the Master of Ruination, they calculated that his strength would not rise that drastically for him to escape their calculations.","Mind you, the last time they could glean information about Noah was the moment before his battle with the Sword Emperor, right before he assimilated all Universal Laws and obtained the Cosmic Dao that was the reason for their stoppage of information!","It was only a day or at most 2 days since then.","For what could change in such a short period of time?","The uncountable number of Spirit Race filling up the chaotic void were in an orderly state, all of them forming nest lines as their bodies thrummed with power.","The ones lined up ranged from Low Tier GALAXY all the way to Peak, Entities and Sages filling the ranks at the very forefront!","The Sages took the lead as beings that looked extremely similar to each other formed a small line to stand in front of the innumerable army.","Each of the Sages had a shimmering blue crown that matched the hazy shape of their bodies, these blue crows spinning wondrously atop their heads as they pulsed with essence.","They would occasionally speak amongst themselves every few minutes.","\"We cannot discern the Master of Ruination, but those around him are no problem. The Sword Emperor is weakened to a large extent, most likely in a bid to increase the strength of the Master of Ruination. The childish Sage is at the same level, while another Sage has risen from the ranks of beings around our target.\"","The Sage that had first come in contact with Noah through Sister Gold smiled.","\"The target...the Master of Ruination...\"","\"If he hadn’t come into the picture for just a few more months, the goal would have been achieved with surety.\"","The sonorous voice of another Sage rang out, and one would even find it hard to distinguish their voices apart!","\"The theory we pushed aside as the cause for him being hidden from us may actually be true though.\"","\"...possibly, after all- it is in his title. How unfair the Cosmos would be if that were the case.\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking words filled with clues came out from these terrifying beings, their eerie conversation continuing!","\"Haha, when have the Cosmos ever been fair? It is why we must do things this way. We cannot depend on things to be handed down to us like the others.\"","\"Until we can forge our own path...\"","\"Until we have achieved it ourselves!\"","THRUM!","Dao essences swirled around them, shimmering with gold as it represented Destiny- but there were a great deal of other Dao essences swarming around them!","At this moment, they went quiet as from a few hundred miles away, they began to sense reverberations ringing out from the chaotic void.","Gradually, the image of a magisterial throne appeared on the horizon, a man domineeringly situated on this throne as his eyes released glorious beams of red light!","A bouncing Blue Slime could be seen by the side as an arrogant Emperor Penguin also came into the picture. Behind them, the shocking auras of 5 Sages appeared as they floated protectively around being atop the Throne.","THRUUUM!","The shocking figures of his Summons floated around him, the shimmering Golden Crow causing all the others to be seen vibrantly.","Next, the terrifying figure of the Nether Lich Emperor appeared, followed by an enormous Undead Legion that was led by 100 Entities- the Necrolords that comprehended the Grand Dao of Decadence!","It was only then that the raucous Legions from the Infinite Galaxy made their appearance.","The leaders of the Ancient Powers Noah had absorbed.","The Sword Emperor and Morgana!","The Holy Emperor, Old Man Khan, Imperial Adjudicator, Anna...","The Harbingers of Sin that carried with them their own resplendent Animus Summons as Barbatos was seen with a shimmering Monkey King, the Sword King Kazuhiko sitting atop a Galaxy Devouring Wolf!","Nearly all the powerhouses of the Infinite Galaxy appeared grandly as they all rallied behind Noah who floated with his throne towards the Sages of the Spirit Race.","The two sides closed in on each other as essence thrummed gloriously, yet the innumerable and incorporeal beings of the Spirit Race remained still!","The Spirit Race Sages at the forefront broke the silence as they actually talked amongst each other once again.","\"He is actually a Sage himself...\"","\"Not a weak one at that. And those things connected to him...interesting!\"","\"What’s even more interesting is the Essence he is giving off!\"","RUMBLE!","The eyes of the Sages of the Spirit Rave were actually shining as they stared at the numerous Legions, but moreover focused on the being atop the Throne of Ruination.","\"Hmm, it truly was the theory we pushed aside. Truly unfair!\"","...!","Even while faced with a terrifying force that they had largely not foreseen, the Sages of the Spirit Race actually did not lose their composure!","Far off in the distance, Noah sat upon his throne as he stared at this scene with sharp eyes that glimmered with blazing light..."]},{"number":877,"title":"Chapter 877: Chapter 876 - We Have Accounted For Everything!","paragraphs":["Noah’s eyes landed on the Sages of the Spirit Race as they constricted tightly.","It was because of the fact that he counted 10 of them!","These beings had humanoid forms, but their bodies were incorporeal as they almost looked like Spirits of the Dead!","But the Sages of the Spirit Race were much more refined as each of them held a shimmering blue crown floating atop their heads, these crowns screaming their status as big bosses while they grandly floated in the chaotic void.","Seeing their composure even while facing off such an enormous force, he looked at them deeply as he wanted to discern exactly what they were!","Yet...he actually found nothing! Noah’s eyes trembled as for the first time ever since he obtained the Protagonist Trait, something was actually blocked from him when his eyes landed on all the Sages of the Spirit Race.","His eyes then turned to the Entities and GALAXY experts of the Spirit Race as with them, he could discern their information with no issues! Beings like Sister Gold that stood behind the Sages...he could see their information just fine when he utilized Eyes of Truth.","But as for these Sages?","[Spirit Race Sage] :: -----------...","[Spirit Race Sage] :: ----------...","For each of them, all 10 of them...he found nothing!","It was a truly curious case as he would have wondered what the reason was and spent a great deal of time on it in the past, but as he now carried a tremendous force of power and Legions of beings behind him, he cared not as he raised his voice towards the Spirit Race in a domineering manner!","\"If I ask nicely, will you just hand the Ruination Cores to me?\"","\"...\"","His voice only received black expressions from the Sages of the Spirit Race as the one at the very forefront spoke clearly, the two forces in a stand off as they could erupt at any time.","\"Handing over the Ruination Cores to you would interfere with our plans, so it cannot be done, Child.\"","Noah’s eyes shone at this sort of tone as he nodded, vibrant red essence erupting from him as his aura began to rise towards the peak.","\"And the reason why you all do not wish for the Dark Universe to rejoin the Primordial Cosmos?\"","A deafening silence appeared as even the Sages of the Spirit Race had not expected Noah to be so straightforward. They looked amongst each other as wondrous smiles formed on their lips, the one at the forefront replying lightly.","\"A fairly simple reason, but it is not time for you to know it as again...it shall interfere with the plan!\"","...!","\"Plans, plans, plans...in the face of ultimate strength, what do your plans amount to?\"","RUMBLE","Noah’s eyes turned cold as his Throne of Ruination moved forward alone, unhindered!","Even the Emperor Penguin stayed behind as the Throne only carried Noah and the Blue Slime situated on it towards the terrifying figures of 10 Spirit Race Sages and all the innumerable beings behind them.","He went forward as he came close to these beings because with over 15% Purification...he didn’t fear them!","With his body rumbling with the strength of a Cosmic Dao, he didn’t consider these Sages to be anything much with the aura of multiple Grand Daos Swirling around them.","So his magisterial throne crossed the few miles distance of the Chaotic Void as his eyes that blazed with luminous red light actually came to gaze upon all the Sages of the Spirit Race up close, with the throne only being a few inches away from them!","WAAA!","A sense of majesty and wonder flooded out from this scene, Noah elevating his throne to be a few inches higher as the eyes of the Spirit Race Sages had to rise to meet him.","Neither side moved at this shocking scene as far in the back, Morgana was tugging on the Sword Emperor’s sleeve in shock at the domineering scene!","Even Noah’s own forces were shocked as the innumerable numbers of the Spirit Race also floated still. Not a single move was made as the Emperor on the Ruination Throne stared at the 10 Sages.","The Spirit Race Sage at the very forefront glanced towards Noah with a light smile as he spoke.","\"There is no path where you win.\"","THRUM!","\"We have accounted for everything, every possible path that could be taken and anything that could go wrong. Through all of it, our plan succeeds.\"","...!","Noah’s eyes remained placid at these words, his bright eyes looking at these beings from up close as he found them truly detestable.","His throne thrummed with Ruination Essence as his body now had tendrils of such Essence coursing through it, his full strength had the boost of over 15% Purification exploding out!","The Sages of the Spirit Race stared at this scene silently as their own bodies began to explode with power, each of the 10 showing strength that shockingly equaled to a Sage that had reached the cap of 10% Purification while utilizing Primordial Essence!","\"You think you have accounted for anything and everything...but you have not truly accounted for me.\"","THRUM!","Noah raised his head arrogantly upon the throne as Ruination Essence exploded out, threatening to swallow and destroy everything in its sight!","\"OOOOOH\"","The Legions behind him saw this scene as they roared out grandly, their bodies glimmering with light as they pierced through the chaotic void.","The staff of the Nether Lich Emperor smashed down onto the chaotic void as a sound that ushered the advancement of the Undead Legion commenced!","OOOOOH!","Tiamat, Jörmungandr, the Golden Crow...all of Noah’s pets shone with an immense crimson brilliance as the clones already merged with them, their bodies releasing terrifying strength at the level of a Sage as they thundered forward!","The glittering bodies of the innumerable numbers of Spirit Race before them whose weakest were in the Low Tier GALAXY and the strongest were Sages...they seemed like the most pristine loot they could come across as they charged forward with vigor!","The Final War for the Dark Universe had officially begun!"]},{"number":878,"title":"Chapter 878: Chapter 877 - DICTATORIAL! I","paragraphs":["RUUUUUMBLE!","Reverberations were spreading out across all surroundings as the chaotic void was constantly being shattered and reformed.","It was a chaotic scene as a truly large number of parties were fighting amongst each other, the forces of the incorporeal Spirit Race weaving through the chaotic void as their bodies thrummed with many Dao essences!","This powerful Race of beings was nearly immune to physical damage as the only thing that could damage them were beings who could deal soul attacks.","From the Legions of the Infinite Galaxy, the ones that had begun dealing the most damage to the Spirit Race...were the Undead Legions that the Nether Lich Emperor commanded!","Each of these terrifying beings dealt heavy Soul Damage as from the Spirit Race that began to perish, it was mainly from the hands of the Necrolords that used the stupendous abilities of the Dao of Decadence.","In the Necrotic Universe, when Necrolords such as these rose to a high enough level, there was a legend that they could go above the Grand Dao of Decadence as they possibly gained comprehensions in the Cosmic Dao of Necromancy!","Throughout history though, it was mainly the Champions like Nether Lich Emperors that had come closest to this peak of strength.","These terrifying beings with deep histories moved against the Spirit Race as the incorporeal beings felt tremendous pressure from the Undead Legions alone!","In other regions, the stellar battles of the Harbingers of Sin could be seen as in a region of space, the gargantuan expanded figure of the Emperor Penguin could be seen.","Its piercing cry rang out as an innumerable number of Swords waved around it, this creature that was now a Sage actually bullying Entities and collecting a great amount of loot as it didn’t join the fight with the 10 Sages!","The Penguin, like Morgana and the Sword Emperor, were some of the free Sages that led the Legions of Entities and GALAXY Experts to wreck the ranks of the Spirit Race.","Against the 10 Spirit Race Sages, Noah was ridiculously matching all of them as if we bothered to tally, we would realize just Noah alone could produce over 10 Sages!","Without even including himself, there were the 8 Animus Summons fused with his clones that made 8 Sages...and there were 5 more Sages that he summoned from his unique skills!","Even the Nether Lich Emperor that was a Sage itself was merely destroying the ranks of the expressionless Spirit Race as it collected Dao Crystals of many Daos and Assimilation Crystals, along with any other loot they came across.","There was a point that many had to keep note of when it came to the loot of Dao Crystals- the fact that the Spirit Race was learned in many Daos, and it meant they could drop a great deal of varying amounts of Dao Crystals!","This was especially so because the Affix was doubled from 10% to 20%!","But...as all the other Sages and Nether Lich focused their attention on the large numbers of Spirit Race Entities and GALAXY Experts, Noah alone faced their 10 Sages as he still sat on his throne.","He was acting so damn domineering against the confident looking Spirit Sages that against them, he didn’t even stand from his throne of Ruination!","His Animus Pets were the ones weaving across the stupendous skills of the Sages that Noah could not get details about, only observing with his sharp eyes powerful attacks that carried golden lights fly from the Sages.","[Destiny’s Reversal].","Simple words were uttered as in the next moment, the attacks from the Animus Summons were deconstructed into nothingness as if they never existed!","[Destiny of Destruction].","RUMBLE!","An ability that combined the essence of two Daos opposed the Chaos Pixie and Abyssal Phoenix’s attacks!","The skills of the Spirit Sages were mysterious as some even contained the essence of 2 or 3 Grand Daos.","Each of them carried a tremendously powerful Soul Damage attribute as they had to be avoided!","Yet Noah remained atop his Ruination Throne as he merely spammed [Cardinal Swords of Ruination] while raising his head arrogantly.","\"Is this among all the paths you have seen?! Is everything going according to your grand plan?!\"","BOOM!","A ridiculous amount of Cardinal Swords of Ruination exploded towards a single Sage, the one that had been talking with Noah at the very forefront.","His body glimmered with the golden light of Destiny among many other Grand and Lesser Daos, his expression remaining placid even with the initial outlook of the battle that put the Spirit Race at a disadvantage merely in terms of numbers and power!","The Blue crown floating atop the head of Sage shimmered as he spoke with a majestic voice.","\"Yes. Even with all this, everything is proceeding towards our goal!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s eyes squinted at this reply as he felt like there was something he had missed.","He had overprepared.","Him alone was enough to stand against all of their Sages! Yet...yet the Sages of the Spirit Race fought as if nothing was wrong, as if everything still proceeded according to their so called plans!","RUMBLE","Noah’s eyes were filled with blazing light as he gave a command, the 100 Necrolords that were ripping apart Entities in another region all instantly being teleported to surround a Sage that was facing the wrath of the Queen Dowager.","The moment the Necrolords were teleported in, Tiamat was teleported out as in the next instant, Noah cast the [Sweet Release of Death].","It was a skill that sacrificed the Legions of Undead for tremendous targetted soul damage. A skill that was only even more powerful depending on the ranks of undead sacrificed!","...BOOOOOOM!","Void shattering waves were created as 100 Necrolords were sacrificed in an instant, their bodies that surrounded the Sage with a glimmering Blue crown ballooning and exploding out as all of their damage was targeted to this single being!","100 Entities...self destructed!","RIIIIP!","In the area where a majestic Spirit Race Sage used to be, a tattered body was ripped apart as the crown above it was shattered, the incorporeal body vibrating as it exploded out luminously a second later!","\"...\"","A Sage...dead!","Noah raised his head atop the Throne of Ruination at this scene, waving his hands as the Nether Lich Emperor smashed his staff down and caused the chaotic void to split open once more, 100 more terrifying Necrolord Entities stepping out as he voiced out domineeringly.","\"Is this still in your calculations and plans?!\"","RUMBLE","Magisterial!","Dictatorial!!!","The Emperor domineeringly looked upon the front most Spirit Sage after stupendously using his +150,000% boost in All Parameters to deal a devastating Soul Attack against a Sage that wiped it out instantly!","\"Everything is gloriously going according to plan, O Master of Ruination!\"","...!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":879,"title":"Chapter 879: Chapter 878 - DICTATORIAL! II","paragraphs":["A Sage had fallen, and in response to this- the strongest Spirit Race Sage said everything was gloriously going according to plan!","The fact that Noah could not garner any information about them and the way the Sages continued to conduct themselves, he knew something was afoot.","\"Do not hold back.\"","He gave the command to his forces at this juncture as they exploded with even more vigor against the forces of the Spirit Race.","Yet the Sages weaved in and out as they seemed like true experts on the battlefield, using their proficiency in many Daos to repel attacks while keeping the status quo!","At this point in time, Noah was also doing something behind the scenes as in a Time Space of the Infinite Galaxy, there were 2 clones grasping multiple Dao and Assimilation Crystals.","His Blood Lord Skill tree allowed him 5 Clones per body, his split origin giving him 2 bodies and the capability to summon 10 clones!","8 were merged with the Animus Summons as two of them were currently using the loot that was concurrently being received in battle!","Noah browsed through all the loot that dropped as he focused on the golden shimmering Dao Crystals that represented the Grand Dao of Destiny.","He had many questions and no answers, and he wanted to peer behind the veil of confidence the Spirit Race held as he wanted to learn about Destiny!","RUMBLE!","The clones began absorbing the Dao Crystal with fervor as with just half a minute passing in the outside world, nearly an hour had passed in the Time Space. This shocking time difference in conjunction with the crazy percentages Noah had to Dao Comprehension and Assimilation made it so that Noah fully comprehended the Grand Dao of Destiny in less than 30 seconds in the outside world.","30 seconds!","Then the 2 clones began using the old and newly appearing Assimilation Crystals as they shot the percentage for this up as well, another half a minute passing in the outside world as the Emperor sitting atop the Throne of Ruination exploded with the Grand golden light of Destiny.","That was a Grand Dao learned in less than a minute.","OOOOOH!","A triumphant bellow came from Noah’s mouth as it shot out golden light, his eyes releasing beams of red light as he looked ridiculously magnificent at this moment!","While he sat on his throne, his essence flooded towards the Dao of Destiny as he wanted to pry open the mysteries hidden from him!","RUMBLE","A golden light erupted out from his body as the Spirit Race Sages looked over towards him with shining eyes.","Noah felt like he was in a unique out of body experience, his aura stretched out as he noticed a great deal of golden particles all around him.","BZZZT!","His mind was flooded with information as he saw a grand image- it was the image of many small blue particles...and each of these blue particles seemed to be connected together as they formed into a triangle. At the top of this triangle...there was a single blue particle that stood above all of them as all the lines of connection came to it!","...!","Noah’s eyes constricted as he deciphered the information he was receiving.","\"Oh? Haha. Very good.\" At this point, the voice of a Sage rang out as he withstood another Cardinal Sword of Ruination that was now also ringed with the light of Destiny, the Spirit Race Sage having seemingly gotten information on something!","\"We have already passed the crucial junction, so even if I tell you of the glorious purpose, it would be of no consequence!\"","RUMBLE!","The centermost Sage then spoke while his body glimmered with innumerable golden lines. Each of these lines weaved together as they released tendrils of terrifying might that tore apart space itself while defending him from any attacks.","The moment his words finished, Noah came out of the state where he was discerning Destiny, feeling something else as he looked up towards a far direction light years away from this location.","Noah’s eyes glimmered with light as he calculated some things while he looked at the ruptures spreading out light years away. The moment they appeared, the Sage said they had passed a crucial juncture!","He also understood the meaning of this somewhat as after comprehending the Grand Dao of Destiny, he could sense many things all around him, even being able to understand the rate that the Ruptures would spread and what it could mean.","He also understood something else as he turned to look at the Sages of the Spirit Race.","Even though they claimed they had everything under control as they grasped the stupendous Dao of Destiny...he found out that even while many things seemed set, they could ultimately be changed and altered!","He sat atop his throne as even at the shocking scene of Fractures tearing apart space, his attacks continued even more vigorously, the constant spamming of Cardinal Swords of Ruination never stopping as he looked closely at the shining Sage while his clones in the Time Space of the Infinite Galaxy grabbed more of the incoming loot from this war to increase Noah’s power by even a little.","As for the Spirit Race...there seemed to be many things in play as the Sage was extremely talkative!","It was a big boss that actually loved to talk and monologue in the middle of battle.","Noah hated these types of big bosses the most!","\"Do you know of the vast Primordial Cosmos? Of the place that houses Universes of all types?!\"","’Ah...’","The moment this f.u.c.k.i.n.g Sage began talking about the Primordial Cosmos and its Universes, along with its prior words about the newly appearing Fractures, Noah’s put together the information he was getting from the wondrous Dao of Destiny as his mind affirmed one of his theories for the Spirit Race and their motives as for why they didn’t care for the survival of the Dark Universe!","\"There are many mysteries surrounding the Primordial Cosmos themselves, but the truly knowledgeable ones know that outside of the Primordial Cosmos...there exists an endless Sea of Ruination!\"","...!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":880,"title":"Chapter 880: Chapter 879 - Of course there had to be a Great Sage! I","paragraphs":["Under the influence of the Dao of Destiny, it felt like Noah’s sight had opened up! Along with the shocking words of the Spirit Race Sage that talked of the Primordial Cosmos, he understood some things!","\"Dangerous, unpredictable, and most of all...a destructive sea that not a single being can traverse through unless they have ultimate strength or an extremely unique ability. That is the Sea of Ruination that exists outside the Primordial Cosmos\"","BOOOM! BOOOM!","Noah’s Cardinal Swords of Ruination began descending down ever faster the more this being talked, Noah’s face cold as in the next instant, his mind worked at rapid speeds as he gave multiple commands.","He had gotten much of the information he needed as now was the time to act.","His Animus Pets and 5 conjured Sages moved even faster as they went for the kill while himself...he looked at the 65+ million and continuously growing skill points he had put aside for emergency use the moment this Sage began talking of the Primordial Cosmos and the Sea of Ruination!","\"So you can imagine my surprise when over a hundred thousand years ago, I coincidentally came upon a few Universal Forces actually ganging up on a single Universe, and I found that they...were actually competing for the ownership of a Cosmic Treasure.\"","...!","At these words, Noah entirely tuned out the Sage that had his blue crown shimmering brighter than ever- his face serious as he put to practice a variety of possible skills he had prepared against the Incorporeal Spirit Race that were only heavily affected by soul damage.","The golden light of Destiny veered him towards a particular skill as he glanced at it!","Since the abilities were already thought of beforehand, the one he was led to was the priciest one as the skill points he had further collected since the war with the Spirit Race began were spent, a skill very quickly being formed!","<strong>[Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs] :: An ability purely created for the aspect of soul damage. Allows the user to throw unstable compressed Galaxies that contain the essence of all of their comprehended Daos and Laws to achieve the effect of +50,000% Soul Damage. The Spirit Bombs are unavoidable as after they are cast, their target must be hit. Cost of Skill Creation- 69,000,000.</strong>","A skill that utilized all his remaining saved up skill points, one for him to quickly spam and clear out any terrain beings that could only be hurt through Soul Damage!","[Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs]...","THRUM!","He began spamming as the talkative Spirit Race Sage looked towards him with brightening eyes, his body becoming enveloped in an array of golden shields that sang with the aura of Destiny!","[The Savior’s Bastion of Golden Destiny].","RUMBLE!","As an innumerable number of Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs appeared, an array of golden shields wrapped around a certain Sage.","The Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs shimmered with wondrous rainbow colored lights as they caused space to tremble when they came to be.","They targeted the much too vocal Sage as they swarmed towards him, the unstable Galaxies exploding out in a flood of Dao Essence as everything around it was ripped apart!","The golden light of Destiny that formed multiple shields around the Sage...they were all ripped apart one by one.","RUUUMBLE!","The chaotic void quaked as when the scene cleared, only the ripped apart body of an Incorporeal Sage remained!","Another Spirit Race Sage, dead!","Noah wasted no more time as he turned his eyes to the other Spirit Race Sages. They were 8 in number as they were swarmed by all of his Animus Summons and 5 Summed Sages, their bodies also lighting up as they began to cast multiple [Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs] themselves.","Yet as his pets cast their fearsome skills and sent them through, all eight remaining Spirit Sages had their blue crowns shimmering with a bright light as their eyes shone with a splendorous blue, their lips moving as a single voice came out from each of them!","\"The Cosmic Treasure they were competing for...was a Myth only known by Universal Realm Hegemonies, yet it was actually real and in the hands of such weak Sages and Great Sages!\"","RUMBLE!","It felt like time had come to a stop as Noah and the Sages on his side watched with sharp eyes as the voice of a singular being came out of the mouths of all Spirit Sages.","As if it was all a single person!","RUMBLE!","An eerie scene was taking place in the midst of the chaotic battle between the forces of the Infinite Galaxy and the Spirit Race.","All the 8 remaining Sages of the Spirit Race had their blue crowns shining in resonance, their eyes shining deep blue as from their mouths, a singular voice resounded out!","\"I was ecstatic to find out about such a secret as I moved in great haste, but alas...the Cosmos are rarely fair!\"","Noah’s eyes constricted as he watched every single Sage speak in the same voice as the most vocal Sage he had just killed, his expression cold as he saw all the 8 Sages congregating together seamlessly as a terrifying force wrapped around them.","The image he had seen when utilizing the Dao of Destiny...of the many blue particles in a triangular formation all connecting to a single one at the very top...it was coming true at this instant!","\"The exact moment I found out about the big secret where I could have easily obtained a Cosmic Treasure only known through myths...was also the moment that unworthy Sages of this Universe decided to use something they did not understand to actually cause for an entire Universe to split off of the Primordial Cosmos!\"","...!","\"Can you imagine such unfairness? The anger I felt at such a time? I could only arrive to observe a piece of the Primordial Cosmos enter the Sea of Ruination, the Cosmic Treasure residing within that Universe being forever lost as anyone with a brain would be able to tell you a Universe cannot survive while being detached from its source!\"","RUMBLE!","The secret as to why the Spirit Race didn’t care for the destruction of the Dark Universe!","The mysteries surrounding them and the tremendous power they held!","It turned out the being at the very top of this Race...was not from the Dark Universe to begin with!"]},{"number":881,"title":"Chapter 881: Chapter 880 - Of course there had to be a Great Sage! II","paragraphs":["As their voices reverberated, the 8 Sages had gathered together as the Blue crowns atop their heads spun rapidly, flying out of their heads and circling around each other as it seemed like they were trying to fuse.","Noah had no habit of letting his enemies power up, sending another command for the newly risen 100 Necrolords to be sacrificed for [Sweet Release of Death] while he continuously spammed Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs!","THRUUUM!","The chaotic void around the 8 Sages was tumultuous as after the terrific attacks landed at their location, an impenetrable golden wall seemed to have arisen as while the Blue crowns above continued to spin and nearly fuse to each other, the bodies of the Spirit Sages were doing the same.","The resonant voice coming from each of their lips continued.","\"Seeing that the distance between the Cosmos and the detached Universe had not been too wide...I chose not to give up as I sent in more than half of my soul to cross the Sea of Ruination and see if I could successfully make it into this Universe without perishing. Sadly...only a sliver of my soul- only a portion, was able to survive the terrifying essence of Ruination.\"","THRUUUM","The 8 bodies of the Spirit Race Sages seamlessly blended together as they didn’t even take all that long, all of them coming together as a brilliant blue light erupted out, the crowns spinning above also fusing into one as they formed into a majestic and enormous blue crown that descended only the head of a 20 meter tall being.","His body was incorporeal as his eyes held limitless wisdom, his mouth continuing to move!","\"This portion survived countless years before I was able to find the unique Spirit Race, and this was finally where I was able to finally get some time to understand the situation around me as I reclaimed my many Daos and planned.\"","The newly formed body of the Spirit Sage shimmered with intense light, where one could actually find...illusory GALAXIES beginning to show around his c.h.e.s.t, but they seemed unstable and ready to fall at any time!","Noah’s eyes constricted from this as he knew what it meant!","It was the Realm above GALAXY that allowed a being to gain the title of a Great Sage, the Realm where from a single GALAXY, one had to birth many more- it was the Galactic Filament Realm!","It was a Realm that was very hard to cross into as many experts would fail to do so for all their lives!","Yet this monstrous being that Noah had found out the identity of now from its words...this being was actually at the cusp of fully forming more stable GALAXIES and stepping into this wondrous Realm.","He was half a stage into the Galactic Filament Realm, Half a Great Sage!","Noah gave a light sigh in his heart as he gathered all of the Sages under him to swarm by his side.","The Sword Emperor and Morgana made their way over as they looked towards the monstrous looking Half-a-Step Great Sage of the Spirit Race.","The being was actually not from their Universe, it being a terrifying creature that had another body that was in a powerful stage in the Primordial Cosmos!","A sliver of its soul had barely crossed the Ruination Sea to reach their Universe, and it had taken over the Spirit Race as it grew them to where they were today. A shocking truth of the race that did not want to save the Universe they were in!","At this moment, the Half-a-Step Great Sage raised his arm as a sense of profound strength released from him, a huge hole tearing apart the chaotic void as Primordial Essence began to flood into him ceaselessly.","The terrifying golden wall that protected this being from Noah’s continuous attacks and Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs was nearly shattered as cracks had spread through it, Noah close to bombing this Half-a-Step Great Sage away in the next seconds!","\"You know, the Dao of Destiny is truly straightforward. It let me know of all the possible plans as out of millions, only two would work with surety.\"","\"When utilizing this Dao, I found that in this Universe, the Cosmic Treasure was actually not destined for me in many the paths I wanted to take, that it would actually merely lead to the death of this sliver of soul that has been recovering! Not destined for the very thing I braved the dangers of the Ruination Sea to cross, it was extremely funny!\"","RUMBLE","The hands of the Half-a-Step Great Sage raised as they thrummed with power, finally saying the shocking words that represented its glorious purpose.","\"But as you now understand...Destiny can be altered! The two paths that were destined for me, both of them had a stupendous boon that was no less treasured than the Cosmic Treasure itself, and if they play out...even the Cosmic Treasure itself could still be in play. It is of course...the Cosmic Dao that many Universal Realm experts strive to get their hands on even in the Primordial Cosmos, the highest form of Dao that very few can grasp, and yet unfairly...the one that was destined for the Master of the Cosmic Treasure who has already comprehended it!\"","...!","\"As for what the two paths were? Haha! One was to experience the destruction of an entire Universe through Ruination, and the other...was to be killed by the destined Master of Ruination himself! Haha!\"","Raucous laughter resounded out across the chaotic void as the goal of the Half-a-Step Great Sage was finally revealed!","It was the Cosmic Dao that in the Primordial Cosmos, only Noah had stepped in on- it was all for Ruination!","THRUM!","Noah’s attacks came to a stop the moment the words of the Half-a-Step Great Sage resounded out, feeling the beat of his heart as many thoughts crossed through his mind.","\"This is why I said we had passed the crucial juncture! The Sea of Ruination will soon ravage the Dark Universe and I will achieve my goal, or the Master of Ruination will kill me...and I will still achieve my goal!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":882,"title":"Chapter 882: Chapter 881 - There is always a third option!","paragraphs":["In the trembling chaotic void, the terrifying Half-a-Step Great Sage continued to speak madly as his face looked towards Noah with intense light.","\"Every time you took down my other 2 bodies...I felt the whispers of a Cosmic Dao enter my ears as the moment I faced utter destruction from you, I would finally step on the path of this tremendous Dao.\"","\"Even a child like you does not grasp the true meaning of it, the true worth of someone capable of utilizing the Dao of Ruination and being able to cross the Ruination Sea outside of the Primordial Cosmos! This is the reason why I decided to simply enjoy the first method, and instead see if I can kill the Master of Ruination so that I can be the only being having access to this Dao.\"","The sinister plan that caused the Half-a-Step Great Sage to fuse his body and step into its terrifying realm came out!","I’m the end, he wanted to experience the death of a Universe to gain the spark of comprehension that would set him on the path of Ruination. He wanted to eliminate the being that had become the Master of Ruination as he took the prime position!","If he learned the Cosmic Dao, he would naturally be able to combine and utilize the Ruination Cores as the Cosmic Treasure would also become his.","\"Yet you haven’t even used your ability to obtain Invincibility for an hour when faced against all my bodies...your strength as a Sage nearly spilling out of the peak of such a stage.\"","RUMBLE","\"I even had plans for when you escape this Time upon your death where I would follow you in the past and kill you there as well...but you threw all of this out when you ridiculously appeared at the stage of a Sage and with a mere wave of your hands produced even more Sages!\"","Yes!","All the plans and contingencies the terrifying being had made were turned into nothingness in the face of true strength.","When Noah’s force came, it was a question of whether the set up plans would ever even get a chance to be utilized!","The Sage actually had the goal of comprehending the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, and he would be able to do so if he experienced the destruction of a Universe with Ruination...or faced destruction from the hands of the Master of Ruination!","Such a shocking reality was extremely shocking to think about!","\"If straining this portion of my soul a bit more might help in taking down a monster like you, I will do so. If not, I’ll have to watch the play of you deciding whether you can kill me and hand me the keys to comprehending Ruination...or if the destruction of this Universe will do it for me!\"","\"Either way...I will not lose!\"","RUMBLE!","The Half-a-Step Great Sage spoke grandly as his words were packed with a great deal of information!","The talkative biggest boss had told Noah everything to answer the questions plaguing him, even going as far as calling a being like him a monster.","What an honor it was to be called a monster from an expert stemming from the Primordial Cosmos!","\"I will not lose...but what will you do? The Sea of Ruination is already ripping apart the portion of the Cosmos torn apart from its home...this Universe will completely be devoured as it does not have the protection of the Primordial Cosmos anymore!\"","\"Will you try and take my life as you grant me the Cosmic Dao? Or will the inevitable destruction of this Universe give it to me? Either way...I win!\"","RUMBLE","\"The moment that I do step on the path of the Cosmic Dao...I will have my main body and soul finally freely traverse the Sea of Ruination as I will come to this destroyed universe to take with me a Cosmic Treasure, your strength next to the full power of my body and soul being negligible!","The glorious Half-a-Step Great Sage said these words with shining eyes, his crowned 20 meter body shimmering with power as Noah just needed a few seconds to think.","A moment after, his body rose from his throne as he turned his eyes towards the direction light years away where he could see Fractures beginning to spread out, where nobody knew how much time was left before these Rifts in space would decimate the entire Universe.","BZZZT!","Ruination Essence flared from him as his hands obtained two Cardinal Swords of Ruination, his hair turning crimson as his eyes blazed with light!","\"Well, that is a decision. But is it the correct one?\"","The Half-a-Step Great Sage that had been drinking Primordial Essence to purify his body saw Noah’s reply, the Tyrannical Emperor’s figure appearing in front of him in the next instant as his body carried large numbers of Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs to smash onto the golden barrier he had been Relentlessly attacking before.","CRACK!","ROAAR!","Tiamat and the other Summoned weaved in on all sides as they went to support their Master against this ferocious enemy, the Legions from the Infinite Galaxy continuing to rip apart the forces of the Spirit Race that had their bodies glimmering with even more strength.","\"I want a piece of this damn Outsider!\"","Morgana’s sharp voice rang out as with her little body that palpated with destruction, she smashed into the figure of the Sage with vigor as she joined the battle!","A single Half-a-Step Great Sage, besieged on all sides by over 10 powerful Sages, most of them just stemming from Noah.","BOOM!","The terrifying Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs were the ones causing the most damage to the big boss, their terrifying +50,000% Soul Damage ripping the defenses that the Half-a-Step Great Sage was setting up in seconds!","\"Purification exceeding the ranks of Sages...this must be from the Ruination Essence, yes? Haha, good! For power such as that, it is still left in the air whether path 1 or 2 will be followed.\"","Death from the Master of Ruination or from the destruction of an entire Universe through Ruination...the Half-a-Step Great Sage would take either as long as he achieved his goal of a Cosmic Dao and gained the ability to traverse freely from the Primordial Cosmos."]},{"number":883,"title":"Chapter 883: Chapter 882 - Innumerable Daos in Seconds!","paragraphs":["Noah analyzed the words of the Half-a-Step Great Sage carefully as he moved.","Since the being repeated over and over again that he would get what he wants from experiencing the destruction of the Universe or from the Hands of the Master of Ruination, Noah simply wanted to find a third option for that.","This third option came in the terrifying identity of a Universal Emperor Slime!","A race that was hunted down by even the powerhouses of the Primordial Cosmos for their unique power, a creature that could turn the tables at any time!","Noah was not looking forward to whatever powerhouse from the Primordial Cosmos who gained the ability to traverse the Ruination Sea and come after him for the Ruination Cores, so this third option had to be utilized.","As for the truthfulness of him being somehow able to comprehend a Cosmic Dao just from him being killed by Noah? He affirmed this to be true with the Grand Dao of Destiny! The soul of this being that had managed to survive Ruination once and enter the Dark Universe while collecting Ruination Cores made this condition viable to this creature as such a soul was only a portion connected to a larger being!","Unless other beings stepped in the Ruination See with half a soul and it came out safe, and then somehow obtained Ruination Cores that the small soul stayed with for over a hundred thousand years- such a thing would not be possible again. So nothing ridiculous like beings gaining comprehensions of a Cosmic Dao merely from being killed by Noah would appear in the future!","BOOOM!","Unstable Galaxies floated around him as they were forward to smash onto the raucous Half-a-Step Great Sage, all of his Summons attacking valiantly as Morgana’s deadly hands palpating with the essence of Destruction fearlessly pounded the enemy!","At this juncture, we have to come to a stop for a second to appreciate the scene playing out.","What was occurring at this moment was a scene of the final war for the Dark Universe, where the most powerful combatants were embroiled in a terrifying battle that would determine many things for the future.","If the scene could be frozen in time, we would be able to see Noah’s Summons surrounded by gorgeous tendrils of Ruination Essence as they released deadly attacks, the figure of Morgana pulsing with the Essence of Destruction onto a Half-a-Step Great Sage, the figure of the gargantuan Emperor Penguin and Barbatos leaving her Holy Undead Army not too far away- as well as the Undead Legion called forth by Noah that had the Nether Lich Emperor pointing its staff towards the glimmering bodies of the Spirit Race!","Then there was Noah.","A being that months ago had only picked up [Fireball] as his first skill. A being that was among the weakest there could be on an unknown planet.","At this period of time, he was shining the most resplendently as he faced a Half-a-Step Great Sage, his eyes blazing with red beams of light as around his body...unstable cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies and vibrating Ruination Swords bloomed out!","This being that was just a Rank F Hunter months ago...was forming and throwing out literal miniaturized Galaxies towards his enemies...","How vast the changes could be in such a short period of time!","But Noah wasn’t thoroughly done as even with this tremendous strength, he still wasn’t getting through the defenses of this Half-a-Step Great Sage to be able to give the third option a possibility.","This was where the clones in the Time Space of the Infinite Galaxy came in!","They had been gaining Dao and Assimilation Crystals every time an Entity of the Spirit Race fell, and they gained an even larger number of Dao Crystals as the GALAXY Rank Spirit Race experts were also learned on the Dao, just not fully comprehending it yet.","This meant that all the Daos the Spirit Race delved in...could now become Noah’s!","RUMBLE","As he clashed with the Half-a-Step Great Sage, the glorious scene resumed as those around felt the aura of the Grand Dao of Destruction erupt around Noah.","It passed through the stage of full comprehension in a second, and then jumped to full assimilation in another second!","BOOOOM!","His strength became even more explosive as the Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs became even more l.u.s.trous.","RUMBLE!","His body glimmered all sorts of colors as the pressure when released only became grander.","Mind you, every fully assimilated Grand Dao gave him +10,000% Increased Damage on top of whatever unique things the specific Daos themselves granted!","This was why his power was increasing greatly every second as he wanted to bring forth all the daos he could until he could overwhelm a Half-a-Step Great Sage purely on the percentage boosts alone.","With his 15% purification paired up with the boosts of multiple Daos...","THRUM!","He continued as those around him stared towards his direction in shock, sensing Noah becoming an Entity in Daos and assimilating them all very quickly in just seconds!","\"Truly ridiculous and unfair how the Cosmos can be! For what reason should someone like you be able to exist? A being so young yet somehow comprehends Lesser and Grand Daos to completion and assimilated them in seconds?\"","RUMBLE","\"Do you see why I say the Cosmos are unprincipled? Do you understand?! Unless you were a monstrous Universal Realm Hegemony that comprehended the Cosmic Dao of Reincarnation and you are simply reclaiming your old comprehensions and Assimilations...what you’re doing now just should not be allowed!\"","THRUM!","The Half-a-Step Great Sage had been clashing with Noah and the others many times in the past few seconds as he seemed fine after each clash, but after Noah comprehended and assimilated his fifth Dao...the Half-a-Step Great Sage began to be pushed back.","...!","The Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs around Noah only formed faster at this scene as they rumbled towards the Half-a-Step Great Sage, yet another Dao aura erupting from Noah!","Vitality, fully comprehended and assimilated.","Voidspace.","Alacrity.","Fortification.","Slaughter.","Summoning!","RUMBLE!","The Spirit Race truly had a vast array of beings that studied many different Daos, where Noah knew it to be the influence of the being that descended onto their souls a long time ago from the Primordial Cosmos.","He was truly thankful for this as even if the beings killed didn’t fully comprehend the Dao- just having proficiency in it would grant him a few Dao Crystals. With his comprehension and Assimilation boosts, it became a cake walk for him to do the shocking actions he was currently doing.","But after the many Daos he just added in a matter of seconds, the one he added last just now was the one to cause a change even more wondrous than the special effects of Grand Daos.","It was the small Lesser Dao of Summoning that went far to forge Noah’s path until he got to where he was today!"]},{"number":884,"title":"Chapter 884: Chapter 883 - Merely a Great Sage! I","paragraphs":["The moment Noah fully assimilated the Dao of Summoning, information of its perks when fully assimilated floated into his mind!","Grand Daos like the Sword gave one the ability to enter a Sword Form that doubled all the boosts of the Dao, Withering had a unique quality of deconstruction, the Grand Dao of Vastness granted one expansive mana reserves, and all the other respective Daos each had their own perks.","The Lesser Dao of Summoning had its perk as well, and it might have not been a big deal to normal beings who fully assimilated it, or even someone like the Holy Emperor.","But for Noah...","<strong>{Aura of the Assimilator of Summoning}: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated the Lesser Dao of Summoning. It grants +5000% Increased Damage to the Summoner and Summoned Pets, and allows the Controller of Summoning to merge his Summons onto him in the form of armament, greatly increasing their battle prowess.</strong>","Aside from a 5000% damage increase that would at this point seem minor with what we’ve seen, it was the perk of an assimilator of the Dao of Summoning being able to merge with all his pets as they would seamlessly attach onto his body as armaments!","Armaments!","THRUM!","His thoughts moved instantly as the essence followed, the enormous body of the Colossal Helios Leviathan that released deadly red rays of plasma being the first to turn into a streak of light as it shot towards Noah.","The light that represented the Leviathan covered his c.h.e.s.t and torso as it shone brightly, the scene clearing up as a gorgeous set of blue-red armor with archaic runic inscriptions appeared grandly on Noah’s body! With the appearance of this, this aura that Noah released became even more oppressive!","RUMBLE!","The figures of the rest of the pets began to shoot towards him as each of them went to a different part of his body.","The Obsidian Panther wrapped around Noah’s feet as sleek red-black boots with obsidian wings formed, while the Calamity Bear wrapped around Noah’s neck and back as a majestic furred coat dr.a.p.ed his back!","The Oculothorax turned into a streak of light that went into Noah’s eyes, forming into stellar contacts that snuggly fit onto both of his eyes as they released horrendous rays of doom lights the moment they appeared.","The light of Jormungandr split in two as within Noah’s hands, curved serpentine blades that pulsated with an intense light appeared!","Tiamat’s enormous figure all went towards Noah’s head and back as it wrapped around, a fearsome draconic head helm and crimson dragon wings forming over Noah that made him look like a dragon warrior!","Lastly, the bright Golden Crow’s light came to float above Noah’s head as it formed into a luminous golden crown filled with archaic runic inscriptions. The golden crown vibrated and released a pulsing light constantly as it washed over Noah, his body constantly clad in vibrant lights.","He stopped there as only the Blue Slime wasn’t fully merged with in the form of an armament, but his current look was a devastating one!","Morgana and the others found themselves breathless when they looked at this scene.","Crimson wings on his back with a dragon helm, a l.u.s.trous armor with two serpentine swords as his eyes blazed with a soul destroying light.","It was a shocking transformation that caused the aura of his body to rise to shocking levels!","His clones that were merged with his pets.","And now his pets that were on his body seamlessly to create a magisterial set of armament!","The boosts...oh the f.u.c.k.i.n.g boosts!","It wasn’t cluttered.","It wasn’t spread apart.","All of it came together in a DICTATORIAL fashion as with a stellar new look as blazing red eyes, he released an aura that was way past a Sage!","Even compared to the Half-a-Step Great Sage in front of him...it seemed higher and more oppressive!","At this juncture, Noah with the demeanor of a true expert moved to attack the stupefied Half-a-Step Great Sage.","BOOOM!","An innumerable number of Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs exploded out, these ones dealing damage multiple times greater than last time as they were now enhanced by a ridiculous amount of boosts! Even Noah was not able to quantify what percentage of boosts he was receiving, as he knew it wasn’t all simply added up from the merged pets.","All he knew was that his body felt invincible, and his strength like he could shatter full sized Galaxies with a swing of his swords!","It was that sense of feeling!","\"Haha! What a Cosmos we live in! What grand creatures that can be born from it! Alright then, O Master of Ruination. Kill me! Let me be destroyed from the hands of the Master of Ruination! From this destruction, I will experience a rebirth as I gain a Cosmic Dao...\"","\"From destruction comes rebirth, from Ruination...\"","THRUM!","The figure of the Half-a-Step Great Sage vibrated with power as Noah’s attacks were actually getting through its defenses.","The serpentine Swords he held tore apart the shimmering blue on the body of the enormous Sage as a starry Expanse was exposed from within!","The Half-a-Step Great Sage was actually excited as even though it wasn’t the path he wanted of him experiencing the Ruination of the Dark Universe, the path of being killed by the Master of Ruination still granted the same result!","All he had to do was have his main body make its way to the Ruination Sea with the newly gained Cosmic Dao...his only task being to locate Noah and take the Cosmic Treasure away from him.","After all, no being in the ranks of Sages or Great Sages could escape the wrath of an expert multiple levels above these!","So the Half-a-Step Great Sage saw the many unstable Galaxies heading towards him and the deadly Animus Summon turned swords as he actually...closed his eyes and welcomed the death of this body.","He waited for the death of this portion of his soul and got ready to reap its rewards!","Oh, the result of this action!!!","A blue assassin that was acting on its own finally made its appearance at this time!"]},{"number":885,"title":"Chapter 885: Chapter 884 - Merely a Great Sage! II","paragraphs":["Pride.","Oh, pride!","It was the deep and conscious satisfaction of oneself, something that experts achieving grand realms have too much of in abundance.","It is pride that causes the downfall of many beings, it is pride that is the cause of great experts becoming careless as all of sudden...they fall from their high pedestals and into an extremely painful experience!","The Half-a-Step Great Sage has a true body in the Primordial Cosmos as he was extremely powerful, and he had such confidence in himself and the Dao of Destiny that in the last few seconds of the Final War of the Dark Universe...he pridefully closed his eyes as he awaited to experience Ruination from the hands of the Master of Ruination.","He waited for what he was destined for...but it would never arrive!","Noah’s eyes shone brilliantly as while in his magisterial armor, he watched in slow motion as on the majestic Half-a-Step Great Stage with a brilliant blue crown spinning atop his head...the viscous mass of a Blue Slime unfolded.","A singular blue slime!","It came from the folds of space as it ballooned up instantly, the Great Sage only sensing it a millisecond later as a single thought crossed his brain.","’Hmm?’","Hmm- It was a stupendous thought that many had throughout their lives, and it was the last thought this being had!","<<Universal Devouring>> was cast from a Universal Emperor Slime that did not have an ounce of Ruination Essence in its body!","RUMBLE!","...!","A void shattering eruption of essence then occurred a second later, everything around the immediate thousands of miles trembling!","---","The Cosmos were vast, mysterious, and most of all...fantastical.","So fantastical that everything within them was something out of a being’s wildest imagination, with the most shocking things being how many trillions of different things one could find across these Cosmos.","The Primordial Cosmos were filled with many Universes, our subject today being a particular Universe that was fairly well known by the true powerhouses that had the capability to stroll around between Universes as they wished!","It was a Universe that was known as the Cerulean Universe, a gorgeous expanse of an innumerable number of galaxies, with its key feature being the wondrous blue aurora of colors that permeated throughout its chaotic void.","Towards the center of this Cerulean Universe, there was a particular region that many powerful experts of this Universe stayed away from- a region that was known as the domain of a powerful being!","Irascible in nature and extremely devious, this being was one of the few experts within this Universe that was widely well known.","For any that were powerful or courageous enough to enter the region, they would be able to find a certain location that had a circular, stellar shimmering Galaxy filled with trillions of stars.","On top of this slowly rotating galaxy that was thousands of light years...one could shockingly see the figure of a being laying on top of it!","Let me repeat that- a figure of a being lying on top of the thin boundary of a galaxy that contained trillions of stellar bodies, where the length of his body ran from the beginning to the edges of the Galaxy, with one foot even dangling freely from the edge of the Galaxy!","It was...a monstrous and unbelievable scene to even imagine.","BZZZT!","The next second, this being’s eyes opened as the void around him trembled and cracked, his immense voice ringing out.","\"WHAT!\"","The galaxy he was laying on trembled at his outburst as the being rose up, his hand coming down in anger as it smashed onto the barrier of the Galaxy and shattered it as if it were a thin film of paper, his hand going on to destroy an uncountable number of stellar bodies in the corner of the galaxy that his hand could cover!","...!","\"What the f.u.c.k?! What the F.U.C.K?!\"","RUMBLE!","He rose up with a face full of anger as one could shockingly see the being to be shifting from being visible to illusory, an enormous blue crown situated grandly atop his head as at this time, it shimmered with an intense blue light that matched with the cerulean chaotic void in the surroundings.","Extreme shock and wrath were apparent on this being’s face as he was the one that was the sliver of the soul within the Half-a-Step Great Sage that was just within the Dark Universe!","His shock came from the fact that the connection with the soul was cut off abruptly, his high Realm being able to see the soul deconstructed and devoured in its entirety by the sudden appearance of a viscous creature.","’The creature...!’","His mind moved at extreme speeds as the scenes of the Final War in the Dark Universe played out, all the ones with a certain Blue Slime being isolated as the face of this being became filled with more and more wrath!","This single creature...caused for tens of thousands of years of hard work to go up in smoke...","Over a hundred thousand years’ worth of work....wasted!","It was all wasted as while he waited for death, the Master of Ruination had actually stopped while the viscous body of a slime wrapped around him and devoured his body and soul in their entirety, wiping that sliver of the soul out from existence.","No death by watching a Universe being destroyed with Ruination, no death from the Master of Ruination- it meant no comprehensions in a Cosmic Dao!","Just death by being utterly wiped from existence as everything he had was taken by a singular round creature.","\"That slime...!\"","His thunderous voice rang out as the Cerulean Chaotic Void trembled, this knowledgeable expert quickly putting the pieces together after looking deeply at the Blue Slime and recalling the feeling of devouring before the sliver of his soul disappeared.","\"A Universal Emperor Slime...that wretch actually obtained a Universal Emperor Slime on top of a Cosmic Treasure and Dao?!\"","RUMBLE!","Within the unique cerulean chaotic void that took a blue hue, he seemed to be truly at home as this being was born from the essence of this Universe!","\"Hah! Truly what an unfair cosmos we live in! Ruining all my years of hard work and obtaining everything for yourself...? It won’t be so easy!\"","..!","The resplendent blue crown of the terrifying being shimmered as he rose up, his eyes that were larger than many stellar bodies stacked together shining with a dominating cold light as the image of a singular being filled his mind.","It was the being situated domineeringly upon a throne of Ruination.","The being whose eyes seemed to always be looking down on those he faced, eyes that blazed with resplendent beams of red light!","\"Noah...Osmont!!!\"","THRUM!"]},{"number":886,"title":"Chapter 886: Chapter 885 - The Rebirth of RUINATION! I","paragraphs":["\"Noah...Osmont!!!\"","THRUM!","His shout reverberated across the cerulean chaotic void as many thoughts crossed his mind.","He had long since known of the name of the being he was batting when he could still utilize the Grand Dao of Destiny against him, and his focus was on this being and the Universal Emperor Slime he commanded.","\"A creature such as that was outlawed and marked for murder across all cosmos, yet you just happened to have one!\"","WAA!","His mere emotions caused the cerulean chaotic void to tremble as he continued.","\"I will not be cheated out of a Cosmic Treasure and Dao so easily...\"","His enormous body now sat at the edge of the Galaxy as many plans seemed to cure through his mind at this moment.","\"To succeed in saving your universe, all you can do with the combined Cosmic Treasure is stave off the advancement of Ruination Essence as you try and connect it back to the Primordial Cosmos...\"","\"But even the Sages and Great Sages of your universe perished as they didn’t have what it took before! Even if you have the prerequisite of the Cosmic Dao, are your mana reserves as much as multiple Great Sages or a Universal Realm Hegemony?! Hmph!\"","RUMBLE","The body of the terrifyingly sized being stood up as the Galaxy below him quaked.","\"I actually wish you succeed in returning your Universe to the Cosmos! Because then...!\"","Devious light shone from the stellar eyes of the being as his body erupted with the golden light of Destiny.","Many plans were weaved in preparation for what would happen with the lost Dark Universe!","---","Back in the Dark Universe, a shocking scene of a trembling Blue Slime that had just absorbed a Half-a-Step Great Sage was playing out!","Before anything else could happen, the viscous body of the Blue Slime seemed to be expanding and contracting as if it had eaten something it shouldn’t have.","BLEEERGH!","A belching sound came as the Blue Slime ridiculously puked out some things...the things turning out to be two slimy red dark cubes that were the Ruination Cores!","\"Ah...\"","The Ruination Cores that were in on the body of the devoured Half-a-Step Great Sage where thrown out as they were actually stupendous enough to be items that were not devourable even with the absolute skill of the Blue Slime.","Noah’s armored body vibrantly floated in the chaotic void as the Ruination Cores sank into his Origin, trying to find their respective location as at this moment, all 6 were about to be gathered together once more under the being proficient in the Cosmic Dao of Ruination.","The being that could actually use the Cosmic Treasure fully!","RUMBLE!","At the same time, the body of the Blue Slime had begun releasing a space shattering aura as its strength surged.","The Legions of the Infinite Galaxy looked towards it in shock as the moment they observed the biggest boss of the Spirit Race fall, the rest of the army of the Spirit Race became dimmer as they seemed to have lost a great supporter!","The bodies of the Spirit Race turned listless, Legions of the Infinite Galaxy shouting out with vigor as they moved to finish them off.","Not a single one should be left alive on their eyes!","OOOOOH!","RAA! RAA","The victorious cries of many beings rang out as they moved to collect loot, but Noah’s resonant voice rang out and stopped all of them.","\"Stop, we have reached a critical junction with the apocalypse. Return to the Infinite Galaxy!\"","RIIIIP!","The moment his words finished, a rupture spread out a few hundred thousand miles away to get his point across.","The Infinite Galaxy bloomed out to the size of a small planet in the chaotic void under the command of Noah, the Legions instantly beginning to rush into it under Noah’s command!","Morgana and The Sword Emperor came towards Noah with shining eyes as they began to so see his body shoot out l.u.s.trous red light, knowing a reaction was happening after all the Ruination Cores were obtained as they waited to see the results.","They had actually succeeded!","Against a Half-a-Step Great Sage, they had actually come out on top!","They looked towards Noah with visible shock and stupor at the level of power his body released, their figures then flashing towards the Infinite Galaxy as they only spread their auras out to see what was occurring in the outside void.","It only took less than a minute for the Legions to be returned into the Infinite Galaxy, just as quickly as they were brought out.","Noah waved his hands to warp this Slime into the Infinite Galaxy as well- becoming the sole being in the chaotic void aside from the listless Spirit Race that looked forward with hazy eyes!","RUMBLE!","Noah’s body shone even brighter as the two Ruination Cores settled into their respective law origins, a wondrous reaction beginning at this moment as across the chaotic void and on the overall Dark Universe...an Apocalypse was accelerating.","Fractures spread throughout as the piece of the Cosmos that was cut off could no longer protect itself from the destructive Sea of Ruination, being eaten up all around as it was only a matter of time before everything was swallowed up!","At this moment as Noah watched ruptures appear one after another hundreds of thousands of miles away, with some even coming tens of thousands of miles close, his eyes were calm as he beckoned towards his throne of Ruination. The Light of Destiny flooded from his eyes as it told him of the time he had, as he ascertained what he had to do in the next few minutes.","THRUM!","His figure sat on the Ruination Throne grandly once more as he looked around the chaotic universe facing destruction. His c.h.e.s.t was shining out brightly as within it- the shocking rebirth of something powerful was occurring!","It was the treasure that the Sages and Great Sages of the past utilized to strengthen themselves, but because they did not have the proper requirements to use it, they only brought themselves and their Universe Ruination.","It was the Cosmic Treasure that forces from nearby Universes fought over, a Treasure that even an expert of the Cerulean Universe failed to get his hands on even after over a hundred thousand years!","In the c.h.e.s.t of an Emperor atop a Throne, the Rebirth of the Cosmic Treasure Ruination was taking place!"]},{"number":887,"title":"Chapter 887: Chapter 886 - The Rebirth of RUINATION! II","paragraphs":["Noah’s thoughts were many as he sat upon his Ruination Throne and saw the ruptures spreading from far away.","His eyes shone with a golden light as he peered through the mysteries of many things, his c.h.e.s.t only continuing to get brighter as an enormous amount of essence from him and the chaotic void was constantly being s.u.c.k.e.d in to help with the Rebirth of Ruination!","The 6 Cores were rotating mystically within his law origins as the line of connection that attached all of them together pulled them closer and closer until the square cubes smashed into each other.","BZZZT!","Reverberations exploded out as on the outside, Noah’s c.h.e.s.t was seemingly exploding out with red light. Inside his Origin, the Ruination Cores had actually begun liquifying the moment they touched as at this moment, they melded together to reform into a single Cosmic Treasure!","This was actually a truly important point to keep in mind- the fact that the Rebirth of such a treasure was occurring inside the Origin of a being.","The birthplace of something is naturally their home, and the birthplace of Ruination...would naturally be its home!","Even the Half-a-Step Great Sage had been wrong when he voiced out that the moment he succeeded, he would traverse the Ruination Sea to come find and kill Noah while retaking Ruination.","Unlike other Cosmic Treasures that all remained Myths, Ruination was about to be the first one that was reborn inside the Origin of a being!","THRUUM!","Noah observed the progress while he sat upon his throne, his eyes observing the fractures to be spreading out and getting ever closer. But the process of rebirth within his origin...was nearly complete.","The Cores that liquefied and melded together came to form not a square- but a round shape as the reborn Cosmic Treasure was circular!","RUMBLE!","Noah watched as the moment the circular Treasure fully formed, a majestic beam of red light shot forth from his body and crossed the millions of miles above him, the circular treasure that was Ruination beginning to form bright points of light within it that looked like wondrous Galaxies.","RUUMBLE!","Noah’s body trembled upon the Ruination Throne as he felt an extremely clear connection form with something that seemed way out of his league at this moment.","A second later, something shocking was heard in his mind!","[I...have been reborn!]","THRUM!","Like lightning descending down, a voice crossed Noah’s mind as he nearly fell out of his majestic chair, focusing on its source that was the Cosmic Treasure Ruination.","[It is I!]","Every single word it released was accompanied by the chaotic void shaking as Noah gave a light smile. At this point, he wasn’t shocked that a Cosmic Treasure could have consciousness and speak and he sent his thoughts into it while gleaming its information.","\"Yes, it is you. Reformed as one after all this time, but we have to move fast to stop the fractures spreading throughout the Universe.\"","[It is but an easy thing, O Master. Have you familiarized yourself with my features that you can currently use?]","Ruination spoke of stopping the fractures plaguing the Dark Universe as something simple, Noah smiling as he glanced upon the information of this Cosmic Treasure!","<strong>COSMIC <RUINATION> :: A treasure of Cosmic proportions. Anyone obtaining this could be considered to have won in life as unless they perish from an early death, their rise into a Universal Hegemony is all but guaranteed. To be properly used, a being proficient in the Cosmic Dao of Ruination is required. Any use without this condition met will always result in Ruination. The Absolute Skills provided from the Cosmic Dao of Ruination are usable in conjunction with this treasure, with these abilities including <Master of Ruination>, <Affix Use and Generation>, <Duplication>, <Ruination Realm>, <Universe Piercer>. Unusable abilities include Ruination Primordial Clone, Dao Birth...</strong>","A great deal of information and uses of Ruination were displayed, but Noah only needed to focus on the first absolute skill for now, it was Master of Ruination!","<Master of Ruination> :: The ability to bend Ruination Essence within the body of the Master of Ruination and outside of it to their will. Simple in name and definition, stupendous in its results.","\"Utilize the absolute skill <Master of Ruination>.\"","...!","[What is the scope you wish for, Master?]","The void of the Cosmic Treasure lingered in his mind as while he sat upon his dictatorial throne, he uttered out domineeringly!","\"The scope is this entire Universe. Stop the advancement of the destructive Sea of Ruination into the Dark Universe.\"","RUMBLE!","A domineering command, but one that was followed fully as from Noah’s c.h.e.s.t, the glimmering red circle that was Ruination was released!","[To cover the light years of an entire Universe, a truly dense reserves of Mana will be required that Master might not- oh...never mind!]","THRUM!","The Cosmic Treasure had begun speaking about mana, but changed its words half way when through the connection with its new master- it realized that his mana reserves were boundless!","It shone with a luminous l.u.s.ter as millions upon millions of galaxies could be seen floating within the Cosmic Treasure that began to shine with an immense brilliance that shot out towards every single area.","From where Noah floated atop his throne, a brilliant red light erupted out as wondrously, there was a Fracture that was about to instantly tear apart the area in the nearly hundreds of miles, but the moment that the red light extending from the Cosmic Treasure passed through this location, the Fracture disappeared!","The chaotic void was restored as the essence of Ruination was wiped away, the light of the Cosmic Treasure only getting faster as it spread its reach as far as it could, the goal being to wrap an entire Universe to stop the advancement of the destructive energies of the Ruination Sea that were plaguing it!","How vast was a Universe?","How many quadrillions of life forms were spread throughout?","Just how wondrous was the Dark Universe?!"]},{"number":888,"title":"Chapter 888: Chapter 887 - I Own a Cosmic Treasure I","paragraphs":["The Ancient Powers were only the cl.u.s.ters of power houses within the Dark Universe as they resided within Galactic Filaments, and they only took over a minute small portion of such a vast area!","A majority of the millions of Galaxies within the Universe were similar to Noah’s- isolated and never having even heard about other Galaxies or Ancient Powers.","Even with Noah traveling a negligible portion of the Universe in the past weeks, he came across over thousands of Galaxies that were spread out far apart!","At this moment, he had commanded his Cosmic Treasure to cast an absolute skill that covered this entire Universe that even he himself had barely discovered the edge of!","The wave of red essence traveled out rapidly as it covered many light years every millisecond, the Fractures that were spreading out across the affected area of the Universe all fading the moment this red light passed through them!","This was because it was the command under the skill of <Master of Ruination>! The deadly Ruination Essence could do nothing but obey the will of the Cosmic Treasure and its Master.","So the light of the Cosmic Treasure continued to cross the hundreds of thousands of light years quickly!","The Dark Universe was vast, being over 100 BILLION Light Years before one could come across the edge of the observable Universe and find themselves faced with a never ending Ruination Sea.","Within it, the Galactic Filaments like the ones that made up Ancient Powers were many, but lone Galaxies spreading throughout were even more numerous!","How many of them fell under the decimating damage of the Sea of Ruination was unknown, but millions of Galaxies were kept safe and sound as the light of a Cosmic Treasure wiped out all the essence of Ruination.","The light covered 10 billion light years.","Then 50 billion.","Ultimately...over 100 Billion light years of the Dark Universe glimmered with the light of the Cosmic Treasure that was using the mana reserves of a being that had an infinite amount of!","RUMBLE","Noah still sat on the Ruination Throne as he experienced a unique feeling. He didn’t feel drained of energy or anything as to him, it didn’t even feel like he cast an ability that affected the whole Universe!","Noah heard the shocking words of the Cosmic Treasure as he smiled.","\"That easy?\"","[That easy, Master. Though the kids that tried using me before to cause a portion of the Ruination Sea to rip apart this Universe from its Primordial Cosmos created a situation where even if the Ruination Essence outside does not ravage this Universe, it still does not have the essence to sustain itself.]","RUMBLE!","A shocking truth was released from the Cosmic Treasure as it called Sages and Great Sages kids along the way.","Noah’s expression was thoughtful as the light of Destiny and many other Dao Essence swirled in his mind.","\"What sustains the Primordial Cosmos?\"","[...the Primordial Essence. I know what you are thinking, Master, but it will be nearly impossible to sustain this Universe with Ruination Essence. It was born from Primordial Essence that is of a different nature.]","[The only solution is to reconnect the Universe back to the Primordial Cosmos- like a piece of a puzzle completing the whole picture. Only then can the Universe be rejuvenated by its Primordial Essence. As of right now, the reason why it could no longer protect itself from Ruination Essence is because the reserves of Primordial Essence sustaining it have reduced greatly the past tens of thousands of years. Even now, after my protection from the Ruination Sea...this Universe will only last a few hundred years before it breaks down entirely!]","The cold truth from the Cosmic Treasure would make anyone despair, but Noah only had a light smile as he tapped his finger upon his throne.","\"A few hundred years...\"","His eyes were filled with an intense light as he thought of many things!","He was thinking of the terrifying expert he had just killed, knowing that the moment the Dark Universe was reconnected to the Primordial Cosmos, the beings within it would be alerted as the fate thereafter was something left in the air.","But the Dark Universe could not just continue floating in the Ruination Sea as it needed Primordial Essence as its source of energy! Even when Noah’s thoughts jumped to using Ruination Essence as the replacement, the Cosmic Treasure denied this possibility!","His eyes shimmered with light as he looked at the shining Cosmic Treasure that contained an image of innumerable Galaxies within it.","Through their connection, he sent information about his Infinite Galaxy to this newly reborn Treasure while he spoke.","\"What if I change the nature of the Universe? What if I devour all the galaxies within it? What if I locate whatever the core of this Universe is and I form a connection with it, and through my connection to the Infinite Galaxy...change the source of the essence of the Universe to accept Ruination?\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking assertion!","[I...well damn. I mean, maybe?]","Even the Cosmic Treasure had entered a state of stupor at the domineering claim as Noah nodded with a smiling expression.","\"Good! We have much work to do!\"","RUMBLE!","The shocking Cosmic Treasure was absorbed back into his c.h.e.s.t as he looked at the nearby chaotic void that had the listless body of the Spirit Race that felt like they had lost their souls, looking even deeper into the Spirit Domains that contained who knew how many more of these beings.","The presence of the being outside the Universe had disappeared as the power of this Race of beings...fell by more than 99%!","A debate on the fate of these beings passed through Noah’s mind as with a heavy heart and a sigh, numerous Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs bloomed in front of him. They thundered towards the listless remaining army of the Spirit Race as for Noah, there was still too many unknowns with the enemy that had its mind take over these beings.","His heart was heavy as he watched the destructive scenes that played out next with the explosions of the Ruination Galaxy Spirit Bombs, waving his hands to collect the loot after a few minutes passed!","He disappeared from the chaotic void as his Ruination Throne appeared inside the Infinite Galaxy. It was on a starry space where the Legions were placed in waiting for word, all of their eyes turning towards Noah when he appeared!","They looked at the fearsome looking being on the throne as they heard his words reverberate out.","\"We were victorious!\"","RUMBLE!","It was but a few words. But they were words that contained a great deal of information!","\"OHHHH!\"","\"VICTORY!\"","\"For the Dark Universe!\"","\"For the Tyrannical Emperor!\"","Reverberations began spreading throughout as shocking celebrations erupted, the Sword Emperor shaking with emotions as Morgana was only staring at Noah with continued shock and disbelief on the side.","\"Our Master’s dream...!\"","The emotional Sword Emperor was surrounded by his Sword Kings as they looked upon the enthroned Noah with shining eyes full of wonder.","Barbatos and the other Harbingers of Sin came close to celebrate as further away from this area in the stellar space, a wondrous Blue Slime was upgrading to become a Half-a-Step Great Sage as the two clones Noah had absorbing Dao and Assimilation Crystals were in front of it watching the process for when he did it himself!","He released the other 7 pets from their merged state with him as they would join for the coming celebrations, but he had a great deal of things to do himself as his attention was turned towards the Cosmic Treasure.","He had only looked at its feature of <Master of Ruination> that stopped the advancement of the destruction of Ruination Essence into the Dark Universe, just how monstrous were its other features?!","It had many features he could use and explore, but his heart couldn’t take it as he had to peek at one that he couldn’t believe just from its name.","<Duplication> :: From destruction comes rebirth. With the exception of very few things, any item placed within Ruination will be deconstructed and then duplicated.","\"...\""]},{"number":889,"title":"Chapter 889: Chapter 888 - I Own a Cosmic Treasure II","paragraphs":["<Duplication> :: From destruction comes rebirth. With the exception of very few things, any item placed within Ruination will be deconstructed and then duplicated.","It seemed to be a very simple feature on the surface!","Anything placed within Ruination would be deconstructed and then duplicated...simple, but the possible uses for it were shocking! Within Noah’s Expansive Space right now were a great deal of Dao Comprehension and Assimilation Crystals, GALAXY Cores, and Skill Books.","All of these things...the rarest type of loot anyone in the Dark Universe had collected- could he be able to duplicate it with this new feature?","[Naturally, Master. After all, I am a Cosmic Treasure. This ability is not even one of the ones I consider truly useful. The ones you cannot use right now are even better.]","The voice of the Cosmic Treasure rang out in his mind as a smile bloomed on Noah’s face. He waved his hands as he ushered forth a multitude of glimmering Cores and Dao Crystals, all of this loot flowing into the small circular Cosmic Treasure that s.u.c.k.e.d them in like a black hole.","THRUUM!","A wondrous flash of light illuminated the surroundings.","A brilliant red light thereafter, a sea of loot double what he had put in before was spat out as RUINATION shone with a luminous light!","[Everything that has been deconstructed and then recreated in double its amount cannot be placed in again, otherwise all Cosmic Laws would be broken with you just constantly duplicating the same things again and again.]","The Cosmic Treasure voiced out what Noah already expected, his eyes shining intensely as he waved his hands to collect his loot that he had truly doubled just with a wave of his hands!","What a Cosmic Treasure this was!","His eyes then went towards the ability of <Ruination Realm>.","<strong><Ruination Realm> :: A unique Realm only the Master of Ruination can enter. Time flows at a rate of 1000:1, where a thousand years passing in the Ruination Realm is one year passing in the Cosmos. When inside, the perks of +50,000% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation in the Cosmic Dao of Ruination is granted, along with +25,000% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation of All Daos. The Ruination Essence within is purer than even the Ruination Sea as it is the perfect place to form the Ruination Primordial Clone. The Ruination Realm can also Simulate all Enemies the Master of Ruination has come across before for the purposes of training.</strong>","\"F.u.c.k.i.n.g hell...\"","Noah breathed out in shock at this feature of the Cosmic Treasure as it was simply too ridiculous.","His wondrous Infinite Galaxy had the max 100:1 time flow between it and the outside world, and yet this feature of Ruination Realm would grant him 1000:1, on top of other shocking perks!","[I like the Ruination Realm, Master. I haven’t been back there since I last left after my birth.]","The Cosmic Treasure released more shocking truths as Noah just nodded, his eyes going towards the other two features that he could currently utilize.","<strong><Affix Use and Generation> :: On top of the Affixes that were available through the pieces of RUINATION, the Master of Ruination can generate as many Affixes as he wishes, as long as they do not interfere or heavily influence the Cosmos. 6 Affixes are capable of being selected at once.</strong>","<strong><Universe Piercer> :: The Cosmos are surrounded by a Sea of Ruination, with Universes being bound and protected by Primordial Essence. This ability can be utilized on a large scale to affect a willing universe, or used by the Master of Ruination to seamlessly pierce into and arrive into any known Universes that the Cosmic Treasure has passed through before. Currently available Universes- Euthenia Universe, Automaton Universe, Animus Universe, Microbial Universe, Necrotic Universe, Cerulean Universe, Elysian Universe, Chthonian Universe...</strong>","Noah finally came across the ability that the Sages and Great Sages of the past had utilized- the ability that reaped all their lives and allowed for Ruination to descend unto the Dark Universe until it nearly underwent an Apocalypse!","But the phrase ’willing universe’ within the definition gave Noah many ideas as it affirmed there was some sort of consciousness for the Dark Universe, and he was beckoning it to stop being so damn slow and come to him already so he could get things rolling!","But the golden light of Destiny gave him no such information on this as he focused on the features again. Universe Piercer also granted him the ability to travel between universes that RUINATION had come across before, and when he focused his eyes on the listed Universes...he found that there were too many in number!","A much larger number of Universes than he expected.","His eyes focused on the Animus Universe where Tiamat was unjustly killed by the collusion of some of the Supreme Bloodlines, and then onto the Necrotic Universe where he was able to call the Nether Lich Emperor from!","He could...go into these Universes if he wished, but he had to collect a great deal of information before he did so.","Some things were crucial as Universes like his existed where beings only came up to the stage of a Sage or Great Sage, while other Universes had the super duper big bosses in the Universal Realm that were known as Hegemonies!","Their rank stupidly had the term ’Universe’ in it, making Noah extremely careful to even step into any Universes in the future with his shiny new Cosmic Treasure.","If he ever did so, he didn’t see a problem in sending his clones, or even the feature that was currently locked for him- the Ruination Primordial Clone!","\"The locked features...?\"","[Master has gained ownership of me, but he still needs to use his Origin Essence to refine me and brand a portion of his soul onto me. When the Master has fully refined the Cosmic Treasure, he can use everything it offers. A Universal Realm Hegemony would have been able to refine me in a few hours, but Master is currently too weak to do so.]","\"...\""]},{"number":890,"title":"Chapter 890: Chapter 889 - GALACTIC FILAMENT! I","paragraphs":["As a Cosmic Treasure called its master weak, the celebrations continued in the wondrous Infinite Galaxy.","The Sword Emperor was laughing jovially as he drank with his Sword Kings, realizing the dream of his Master who sacrificed his life to give the time required for the Master of Ruination to be born!","His hand in creating an Immemorial Sword Dungeon and accelerating the strength of Noah helped them get where they were today!","\"Drink!\"","The wondrous fruits and herbs of the Infinite Galaxy were enjoyed to the fullest as many beings felt a huge weight lifted off their shoulders.","RAA!","A certain Penguin was boasting of his achievements as the Harbingers of Sin came together, with the eyes of Barbatos being glued to Morgana who sat opposite her.","The Sage didn’t get any special treatment from the Harbingers of Sin as at this moment, there were golden drinks filled to the brim in front of her and Barbatos!","\"I could at least out drink a child.\"","\"I f.u.c.k.i.n.g dare you to try.\"","BZZT!","Essence buzzed around wildly as the two women grabbed the Golden drinks and began chugging them.","Off to the side, Kazuhiko’s face was flushed as he was rambling on at a cold faced Anna and Athena.","The two valiant women looked at this Sword King in disdain as he voiced out loudly.","\"You see, I was with Noah first before anyone else, so I know how this goes! Listen...\"","\"...we saved our home world from an invasion against Demons, and then went on to conquer a bunch of worlds after that! We stood against tyrants of our Galaxy until we overcame them! Well...it was really Noah doing all the work...\"","Kazuhiko seemed to have a thoughtful look amidst his ramblings as the Imperial Phoenix came to join the party of two girls while signaling them with her eyes that this would continue for a while.","\"But the point is! We conquered worlds and Realms, and now Noah is fusing Galaxies so he could probably take over the Universe! That crazy guy...you all just wait when the time comes to conquer Universes!\"","RUMBLE!","The ramblings of Kazuhiko got many beings to look at each other with shining lights as they ascertained his words for truthfulness.","\"Who will still be a major player when that starts...which of us will stand tall and strong to even provide Noah with any aid? Haha!\"","\"Alright, alright.\" Steel Mikhail stepped in as he moved the rambling Kazuhiko away from the women who turned their eyes towards a certain location in the stellar space they were in.","It was in a Time Space where one of Noah’s clones was watching a Blue Slime closely.","On the body of this fearsome Blue Slime, the essence of Daos even more numerous than Noah’s shone out brilliantly.","This was a natural course after swallowing the portion of a soul of an expert that had spent hundreds of thousands of years comprehending multiple Daos!","At this moment, unstable Galaxies were shining and trembling in the Origin of the Blue Slime as it shockingly obtained the Realm of the being it Devoured!","Half-a-Step Great Sage!","\"To step into the Galactic Filament Realm, you have to nurture your Galaxy with the essence of Assimilated Daos to birth more Galaxies. You have many Daos on you little guy, come on!\"","Noah spoke to the wobbly blue slime that seemed drunk on power, bobbing itself up and down as it was seemingly promising to stabilize the newly forming unstable Galaxies and fully step into the Galactic Filament Realm.","Noah’s clone smiled as he looked where the raucous celebrations were ongoing, choosing to let the powerful beings of the Infinite Galaxy enjoy themselves some more before another clone appeared in front of them with the Duplicated Cores and Dao Crystals!","Off to the side, the voluptuous figure of Tiamat could be seen as she bit her lips while looking at Noah.","\"I...you...you really became a Sage in less than a hundred years...\"","Noah looked towards her as he remembered something and laughed heartily.","\"Oh yes, our bet! Well, not even a hundred years, but a few weeks have passed since that time? I frankly thought it would take me a bit longer too. I have myself to blame for being too outstanding.\"","\"..\"","Tiamat stayed silently as her eyes shimmered with the light of stars, getting in front of Noah as this terrifying being with a stupendous identity...fell to her knees!","Her full c.h.e.s.t glistened in the wondrous colors within the time space as she voiced out with a firm voice.","\"Unbelievable rate of progression, assimilating daos as if they were nothing, gaining a Cosmic Dao while still an Entity...you have a rap sheet that would even make Universal Realm Hegemonies jealous!\"","RUMBLE!","\"I...I pledge my full allegiance to you, Master. You have my trust...and my heart if you wish for it!\"","...!","The domineering Queen Dowager could not help but succ.u.mb to the Tyrannical Emperor, this powerful Progenitor of Dragons kneeling in front of him in a shocking scene that would make the knowledgeable beings of the Animus Universe gape in shock.","Noah came down to the level of Tiamat as he placed his hand on her chin to lift the face of the Queen Dowager up. He looked into her red draconian eyes as he spoke with a smile!","\"I told you that as one of my people, I would settle all grievances you have. I haven’t forgotten about your wishes in the Animus Universe! Focus on increasing your power for now as you work back to regaining your Cosmic Dao. We’ll start by making you and the others Sages and Great Sages...\"","Noah spoke domineeringly as Tiamat rose with a smile, replying with sweet words that were filled with trust.","\"Yes, Master!\"","The scenes gradually changed and shifted as time passed, Noah’s words being those of Truth as he truly had the capability to make more Sages and Great Sages!","As for the Great Sages? Well, such a thing could easily be done by him to his Animus Summons after he stepped on this path himself!","He was telling the wobbly blue slime that his existence that held many Daos would be able to easily stabilize his Realm and advance into a Great Sage, but this situation applied to him even more as he had assimilated a great deal of Daos!","In the chaotic void, Noah’s main body returned as he remained situated upon the Ruination Throne, twirling with the bright Cosmic Treasure within his hands.","\"Let’s visit the Ruination Realm. Let me experience a thousand days there in exchange for one...let me advance into the next Realm for the first time ever without relying on Cores of the same level!\"","...!","With the absence of Galactic Filament Cores as the Blue Slime had devoured everything for himself, Noah was left without Cores to advance his Realm as he chose to do it himself!"]},{"number":891,"title":"Chapter 891: Chapter 890 - GALACTIC FILAMENT! II","paragraphs":["The glimmering Cosmic Treasure released an oppressive light that wrapped around Noah and the throne he sat on, his figure disappearing from the chaotic void.","The place he appeared was not within the Dark Universe nor within the Primordial Cosmos, but a location no other being had stepped on- it was the Ruination Realm that existed somewhere deep within the Ruination Sea!","SHAA!","His figure appeared in a space that was tinged red with a hint of gold, rivers of deeply crimson Ruination essence flowing smoothly in front of his eyes as they seemed extremely dense.","Every breath he took here made his every cell feel extremely vibrant and full of life as even the Cosmic Treasure flowed from him to spin around the area!","[The Ruination Realm is the place to come to when you need to increase your strength and even for Purification. Master can easily break into the Galactic Filament Realm here.]","Its voice flowed out as Noah nodded, closing his eyes as he felt the abundant Ruination Essence around him.","As he got familiar with the new environment, Information of his Stat Panel freely flowed into his mind as it showed him how far he had come!","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Sage, Infernal Lord(Variant), Controller(All Laws)]","[Trait(s) : Infinite Mana & Protagonist]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","[Vitality: GALAXY(PEAK)]","[Focus: ∞ ]","[Strength: GALAXY(PEAK)]","[Law(s) : Life-100%, Death-100%, Aether- 100%, Karma-100%,Fate-100%,Chaos-100%, Light-100%, Dark-100%, Space-100%, Time-100%, Fire-100%, Water-100%, Earth-100%, Air-100%]","[Universal Laws Assimilation: 100%]","[Primeval Propitious Physique: 100%]","[Skill Points :: 39,125,269]","His stat panel made him look like a maxed out character that someone had spent too much time on to achieve excellence on every possible avenue, but he had only done it in a matter of weeks!","And after this time, he was making a bid to advance even further as he focused on his Manifested Galaxy that had been enriched to the fullest, and yet it hadn’t advanced to the next stage!","To further increase and birth more Galaxies, a being had to enrich their origin with the essence of their assimilated Daos. Within this wondrous Ruination Realm that had 1000:1 time ratio, this was exactly what Noah had begun to do as he utilized the essence of the many Daos he had recently assimilated and sent them all to his origin.","THRUM!","The Manifested Galaxy trembled with power as the stellar bodies within it shone gloriously, beginning to pulsate and expand as after being stagnant in the GALAXY Realm for so long, Noah was going forward to try and forge more Galaxies and build up his Galactic Filament!","The past Sages of the Dark Universe had undergone a similar process, but very few of them had managed to comprehend many Daos, and thus it was harder for them to form new Galaxies and step into the stage of a Great Sage!","After observing his own Animus Summon forge towards this level and having an overabundance of Assimilated Daos himself, it was only a matter of time before he advanced.","And time...he had an abundant amount of!","In a day, he finished enriching his Manifested Galaxy as it pulsed out with power, many smaller Galactic Nuclei slowly being born around it in a grand manner.","In a week, the Nuclei began forming into their own Galaxies as they shook with instability, needing to be enriched with Dao Essence even more before they could become genuine Galaxies!","Another 3 weeks passed within the Ruination Realm, and a space shattering aura erupted from Noah as at this moment- multiple vibrant Galaxies floated within his origin!","No need for Cores of the Realm, no need to even depend on others! For the GALACTIC FILAMENT Realm, he stepped on it himself as his body upon the Ruination Throne buzzed with power.","He opened his eyes as his body shone with a gorgeous splendor!","On his c.h.e.s.t, the swirling manifestations of many Galaxies could be seen, where there was currently 10 in number.","Such a wondrous title just less than a year since he stepped on the path of power!","[That took you longer than I expected, Master.]","The Cosmic Treasure commented lightly as it floated around the rivers of Ruination Essence gleefully, stopping in front of Noah’s grand visage that trembled trembled power.","Noah was in a stupor as he agreed, but he defended himself nonetheless!","\"It was my first time breaking through a Realm naturally, even though a month was long, less than an hour has passed in the Cosmos!\"","RUMBLE!","The Master and Cosmic Treasure had a shocking conversation that would make the geniuses of the Cosmos spit blood.","A month to achieve the stage of Great Sage? Other beings needed thousands upon thousands of years to do so!","Yet Noah had spent over a month in the Ruination Realm as in the outside Cosmos...less than an hour had passed...","The Cosmic Treasure voiced out again as Noah nodded. The time difference was so shocking that he could spend a year in here, and only 9 or so hours would have passed outside the Cosmos!","He planned to utilize this to the fullest by having his clones or his main body remain in this location at all times to enjoy this boon while working towards achieving full comprehension in a Cosmic Dao that he could not use any outside tools to increase.","\"It’s time to fully put all focus into fusing Galaxies and locating the core of the Dark Universe...\"","On top of the many things he had to do after achieving Galactic Filament like increase the Realms of his pets and comprehend the Cosmic Dao, he would be having all clones actively spread throughout the Dark Universe to come in contact with and fuse the Galaxies spread throughout!"]},{"number":892,"title":"Chapter 892: Chapter 891 - Making Sages is Actually Very Easy","paragraphs":["For the near future, Noah planned to have the clones teleporting back and forth with the Infinite Galaxy as they undertook the mission that was the basis to save the Dark Universe.","Aside from this, Noah had to find the core of this Dark Universe as he needed its cooperation before many things could be done!","At this moment, Noah left the Ruination Realm as he returned to the Dark Universe. The miniaturized Infinite Galaxy was still at the same location he had left it, his hands reaching towards it as he thought of how many days and months would have to be spent going around the Dark Universe to collect the 100,000 Galaxies he needed for the next advancement of this wondrous Treasure.","He was about to summon his clones to begin fanning out and wading through the chaotic void in search of galaxies when he came to a stop, his eyes shining brightly as he turned to the Cosmic Treasure that was floating beside him!","\"You...still have <Master of Ruination> active as you are actively protecting all of the Dark Universe from the advancement of the Ruination Essence from the Sea of Ruination, right?\"","Noah recalled the first feature he had used after the Rebirth of the Cosmic Treasure- the feature that released a red wave of essence that was currently keeping the Dark Universe from being ravaged by fractures!","[Yes, Master.]","\"Since you are protecting all the 100 Billion Light Years, you know where everything is in the Dark Universe?\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s eyes shone with bright rays of light as he asked this question.","[Yes, Master. Hmm? Oh! Yes, there are many Galaxies and cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies located throughout, if Master wants to quickly carry out the idea of fusing Galaxies with that unique Treasure, I can send you the mental image of the area for you to even teleport to the Galaxy’s location right away!]","\"...\"","The Cosmic Treasure very quickly caught onto Noah’s thought process as it replied with vigor, Noah nearly laughing at this scene as the hard task of wading through millions of light years for months to locate and fuse the required Galaxies...was reduced to a negligible amount of time!","He...felt extremely good at finding such a method as it felt like he was speedrunning a tedious task that would have taken a significant amount of time.","\"Good!\"","The Cosmic Treasure shone vibrantly at the praise as Noah himself moved this time around for the task of fusing Galaxies with the help of a few clones.","He had other clones within the Infinite Galaxy gather the celebrating forces as they got ready to stabilize the infusion of a truly great number of Galaxies!","It wouldn’t be too much of an issue as the isolated Galaxies Noah was about to fuse wouldn’t have powerful beings like Entities or Sages, being similar to Noah’s home Galaxy that barely had a Nebula Realm expert at the peak.","While other clones handled this task, one would be handing out the duplicated Cores and Dao Crystals to begin the process of mass producing Entities and Sages, one clone would be sent to the Ruination Realm and be forever stationed there for the purposes of comprehending the Cosmic Dao, while another one would have the task of upgrading the Realms of the Animus Summons to Galactic Filament!","Noah was moving with extreme efficiency as he was doing a great deal of things simultaneously, his speed unmatched at this moment as with a vibrant new Realm, he felt pumped to do many things!","A clone had already arrived in front of the Blue Slime that had been trying to stabilize its Galaxies, only an hour having passed for the slime and all others as it raised its wobbly body to find its Master had somehow already stepped on Galactic Filament fully before it.","...!","Alarm overcame the Blue Slime as its wiggly body formed question marks and exclamations, Noah’s clone merely laughing as his essence moved to personally stabilize and elevate the Realm of the Blue Slime!","The others were teleported into the area as well, Tiamat watching the scene of Noah’s clone that had multiple revolving Manifested Galaxies with shining eyes.","’With someone like him by my side...those traitors will all be eaten up!’","Her gaze was fiery as the Queen Dowager rushed to her Master so that her strength could be increased as well.","The kingly Calamity Bear stroked its chin with majestic pride as the Jörmungandr eyes turned into dangerous slits, also being very happy at having found such a Master!","CAA!","All the pets went forward to have their Realms elevated as in another region where the celebrations were brought to a close, another one of Noah’s clones at the Realm of Galactic Filament stood in front of the Sages and Entities of his Infinite Galaxy.","\"You...you...!\"","Morgana’s small face was dripping with shock as she stared at the being who had been an Entity days ago, yet now stood in front of her in the Galactic Filament Realm while having also assimilated many Daos!","It meant...he was a Great Sage!","\"Great Sage...\" The Sword Emperor uttered with shock as he began to laugh raucously, the Harbingers of Sin staring at these new incoming being with calm eyes as they had long developed immunity from Noah’s domineering surprises.","\"Hmph. Little Fish, I’m next up to become a Sage.\"","Barbatos raised her face as she looked towards Morgana like a country bumpkin that didn’t know things, coming to hug Noah’s arm who only gave a light smile while waving his hands to call forth an innumerable amount of Galaxy Cores and Dao Crystals!","The Galaxy Cores were even more numerous in number as he hadn’t consumed any of them, so when they were duplicated...the amount was shocking.","Since he had utilized some Dao Comprehension and Assimilation Crystals though, they were slightly fewer in number as by his calculations- they should be able to produce a few hundred Entities...and even tens of Sages!","RUMBLE!","This number may seem shocking and unrealistic, but not when Noah also began exploring the new feature of the Cosmic Treasure- <Affix Use and Generation>!","In the past he only had affixes that affected him when it came to how rapidly he comprehended and assimilated Daos, but he could make a tweak and produce an Affix that affected his subordinates!","Thus, while Noah’s main body began moving with the Cosmic Treasure to teleport next to Galaxies and fuse them, he utilized the feature of the Cosmic Treasure as the Affix [Ruination Guider] was born!","[Ruination Guider] :: When selected, all the beings considered as Subordinates of the Master of Ruination gain 20,000% Increased Comprehension and Assimilation of All Laws and Daos.","Even the 20,000% was the max that Noah was allowed to do from the words of the Cosmic Treasure, with his first number when generating the Affix being 50,000%!","But this shocking Affix meant Noah would not be alone in enjoying the sweets of easily comprehending and assimilating Daos.","He had a bright smile as within the Dark Universe that was floating in a Sea of Ruination, multiple Sages were about to be born!"]},{"number":893,"title":"Chapter 893: Chapter 892 - Where art thou, Universe Core?","paragraphs":["As his clones went about doing a great deal of things, Noah’s main body and a few clones were teleporting to multiple Galaxies from the mental images that he was receiving from the Cosmic Treasure.","With his past teleporting skills and now the Dao of Voidspace, the reality of him being able to warp to whatever location as long as he had a memory or image of it remained true!","Those clones would have the task of communicating and convincing the Cores of Galaxies as they shared their memories of what they had been doing and what was to come, the logical entities that were the centers of galaxies all agreeing without a hitch as always.","So all that was left was for Noah to warp to these convinced Galaxies and fuse them while continuing to test out the features of the Cosmic Treasure!","He had already produced the terrifying [Ruination Guider] Affix as he thought of many more that could apply to himself aside from just things like +10,000% to All Damage.","He could create Affixes to heavily enhance specific skills or abilities that pertain to him, or even generate more unique ones along the lines of things like Dao Crystal Affixes or Increased Loot Drop Affix...the possibilities were endless!","As for the wonders of Ruination Guider?","THRUM!","Essence was constantly converging around the figures of the Harbingers of Sin, Elena, Athena, Holy Emperor, Imperial Adjudicator, Anna...around 20 of Noah’s strongest subordinates aside from the Emperor Penguin!","All of them were in a Time Space as they absorbed Dao Comprehension and Assimilation Crystals, finding to their shock that the percentages of the Daos they chose were rising crazily!","The Sword Emperor was looking at this shocking scene as his voice rang out to a scowling Morgana.","\"Do you believe in the words of the Master now? For the being they all sacrificed their lives to wait for?\"","Morgana had given up from all the shocks at this point as she merely waved her hands while watching the shocking scenes of multiple being fully comprehending Daos and going on to Assimilate them minutes later!","\"Yes yes we get it, the Old Geezer was right.\"","Morgana voiced out lazily as she saw the aura of a Sage erupt from the vivacious Barbatos.","This being that was merely an Entity a few days back now stood at the same stage as her as when her eyes opened, the two alike beings glanced at each other competitively!","RUMBLE!","In other regions, those that weren’t fortunate enough to get the Dao Crystals received an overabundance of GALAXY Cores to push their strength to the peak of this Realm, hundreds of beings entering the ranks of experts!","In another region of the Time Space, Noah’s own Summons were being elevated in strength as with the Summoner achieving the next Realm, it was extremely easy to push their Summons to the same realm as well.","Noah’s clone pulsed with mana and Dao Essence that flowed into the pets, the birth of many Galaxies being seen as the Animus Summon were brought into the Galactic Filament Realm!","With the addition of Assimilation Crystals, they would be one of the very few beings in the Infinite Galaxy to be termed Great Sages.","ROAAR!","Tiamat let out a roar filled with power as the Golden Crow rose to the skies brilliantly, the body of the Jörmungandr becoming even more pristine and majestic as all the pets shone with gorgeous splendor!","At this moment, every single being was unceasingly increasing their strength as during this time, Noah had fused hundreds of Galaxies, the number only continuing to shoot up as he could locate them with much greater efficiency than before.","The task was extremely tedious and time consuming, where fusing each Galaxy took at least a minute, and this was with Noah wildly using his power to complete the fusion quickly. When this was paired up with the remaining Galaxies he needed to fuse out of the 100,000 required for the Infinite Galaxy to advance forward, it meant his progress was around the range of 1400 Galaxies every day.","This shocking number meant that Noah and his clones would be spending over 2 months just fusing the required Galaxies, a time period that was longer than it took him to advance from a non Entity into a Great Sage!","During this 2 month time period, Noah traversed the expansive Dark Universe as his clones and subordinates helped with taking care of the successful inclusion of tens of thousands of Galaxies.","This was an addition of trillions of beings every minute, something that would have been hard for the beings of the Infinite Galaxy to handle if they didn’t increase their power and also Master the Blood Clone ability of Blood Lord!","During this entire 2 month period where the fusions were taking place, Noah asked himself and the Cosmic Treasure exactly where they could locate the Core of the Dark Universe.","Even with its essence covering up the entire Universe, the Cosmic Treasure wasn’t able to sense anything that could be seen as the core of a Universe!","[When I was just floating across the folds of space in the Cosmos, I came across many Universes, but never chanced upon their Cores or anything like that.]","The Cosmic Treasure spoke of its own experiences as Noah nodded, wanting to scream out to the Dark chaotic void around him as he simply asked- where was the core of the Universe!","But even though he could not locate it at this moment, the Golden light of Destiny that wrapped around him told him not to worry.","His plan of elevating the stage of the Infinite Galaxy was actually in the right direction, with the mysteries he could unveil telling him that when he achieved the requirement of 100,000 Galaxies and upgraded his wondrous Treasure...that would be the time when the will of the Dark Universe would reveal itself!"]},{"number":894,"title":"Chapter 894: Chapter 893 - From a Spiritual Land into...!","paragraphs":["Like this, 2 months passed in the fantastical Cosmos as an uncountable number of beings each moved with their own goals and ideals.","During this period of time, the Infinite Galaxy gained 21 new Sages and hundreds of beings in the GALAXY Realm, with Noah increasing his level of strength and having all of his pets step into the stage he was in...as Great Sages!","Every single Pet was vibrantly releasing the Manifested glows of multiple galaxies, their Realms stably within the Galactic Filament Rank.","This Rank also meant that Noah could summon another two pets for him to contract and bring his Summons to 10, but he waited to do so as the Universe he would be Summoning them from...it was one of the Universes he would soon be stepping into!","Aside from his Summons and subordinates, Noah himself also advanced greatly in a field he thought would take him forever- his comprehension in the Cosmic Dao of Ruination.","Leaving a clone in the Ruination Realm for the past two months meant that the clone had undergone a training session that lasted over 2000 months...or 166 years!","The session had been extremely fruitful as on the percentage next to the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, a gorgeous 16% could be seen.","2 months to comprehend one sixth of a Cosmic Dao...it meant that Noah would only need over a year to fully comprehend it! Such a time felt extremely long for him, yet it was already something unbelievable for any other beings that comprehended a Cosmic Dao.","Aside from this advancement, there was also the Purification of Primordial Essence that he had access to on top of the Ruination Essence. Within the Ruination Realm, the clone let this wondrous Essence wash into its Origin as it connected with the main body, Noah gaining constant purifications as the daily .1 percentages gradually filled up to grant him to allowable 25% that all Great Sages were capped to when it came to Primordial Essence Purification!","With the 15% from Ruination Essence, Noah currently had 40% Purification that represented +400,000% to All Parameters.","All Parameters!","Apart from this rapid increase in strength, the main focus remained on the fusion of Galaxies as after 2 months, Noah was currently floating in front of the 100,000th Galaxy- the final Galaxy required before the next evolution of the Infinite Galaxy.","THRUM!","The process began just as the others, Noah watching as the boundary of this Galaxy faded away while all of its stellar bodies fused into the Infinite Galaxy that had an uncountable number of stars, planets, black holes, and quasars within it!","[Even I am curious about the upgrade treasure. I haven’t come across anything like it before...]","RUINATION floated beside Noah as it looked curiously at the miniaturized Infinite Galaxy that had begun to shine brilliantly unlike when other Galaxies fused into it before.","Noah watched on with expectant eyes as the moment the quota of 100,000 Galaxies were met, the Infinite Galaxy vibrated while releasing wondrous bursts of light, beginning the process of advancement as it drained mana from Noah the moment the upgrade condition was met!","RUMBLE!","As always when it came to the advancement of this treasure, all it did was require a large amount of Mana that Noah very easily provided. Although this time, Noah’s essence was filled with the crimson of Ruination as the upgrading Infinite Galaxy was tinged with pure blue mana that was laced with red.","[Beautiful...]","RUINATION uttered such words as in front of it and Noah, the Infinite Galaxy floated upwards as it shone brilliantly, the Galaxy that should have remained miniaturized actually beginning to expand by itself against Noah’s control!","...!","Noah watched with a stupefied expression as the miniaturized Infinite Galaxy expanded rapidly, almost as if saying it could not remain such a small size after its upgrade as it chose for itself the smallest size it could be at this moment. It very quickly passed hundreds of miles, Noah’s figure becoming dwarfed as it went on to a hundred thousand miles, then on to a million! Then onto a billion miles!","THRUM!","Essence was s.u.c.k.e.d into it in droves as it expanded out madly, the smallest size this treasure chose to be at...becoming a single light year!","The figures of Noah and the Cosmic Treasure looked insignificant as just the mere miniaturized version of the treasure...was a light year- over 6 trillion miles!","’How the hell am I going to be carrying you now...’","Noah had begun with a thought as it was quickly erased...and this was because he glanced towards the shimmering 1 light year long object that used to be the Infinite Galaxy.","At this moment, its boundary shone with a gorgeous array of blue and red l.u.s.ter, the innumerable number of stellar bodies hidden within from the fusion of 100,000 Galaxies not even being seen!","The moment it reached 1 light year, it stopped s.u.c.k.i.n.g Noah’s essence as it released one final burst of Mana, the stellar treasure floating majestically to announce its arrival.","\"...\"","<You Have Finally Completed It>","RUMBLE!","Out of nowhere, an archaic voice thundered all around him as even Noah’s strong soul trembled, his eyes shining brilliantly as they remained locked onto the treasure that used to be the Infinite Galaxy.","He locked eyes with it because as its Master, information about it flowed into his mind as he found his eyes shaking from what he found out and read on the ability that used to be called {Spiritual Galaxy Management}, but was now under a different name!","{Universal Core Management}","[Universal Core-13]","Beasts: F-XXX, E-XXX, D-XXX, C-XXX, B-XXX, A-XXX, S-XXX, EPIC-XXX, LEGENDARY-XXX, MYTHICAL-XXX, PHANTASMAL-XXX, TRANSCENDENT-XXX, SAINT- XXX, VOID- XXX, SOUL-XXX, DOMAIN- XXX, WORLD-XXX, STAR FORGING- XXX, NEBULA- 5 Million, BLACK HOLE- 1 Million, QUASAR- 324,837, GALAXY-12,833","Plants- Whitefall Trees, Snow Vine, Sacred Rye, Pigmy Melon, Ice-fire Persimmon, Ice Phoenix Fruits, Spirit of the Arctic, Frozen Angelica, Regal Flora, Qilin’s Cold Stone, Resonant Okra, Arctic Flora, King’s Collard, Athramire, Phantom Mulberry, Fire Starter, Frigid Apple, Fate’s Orchard, Chaotic Amaranth, Aether Infused Willow, Immemorial Dragon Fruits, Mythical Fruit of Life. Available for planting(Fruit of Destiny)","Features- Size Regulation(Unlocked), Movement(Unlocked), Anchor(Unlocked), Boost Surroundings(Unlocked), Architecture(Unlocked), Frozen Barrier(Unlocked), Offensive Maneuvers(Unlocked), Time Dilation(Unlocked), Treasure Hunter (Unlocked), Interstellar Travel(Unlocked), Law Space(Unlocked), Blacksmith’s Forge(Unlocked), Division(Unlocked), Alchemy Hall(Unlocked), Library(Unlocked), World Integration(Unlocked), Universe Gateway(Unlocked), Pocket Universe (Unlocked), Assimilation(Unlocked), Trait Blessing(Unlocked), Dao Birth(Unlocked)...#^$%#(Locked)","A shocking set of details, one that listed the Infinite Galaxy under the name of Universal Core!","<You Have Finally Completed The Universal Core>","RUMBLE!","...!"]},{"number":895,"title":"Chapter 895: Chapter 894 - A Universe I","paragraphs":["The thundering archaic voice he had been waiting for for so long finally arrived, and it was the will of the very same Universe he had just saved from Ruination two months ago!","<You were searching for the core of the Dark Universe that does not exist. A Universe has no central core, with its will exerted throughout its billions of light years.>","...!","That was right! For the past months, Noah had searched for and wondered where the core of the Dark Universe would be, the Dao of Destiny only telling him he would get answers when the upgrade of the Infinite Galaxy finished.","He just didn’t think...it would play put this way!","This was a truth that an infinitesimal amount of beings knew- the fact that a Universe actually did not have a central core, being something that could not be destroyed...unless its source of sustenance was cut off and it was swallowed by the Ruination Sea.","That sustenance...was the Primordial Cosmos!","<For you to achieve your purpose of changing the nature of this Universe to accept Ruination Essence instead of Primordial Essence for sustenance, something that had not been born before had to come to light. You had to forge your own Universal Core>","<Now that a Universal Core connected to you and capable of accepting Ruination Essence for substance has appeared, all that is left to do is to connect with the whole Universe. All 100 Billion Light Years of it.>","THRUM!","A shocking development appeared before Noah’s eyes as a myriad of thoughts danced in his mind.","The little floating Spiritual Land from the Beast World...went to become a World of its own, into a Realm, and then a Galaxy!","Now, it was a Universal Core that had not appeared before, something to be used to change the nature of a Universe that relied on Primordial Essence into an Essence that was normally destructive to it!","\"...\"","He breathed out slowly as his eyes flashed with light. Time seemed to flow slowly as he thought about many things before his face became firm, grabbing his Cosmic Treasure as he asked the will of the Universe that had finally chosen to speak.","\"...how do we start?\"","RUMBLE!","<Sit atop the Universal Core and be ready. I will use the remaining hundreds of years of Primordial Essence to initiate the connection. It will be up to you to control the essence thereafter to finish the connection>","A tremendous task lay in front of Noah as he looked at the 1 light year large Universal Core!","A spatial light covered him as he disappeared, his face shining with brilliance as he went on to start a task of utmost importance.","It was at this moment.","At this moment where a transcendental scene that should definitely be inscribed into history books occurred!","It was the scene of Noah teleporting towards the top of the Universal Core as he sat upon it, a Cosmic Treasure within his hands shining brilliantly as a gorgeous display of colorful Essence surrounded them.","A second after that, the chaotic void trembled and quaked.","THRUUM!","From the chaotic void- from the folds of the Universe itself, tendrils of colorful Primordial Essence erupted out as they instantly went to cover the 1 light year Universal Core!","These tendrils reached out to land on the Universal Core on all sides, multiple of them going towards Noah and piercing into his body as his soul nearly crumbled from the pressure.","Feeling the tendrils of Primordial Essence that came from the Universe itself connecting to both the Universal Core and him, Noah’s Origin felt the blooming of a distinct connection that he focused on.","It was a connection that felt more enormous than anything he had come across, a connection that the moment it came to be, the thunderous voice of the Universe rang out.","<Now>","RUUUMBLE!","The gorgeous tendrils of Primordial Essence and their points of connection to the Universal Core...Noah’s eyes that had beams of blue-red light shooting out...the glimmering Cosmic Treasure...it felt like everything came to a stop at this moment. As if time itself had stopped briefly!","When time moved again, an explosive force of essence erupted out from Noah and the Universal Core as the tendrils of Primordial Essence they were connected to...flashed blue as an intense hint of red began to occupy them!","This red...caused the tendrils of essence to pulse with light as an instant later, they began to shoot out from the Universal Core and tear through the chaotic void around them on all sides.","This created for the shocking image where with the Universal Core at the scene, tendrils of blue and red essence interweaved together and began to erupt out over the nearby light years, these tendrils of essence continuing to expand in every direction!","<For the connection to be successfully established and for the Universal Core to be used as the true core of the Universe, it must stretch its will to cover the entire 100 Billion Light Years of the Dark Universe>","The tendrils of essence spread out with the intent to cover the entire Universe!","In the beginning, the light of blue that represented the Primordial Essence dominated, but after a few million Light Years, the shade of crimson red was all that could be seen from the tendrils that were exploding out across the Dark Universe.","They were innumerable in number as from the connection of Noah, his Universal Core, and the Cosmic Treasure- tendrils of Ruination Essence were used as the source of the connection to an entire Universe!","Ruination Essence!","Something that was normally destructive to Universes and to its life forms- this very same essence now began to permeate throughout the Dark Universe with its goal being to be its main source of energy.","THRUM!","Atop the Universal Core, tendrils of Ruination Essence shot forth from Noah’s eyes and mouth as he looked extremely terrifying at this moment, the Cosmic Treasure on his l.a.p shining ever brighter.","100 million light years.","10 billion light years.","Noah did not know how long it took, only coming to as he awoke to a magisterial sight around him!","It was the sight of a vibrant Universal Core stretching out its will to cover the entirety of a Universe!"]},{"number":896,"title":"Chapter 896: Chapter 895 - A Universe II","paragraphs":["We come across beautiful things every day, but there are times when we observe something so outrageously beautiful that we even lose the words for it.","This was Noah’s current situation, the tendrils of light that were shooting from his eyes and mouth dying down as he came to only to observe a shocking scene!","From the Universal Core that was his past Infinite Galaxy, tendrils of crimson essence stretched throughout the chaotic void on all sides! He closed his eyes as he focused on the connections he had to his soul, focusing on the Universal Core as the things it showed him...were simply too much for someone like him to be seeing.","THUMP!","Like a beating heart, the Universal Core released a wave of essence that traveled throughout all the tendrils coming out of it, Noah’s senses following this pulse of essence as he saw it spread for millions of lights and still continue!","[Crazy...] Even the Cosmic Treasure on his l.a.p uttered out its astonishment at the shocking scene!","This was because it was the first time in history for such a thing to happen- for a Universe to have its nature changed as it connected to a Universal Core that released Ruination Essence throughout it.","The first time that a Universe wasn’t supported and did not require the support of a Cosmos!","And Noah...was at the center of it all as he was the master of the Universal Core that was now connected to the Dark Universe.","RUMBLE!","This shocking reality only dawned on Noah now as he didn’t even know what to think!","<One of the many possible paths for this Universe since the Cosmic Treasure floated into it and caused the sequence of events has been achieved>","...!","The voice of the will of the Universe rang out in Noah’s mind once more, this time seeming very clear as he shared a connection with it through the Universal Core.","<What happens after this is unknown as at this moment, it is not the will of a Universe that is heavily restricted by Cosmic rules in control, but the will of a being that has vastly different rules applied to>","RUMBLE!","Shocking words were released from the will of the Universe as Noah’s eyes shone calmly.","<Something to keep in mind is the System that began from your home world and was expanded into the Infinite Galaxy...it has now been expanded to cover the whole Universe and all the beings dwelling within it>","\"The system...\"","<The ability to devour the defeated being’s power, the panel quantifying your strength and abilities...It should be a Devour Class System brought about under the influence of Ruination that the Novus Galaxy used to bend Universal Laws to create, its scale just being expanded>","Many thoughts crossed Noah’s mind as he nodded as this, focusing on the connection of the Universal Core below him as a change began to occur once more.","The red tendrils of essence spread out across billions of light years slowly receded into folds of the void as they became hidden, the Universal Core doing the same as well!","It entered the folds of space as it utterly disappeared, where the only thing that was left behind throughout the Dark Universe from the shocking event that had just occurred was the shining color of crimson that permeated throughout.","The dark chaotic void...was now lit up brightly with the aura of red essence flowing throughout, creating a beautiful scenery of shimmering darkness with the bright allure of crimson across the Universe!","Within the folds of space, Noah stared at this scene with wonder as he returned to the {Universal Core Management} ability to see exactly what he had done.","Many things had changed as features like <Realm Gateway> and <Pocket Realm> became Universal Gateway and Pocket Universe.","As the Universal Core was now connected to the Universe itself, its features like Movement and Size Regulation could be used somewhat, and even nonconsequential features like Architecture could now be utilized on a grand scale Noah never thought to be possible!","<Architecture> :: A feature that allows the Master of the Universal Core to build structures and alter the shapes and designs of existing stars, planets, and even the layouts of Galaxies and Galactic Filaments.","\"...\"","It was the shocking feature termed Dao Birth!","<Dao Birth> :: Dao Birth is normally an ability that only those in the Universal Realm can have a chance of utilizing. Such an ability holds the secrets on how to surpass the Universal Realm to reach the state of ●●●●● ●●●●●. After coming into control of a Universal Core, Noah Osmont can utilize this feature to Birth a limited number of Daos of his own making. Dao Spaces of already utilized Daos can also be established within the Universal Core. Currently possible Daos : 3 Lesser.","...!","An ability only reserved for the Universal Realm Hegemonies that had reached the peak of power!","An ability that was a must have in one wanted to peer through the secrets of reaching the stage above Universal Realm that was even hidden from Noah!","At this moment as he obtained control of a Universe...Noah could birth his own Daos.","...!","---","Within this same period of time, a shocking event occurred not in Noah’s Dark Universe, but in a far away location across the vast Sea of Ruination.","On this day, throughout the very Cosmos themselves...the most powerful experts could shockingly hear sounds of weeping stretching out across the billions of light years.","It was a sign that very few of them understood the meaning of, but those that had not locked themselves away for hundreds of thousands of years and knew of the events that occurred over a hundred thousand years ago were able to understand its meaning!","In the Cerulean Universe, a being with a shimmering blue crown with a stature that was the size of a Galaxy looked up as he heard this sound, his face turning sour as if he had tasted the worst type of shit.","\"That fool even failed to save the Universe anyways! Of course he couldn’t utilize the Cosmic Treasure...!\"","...!","In another universe, a Universal Realm Hegemony rose her head as her eyes sparkled with the light of Galaxies, her fair mouth moving as she spoke in a sad tone.","\"A portion of the Cosmos has perished...a most troubling sign for what is to come!\"","RUMBLE!","Yes, the significance of Noah’s actions to not reconnect the Dark Universe with the Cosmos and instead turn it into something else entirely...it would bring sweeping changes that even he had no ideas about!"]},{"number":897,"title":"Chapter 897: Chapter 896 - Unlimited Possibilities!","paragraphs":["Throughout the Cosmos, a weeping cry reverberated out as many knowledgeable beings were alerted to the supposed death of a Universe that had been separated from the Cosmos over a hundred thousand years ago.","With the vast Cosmos, a few knew the meaning behind it, but not a single being knew what it truly represented!","It was actually one of the very few Keystone Events- Events throughout history that would go on to be a springboard for the direction of an entire Cosmos.","The terrifying Universal Realm Hegemonies overseeing the Primordial Cosmos did not know this.","The wills of the many Universes did not know this!","The being who initiated this event himself...even he didn’t know this!","---","In the Animus Universe.","There were only two beings within this Universe that noticed the phenomenon, both of them raising their heads as sharp lights crossed through their eyes.","One was the individual that birthed the Dao of Summoning, her eyes shimmering with starry lights as the moment the weeping finished, she turned her attention to the abundant amount of information she was receiving on the usage of the Dao she created, her eyes continuing to be locked on the Animus Universe!","Meanwhile...the other individual had a devious light flash across his eyes as he also turned his attention to the happenings within the Animus Universe, his fingers continuing to move as bright lights released from them- with this being having his own motives!","Neither of the experts could have known the weeping was connected to a special being.","A being that would very soon be descending onto the very same Animus Universe they had their eyes on!","---","Inside the Universal Core, the beings within merely felt the starry space tremble as with every passing second since the upgrade of the Infinite Galaxy began, where they felt the atmospheric mana of the surroundings rise exponentially over the next few hours!","The Sages within noticed this phenomenon the most as they tried to spread their aura out of the Infinite Galaxy to see what was happening outside...only to find they were blocked from doing so.","They could only shockingly remain to observe the changes as after a few hours, things began to settle while leaving behind something that caused the inhabitants of the Infinite Galaxy to move around in a stupor.","The atmospheric essence throughout the expansive Galaxy that held an uncountable number of stars...had grown to such an extent that all around, rivers of condensed essence could be seen!","Rivers of essence!","Aside from this, the concentration of universal law essence was also so dense that liquid wisps of multiple law essences could be seen on all the uncountable numbers of stars and planets within the Universal Core.","The most visible changes to the inhabitants of the upgraded Universal Core was this shocking condensation of essence that would make it unbelievably easy for beings to advance on the path of power.","\"He has made a Holy Land of Cultivation...\"","The Sword Emperor was looking around the rivers of essence all around them as he spoke, the place they were in seeming like a paradisiacal Holy Land meant only for the highest beings to be in.","Morgana was sighing wistfully as while she looked at the sweeping changes around them, she stared at the new Sages that had sprouted in the last few days.","Even they who were the locals of this place for much longer than them looked to be in a stupor as they ran their hands over the rivers of essence flowing out, the voice of a particular being just turned Sage beginning to reverberate out in jovial laughter!","\"Haha, what did I tell you guys? I wouldn’t be surprised if Noah has somehow advanced the Spiritual Land into a mini Universe or something...ah!\"","Kazuhiko had a bright smile as all the others around him digested his words, their eyes looking around them as they wanted to ask the being himself what had happened!","RUMBLE!","They didn’t have to wait long as Noah’s main body flashed into the Universal Core with a light smile, a Cosmic Treasure by his side as he looked around at the progress of the beings within it.","He had been looking at the wondrous feature of Dao Birth as he chose not to rush it for the time being, seeing as how he had only 3 chances to birth Daos as of right now. He would continue gathering information as he formulated possibilities of Daos before he moved to enact them!","His eyes glimmered with the light of possibilities as he looked at the beings that had been training hard for the past 2 months, his voice ringing out.","\"The apocalypse of the Dark Universe isn’t a worry anymore, with the only thing remaining now being our own choices on how to move forward...\"","Noah began to speak with his people as he waved his hands to call forth all of his Animus Summons that pulsate with the shocking strength at Great Sage just like him.","\"Tiamat, come forward!\"","He beckoned to the domineering Queen Dowager who was only servile towards him, with her gaze remaining cold and ruthless when she gazed upon all others!","Her voluptuous humanoid void came to stand beside Noah as she looked towards everyone else, Noah’s voice continuing to ring out.","\"Let us talk about what we do from here...let us talk about the Universe we reside in and the Primordial Cosmos...let us talk about the Animus Universe!\"","RUMBLE!","Terrifying lights passed across the eyes of all the powerful beings within the Universal Core as at this moment, a shocking discussion began about the Primordial Cosmos they were all initially from...and the Animus Universe where Tiamat, the Blue Slime...and all other Summoned Animus came from.","The voluptuous Tiamat that used to be a Ruler of an entire section of the Animus Universe was at the forefront of the discussion, a few hours passing as the Sages and Great Sages of the Dark Universe planned!","When all was over and done, Kazuhiko had a profound expression as while everyone was digesting information, he rose up with a bright smile while speaking out.","\"So what you’re telling me is...that it is time for us to explore and conquer Universes?\"","RUMBLE!","Noah glanced at the raucous new Sword Emperor as he gazed across the Universal Core.","\"I’m not sure about conquering with the powerful Universal Realm hegemonies who can birth Daos running around the Cosmos, but exploring...will definitely be something I’ll be doing!\"","\"We have unlimited possibilities on what we can do, with our first step being the Animus Universe.\"","...!","\"There, one of our own was stripped from her throne from the collusion of forces that should have been her allies. We’ll move carefully as we start in this Universe first...we shall first explore the Animus Universe as we gain more understanding of the Primordial Cosmos!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":898,"title":"Chapter 898: Chapter 897 - The Animus Universe! I","paragraphs":["Hours passed as the Sages and Great Sages of the Dark Universe congregated and discussed!","Noah only brought up Tiamat’s ordeal and mission, leaving out the terrifying identity of the Universal Emperor Slime that he would actually have to not display so freely in the Primordial Cosmos- not unless he wanted all the experts to rush towards him anyways.","Something worthy of note that seemed to foretell of a difficult future was the enormous body of Jormungandr stepping forward, its booming voice ringing out.","\"I was a weak thing in the Animus Universe before you summoned me...but I do know that the state of the Dragon Race has fallen from what it used to be! I haven’t been to the Holy Lands of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines, but the scenes there might not be something any of us expect!\"","THRUM!","The Galaxy Devouring Serpent said this while glancing at Tiamat, preparing her and Noah for whatever they would find when they arrive in the Animus Universe!","Tiamat had a solemn expression as she expected this somewhat since she who was the Ruler of Dragons fell, but she still held hope that the Great Sages and Monarchs of her race had continued to fight for the status of her bloodline.","Many things continued to be mentioned as after extensive discussions and preparations, Noah felt he had prepared sufficiently enough as he was ready to set off!","The meeting was dissolved as others made their own preparations, Noah coming into the glimmering crimson chaotic void as he stared at its new beauty.","He had achieved his goal of protecting his Universe and preventing its apocalypse, where it now faced no threats as it floated amidst the Sea of Ruination that was not harmful to it.","At this moment, his mind was filled with thoughts of the Primordial Cosmos and all the Universes within them.","Aside from the Animus Universe, Noah also put the Necrotic Universe and the...Cerulean Universe on his radar!","This was because the Blue Slime shared with him the memories it had obtained after it absorbed the sliver of soul that was the Half-a-Step Great Spirit Sage.","From this, he knew that the terrifying being that had targeted and been on the Dark Universe for the last tens of thousands of years was in the Cerulean Universe, and just how terrifying his level of power was!","The contrasting image of the Blue Cerulean Universe passed through his mind as he looked at his own Dark Universe. Its formerly dark chaotic void now shone with auroras of crimson, the void of space being lit up brightly as the dark universe...wasn’t so dark anymore!","The contrast put a smile on Noah’s face as he held the Cosmic Treasure that voiced out lightly.","[Ready?]","The Cosmic Treasure asked for affirmation if Noah was ready as their next action...was to utilize the [Universe Piercer] feature to make a Gateway to a Universe the treasure had come across- their target being the Animus Universe!","Attached to Noah at this time was a [Pocket Universe] that held a Universal Gateway back into the Universal Core of the Dark Universe where he could access his subordinates within any time he wished, and he could also enter it to appear back in the Dark Universe whenever he wanted. He would enter the Animus Universe himself first before he called out any of the Sages within his Universal Core in this manner.","\"Ready!\"","THRUM!","He replied to the Cosmic Treasure that initiated Universal Piercer right away, Noah’s body being wrapped by a crimson red light as he disappeared!","From the Dark Universe...he was shuttled into the Ruination Sea as a wondrous spatial light wrapped around him, his destination being the Primordial Cosmos!","---","The Primordial Cosmos with its multitude of Universes was extremely old.","Its actual age was very hard to ascertain even now as within it...a great deal of powerful beings had risen.","Some beings achieved such powerful Realms of power that their very strengths could disrupt the lives of Quadrillions of beings if they battled or acted freely on their wishes!","This was why in the Primordial Cosmos, there existed an Absolute Rule that was maintained throughout.","An Absolute Rule that was rarely ever broken, a rule that upheld the era of balance and prosperity for the eons that passed within the Cosmos.","It was the Rule that Hegemonies within the Universal Realm...could not move to act against those in the lower Realms, and nor could they act against each other for small conflicts!","It was such a tremendously stringent rule that for it to be kept...an extremely powerful Universal Realm Hegemony called the Oathkeeper had stepped up to oversee it!","Through the Lesser Dao of the Oath Keeper that this being had created, all rising and current Universal Realm Hegemonies would have to make an oath in front of him that would be inscribed into the very souls of each party.","That was how Absolute the rule of Universal experts not moving against themselves for small conflicts or moving against those in the lower Realms was.","That a Lesser Dao was made by a terrifying creature just for it, and all Universal experts had to make an oath under this Dao that if they broke...the Oathkeeper would know right away as the wrath of all the collective Universal Realm Hegemonies in the Cosmos would descend upon the Oath Breaker.","This being one of the main things that kept the Prosperity of the Cosmos...made Noah extremely excited when he heard of it from Tiamat!","Of course, he also knew that nothing was set in stone as just weeks prior, he had faced a negligible sliver of a soul from a being had just reached the bounds of the Universal Realm in the Cerulean Universe...and yet this being had been able to act against them!","Whether it was due to their actual body and strength not acting, or the fact that it stayed within the boundary of the Realms within the Galaxy...whatever the reason was, Noah saw that this Absolute Rule that was maintained with such stringency...had loopholes to play with here and there.","’The most powerful experts cannot move against me...’","This thought carried him with confidence as the voice of the Cosmic Treasure passed through his mind.","[We’re arriving, Master.]","RUMBLE!","It was the place his Summons stemmed from, a Universe that he would soon come to know as a place with brutality and fantastical creatures each with their own histories!","The Universe where the 9 Supreme Bloodlines ruled through pure strength and power...the Animus Universe!"]},{"number":899,"title":"Chapter 899: Chapter 898 - The Animus Universe! II","paragraphs":["The crimson red channel Noah was on gradually became a mixture of beautiful essence as the spatial light around him increased, a brilliant flash of light spreading throughout as he felt himself transported to a new place he had never been to!","WAA!","He came to as he found himself in a wondrously colorful chaotic void, the glimmers of bright stars and celestial bodies being seen from the distance.","His eyes and aura took in everything around him as his mind absorbed all he saw rapidly, his heart shaking as he turned towards a certain direction where he saw...an enormous Planet!","He would only consider a planet enormous if it was truly exaggerated in size- and this planet exactly had that feature.","The smallest planets could range from a few thousand to tens of thousands of miles. The Planet he was seeing from a distance...was way out the ball park for this number as its size was shockingly akin to that of a small Galaxy!","The singular Planet...was approximately 20,000 Light Years large.","A planet the size of a small Galaxy!","\"It seems like we arrived in the territory of the Galaxy Devouring Serpents...\"","The voice of Tiamat rang out as Noah’s eyes shone brightly, stepping into the Animus Universe for the first time as he came face to face with a majestic scene!","\"This unique galaxy-sized planet is a territory of the Galaxy Devouring Serpents, one of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines that controls a region of the Animus Universe...\"","Tiamat continued to speak as Noah summoned her curvaceous figure out first in this new universe!","Her eyes coldly glanced at the far away planet as she continued.","\"Tens of thousands of years have passed since I’ve been here, so I can’t say for sure how the situation has changed within the Animus Universe. But from my recollection, this planet is one of the important strongholds of the Galaxy Devouring Serpents, it’s nothing but those Snakes down there!\"","Noah smiled at her words as he asked with a smile.","\"Do we start there?\"","\"...no, we might just come across a few Great Sages or Monarchs within this stronghold. We need to go into the Supreme Galactic Filament- a cl.u.s.ter of Galaxies that actually surround a planet even bigger than most galaxies- the Planet of Consanguinity where all the races of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines congregate!\"","THRUM!","\"There...we can go to the domain that the Dragons rule!\"","Tiamat’s words made Noah’s eyes shine as he nodded, the Queen Dowager sending Noah memories of the location she talked about as a light of teleportation wrapped around the both of them, their figures disappearing from the chaotic void.","WAP!","A second later, Noah found himself in front of a planet even more enormous than the first one he came across in the Animus Universe- a planet that actually had cl.u.s.ters of Galaxies surrounding it!","\"The Planet of Consanguinity...\"","Tiamat seemed to be emotional as she looked at the galaxy-sized planet, many memories being dug from her mind as events of the past were recalled.","She shook her head with a firm expression as she looked towards Noah who only nodded towards her to take the lead towards the location ruled by the Dragon Race.","The Planet of Consanguinity was truly as large as a Galaxy, being over 40,000 light years as the surface area was truly something hard to comprehend! When Noah began descending onto the enormous Planet, he could pick up an uncountable number of powerful auras dwelling just in the small area they were heading down to!","\"We must not call attention to ourselves before we collect more information. We’ll have to get in contact with the Dragons inside the Stardew Valleys below us first.\"","The area of the Planet of Consanguinity they were descending down on had an expansive area that was one of the strongholds of those with the Bloodline of Dragons, a place called Stardew Valleys that was 1 light year in size!","That was over 6 trillion miles of land, most of it being wide stretching valleys that changed from freezing icecaps to barren deserts, all the way to verdant green mountainous landscapes- Noah and Tiamat going towards the center of it where the most powerful Dragon Tribes would be.","\"The other 9 Supreme Bloodlines are spread out all around this planet, with each force staying within the bounds of their regions unless a fight for Supremacy breaks out...\"","Tiamat continued to introduce the new land they were in as she provided a great deal of information, Noah continuing to pick up the auras of terrifying beings below them!","They gradually entered the skies of the planet as below them, verdant valleys and mountains were stretched out for millions upon millions of miles, at the peaks of each of these mountains and valleys...one could see majestic structures that looked like magical cities.","Noah looked at the exquisitely built structures atop the mountain valley right below them that held one of such fantastical cities, their two figures descending down towards it as they could see multiple figures moving about.","As they went down and neared the peak of the valley while clearly seeing the fantastical scenes before them, Tiamat’s face drastically began to change while Noah’s eyes shone with an intense light!","This was because at their Realms, the things they could see were truly many and not just a single scene of the grand structures filled with powerful beings below them.","Set on top of the mountainous valley, the fantastical city had structures shining with an Obsidian color as they rose to the skies, majestic looking castles and abodes spread out everywhere as the city alone was over 5000 miles in size- the diameters of small planets!","And this was just 1 of the many cities on top of the peak of the multiple mountains of the 1 Light Year long Stardew Valleys.","Within the mountain peak and in this majestic city...the figures of many Dragons and other creatures from the 9 Supreme Bloodlines could be seen!","Tiamat’s face had changed drastically because with their power, they were now able to observe the happenings of this planet-sized city as many scenes unfolded in front of their eyes.","A scene of the creatures from the Supreme Bloodline of White Tigers riding atop the backs of the Water Dragons while talking nonchalantly...","An even more shocking sight was a scene of a group of creatures from the Nine-Tailed Fox Supreme Bloodline at the stage of Entities with a single Sage following them, the Sage waving his hands down as in the middle of the city...he cut off the head of a Blue Dragon while saying out nonchalant words.","\"This one will be today’s meal. Make sure you stew the meat until it is well done!\"","...!","Tiamat watched this scene and many others scenes in the city below them as her drastically changing face became ashen, quickly becoming filled with immense wrath and shame!","There were many scenes, but they all depicted great injustices befalling those of the Dragon Race!","Within the City atop this mountain peak and on many other locations in the Domain of Dragons that was the Stardew Valleys...these scenes were actually commonplace.","Since over a hundred thousand years ago when the Queen Dowager that ruled over the dignified Dragon Race was eradicated...this was the state that had befallen the Bloodline of Dragons!","It was a heart rending scene for Tiamat to see on her return into the Animus Universe!"]},{"number":900,"title":"Chapter 900: Chapter 899 - The Fall of the Dragon Race I","paragraphs":["Noah looked at the shocking scenes around them with calm eyes as his hand tightly grasped the shoulder of Tiamat, their feet touching the earth of one of the celestial bodies of the Animus Universe for the first time.","They were within the Planet of Consanguinity where all the 9 Supreme Bloodlines congregated, one of the important locations within the Animus Universe that wasn’t under the control of a single Supreme Bloodline!","Tiamat had chosen to come here first and not in the Draconic Holy Lands where she ruled before and was assassinated in for the purpose of first gathering information.","She had to know the state of the Dragon Race, and understand what had occurred in the last tens of thousands of years.","For this, they descended onto one of the many mountainous valleys of a location millions of miles long called Stardew Valleys that should have been under the control of Dragons!","What she found...caused her heart to nearly explode in shame and wrath as it was the scene of majestic Dragons...being treated as if they weren’t the peak Bloodline of the Animus Universe!","Nine-tailed Phoenixes killed Dragons in plain sight for a meal, and the magisterial Dragons were used throughout the city as mounts that pulled carriages or to cross the skies.","It was as if the dragon race was purposefully being bullied and shamed as when Noah used his eyes to cover the sights of the city nearest to them, he discovered it was only those of the Dragon Race receiving such treatment.","\"This...!\"","Tiamat’s aura had nearly begun to explode out as Noah’s hand on her shoulder tightened, sending a command to this Queen Dowager to calm down!","He walked with her into the city as the many unfolding scenes around them became even clearer.","It was a bustle of activities all around, Noah seeing many unique creatures and beings in human forms wandering about.","Some of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines liked to keep their animalistic forms throughout, others took on the humanoid form as they moved across the City with ease and laughter!","The scenes of Dragons being abused throughout seemed like the norm as nobody paid attention to it, Noah and Tiamat only being able to see fear and shame when they looked into the eyes of the Dragons moving around the nearest areas they could observe without spreading their auras out wildly.","The dragon in human form had tears welling up in her eyes as she looked at the huge body of the dragon dissected not too far from her, but her head only turned away as she continued her task!","Noah saw the girl had only Low Tier GALAXY Realm power flowing within her, sending a message to Tiamat as his essence silently flew out.","The essence of the fully assimilated Dao of Voidspace silently flashed once as the figure of the sweeping dragon girl disappeared silently, along with the figures of Noah and Tiamat!","Before they went even further into the city and saw what was happening within it, Noah wanted to collect information on the state of everything around them.","The three of them disappeared from the majestic city as Noah utilized the [Pocket Universe] to send them into this isolated space!","\"Who...?!\"","The dragon girl was fearful as her voice shakily came out, her body pulsing with the aura of a being in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm as her pulsing body threatened to transform.","\"Who?! Who?!\"","RUMBLE!","Tiamat’s face was filled with wrath as she appeared in front of the Dragon Girl with her aura wildly exploding out!","\"This...!\"","The dragon girl was shocked as she felt a dominating presence that called for her to kneel, and she could not actually resist as she fell to her knees while looking up towards Tiamat in shock.","\"What has happened to my Bloodline?! What has happened to the dragon race in just a few tens of thousands of years?!\"","With a face filled with shame and pain from seeing her Bloodline treated as lower than Slaves, Tiamat looked for answers from the dragon girl they had snatched before them!","\"An ancestor of our race...\"","The girl looked towards them in a stupor for a few more seconds before she came to, sensing the dominating Bloodline strength of Tiamat that seemed much purer than hers as she mistook her for one of the hiding ancestors of Dragons!","Her face became tearful as she choked her words out.","\"Ancestor...where have you and the others gone to? Why have you left us alone and defenseless?! You ask what happened to the dragon race? You abandoned us!\"","RUMBLE!","Tiamat’s body shook from the words as her domineering body nearly fell back, Noah coming forward with his eyes shining out red beams of light.","\"Treat us if we just woke up and know nothing of what happened in the last tens of thousands of years. What has happened with the Dragon Race in the Animus Universe?\"","The dragon girl came to as she became aware of of Noah’s aura at the Galactic Filament Realm, finally coming to as she began to weave out a story.","It was the story of the majestic Bloodline of Dragons...of how they had fallen from their high pedestals into where they were now!","\"Since the Progenitor perished...\"","After the shocking ambush that Tiamat had faced from the collision of multiple Races of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines, new Rulers that stood at the top of the food chain in the Animus Universe were crowned!","The Lands of Dragons were taken over, the once majestic race that gradually lost its strongest protectors falling to the bottom of the ranks of creatures within the Animus Universe.","Even the Race of the Golden Cyclops that was ranked at the bottom of the Supreme Bloodlines...received better treatment than Dragons for the thousands of years that followed the fall of the Queen Dowager!","\"The powerful Ancestors either bent their knees to the Nine-Tailed Fox Race or Qilin Race, with some disappearing as they merely hid in the shadows...!\"","\"We have no experts to protect us, nobody to stand or defend us as we are treated like the lowest class of beings in our own lands! The Nine-Tailed Fox Race has a penchant for Dragon Meat, so they slaughter hundreds of Dragons daily just within this mountain to satiate their thirst!\"","\"I see your aura at the stage of Galactic Filament with your Bloodline power matching that of the Ancestors...where were you this whole time?! To stand before me like someone important, to look at me who is only in the Low Tier GALAXY Realm and dare ask me of the state of the Dragon Race...\"","\"...where were you this entire time?! While we were butchered and played around with? While the queens of our race became lower class citizens that the ugly Races sullied?! Where were you, oh great ancestor of the Dragon Race?!\"","RUMBLE!","Shame filled Tiamat’s face as she couldn’t answer the Dragon girl’s cries, her figure sinking back as she found out her Bloodline...had gone through a great deal of pain in the last tens of thousands of years!"]}]);
